<FONT FACE="URW Palladio UNI">
<H1>kaḷaviyal eṉṟa iṟiyaṉār akapporuḷ</H1>


<P>((file preparation based on AA\ILAKKANM\IRAI.pdy))
<P>((latest modification: 2004 july 2nd))
<P>((Original text entry done based on the kaḻakam edition))
<P>((References are given to the 208 pages of this edition))
<HR>
R 55,T 5
<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P1">{{iṟi: Page 1}}</A>
<HR>

<H1>((kaḷaviyal eṉṟa iṟiyaṉār akapporuḷ))</H1>

<H1>((1. kaḷavu))</H1>

<H2>1</H2>
<P>	aṉpiṉ aim^ tiṇi+ kaḷavu* eṉappaṭuvatu
<BR>	antaṇar aru-maṟi maṉṟal eṭṭiṉuḷ
<BR>	kantaruva vaḻakkam eṉmaṉār pulavar.

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉpatu cūttiram.

<P><H3>((pāyiram))</H3>

<P>e+ nūl urippiṉum a+ nūṟku+ pāyiram urittuurikkaṟpāṟṟu.

<P>eṉṉi,
<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`āyira mukattāṉ akaṉṟatu* āyiṉum
<BR>	pāyiram illatu paṉuval aṉṟu* ē'
<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉpatu* ākalāṉ -um,
<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`paru+-poruṭṭu* ākiya pāyiram^ kēṭṭārkku
<BR>	nuṇ-poruṭṭu* ākiya nūl iṉitu viḷaṅkum'
<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉpatu* ākalāṉ -um, pāyiram urittu urikka eṉpatumarapu.

<P>eṉ pōla ~ō eṉiṉ,
<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`koḻu+ ceṉṟa-vaḻi+ tuṉṉūci iṉitu cellumatu pōla'
<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉpatu.

<H3>((potuppāyiram ciṟappuppāyiram))</H3>

<P>a+ pāyiram^ tāṉ iru-vaki+_paṭum, potu+-pāyiram -umciṟappu+-pāyiram -um eṉa. avaṟṟu* -uḷ potu+-pāyirameṉpatu ellā nūl-mukattu* -um urikka+ -paṭuvatu;ciṟappu+-pāyiram eṉpatu taṉṉāl urikka+ -paṭum nūṟkuiṉṟiyamiyātatu.

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P2">{{iṟi: Page 2}}</A>
<HR>
<H3>((pāyirattiṉ iṉṟiyamiyāmi))</H3>

<P>pāyiram eṉṟa coṟku+ poruḷ yātu* -ō eṉiṉ, puṟavurieṉṟavāṟu. āyiṉ, nūl kēṭpāṉ pukuntu* -ē nūl kēḷātupuṟavuri kēṭṭu eṉ payaṉ eṉiṉ, nūṟku+ puṟaṉ -ākavittum nūṟku iṉṟiyamiyātatu, ātaliṉ eṉka. eṉ pōla -~ōeṉiṉ, karu ~aminta mā-nakarkku uruvu* amintavāyil-māṭam pōla -~um, aḷappu* ariya ākāyattiṟkuviḷakkam ākiya tiṅkaḷ -um ñāyiṟu* -um pōla -~um, takimāṇṭa neṭum^-cuvarkku vaki māṇṭa pāvi pōla -~umeṉpatu. ākaliṉ pāyiram^ kēṭṭu* -ē nūl kēṭka+ -paṭum.

<H3>((potuppāyiram))</H3>

<P>avaṟṟu* -uḷ, a+ potu+-pāyiram^ tāṉnāṉku-vaki+_paṭum: avi, īvōṉ taṉmi -~um, ītaliyaṟki -~um, koḷvōṉ taṉmi -~um, kōṭal marapu* -umeṉa.

<P>eṉṉi,
<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`īvōṉ taṉmi ~ītal iyaṟki
<BR>	koḷvōṉ taṉmi kōṭal marapu* eṉa
<BR>	īriraṇṭu* eṉpa potuviṉ iyaṟki'
<C /CITA>
<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉpatu* ākaliṉ,
īvōṉ taṉmi eṉpatu -- āciriyaṉatu taṉmi eṉṟavāṟu;
ītal iyaṟki eṉpatu -- avaṉ urikkum muṟimi eṉṟavāṟu;
koḷvōṉ taṉmi eṉpatu -- māṇākkaṉatu taṉmi eṉṟavāṟu;
kōṭal marapu eṉpatu -- avaṉ kēṭkum muṟimi eṉṟavāṟu.
avi -~ellām virittu* urippiṉ+ perukum; virinta nūliṟkaṇṭu-koḷka.

<H3>((ciṟappuppāyiram))</H3>

<P>iṉi+ ciṟappu+-pāyiram eṭṭu-vaki+_paṭum. avi yāvi-~ō eṉiṉ, ākkiyōṉ peyar -um, vaḻi -~um, elli -~um, //
<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P3">{{iṟi: Page 3}}</A>
<HR>
// nūṟ-peyar -um, yāppu* -um, nutaliya poruḷ -um,kēṭpōr -um, payaṉ -um eṉa ivi.
eṉṉi,
<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`ākkiyōṉ peyar ē vaḻi ~ē ~elli
<BR>	nūṟ-peyar yāppu* ē nutaliya-poruḷ -ē
<BR>	kēṭpōr payaṉōṭu* āy eṇ poruḷ -um
<BR>	vāyppa+ kāṭṭal pāyirattu* iyalpu* -ē'
<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉṟār ākaliṉ.
ivaṟṟoṭu, kālam -um kaḷaṉ -um kāraṇam -um kūṭṭi+patiṉoṉṟu eṉpār -um uḷar;
eṉṉi,
<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`kālam^ kaḷaṉ -ē kāraṇam eṉṟu* i+
<BR>	mū-vaki ~ēṟṟi moḻinar -um uḷar -ē'
<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉṟār ākaliṉ.

<P>ākkiyōṉ peyar eṉpatu -- nūl ceyta āciriyaṉ peyareṉṟavāṟu; i+ nūl ceytār yār -ō eṉiṉ, mālvari puriyummāṭakkūṭal ālavāyiṟ pālpuri pacuṅkatir+kuḻavittiṅkaḷi+ kuṟuṅkaṇṇi ~āka ~uṭiya aḻal avir cōtiaru-maṟi+ kaṭavuḷ eṉpatu.

<P>vaḻi eṉpatu -- i+ nūl iṉṉataṉ vaḻittu eṉpatu. itu,&viṉiyiṉ* ^nīṅki viḷaṅkiya aṟiviṉ muṉivaṉāṉ+#(([TP_IX_96mr])) ceyyappaṭṭatu* ākalāṉ vaḻinūl eṉṟucolla+ -paṭātu, mutaṉūl eṉa+ -paṭum eṉpatu.

<P>elli eṉpatu -- i+ nūl iṉṉa elli ~-uḷ naṭakkumeṉpatu. i+ nūl ev= elli ~-uḷ naṭakkum -ō eṉiṉ, vaṭakkuvēṅkaṭam, teṟku+ kumari, kiḻakku* -um mēṟku* -um^ kaṭalelli -~āka naṭakkum eṉpatu.
eṉṉi,
<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`vaṭakku* um^ teṟku* um^ kuṭakku* um^ kuṇakku* um
<BR>	vēṅkaṭam kumari tīmpuṉal+ puvam eṉṟu*
<BR>	a+ nāṉku* elli akavayiṉ+ kiṭanta
<BR>	nūlatiṉ muṟi ~ē vālitiṉ virippiṉ'
<BR>		(([kākkipāṭiṉiyam])) <P>{{C URAI}}
eṉa ~um,
<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`vaṭavēṅkaṭam teṉkumari
<BR>	āyiṭi+
<BR>	tamiḻkūṟu nallulakattu'
<BR>		(([tolkāppiyam, ciṟappu pāyiram_1/2/3]))

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P4">{{iṟi: Page 4}}</A>
<HR>
<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉa ~um kākkipāṭiṉiyār -um tolkāppiyaṉār -um coṉṉārākaliṉ eṉpatu.

<P>nūṟ-peyar eṉpatu -- nūlatu peyar eṉṟavāṟu. nūlpeyar-peṟum -iṭattu+ pal vikaṟpattāṉ+ peyar-peṟum;eṉṉi, ceytāṉāṉ+ peyar-peṟutal -um, ceyvittāṉāṉ+peyar-peṟutal -um, iṭu-kuṟiyāṉ+ peyar-peṟutal -um,aḷaviṉāṉ+ peyar-peṟutal -um, ciṟappiṉāṉ+ peyar-peṟutal-um eṉka.

<P>ceytāṉāṉ+ peyarpeṟṟaṉa; akattiyam, tolkāppiyam eṉaivi.
ceyvittāṉāṉ+ peyarpeṟṟaṉa: nikaṇṭu nūl, kalikkōṭṭu+taṇṭu eṉa ivi.
aḷaviṉāṉ+ peyarpeṟṟatu: paṉṉirupaṭalam eṉpatu.
ciṟappiṉāṉ+ peyarpeṟṟatu: kaḷaviyal eṉpatu; eṉṉi,kaḷavu kaṟpu eṉṉum^ kikōḷ iraṇṭaṉ -uḷ kaḷaviṉi+ciṟappu* uṭittu* eṉṟu vēṇṭum iv= āciriyaṉ.
eṉṉi,
<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`muṟpaṭa+ puṇarā+ col= iṉmiyiṟ
<BR>	kaṟpu* eṉappaṭuvatu kaḷaviṉ vaḻittu* ē'.
<BR>		(([iṟi:15)])
<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉṟu vēṇṭutaliṉ. kaṟpu, kaḷavu pōla orutaliyāṉaaṉpiṟṟu aṉṟu.

<P>iṉi, yāppu eṉpatu -- nūl yāppu, nūl yākkumiṭattunāṉku vakiyāl yākka+ -paṭum; tokuttu* -um, virittu*-um, toki-viri -~āka -~um, moḻipeyarttu* -um eṉa.
eṉṉi,
<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`tokuttal virittal toki-viri moḻi-peyarttu*
<BR>	atarppaṭa yāttalōṭu* aṉi marapiṉa ~ē'
<BR>		(T_marapiyal:99mr)
<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉṟār ākaliṉ.

<P>avaṟṟu* -uḷ, itu tokutti-yākka+ -paṭṭatu; eṉṉi,ulakattu naṭakkum aka+-poruḷ+ ceyyuḷ ilakkaṇam -ellāmiv= aṟupatu cūttirattu* -uḷ= ē tokuttāṉ ākaliṉ eṉpatu.

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P5">{{iṟi: Page 5}}</A>
<HR>
iṉi, nutaliya poruḷ eṉpatu -- nūṟ-poruḷi+ collutaleṉpatu. i+ nūl eṉ nutaliṟṟu* ō eṉiṉ, tamiḻ nutaliṟṟueṉpatu.

<P>kēṭpōr eṉpatu -- iṉṉār kēṭṭār eṉpatu. i+ nūl kēṭṭāryārō eṉiṉ, kuṟṟam uṭiya nūl āyiṉ aṉṟu* ē kuṟṟam iṉmiārāya vēṇṭuvatu; itu muṉivaṉ taṉṉāṟ ceyyappaṭṭa nūlākalāṉ kuṟṟam iṉṟu* ē; iṉmiyiṟ kēṭṭāri ~um iṉṟu*eṉpatu. inṟu* ē ~eṉiṉum, uri naṭantu -vārā-niṉṟaminōkki+ kēṭṭāri -~um uṭittu* eṉpatu. yārō kēṭṭār eṉiṉ,maturi uppūrikuṭikiḻār makaṉ āvāṉ uruttiracaṉmaṉeṉpatu. avaṉ kēṭṭaṟku+ kāraṇam^ collutum:

<H3>((muccaṅka varalāṟu))</H3>

<P>tali+-caṅkam, iṭi+-caṅkam, kaṭi+-caṅkam eṉa mūṉṟucaṅkam irīiyiṉār pāṇṭiyar.
avar -uḷ tali+-caṅkam iruntār akattiyaṉār -um,tiripuram eritta viricaṭi+ kaṭavuḷ -um, kuṉṟu* eṟintamuruka-vēḷ -um, muriñciyūr muṭinākarāyar -um, nitiyiṉkiḻavaṉ -um eṉa ittoṭakkattār aiññūṟṟu nāṟpattuoṉpatiṉmar eṉpa. avaruḷḷiṭṭu nālāyirattu nāṉūṟṟunāṟpattoṉpatiṉmar pāṭiṉār eṉpa. avarkaḷāṉ+ pāṭa+-paṭṭaṉa ettuṇiyō paripāṭal -um, mutunāri -~um,mutukuruku* -um, kaḷariyāviri -~um eṉa ittoṭakkattaṉa.avar nālāyirattu nāṉūṟṟu nāṟpatiṟṟu^ yāṇṭu caṅkamiruntār eṉpatu. avarkaḷi+ caṅkam irīiyiṉārkāyciṉavaḻuti mutal-āka+ kaṭuṅkōṉ īṟu*-ākaeṇpattoṉpatiṉmar eṉpa. avaruḷ kaviyaraṅkēṟiṉār eḻuvarpāṇṭiyar eṉpa. avar caṅkam iruntu tamiḻ ārāyntu kaṭalkoḷḷappaṭṭa maturi eṉpa. avarkku nūl akattiyam eṉpa.

<P>iṉi, iṭi+-caṅkam iruntār akattiyaṉār -um,tolkāppiyaṉār -um, iruntiyūr karuṅkōḻi mōci -~um,veḷḷūr+ kāppiyaṉ -um, ciṟu pāṇṭaraṅkaṉ -um, tiriyaṉmāṟaṉ -um, tuvari+ kōmāṉ -um, kīranti -~um eṉa i+toṭakkattār aimpattoṉpatiṉmar eṉpa. avaruḷḷiṭṭumūvāyirattu eḻunūṟṟuvar pāṭiṉār eṉpa. avarkaḷāṉ+ pāṭa+-paṭṭaṉa kali -~um, kuruku* -um, veṇṭāḷi -~um,viyāḻamāli akaval -um //
<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P6">{{iṟi: Page 6}}</A>
<HR>
// eṉa i+ toṭakkattaṉa eṉpa. avarkku nūl akattiyam -um,tolkāppiyam -um, māpurāṇam -um, ici-nuṇukkam -um,pūtapurāṇam -um eṉa ivi. avar mūvāyirattu eḻunūṟṟu^yāṇṭu caṅkam iruntār eṉpa. avari+ caṅkam irīiyiṉārveṇtērcceḻiyaṉ mutal-āka muṭattirumāṟaṉ īṟu*-ākaaimpattoṉpatiṉmar eṉpa. avaruḷ kaviyaraṅkēṟiṉār aivareṉpa. avar caṅkam iruntu tamiḻ ārāyntatu kapāṭapurattueṉpa. akkālattu+ pōlum pāṇṭiyaṉāṭṭi+ kaṭalkoṇṭatu.

<P>iṉi+ kaṭi+-caṅkam iruntu tamiḻ ārāyntārciṟumētāviyār -um, cēntampūtaṉār -um, aṟivu* uṭiyarīr-um, perum^ kuṉṟūrkiḻār -um, iḷantirumāṟaṉ -um, maturiāciriyar nallantuvaṉār -um, maturi marutaṉiḷanākaṉār-um, kaṇakkāyaṉār makaṉār nakkīraṉār -um eṉa i+toṭakkattār nāṟpattoṉpatiṉmar eṉpa. avaruḷḷiṭṭu nāṉūṟṟunāṟpattoṉpatiṉmar pāṭiṉār eṉpa. avarkaḷāṉ+ pāṭappaṭṭaṉaneṭuntoki nāṉūṟu* -um, kuṟuntoki nāṉūṟu* -um,naṟṟiṇi nāṉūṟu* -um, puṟa nāṉūṟu* -um, aiṅkuṟu nūṟu*-um, patiṟṟuppattu* -um, nūṟṟimpatu kali -~um, eḻupatuparipāṭal -um, kūttu* -um, vari -~um, ciṟṟici -~um,pērici -~um eṉṟu i+ toṭakkattaṉa. avarkku nūlakattiyam -um, tolkāppiyam -um eṉpa. avar caṅkam iruntutamiḻ ārāyntatu āyirattu eṇṇūṟṟu aimpatiṟṟu^ yāṇṭueṉpa. avarkaḷi+ caṅkam irīiyiṉār kaṭal-koḷḷa+ -paṭṭu+pōntirunta muṭattirumāṟaṉ mutal-āka ukkira+ peruvaḻutiīṟu*-āka nāṟpattoṉpatiṉmar eṉpa. avar -uḷ+kaviyaraṅkēṟiṉār mūvar eṉpa. avar caṅkam iruntu tamiḻārāyntatu uttaramaturi eṉpa.

<H3>((kaḷaviyaliṉ varalāṟu))</H3>

<P>akkālattu+ pāṇṭiyaṉāṭu paṉṉīriyāṇṭu vaṟkaṭam^ceṉṟatu. cella -~ē, paci kaṭukutal um, aracaṉ ciṭṭari~ellām^ kūvi, vammiṉ, yāṉ uṅkaḷi+ puṟantara -killēṉ; eṉ tēyampēritum varuntukiṉṟatu; nīyir numakku aṟintavāṟu pukku,nāṭu nāṭu* āyiṉa ñāṉṟu eṉṉi ~uḷḷi vammiṉ eṉṟāṉ. eṉa,aracaṉi viṭuttu ellārum pōyiṉa piṉṟi+, kaṇakku* iṉṟi+paṉṉīru^ yāṇṭu kaḻintatu. kaḻinta piṉṉar, nāṭu maliyamaḻi peytatu. peyta piṉṉar, aracaṉ, `iṉi nāṭu nāṭu*āyiṟṟu* ākaliṉ, nūl vallāri+ koṇarka' eṉṟu ellā+pakkam -um āṭpōkka, eḻuttu*-atikāram -um col=-atikāram-um //
<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P7">{{iṟi: Page 7}}</A>
<HR>
// yāppu*-atikāram -um vallāri+ tali+-paṭṭu+koṇarntu, `poruḷ-atikāram vallāri eṅkum^ tali+-paṭṭu*-ilēm' eṉṟu vantār. vara aracaṉ -um puṭi-paṭa+ kavaṉṟu`eṉṉi, eḻuttu* -um col= -um yāppu* -um ārāyvatuporuḷ-atikārattiṉ poruṭṭu* aṉṟu* ē. poruḷ-atikārampeṟēm -ē ~eṉiṉ, ivi peṟṟum peṟṟu*-ilēm' eṉa+collā-niṟpa, maturi ālavāyil aḻal niṟa+ kaṭavuḷcintippāṉ: `eṉṉi pāvam! aracaṟku+ kavaṟci peritu*āyiṟṟu; atu tāṉ -um ñāṉattu*-iṭiyatu* ākalāṉ, yāmataṉi+ tīrkkaṟ-pālam' eṉṟu, iv= aṟupatu cūttiratti-~um^ ceytu mūṉṟu ceppu*-itaḻ akattu eḻuti+ pīṭattiṉkīḻ iṭṭāṉ.

<P>iṭṭa piṟṟi-ñāṉṟu, tēvar-kulam vaḻi-paṭuvāṉ, tēvarkōṭṭatti eṅkum^ tuṭittu, nīr teḷittu+ pū-~iṭṭu+pīṭattiṉ -kīḻ eṉṟu*-um alaku*-iṭātāṉ aṉṟu teyvatattu+kuṟippiṉāṉ, `alaku*-iṭuveṉ' eṉṟu, uḷḷaṅ-kuḷiraalaku*-iṭṭāṉ; iṭṭāṟku av= alakiṉōṭu* -um itaḻ pōntaṉa.pōtara+, koṇṭupōntu nōkkiṉāṟku vāyppu* uṭittu* āyiṟṟu*ōr poruḷatikāram āy+ kāṭṭiṟṟu. kāṭṭa+, pirāmaṇaṉcintippāṉ: `aracaṉ poruḷatikāram iṉmiyiṟ kavalkiṉṟāṉeṉpatu kēṭṭu+ cellā-niṉṟatu uṇarntu namperumāṉ aruḷi+ceytāṉ ākum' eṉṟu taṉ akam pukutātu* -ē, kōyil+^tali+-kaṭi+ ceṉṟu niṉṟu, kaṭi-kāppārkku uṇartta+,kaṭi-kāppār aracaṟku uṇartta, aracaṉ, pukutuka' eṉa+pirāmaṇaṉi+ kūva+, ceṉṟu pukku+ kāṭṭa ēṟṟukkoṇṭunōkki+, `poruḷatikāram! itu namperumāṉ namatu iṭukkaṇkaṇṭu aruḷi+ ceytāṉ ākaṟ-pālatu!' eṉṟu, a+-tici nōkki+toḻutu-koṇṭu niṉṟu, caṅkattāri+ kūvuvittu, `namperumāṉnamatu iṭukkaṇ kaṇṭu aruḷi+ ceyta poruḷ-atikāram,itaṉi+ koṇṭu-pōy+ poruḷ kāṇmiṉ' eṉa avarkaḷ ataṉi+koṇṭu-pōntu kalmā+-palaki ēṟi-~iruntu ārāyvu*-uḻi,ellār-um tām^-tām uritta uri -~ē nallatu* eṉṟu cilanāḷ -ellām^ ceṉṟaṉa.

<H3>((kaḷaviyal uri kaṇṭami))</H3>

<P>cella, `nām iṅṅaṉam ettuṇi urippiṉum oru-tali+-paṭātu; nām aracaṉ -uḻi+ ceṉṟu, namakku* ōrkāraṇikaṉi+ taral vēṇṭum eṉṟu koṇṭu-pōntu, avaṉāṉ+poruḷ eṉa+-paṭṭatu poruḷ -āy, aṉṟu* eṉa+-paṭṭatu aṉṟu*āy oḻiya+ //
<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P8">{{iṟi: Page 8}}</A>
<HR>
// kāṇṭum' eṉṟu, ellārum oru+-paṭṭu, aracaṉ -uḻi+ceṉṟār. aracaṉ -um etirceṉṟu, `eṉṉi, nūṟku+ poruḷkaṇṭīr -ō?' eṉa, `atu kāṇum-āṟu emakku* ōr kāraṇikaṉi+ taral vēṇṭum' eṉa, pōmiṉ, numakku* ōrkāraṇikaṉi yāṉ eṅṅaṉam nāṭuvēṉ! nīyirnāṟpattoṉpatiṉmar āyiṟṟu, numakku nikar āvār oruvariṉmiyiṉ aṉṟu* -ē? eṉṟu aracaṉ colla+, pōntu,kalmāppalaki ēṟiyiruntu, `aracaṉ -um itu colliṉāṉ, yāmkāraṇikaṉi+ peṟumāṟu eṉṉikol' eṉṟu cintippuḻi,cūttiram^ ceytāṉ ālavāyil avircaṭi+ kaṭavuḷ aṉṟu* ē,avaṉi ~ē kāraṇikaṉi ~um taral vēṇṭum eṉa+ ceṉṟuvaram^ kiṭattum eṉṟu varam^ kiṭappa, iṭiyāmattu, `iv=ūr uppūri kuṭikiḻār makaṉ āvāṉ uruttiracaṉmaṉ eṉpāṉ,piṅkaṇṇaṉ, puṉmayiraṉ, aiyāṭṭi+ pirāyattāṉ, orumūṅki+-piḷḷi uḷaṉ; avaṉi aṉṉaṉ eṉṟu ikaḻātukoṇṭu-pōntu, ācaṉattiṉ mēl irīi+ kīḻiruntu cūttira+poruḷ urittāl+ kaṇṇīr vārntu meymmayir cilirkkum, mey=āyiṉa uri kēṭṭa-~iṭattu; mey= allā uri kēṭṭa -~iṭattuvāḷā irukkum; avaṉ kumāra teyvam. aṅku* ōr cāpattiṉāltōṉṟiṉāṉ' eṉa mukkāl icitta kural ellārkku*-umuṭaṉ-pāṭu* āyiṟṟu; āka, eḻuntiruntu, tēvarkulattivalaṅkoṇṭu pōntu, uppūri kuṭikiḻār uḻi+ caṅkam -ellām^ceṉṟu, iv vārtti -~ellām^ colli, `aiyaṉ āvāṉuruttiracaṉmaṉi+ taral vēṇṭum' eṉṟu vēṇṭi+ koṭu pōntu,veḷiyatu uṭīi, veṇpū+ cūṭṭi, veṇcāntu aṇintukalmāppalaki ~ēṟṟi+ kīḻiruntu cūttira+ poruḷ urippaellārum muṟi ~ē poruḷ urippa+ kēṭṭu vāḷā iruntumaturi marutaṉiḷanākaṉār uritta -~iṭattu or-ō-~iṭattu kaṇṇīr vārntu, meymmayir niṟutti, piṉṉar+kaṇakkāyaṉār makaṉār nakkīraṉār urittaviṭattu+patantoṟum^ kaṇṇīr vārntu, meymmayir cilirppa iruntāṉ.iruppa, ārppu*-eṭuttu,`mey= uri peṟṟām i+ nūṟku!'eṉṟār.

<P>ataṉāl, uppūri kuṭikiḻār makaṉ āvāṉ uruttiracaṉmaṉāvāṉ ceytatu i+ nūṟku uri eṉpār -um uḷar; avarceytilar, mey=-uri kēṭṭār eṉka. maturi ālavāyiṟperumāṉ aṭikaḷāṉ+ ceyya+-paṭṭa nūṟku nakkīraṉārāluri-kaṇṭu, kumāracuvāmiyāṉ+ kēṭka+-paṭṭatu eṉka. iṉiuri naṭantu vantavāṟu collutum:

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P9">{{iṟi: Page 9}}</A>
<HR>
<H3>((uri naṭantuvanta muṟi))</H3>

<P>maturi+ kaṇakkāyaṉār makaṉār nakkīraṉār tam makaṉārkīraṅ-koṟṟaṉārkku urittār; avar tēṉūr-kiḻārkkuurittār; avar paṭiyaṅ-koṟṟaṉārkku urittār; avarcelvattāciriyar peruñcuvaṉārkku urittār; avarmaṇalūr-āciriyar puḷiyaṅkāy+ peruñ-cēntaṉārkkuurittār; avar cellūr-āciriyar āṇṭi+ perum^kumāraṉārkku urittār; avar tirukkuṉṟattu*-āciriyarkkuurittār; avar mātaḷavaṉār iḷanākaṉārkku urittār; avarmuciṟi-~āciriyar nīlakaṇṭaṉārkku urittār. iṅṅaṉamvarukiṉṟatu uri.

<P>iṉi+ payaṉ eṉpatu, itu kaṟka iṉṉatu payakkum eṉpatu.itu kaṟka iṉṉatu payakkum eṉpatu aṟiyēṉ, yāṉ nūl+ poruḷaṟival eṉṉum -ē ~eṉiṉ, cil= eḻuttiṉāṉ iyaṉṟa payaṉaṟiyātāy, pal= eḻuttiṉāṉ iyaṉṟa nūṟporuḷ yāṅṅaṉam aṟiti~ō eṉappaṭum; ākaliṉ, iṉṉatu payakkum eṉpatu aṟiyalvēṇṭum. eṉ payakkum -ō itu kaṟka eṉiṉ, vīṭu-pēṟupayakkum eṉpatu.

<H3>((kaḷavu eṉṟataṉ kāraṇam))</H3>

<P>eṉṉi,
itu kaḷavu*-iyal aṉṟu* -ē,
itu kaṟka vīṭu-pēṟu payakkum-āṟu eṉṉi,

<P>kaḷavu koli kāmam iṇi-viḻiccu eṉpaṉa ~aṉṟu* ōcamayattārāṉ -um ulakattārāṉ -um kaṭiya+ -paṭṭaṉa.

<P>avaṟṟu* -uḷ oṉṟu* aṉṟu* -āl -ō ~itu eṉiṉ,
aṟṟu* aṉṟu.

<P>kaḷavu eṉṉum^ col+ kēṭṭu+ kaḷavu tītu* eṉpatūum,
kāmam eṉṉum^ col+ kēṭṭu+ kāmam tītu* eṉpatūum aṉṟu;

<P>maṟṟu
avi nalla ām-āṟu* -um uṇṭu:

<P>eṉṉi,

<P>oru peṇṭāṭṭi tamaroṭu kalāyttu
nañcu* uṇṭu cāval eṉṉum uḷḷattaḷ āy
nañcu kūṭṭi -vittu,
vilaṅkkuvār illāta-pōḻtu uṇpal eṉṟu niṉṟa -~iṭattu,

<P>aruḷ uṭiyāṉ oruvaṉ ataṉi+ kaṇṭu,
`ivaḷ itaṉi uṇṭu cāvāmal+
koṇṭu-pōy ukuppal eṉṟu
avaḷi+ kāṇamē koṇṭu-pōy ukuttiṭṭāṉ;
<P>((CORR. TVG: pavāṉantar kaḻakam [1939] vs. kaḻakam))

<P>avaḷ -um caṉa nīkkattukkaṇ nañcu* uṇṭu cāvāṉ ceṉṟāḷ;
atu kāṇāḷ āy+ cākkāṭu nīṅkiṉāḷ.

<P>avaṉ a+ kaḷaviṉāl avaḷi uyyakkoṇṭamiyiṉ
nal= ūḻiṟ cellum eṉpatu.

<P>maṟṟum itu pōlvaṉa kaḷavu* ākā;
naṉmi payakkum eṉpatu.

<P>iṉi+
kāmam naṉṟu* āmāṟu* -um uṇṭu.

<P>cuvarkkattiṉkaṇ ceṉṟu pōkam^ tuyppal eṉṟu* -um,
uttara-kuruviṉkaṇ ceṉṟu pōkam^ tuyppal eṉṟu* -um,
nal% ñāṉam^ kaṟṟu vīṭu peṟuval //
<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P10">{{iṟi: Page 10}}</A>
<HR>
// eṉṟu* -um,
teyvatti vaḻipaṭuval eṉṟu* -um
eḻunta kāmam kaṇṭāy aṉṟu* ē?

<P>mēṉmakkaḷāṉ -um pukaḻappaṭṭu,
maṟumikku* -um uṟuti payakkum
ātaliṉ,
i+ kāmam peritum uṟuti ~uṭittu eṉpatu

<P>uṟuti uṭittu* āmāṟu:
aṟu-vaki+ -paṭṭa pācāṇṭikar -um
iṇi-viḻiccu+ tītu* eṉpa.

<P>aḵtu uṇṭām -iṭattu+ cuṟṟa+ toṭarcci uṇṭām;

<P>uṇṭāka ~ē,
koli -~ē kaḷavu* -ē vekuḷi -~ē cerukku* -ē māṉam -ēeṉṟu i+ toṭakkattu+ kuṟṟam nikaḻum eṉpatu.

<P>atu kēṭka ~ē,

<P>tali ~āyiṉār ataṉkaṇiṉṟu nīṅkuvar.

<P>iṉi,
iṭi ~āyiṉār,
peṇ eṉpatu
eṟpu+ caṭṭakam, muṭi+ kurampi, puḻu+ piṇṭam, pi+maṟiyā nōkka+ paruntu* ārkkum^ takimittu;
ai -~um pittu* -um vaḷi -~um kuṭar -um koḻu -~um puraḷi-~um narampu* -um mūttira-purīṭaṅkaḷ -um eṉṟu
ivaṟṟatu iyipu poruḷ aṉṟu;

<P>poruḷ āyiṉ,
pū -~ē cāntu* -ē pāku* -ē eṇṇey -~ē aṇikalaṉ -ēeṉṟivaṟṟāṉ+ puṉiya vēṇṭā,
tāṉ iyalpāka -~ē naṉṟu* āyiṉ
eṉṟu ataṉ acupa+ taṉmi urippa+ kēṭṭu nīṅkuvar.

<P>kaṭi ~āyiṉār e+-tiṟattāṉ-um nīṅkār; eṉṉi, palpiṟappu* -iṭi āṇ um peṇ= um āy+ payiṉṟu, pōkam^ tuyttuvarukiṉṟamiyiṉ. avarkku itu kāṭṭappaṭṭatu. eṉṉi,`pētiyi+ kātal kāṭṭi+ kiviṭukka' eṉpataṉāl avaṉtāḻappaṭṭa iṇiviḻicciṉ-uḷ= ē mikkatu* oṉṟukāṭṭappaṭṭatu. eñ-ñāṉṟu*-um mūppu+ piṇi cākkāṭu illatu,nicca nirappu iṭumpi illatu; ivaṉ -um patiṉāṟu* āṭṭi+pirāyattāṉ āy, ivaḷ -um paṉṉīr āṭṭi+ pirāyattāḷ āy,otta paṇpu* -um, otta nalaṉ -um, otta aṉpu* -um, ottacelvam -um, otta kalvi -~um uṭiyar āy+, piṟitoṉṟiṟkuūṉam iṉṟi+ pōkam^ tuyppar eṉṟu kāṭṭa+ -paṭṭatu eṉpatu.eṉ pōla -~ō eṉiṉ, kaṭu+ tiṉṉātāṉi+ kaṭṭi pūci+ kaṭu+tīṟṟiyavāṟu pōla -~um, kalaṅkaṟ ciṉṉīr teruḷāmiyāṉuṇpāṉi, aṟivu* uṭiyāṉ oruvaṉ pēyttēri+ kāṭṭi, `utu+kāṇāy, nallatu* oru nīr tōṉṟukiṉṟatu, a+ nīr parukāy,i+ cēṟṟu nīr paruki eṉ ceyti'! eṉṟu koṇṭu pōy naṉṉīrkāṭṭi ūṭṭiyatu pōla ~um, tāṉ oḻukāniṉṟatu* -ōriṇi-viḻicciṉ -uḷ= ē mikkatu* -ōr oḻukkam^ kāṭṭiṉāṉ.kāṭṭa ~ē, kaṇṭu, `itu peṟum-āṟu eṉṉi kollō'? eṉṉum;eṉa ~ē, makkaṭpāṭṭiṉ -āṉum vali -~āṉum //
<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P11">{{iṟi: Page 11}}</A>
<HR>
// vaṉappu* -āṉum poruḷ -āṉum peṟal -āvatu aṉṟu, tavam^ceytāṟ peṟal ām;

<P>eṉṉi,
<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`vēṇṭiya vēṇṭiyāṅku* eytalāṉ+ cey tavam
<BR>	īṇṭu muyala+ -paṭum'. (kuṟaḷ. tavam -- 5)
<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉpatu* ākalāṉ eṉpatu. atu kēṭṭu, iṉi yāṉ -um tavam^ceytu itaṉi+ peṟuval eṉṟu, ataṉ -māṭṭu vēṭkiyāl,tavam^ ceyyum; ceyyā-niṉṟāṉi+, `pāvī, itaṉ parattatu*-ō vīṭu-pēṟṟu* iṉpam?' eṉṟu, vīṭu-pēṟṟu* iṉpattivirittu urikkum. atu tāṉ piṟappu+ piṇi mūppu+ cākkāṭṭuavala+ kavali+ kiyāṟṟiṉ nīṅki, maṇiyiṉatu oḷi -~um,malariṉatu nāṟṟam -um, cantaṉattatu taṭpam -um pōla,uḷniṉṟu eḻutarum oru pēr-iṉpa veḷḷattatu eṉpatu kēṭṭu,ataṉi viṭṭu, vīṭu-pēṟṟiṉkaṇ= ē avāvi-niṉṟu, tavam -umñāṉam -um purintu, vīṭu peṟuvāṉ ām eṉpatu. avaṉivañcittu+ koṇṭu-ceṉṟu, nal%^neṟikkaṇ niṟīiyiṉamiyiṉkaḷaviyal eṉṉum^ kuṟi peṟṟatu.

<H3>((itu kaṟka nāṟporuḷum payakkum eṉpatu))</H3>

<P>iṉi+, pukaḻ poruḷ naṭpu aṟaṉ eṉṉum nāṉkiṉi ~umpayakkum, itu vallaṉāka; eṉṉi, kaṟṟuvallaṉ eṉpataṉiṉmikka pukaḻ illi, ulakattārāṉum camayattārāṉum oruṅkupukaḻappaṭum ākalāṉ eṉpatu. iṉi+, poruḷum payakkum;eṉṉi, poruḷuṭiyār um poruḷkoṭuttu+ kaṟpar ākaliṉeṉpatu. iṉi, naṭpu* um payakkum: eṉṉi, kaṟṟāri+cārntu oḻuka ~ē emakku* um aṟivu perukum eṉṟu palar um^cārntu oḻukaliṉ eṉpatu. iṉi, aṟaṉum payakkum; eṉṉi,ñāṉattiṉ mikka koṭi iṉmiyāṉ eṉpatu. itu payaṉ.

<P>iṉi+, kālam eṉpatu -- kaṭiccaṅkattār kālattu+ceyyappaṭṭatu.

<P>iṉi+, kaḷam eṉpatu -- ukkirapperuvaḻutiyāravikkaḷam eṉpatu.

<P>kāraṇam eṉpatu -- a+ kālattu+ pāṇṭiyaṉ -um caṅkattār-um poruḷ-ilakkaṇam peṟātu iṭar-paṭuvāri+ kaṇṭuālavāyiṟ perumāṉ-aṭikaḷāl veḷi+-paṭukka+ -paṭṭatu.

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P12">{{iṟi: Page 12}}</A>
<HR>
<H3>((nūl))</H3>

<P>iṉi+, pāyiram uritta -piṉṉar nūl urikkaṟ -pālatu.atu tāṉ nāṉku-vakiyāṉ urikka+ -paṭum: avi yāvi -~ō~eṉiṉ, nūl nutaliyatu urittal -um, nūluḷ atikāramnutaliyatu urittal -um, atikārattu* -uḷ ōttunutaliyatu urittal -um, ōttiṉ -uḷ+ cūttiram nutaliyatuurittal -um eṉa ivi. avaṟṟuḷ, nūl nutaliyatu urikkum-iṭattu, nūl-āmāṟu* -um nūl eṉṟa coṟku+ poruḷ ām -āṟu*um urittu urikkaṟ-pāṟṟu.

<H3>((mūvaki nūl -um, etir nūl -um))</H3>

<P>avaṟṟuḷ, nūl āmāṟu urikkumiṭattu, nūltāṉmūṉṟuvakippaṭum. mutaṉūlum vaḻinūlum cārpunūlum eṉa:
eṉṉi,
<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`mutal vaḻi cārpu* eṉa nūl mūṉṟu* ākum'.
<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉṟār ākaliṉ.
avaṟṟuḷ, mutaṉūl āvatu -- varampil aṟivaṉ payantatu*ākum:
eṉṉi,
<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`viṉiyiṉ* ^nīṅki viḷaṅkiya ~aṟiviṉ
<BR>	muṉivaṉ kaṇṭatu mutalnūl ākum' (marapiyal -- 91)
<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉa ~um,
<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`mutalvaṉa nūṟku+ piṟaṉkōḷ+ kūṟātu'.
<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉa ~um,
<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`tantiram^ cūttiram virutti mūṉṟaṟku
<BR>	muntunūl illatu mutalnūl ākum'.
<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉa ~um coṉṉār ākaliṉ.

<P>iṉi, annūlōṭu otta marapiṟṟāy āciriya matavikaṟpampaṭa+ kiḷappatu vaḻinūl eṉappaṭum;
eṉṉi,
<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`muṉṉōr nūliṉ muṭipu* oruṅku* ottu+
<BR>	piṉṉōṉ vēṇṭum vikaṟpam^ kūṟi
<BR>	aḻiyā marapiṉatu vaḻinūl ākum'
<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉṟār ākaliṉ.

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P13">{{iṟi: Page 13}}</A>
<HR>
avviru nūluḷḷum oruvaḻi muṭinta poruḷi ōr upakāranōkki, oru kōvippaṭa vippatu cārpunūl ākum;
eṉṉi,
<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`iruvar nūṟkum oruciṟi toṭaṅki+
<BR>	tiripuvēṟu* uṭiyatu puṭinūl ākum'.
<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉṟār ākaliṉ.
iṉi, etirnūl eṉpatum oṉṟu uṇṭu. atu yātō eṉiṉ,mutaṉūliṉ muṭintaporuḷi ōr āciriyaṉ yātāṉum orukāraṇattāṉ+ piṟaḻavittāl, ataṉi+ karuviyāl tirivukāṭṭi oruvāmi vittaṟku, oḷḷiyāṉ oru pulavaṉālurikkappaṭuvatu;
eṉṉi,

<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`taṉkōḷ niṟīi+ piṟaṉkōḷ maṟuppatu*
<BR>	etirnūl eṉpa orucārōr ē'

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉṟār ākaliṉ.
allatūum,

<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`nūl eṉa+ paṭuvatu nutaliya poruḷi
<BR>	āti+ kaṇ= ē ~aṟiya+ cuṭṭi
<BR>	ōttumuṟi niṟuttu+ cūttira niṟīi
<BR>	mutal vaḻi cārpu* eṉa mū vaki marapiṉ
<BR>	toki vaki viriyiṉ vaciyaṟa+ terintu
<BR>	ñāpakam^ cemporuḷ āyiru vakiyiṉ+
<BR>	pāvam aintu* oḻukum paṇpiṟṟu* āki+
<BR>	puṇarcciyiṉ amintatu poruḷakattu* aṭakki+
<BR>	taṉakku varampu* āki+ tāṉ muṭivu* atu ~ē'
<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉa ~um coṉṉār ākaliṉ.
aṉṟi ~um,

<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`nūleṉa+ paṭuvatu nuvalum^ kāli
<BR>	nutaliya poruḷi mutaliṟ kūṟi
<BR>	mutal um muṭivum māṟukōḷ iṉṟi+
<BR>	tokiyiṉum vakiyiṉum poruṇmi kāṭṭi
<BR>	uṇṇiṉṟu* aminta uriyoṭu porunti
<BR>	nuṇṇitiṉ viḷakkal atu ~ataṉ paṇpu* ē'

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉṟār ākalāṉ -um, iv vaki colla+ -paṭṭatu nūl eṉpa.

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P14">{{iṟi: Page 14}}</A>
<HR>
<H3>((nūl eṉṟataṉ col+ poruḷ))</H3>

<P>iṉi, nūl eṉṟa coṟku* um poruḷ urikkappaṭum: nūlpōṟaliṉ nūl eṉpa, pāvi pōlvāḷi+ pāvi eṉṟāṟpōla, nūlpōṟal eṉpatu, nuṇṇiya pala ~āya pañciṉ nuṉikaḷāṉ+ kival makaṭūu+ taṉatu ceyki nalam^ tōṉṟaōriḻippaṭuttalām ulakattu nūl nūṟṟal eṉpatu. avvāṟu*ē, cukirntu paranta coṟparavikaḷāṉ+ perumpulavaṉtaṉatu uṇarvu māṭciyiṟ piṇṭam paṭalam ōttu+ cūttirameṉṉum yāppu naṭipaṭa+ kōttal āyiṟṟu, nūl ceytal āvatu;avvaki nūṟkappaṭutaliṉ nūl eṉappaṭṭatu.

<P>iṉi, oru cārār nūlpōla+ ceppam^ ceytaliṉ nūl eṉpa.

<P>iṉi+, tantiram eṉṉum vaṭamoḻipporuḷi nūl eṉavaḻaṅkutal tamiḻvaḻakku eṉa+ koḷka. itu nūl eṉṟa coṟku+poruḷ.

<H3>((nūl nutaliyatu))</H3>

<P>iṉi, nūl nutaliyatūum urikkaṟpālatu. atupāyirattuḷ= ē urittām; tamiḻ nutaliṟṟu eṉpatu. tamiḻnāṉku vakippaṭum, eḻuttu* um col= um poruḷ um yāppu*um eṉa.

<H3>((atikāram nutaliyatu))</H3>

<P>avaṟṟuḷ, iv= atikāram eṉṉutali eṭuttukkoḷḷappaṭṭatōeṉiṉ, poruḷ ārāytali nutali eṭuttukkoḷḷappaṭṭatu. iṉi,atikāram nutaliyatu ellām atikārattuḷ ōttu nutalā~aṉṟu* ē, pala ōttukkoṇṭatu ōr ātikāram ākalāṉ.

<P>itaṉuḷ iv= ōttu eṉṉutali eṭuttu+ koḷḷappaṭṭatu* -ōeṉiṉ, ōttiṉatu paṉmi ~iṉmiyiṉ ōttu iṉṟu eṉpatu.

<H3>((cūttiram nutaliyatu))</H3>

<P>iṉi+, cūttiram nutaliyatūum urikkaṟ pālatu. i+cūttiram eṉ nutaliṟṟu* -ō eṉiṉ -- cūttiram urikkiṉ,atu nāṉku vakiyāṉ urikkappaṭum. karutturittu+kaṇṇaḻittu+ poḻipputtiraṭṭi akalaṅkūṟal eṉa.

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P15">{{iṟi: Page 15}}</A>
<HR>
i+ cūttirattiṉ karuttu eṉṉiyō eṉiṉ, iv= atikārattuurikkiṉṟa poruḷ iṉṉatu eṉpatūum, iṉṉataṉōṭu okkumeṉpatūum uṇarttutal nutaliṟṟu. aṉṉatu* ākal i+ cūttiramkaṇṇaḻippa viḷaṅkum.

<P>kaṇṇaḻittal eṉpatu pata+-poruḷ collutal.

<P>itaṉ poruḷ: aṉpiṉ aim^ tiṇi+ kaḷavu eṉa+ -paṭuvatueṉpatu -- aṉpiṉāṉ āya aintiṇiyiṟ kaḷavu eṉappaṭṭaoḻukkam eṉṟavāṟu; antaṇar aru maṟi maṉṟal eṭṭiṉuḷeṉpatu -- antaṇar eṉpār pārppār, arumaṟi eṉpatu vētam,maṉṟal eṉpatu maṇam, eṭṭu eṉpatu avaṟṟatu tokieṉṟavāṟu; kantaruva vaḻakkam eṉmaṉār pulavar eṉpatu --kantaruva vaḻakkattōṭu okkum vaḻakkiṉi+ kaḷavu eṉṟucolluvar kaṟṟu-vallōr eṉṟavāṟu.

<P>iṉi+, poḻippu+ tiraṭṭal eṉpatu -- aṉpiṉāṉ āyaaintiṇiyiṟ kaḷavu eṉappaṭṭa oḻukkam pārppārvētattukkaṇ makaṭkōṭalāṟu eṉṉum eṭṭiṉuḷ kantaruvaroḻukalāṟu oppatu, ataṉi+ kaḷavu eṉṟu colluvar kaṟṟuvallōr eṉṟavāṟu.

<P>iṉi+, cūttirattu+ poruḷi+ tūymi ceytaṟku+ kaṭāviṭi uḷḷuṟuttu urikkum uri ~ellām akalavuri eṉa+koḷka.

<H3>((aṉpu eṉpatu))</H3>

<P>aṉpiṉ aim^ tiṇi eṉṟaviṭattu, aṉpu aṟintēṉ āyiṉaṉṟu* ē, aṉpiṉāṉ āya aintiṇi ~um aṟivatu eṉiṉ, atu,`kuṭattuḷ viḷakku* um, taṭaṟṟuḷ vāḷ um pōla' itukāṇaṉpu eṉṟu pōtattiṟantu kāṭṭalākātu. aṉpuṭiyarāṉakuṇam^ kaṇṭaviṭattu ivi uṇmiyāṉ īṅku aṉpu uṇṭu* eṉṟuaṉumittu+ koḷḷaṟpāṟṟu. aṉpuṭiyarāṉa kuṇam yāvi ~ōeṉiṉ -- cāviṟcātal, nōviṉātal, oṇporuḷ koṭuttal,naṉkiṉitu moḻital, puṇarvu naṉi vēṭṭal, pirivu naṉi~iraṅkal eṉa ivi; eṉṟārkku, ivi tiripuṭiya; eṉṉiivi tiripuṭiyavāṟu eṉiṉ,

<P>cāviṟ cātal eṉpatu, aṉpiṉāṉ ē nikaḻvatu aṉṟu, piṇi~uṭiyaḷ āy vāḻkkiyi muṉintu celvāḷ itu talikkīṭāka+cāval eṉṟu cāva ~um peṟum; iṉi+, `kaṇṭīr aṉṟu* ē, //
<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P16">{{iṟi: Page 16}}</A>
<HR>
// kuṭumikkūntalil naṟuney peytu, koṇṭāṉiṟ piṉṉi ~umiruntu, cōṟu tiṉṟu vāḻkiṉṟāḷ, ō koṭiyaḷēkāṇ! eṉṟunittal paḻitūṟṟappaṭṭiruntu, piṉṉum ē oru nāḷ+ cāval,ataṉāṉ iṉṟu* ē cāval' eṉa+ cāvavum peṟum; atu ~aṉṟi+pukaḻ vēṇṭi+ cāva ~um peṟum; kaṇavaṉoṭu cettārcuvarkkam pukuvar eṉṉum urikēṭṭu atu vēṭkiyāṉum^ cām;a+ paricu aṉṟi aṉpiṉāṉum^ cām; aḵtu orutaliyānikaḻvatu aṉṟu eṉpatu.

<P>iṉi, nōviṉ nōtal eṉpatu, iṉṉan ō eṉṟu aṟiyal ākātu; atu~um tiripuṭittu; aṉpu uḷvaḻi ~um aṉpu ilvaḻi ~umtōṉṟum eṉṟu maṟukkappaṭum.

<P>oṇporuḷ koṭuttal eṉpatu, kaṇikiyar kūṭṭam poruḷāṉ ām;ākaliṉ, atu ~um aṉpu aṉṟu.

<P>naṉkiṉitu moḻital eṉpatu, naṉkiṉitu colli+ pakivar um^tam karumam muṭippar; ākaliṉ, atu ~um aṉpu aṉṟu.

<P>puṇarvu naṉivēṭṭal eṉpatu, accam kāraṇattāṉum puṇarvuvēṭṭār pōla+ puṇarvar; ākaliṉ, atu ~um tiripuṭittu.

<P>pirivu naṉi ~iraṅkal eṉpatu, nīr um āṭār, pū ~um^cūṭār, cāntu* um aṇiyār āy+ pirintiruntārpōlavāṭiyiruppar, aṉpu ilātār um; ākaliṉ, atu ~um tiripu*uṭittu.

<P>iṉi+, tiripiṉṟi i+ kuṇaṅkaḷ nikaḻntavaḻi aṉpu uṇṭueṉa+ koḷka. aḵtu eṅṅaṉam nikaḻumō eṉiṉ, avaṉiṟantupaṭṭavāṟu* ē tāṉ um iṟantupaṭṭavaḻi aṉpiṉāṉ ēāyiṟṟu eṉa+ koḷka. allātaṉa ~um ivvakiyāl tiripuillaṉa aṉpiṉāṉ ē āyiṟṟu eṉa+ koḷka.

<P>allatūum, aṉpu eṉappaṭṭatu, tāṉ vēṇṭappaṭṭaporuḷiṉkaṇ tōṉṟum uḷḷanikaḻcci. ataṉi+ kāṭṭi+ kāṇkaeṉṉāṉ aṉṟu* ē, tāṉ aṟinta poruḷ ākaliṉ; eṉṉi, māṇākkaṉnīrvēṭṭāṉ, nīrvēṭṭa vēṭkiyi+ kāṭṭuka eṉṉāṉ, tāṉaṟinta poruḷ ākaliṉ; kāṭṭuka eṉṉum ē ~eṉiṉ vañcittāṉām; avaṉi āciriyaṉ aṟivikkal uṟum ē ~eṉiṉ pēti~āyiṉāṉ ām.

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P17">{{iṟi: Page 17}}</A>
<HR>
<H3>((poruḷ iraṇṭu vakippaṭum))</H3>

<P>allatūum, ulakattu+ poruḷ tāṉ iraṇṭuvakiyāṉuṇarttappaṭum. uṇmi māttiri uṇartti+ piḻampuuṇarttappaṭātaṉa ~um, uṇmi ~um piḻampu* umuṇarttappaṭuvaṉa ~um eṉa.

<P>avaṟṟuḷ, uṇmi ~uṇartti+ piḻampu uṇarttappaṭātaṉa kāmamum vekuḷi ~um mayakkam um iṉpam um tuṉpam um mutalāka~uṭiyaṉa;

<P>eṉṉi,

<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`oppum uruvum veṟuppum eṉṟā
<BR>	kaṟpum ērum eḻilum eṉṟā
<BR>	cāyalu nāṇu maṭavaṉum eṉṟā
<BR>	nōyum vēṭkiyu nukarvum eṉṟāṅku
<BR>	āvayiṉ varūum^ kiḷavi ~ellām
<BR>	nāṭṭiya marapiṉ neñcu koḷiṉ allatu
<BR>	kāṭṭal ākā+ poruḷa ~eṉpa'
<BR>		(([poruḷiyal -- 52]))
<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉṟār ākaliṉ.

<P>iṉi, uṇmi ~um piḻampum uṇarttappaṭuvaṉa māṭakkūṭalmānila+ toṭakkattaṉa eṉṟu koḷka. aṉpu* eṉṉum poruḷuṇmi māttiri ~allatu, piḻampu uṇarttappaṭātu eṉpatu;eṉṟārkku, aṉpu eṉpatu tāṉ karutappaṭṭa poruḷiṉkaṇtōṉṟum vēṭki ~aṉṟu* ē, īṇṭu nammāl aṉpu eṉṟuvikaṟpikkappaṭāniṉṟatu; aḵtu yātō eṉiṉ, nāṇu+ curuṅka,puṇarvuvēṭki peruka, oruvaṉōṭu oruttiyiṭi nikaḻumaṉpu vicēṭa ilakkaṇam uṭittu eṉṟu koḷka.

<H3>((aintiṇi eṉpaṉa))</H3>

<P>aḵtu* ē ~eṉiṉ, aṉpu aṟintēṉ; aintiṇi ~āvaṉa yāviyōeṉiṉ, kuṟiñci neytal pāli mulli marutam eṉa ivi.āyiṉ, aintiṇi eṉṟatu* allatu avaṟṟatu peyar um muṟi~um ilakkaṇam um aṟiya+ colliṟṟilar ō eṉiṉ, itucurukkanūl ākaliṉ colliṟṟilar; avi muṭinta nūliṟkoṇṭuurikkappaṭum. urikkumiṭattu, mutal karu uripporuḷ eṉamūṉṟuvakiyāṉ urikkappaṭum;

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P18">{{iṟi: Page 18}}</A>
<HR>
eṉṉi,
<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`mutal karu uripporuḷ eṉṟa mūṉṟu* ē
<BR>	nuvalum^ kāli muṟi ciṟantaṉa ~ē'.
<BR>		(([akattiṇiyiyal -- 3]))
<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉṟār ākaliṉ.

<H3>((aintiṇi mutaṟporuḷ))</H3>

<P>avi varumāṟu:
avaṟṟuḷ, mutal iraṇṭu vakippaṭum, nilam um poḻutumeṉa.
eṉṉi,
<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`mutal eṉa+ paṭuvatu nilam poḻutu* iraṇṭiṉ
<BR>	iyalpu* eṉa moḻipa iyalpu* uṇarntōr ē'.
<BR>		(([akattiṇiyiyal -- 4]))
<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉṟār ākaliṉ.

<P>kuṟiñcikku nilam, mali ~um malicārnta iṭam um;poḻutu, kūtir um yāmam um muṉpaṉi ~um.

<P>neytaṟku nilam, kaṭal um kaṭalcārnta iṭam um; poḻutu,eṟpāṭu.

<P>pālikku nilam illi.
<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`naṭuvaṇ aintiṇi naṭuvaṇatu* oḻiya+
<BR>	paṭu tiri viyam pāttiya paṇpu* ē'.
<BR>		(([akattiṇiyiyal -- 2]))
<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉṟār tolkāppiyaṉār ākaliṉ, poḻutu, naṇpakal um, vēṉilum, piṉpaṉi ~um. nilam iṉṟi+ poḻutiṉāṉ ē tiṇi ~ām ōeṉiṉ, kuṟiñci ~um mulli ~um aṭutta nilam ē kālampaṟṟi+ pālinilam ām eṉpatu.

<P>mullikku nilam, kāṭum kāṭucārnta iṭam um; poḻutu,kār um māli ~um.

<P>marutattiṟku nilam, paḻaṉam um paḻaṉam^ cārnta iṭamum poḻutu, vikaṟi yāmam.

<P>aḵtu eṉṉi peṟumāṟu eṉiṉ,
<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`māyōṉ mēya kāṭuṟi ~ulakam um
<BR>	cēyōṉ mēya mivari ~ulakam um
<BR>	vēntaṉ mēya tīmpuṉal ulakam um
<BR>	varuṇaṉ mēya perumaṇal ulakam um

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P19">{{iṟi: Page 19}}</A>
<HR>
<BR>	mulli kuṟiñci marutam neytal eṉa+
<BR>	colliya muṟiyāṉ+ colla ~um paṭum ē'.
<BR>		(([akat. -- 5]))

<P>	`kār um* māli ~um* mulli'.
<BR>		(([akat. -- 6]))

<P>	`kuṟiñci
<BR>	kūtir yāmam eṉmaṉār pulavar'.
<BR>		(([akat -- 7]))

<P>	`paṉi ~etir paruvam um urittu* eṉa moḻipa'.
<BR>		(([akat. -- 8]))

<P>	`vikuṟu viṭiyal marutam'.
<BR>		(([akat. -- 9]))

<P>	`eṟpāṭu
<BR>	neytal ātal meypeṟa+ tōṉṟum'
<BR>		(([akat. -- 10]))

<P>	`naṭuvunili+ tiṇi ~ē naṇpakal vēṉiloṭu
<BR>	muṭivunili maruṅkiṉ muṉṉiya neṟittu* ē'.
<BR>		(([akat. -- 11]))

<P>	`piṉpaṉi tāṉ um urittu* eṉa moḻipa'.
<BR>		(([akat. -- 12]))
<P>{{C URAI}}

<P>marutattiṟkum neytaṟkum perumpoḻutu colliṟṟiṉmiyiṉ,aṟuvaki irutuvum uriya eṉa+ koḷka: ivi mutal.

<H3>((aintiṇi+ karupporuḷ))</H3>

<P>iṉi+, karu eṉpatu teyvam um uṇāvu* um mā ~um maramum puḷ= um paṟi ~um ceyti ~um yāḻ um mutalākauṭiyatu;
eṉṉi,
<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`teyvam uṇāvu* ē mā maram puḷ+ paṟi
<BR>	ceyti yāḻiṉ pakutiyoṭu tokii
<BR>	avvaki piṟavum^ karu ~eṉa moḻipa'.
<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉṟār ākaliṉ, avi ammuṟiyāṉ ē collutum.

<P>kuṟiñcikku+,
teyvam -- murukavēḷ;
uṇā -- aivaṉa nellum, tiṉi ~um;
mā -- puli ~um, paṉṟi ~um, yāṉi ~um;
maram -- akilum, āram um, timicum, tēkkum, vēṅki ~um;
puḷ -- kiḷi ~um, mayilum;
paṟi -- veṟiyāṭṭuppaṟi ~um, toṇṭakappaṟi ~um,kuravippaṟi ~um;

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P20">{{iṟi: Page 20}}</A>
<HR>
ceyti -- tēṉ aḻittal um, kiḻaṅku akaḻtal um, kuṉṟamāṭutal um, tiṉikkiḷi kaṭital um;
yāḻ -- kuṟiñciyāḻ.

<P>`piṟavum' eṉṟataṉāl,
talimakaṉ peyar -- cilampaṉ, veṟpaṉ, poruppaṉ;
talimakaḷ peyar -- koṭicci, kuṟatti;
nīr -- aruvinīrum, cuṉinīrum;
ūr -- ciṟukuṭi ~um, kuṟicci ~um;
pū -- kuṟiñci ~um, kāntaḷum, vēṅki ~um, cuṉikkuvaḷi~um;
makkaḷpeyar -- kuṟavar, iṟavuḷar, kuṉṟavar eṉappaṭum.

<P>neytaṟku+,
teyvam -- varuṇaṉ;
uṇā -- mīṉvilipporuḷum, uppuvilipporuḷum;
mā -- cuṟāvum, mutali ~um;
maram -- puṉṉi ~um, ñāḻal um, kaṇṭal um;
puḷ -- aṉṉam um, aṉṟilum, makaṉṟilum;
paṟi -- mīṉkōḷ+ paṟi ~um, nāvāy+ paṟi ~um;
ceyti -- mīṉviṟṟal um, uppuviṟṟal um, avi paṭuttal um;
yāḻ -- viḷariyāḻ.

<P>iṉi+ `piṟavum' eṉṟataṉāl,
talimakaṉ peyar -- tuṟivaṉ, koṇkaṉ, cērppaṉ;
talimakaḷ peyar -- nuḷicci, paratti;
nīr -- maṇaṟkiṇaṟum, uvarkkaḻi ~um;
pū -- veḷḷitaḻ+ kiti ~um, neytal um;
ūr -- kalamēṟu paṭṭiṉam um, ciṟukuṭi ~um, pākkam um;
makkaḷ peyar -- paratar, parattiyar, nuḷiyar,nuḷicciyar eṉappaṭum.

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P21">{{iṟi: Page 21}}</A>
<HR>
tolkāppiyaṉār pālikku -- nilam vēṇṭiṟṟilar;vēṇṭāmiyiṉ, teyvam um vēṇṭiṟṟilar.

<P>piṟar, pakavatiyi ~um ātittaṉi ~um teyvam eṉṟuvēṇṭuvar;

<P>uṇā -- āṟalittaṉavum, ūreṟintaṉavum;
mā -- valiyaḻinta yāṉi ~um, puli ~um, cennāy um;
maram -- iruppi ~um, ōmi ~um;
puḷ -- kaḻukum, paruntum, puṟāvum;
paṟi -- pūcaṟpaṟi ~um, ūreṟipaṟi ~um, nirikōṭpaṟi~um;
ceyti -- nirikōṭal um, cātteṟital um, cūṟiyāṭal um;
paṇ -- pañcuram.

<P>`piṟavum' eṉṟataṉāl,
talimakaṉ peyar -- mīḷi, viṭali, kāḷi;
talimakaḷ peyar -- eyiṟṟi, pēti;
pū -- marāmpūvum, kurāmpūvum, pātirippūvum;
nīr -- aṟunīrkkūval um, aṟunīrccuṉi ~um;
ūr -- kolkuṟumpu.
makkaḷ peyar -- eyiṉar, eyiṟṟiyar, maṟavar, maṟattiyareṉappaṭum;

<P>mullikku+,
teyvam -- vācutēvaṉ;
uṇā -- varaku* um cāmi ~um;
mā -- muyal um, ciṟumāṉ um;
maram -- koṉṟi ~um, kuruntu* um;
puḷ -- kāṉaṅkōḻi ~um, mayil um, cival um;
paṟi -- ēṟukōṭ paṟi ~um, muracu* um;

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P22">{{iṟi: Page 22}}</A>
<HR>
ceyti -- varakukku+ kaḷikaṭṭal um, avi aṟuttal um,kaṭāviṭutal um, nirimēyttal um;
paṇ -- mulli.

<P>`piṟavum' eṉṟataṉāl,
talimakaṉ peyar -- kuṟumpoṟi nāṭaṉ;
talimakaḷ peyar -- kiḻatti, maṉivi; (i+ peyar marutanilattu+ talimakaṭkum uriya;)
pū -- mulli ~um, tōṉṟi ~um;
nīr -- kāṉyāṟu;
ūr -- pāṭi ~um, cēri ~um;
makkaḷ peyar -- iṭiyar, iṭicciyar, āyar, āycciyareṉappaṭum.

<P>marutattukku+,
teyvam -- intiraṉ;
uṇā -- cennel= um, veṇṇel= um;
mā -- erumi ~um, nīrnāy um;
maram -- vañci ~um, kāñci ~um, marutu* um;
puḷ -- nīrkkōḻi ~um, tārāvum;
paṟi -- maṇamuḻavu* um, nellari kiṇi ~um;
ceyti -- nellarital um, avi kaṭāviṭutal um, payirkku+kaḷikaṭṭal um;
yāḻ -- marutayāḻ.

<P>`piṟavum' eṉṟataṉāl,
talimakaṉ peyar -- ūraṉ, makiḻnaṉ;
talimakaḷ peyar -- kiḻatti, maṉivi;
pū -- tāmarippū ~um, ceṅkaḻunīrppū ~um;
nīr -- maṉikkiṇaṟu* um, poyki ~um;
makkaḷ peyar -- kaṭiyar, kaṭiciyar, uḻavar,uḻattiyar;

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P23">{{iṟi: Page 23}}</A>
<HR>
ūr -- pērūr eṉappaṭum.

<P>i+ kūṟapaṭṭa karu mayaṅkiyum varappeṟum;
eṉṉi,
<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`e+ nila maruṅkiṟ pū ~um puḷ= um
<BR>	a+ nilam poḻutoṭu vārā āyiṉum
<BR>	vanta nilattiṉ payatta ākum'.
<BR>		(([akat. -- 22]))
<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉṟār ākaliṉ.

<H3>((aintiṇi uripporuḷ))</H3>

<P>iṉi, uripporuḷ āvatu tiṇikku uriya poruḷ eṉṟavāṟu.avi yāvi ~ō eṉiṉ, puṇartal pirital iruttal iraṅkalūṭal, avaṟṟiṉ nimittam eṉa ivi;

<P>eṉṉi,
<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`puṇartal pirital iruttal iraṅkal
<BR>	ūṭal ivaṟṟiṉ* ^nimittam eṉṟivi
<BR>	tērum^ kāli+ tiṇikku* uri+ poruḷ ē'.
<BR>		(([akat. -- 16]))
<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉṟār ākaliṉ. avaṟṟuḷ,
<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	puṇartal um puṇartal nimittam um kuṟiñci;

<P>	pirital um pirital nimittam um pāli;

<P>	iruttal um iruttal nimittam um mulli;

<P>	iraṅkal um iraṅkal nimittam um neytal;

<P>	ūṭal um ūṭal nimittam um marutam.
<P>{{C URAI}}
puṇartal ē kollō kuṟiñci eṉiṉ, puṇartal ē aṉṟu;pirivaccam um, vaṉpuṟi ~um, talimakaṉ nīṅkiṉa ~um,pāṅkaṟku urittaṉa ~um, pāṅkaṉ kaḻaṟiṉa ~um, talimakaṉetirmaṟuttaṉa ~um, pāṅkaṉ etirntaṉa ~um, talimakaḷi+kaṇṭaṉa ~um, āṟṟāṉ āyiṉa ~um, talimakaṉ ceṉṟaṉa ~um,talimakaṉ talippeytaṉa ~um i+ toṭakkattaṉa ~ellām;talimakaṭku* um tōḻikku* um iv vakiyāṉ ē nōkkivikaṟpikka, iṟappa ~um pala ~ām. avi ~ellām puṇartalum puṇartal nimittam um āy aṭaṅkum. ēṉiyavaṟṟiṟku* umivvāṟu* ē koḷka.

<H3>((tiṇi iṉṉatu eṉpatu))</H3>

<P>iṉi, oḻukkattiṉi+ tiṇi eṉpār um, nilattiṉi+ tiṇieṉpār um eṉa irupakutiyar āciriyar. atu poruntātu //
<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P24">{{iṟi: Page 24}}</A>
<HR>
//; oḻukkam ē tiṇi eṉappaṭum. kuṟiñci ~ākiya oḻukkamnikaḻnta nilam um kuṟiñci eṉappaṭṭatu; eṉṉi, viḷakku*ākiya cuṭar irunta iṭaṉ um viḷakku eṉappaṭṭatu pōlaeṉpatu.

<P>iṉi, oru cārār oḻukkattiṉi ~um tiṇi eṉpa,nilattiṉi ~um tiṇi eṉpa. ākalāṉ aṉṟu* ē, `aṉpiṉ aim^tiṇi' eṉṟatu, aintiṇi ~āṭi, aintiṇi mañciki eṉṟatupōla eṉpa; atu poruntātu. aḵtu* ē karutiyatu eṉiṉ,muṉṉar+,
<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`tiṇi ~ē kikōḷ'
<BR>		(([iṟiyaṉār-56]))
<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉṉāṉ aṉṟu* ē,
`iṇi ~ē kikōḷ' eṉṉum aṉṟu* ē, iṇi eṉṟu karutiṉāṉāyiṉ eṉpatu. aḵtu* ē ~eṉiṉ, `aintu tiṇi' eṉṉum, aintucāṇ, aintu kaṇam eṉṟatu pōla eṉiṉ, aṟiyātu kaṭāviṉāy;aintu taliyuṭiya nākatti aintali nākam um eṉpa;aintu tali nākam um eṉpa; iru muṭipum uṭittu. eṉṉi,kuṟṟiyalukara+ puṇariyaluḷ,
<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`mutaṉili ~eṇṇiṉ muṉ valleḻuttu variṉum
<BR>	ña na ma va+ tōṉṟiṉum ya va vantu* iyiyiṉum
<BR>	mutaṉili ~iyaṟki ~eṉmaṉār pulavar'.
<BR>		(([kuṟṟiyalukara -- 73]))
<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉṟār ākaliṉ.

<H3>((aintiṇi+ kaḷavu))</H3>

<P>aḵtu* ē ~eṉiṉ, aṉpiṉāṉāya oḻukkatti aṉpiṉ vēṟu*eṉṟu koḷval, taccaṉāṉ āya māṭam taccaṉiṉ vēṟu āyatupōla eṉṟāṟku, atu ~aṉṟu; poṉṉiṉāṉ āya kuṭam poṉṉiṉvēṟu* allatu pōla eṉpatu. mūṉṟām vēṟṟumi kāraṇakāriyatti vēṟu uṇaravum niṟkum, vēṟaṉṟi uṇaravumniṟkum; avaṟṟuḷ, vēṟaṉṟi uṇaraniṟkum pakuti koḷka.

<P>aḵtu* ē ~eṉiṉ, `aintiṇi' eṉpataṉ muṉṉar+, `kaḷavu'eṉṉum^ col ettiṟattāṉ vantatu? oru col% muṉ orucolvaruṅkāṟ payaṉili vakiyāṉum, tokinili vakiyāṉum,eṇṇunili vakiyāṉum eṉa mūṉṟiṉuḷ oṉṟu paṟṟi ~aṉṟu* ēvaruvatu; avaṟṟuḷ, iḵtu evvakiyāṉ vantatō eṉiṉ,tokinilivakiyāṉ vantatu eṉpatu. toki tām pala;avaṟṟuḷ iḵtu ettokiyāṉ vantatō eṉiṉ, vēṟṟumittokiyāṉvantatu eṉpatu. //
<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P25">{{iṟi: Page 25}}</A>
<HR>
// a+ vēṟṟumittoki tām pala; avaṟṟuḷ iḵtuevvēṟṟumittokiyō eṉiṉ, ēḻāmvēṟṟumittoki eṉpatu. av=ēḻām vēṟṟumi urupu tām pala. avaṟṟuḷ yātu tokkatueṉiṉ, uḷ eṉpatu tokkatu. aintiṇiyuḷ+ kaḷavu eṉpatu*āyiṉ, aintiṇiyuḷ= um^ kaḷavu vēṟu* ākātō, kuṭattuḷviḷakku* um taṭaṟṟuḷ vāḷ um avviṭattiṉ vēṟu* āyatu pōlaeṉiṉ, ēḻām vēṟṟumi iṭatti ~um iṭattunikaḻporuḷi ~umvēṟu uṇara ~um niṟkum, vēṟaṉṟi uṇara ~um niṟkum;avaṟṟuḷ, vēṟu uṇara niṉṟa vaḻi+ kāṭṭi+ kaṭāviṉāy;vēṟaṉṟi uṇara niṉṟavaḻi+ kāṭṭiyakkāl atu pōla+ koḷka.araṅkiṉuḷ akaḻntāṉ, māṭattiṉuḷ akaḻntāṉ eṉṟatu pōla,aintiṇiyuḷ= um^ kaḷavu vēṟu* aṉṟu eṉpatu.

<P>aḵtu* ē ~eṉiṉ, `aṉpiṉ aintiṇi+ kaḷavu antaṇararumaṟi' eṉa amiyātō? `eṉappaṭuvatu' eṉṟatu eṟṟiṟkōeṉiṉ, ceyyuḷiṉpattiṉ poruṭṭu vantatu eṉṉum oruvaṉ;aṟṟu* aṉṟu, ataṉāṉ oruporuḷ urippal eṉṉum oruvaṉ.ataṉāṉ oruporuḷ urippal eṉṉum oruvaṉ. ataṉāṉ oru poruḷurippāṉ pakkam valiyuṭittu. aḵtu^ yātu* ō eṉiṉ,kaḷavu eṉṟaṟku+ ciṟappuṭittu eṉṟavāṟu. `ūreṉappaṭuvatu uṟiyūr' eṉṟa iṭattu+ piṟa ~um ūr uṇmicolli, avaṟṟuḷ ellām uṟiyūr ciṟappuṭimi collupa.iṅku+ piṟavum kaḷavuṇmi colli, a+ kaḷavukaṭku* ellāmi+ kaḷavu ciṟappuṭittu cuvarkkam vīṭupēṟukaḷimuṭikkum ākalāṉ, `eṉappaṭuvatu' eṉṟu colli+ciṟappikkappaṭṭatu. atu pāyirattuḷ= um urittām. maṟṟaulakattu+ kaḷavāyiṉa ellām, kikuṟippavum kaṇcūlavumkaḻuvēṟṟavum paṭṭu+, paḻi ~um pāvam um ākki, naraka+toṭakkattu+ tīkkatikaḷil uykkum. itu mēṉmakkaḷāṉ+pukaḻappaṭṭu ñāṉa ~oḻukkattōṭu otta iyalpiṟṟu* ākalāṉum, paḻi pāvam iṉmiyāṉ um, `eṉappaṭuvatu' eṉṟuvicēṭikkappaṭṭatu.

<H3>((eṇvaki maṇam))</H3>

<P>iṉi, antaṇar arumaṟi maṉṟal eṭṭiṉuḷ eṉpatu; antaṇareṉpār pārppār; arumaṟi eṉpatu vētam; maṉṟal eṉpatumaṇam; eṭṭu eṉpatu avaṟṟatu toki koṭuttu+ coṉṉavāṟu.avi yāvi ~ō eṉiṉ -- piramam, piracāpattiyam, āriṭam,teyvam, kāntarvam, acuram, irākkatam, picācam eṉaivi;

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P26">{{iṟi: Page 26}}</A>
<HR>
eṉṉi,
<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`aṟanili ~oppu* ē poruḷkōḷ teyvam
<BR>	yāḻ ōr kūṭṭam arumporuḷ viṉi ~ē
<BR>	irākkatam pēynili ~eṉṟi+ kūṟiya
<BR>	maṟiyōr maṉṟal eṭṭavi avaṟṟuḷ
<BR>	tuṟiyami nalliyāḻ tuṇimiyōr iyalpitaṉ
<BR>	poruṇmi ~eṉmaṉār pulamiyōr ē'.
<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉpataṉ poruḷ eṉṟu uṇarvatu,

<P>piramam eṉpatu -- nāṟpatteṭṭu^ yāṇṭupiramacariyaṅkāttāṟku+ paṉṉīrāṭṭi+ pirāyattāḷiaṇikalaṉ aṇintu koṭuppatu. koṭāviṭiṉ, ōr irutukkāṭcioruvaṉi+ cārātu kaḻintaviṭattu oru pārppaṉa+ koliyōṭuokkum eṉpatu; itaṉi aṟanili eṉṟuṇarvatu.
piracāpattiyam eṉpatu -- mittuṉa kōttirattāṉ makaḷvēṇṭi+ ceṉṟāl maṟātu koṭuppatu; itaṉi oppu eṉṟuuṇarvatu.

<P>āriṭam eṉpatu -- āvum āṉēṟum poṟkōṭṭu+poṟkuḷampiṉavāka+ ceytu avaṟṟiṭi nīriṟ koṭuppatu;itaṉi+ poruḷkōḷ eṉa uṇarvatu.

<P>teyvam eṉpatu -- vēḷvi āciriyaṟku vēḷvi+ tī muṉvittu+ koṭuppatu; itaṉi+ teyvam eṉṟuvaḻipaṭappaṭṭatu.

<P>kāntarvam eṉpatu -- iruvar ottār tām ē kūṭum^kūṭṭam; itaṉi yāḻōr kūṭṭam eṉṟu uṇarvatu.

<P>acuram eṉpatu -- kollēṟu koṇṭāṉ ivaḷi eytum, vil=ēṟṟiṉāṉ ivaḷi eytum, tiripaṉṟi eytāṉ ivaḷi eytum,māli cūṭṭappaṭṭāṉ ivaḷi eytum eṉa ivvāṟu colli+koṭuppatu, iḵtu arumporuḷ viṉinili eṉpatu.

<P>irākkatam eṉpatu -- avaḷ taṉṉiṉ um^ tamariṉ umpeṟātu valintu koḷvatu.

<P>picācam eṉpatu -- mūttāḷ māṭṭum tuyiṉṟāḷmāṭṭumkaḷittāḷ māṭṭum cārvatu; itu pēynili eṉappaṭum.

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P27">{{iṟi: Page 27}}</A>
<HR>
iv= eṭṭu maṇam um, `maṉṟal eṭṭu' eṉṟu collappaṭṭaṉa eṉa~uṇarka.

<P>iṉi+, kantaruva vaḻakkam eṉpatu -- kantaruvar eṉpārīṇṭu+ ceyta nalviṉi+ payattāl oruvar koṭuppār umaṭuppār um iṉṟi, iruvarum oru poḻilakattu etirppaṭṭu+puṇarvatu; itu kāntarppamaṇam. itaṉi oppataṉi+ kaḷavueṉṟu vēṇṭum iv= āciriyaṉ.

<P>aḵtu* ē ~eṉiṉ, kantaruva vaḻakkam pōlvatu eṉṉātu,`kantaruva vaḻakkam' eṉṟamiyāṉ, ataṉi+ kaḷavu eṉṟukoḷḷām ō eṉiṉ, koḷḷām. nūṟ kiṭakki av= iyalpiṟṟu*aṉṟu, ākalāṉ, pōlvatu eṉṟu* ē koḷḷaṟpālatu. pōṟaleṉpatu ciṟitu ottu+ ciṟitu ovvātu oḻivatu; eṉṉi,`kuvaḷi+ pū+ pōlum^ kaṇ' eṉṟāl, nīla māttiri okkum,maṟṟu ovvāppuṭi peritu; `pavaḷampōlum vāy' eṉṟāl,cemmi māttiri okkum, maṟṟu ovvā+ puṭi peritu. iṅkumēkatēcattu+ puṇartal um, koṭuppār um aṭuppār um iṉṟi+puṇartal um, otta kulattiṉar ākal um, otta aṉpiṉar ākalum eṉṉum ittuṇi ~ē oppikkappaṭṭatu; maṟṟi+ puṭi~ellām ovvātu.

<P>aḵtu* ē ~eṉiṉ, `kantaruva vaḻakkam pōlvatu' eṉa vēṇṭāvōcūttirattuḷ eṉiṉ, vēṇṭā; uvamam tokuttavāṟu collutum:pacuppōlvāṉi+ pacu eṉṟal um, pāvipōlvāḷi+ pāvieṉṟal um eṉpatu.

<P>aḵtu* ē ~eṉiṉ, avi eṭṭum, ataṉi ~otta itu ~um eṉa,maṇam oṉpatu* ākaṟpāla eṉiṉ, atu ~aṉṟu; av= eṭṭu* umulakiyalil uḷḷaṉa; iḵtu aṉṉatu aṉṟu; illatu iṉiyatunallatu eṉṟu pulavarāl nāṭṭappaṭṭatōr oḻukkam ākaliṉ,itaṉi ulaka vaḻakkattiṉōṭu iyiyāṉ eṉpatu. aḵtu* ē~eṉiṉ, itaṉi mutaṉūl eṉṟu pukuntamiyāṉ+, `kantaruvavaḻakkam' eṉṟu* ē moḻiyaṟpāṟṟu; `eṉmaṉār' eṉṟucollaṟpāṟṟu aṉṟu; atu vaḻinūl vāypāṭu* ākalāṉ eṉpatukaṭā. ataṟku viṭi, piṟa nūl ellām āciriya+pakutippaṭum, itu ~um avi ~ē pōla āciriyappakuti+paṭuṅkollō eṉiṉ, paṭātu. kantaruva vaḻakkam pōlvatukaḷavātal mūṉṟu kālattu+ pulavarkku* um oppamuṭintamiyāl, avvaki coṉṉāṉ eṉpatu.

<P>aḵtu* ē ~eṉiṉ, taṉṉi ~otta pulavar illi ~aṉṟu* ētāṉ talivaṉ ākalāṉ, ellām uṇarntāṉ ākalāṉ eṉiṉ, //
<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P28">{{iṟi: Page 28}}</A>
<HR>
// aḵtu* ē karuttu, aṟintili; taṉṉāṉ ē urikkappaṭṭatueṉiṉum, piṟavaṟṟi ~ellām tiriyavum tiriyāmi ~umkoṇṭār. itaṉi+ tiriyāmi ~ē koṇṭār ellārum eṉṟaṟkuavvāṟu urikkappaṭṭatu. taṉ matam uṇarntāri ~umpulavar eṉṟāṉ, aṟiporuḷukku ēṉōrum pulavar ākaliṉ.

<P>iṉi, eṉmaṉār eṉpatu, `eṉpa' eṉṉum muṟṟuccol,
<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`kuṟikkumvaḻi+ kuṟittal' (([eccaviyal-7]))
<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉpataṉāṉ+ pakaram kuṟittu,
<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	virikkumvaḻi virittal' (([eccaviyal -- 7]))
<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉpataṉāl, `maṉ, ār' eṉpaṉa iraṇṭu iṭiccoṟ peytuvirittu, `eṉmaṉār' eṉṟu āyiṟṟu.

<P>`eṉmaṉār' eṉpatu `pulavar' eṉṉum peyarkoṇṭumuṭintatu, muṟṟuccol eccappeyarkoṇṭu muṭiyum ākaliṉeṉpatu.

<H2>2</H2>
<P>	atu ~ē
<BR>	tāṉ ē avaḷ ē tamiyar kāṇa+
<BR>	kāma+ puṇarcci iruvayiṉ ottal.
<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉpatu eṉ ^nutaliṟṟu* ō eṉiṉ, mēṟkantaruva vaḻakkattōṭuokkum oḻukkam kaḷavu eṉṟu vēṇṭiṟṟu* allatu, iṉṉailakkaṇattatu eṉṟilātār, ataṉi uṇarttutal nutaliṟṟu;i+ cūttirattuḷ+ karutiya poruḷ mēlataṉōṭu iyiyum.

<P>itaṉ poruḷ: atu ~ē eṉpatu -- paṇṭaṟi cuṭṭu, mēṟcollappaṭṭa kantaruva vaḻakkampōlum^ kaḷavu eṉṟavāṟu;tāṉ ē avaḷ ē eṉpatu -- tāṉ ē avaḷ, avaḷ ē tāṉ; eṉpatueṉ colliyavāṟu* ō? eṉiṉ, "tāṉ avaḷ" eṉṉum vēṟṟumi~ilar eṉṟavāṟu;

<P>iṅṅaṉam vācakam vēṟupaṭa+ collappaṭṭārāyiṉum,aṉpiṉāṉum kuṇattiṉāṉum kalviyiṉāṉum uruviṉāṉumtiruviṉāṉum tiripilar oruvarōṭu* oruvar eṉpatu* ām.aḵtu //
<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P29">{{iṟi: Page 29}}</A>
<HR>
// eṉ pōla ~ō eṉiṉ -- uruḷarici, kottamuri eṉṟāṟpōlaeṉiṉ, atu poruntātu; eṉṉi kāraṇam eṉiṉ, kantaruvavaḻakkattōṭu okkum eṉa ~ē vēṟṟumi ~iṉmi muṭintatu,avar vēṟṟumi ~ilar ākaliṉ; iṉṉum orukāl vācakamvēṟupaṭuttu a+ poruḷ ē colla+ puṉaruttam ām; eṉṉi, oruporuḷi vēṟupaṭṭa vāypāṭṭāṉ+ palkāṟ colluvatupuṉaruttam ākaliṉ.

<P>iṉi, oruvaṉ colvatu ivaṉ um paṟpal% ^nūṟāyiravar kūrvēl iḷiñaroṭu tiritariṉ aṉṟi+ tamiyaṉ ātal ilaṉ,periyaṉ ātalāl; ivaḷ um paṟpal% ^nūṟāyiravar āyamakaḷirpuṭi cūḻa+ tiritariṉ aṉṟi+ tamiyaḷ ātal ilaḷ, periyaḷātalāl. iṅṅaṉam illātāṉ. ivaṉ um iḷiñariṉ* ^nīṅki+ tāṉē ~āy, ivaḷ um āyattiṉ nīṅki+ tāṉ ē ~āy, iṅṅaṉampuṇarvar eṉpa. ivaṉi iḷiñariṉ nīkki ~um, ivaḷiāyattiṉ nīkki ~um pirittu+ kōṭaṟku+, `tāṉ ē avaḷ ē'eṉṟu collappaṭṭatu eṉṉum. iv= uri ~um poruntātu. eṉ= ōkāraṇam eṉiṉ, kantaruva vaḻakkattōṭu okkum eṉa ~ē,tamiyar āy+ puṇartal muṭintatu; iṉṉum orukāl a+ poruḷi~ē colla+ puṉaruttam ām eṉpatu.

<P>maṟṟu eṉṉō uri ~eṉiṉ, tāṉ ē avaḷ ē eṉpatu,āṇpālkaḷuḷ ivaṉōṭu ottār um illi, mikkār um illi,kuṟipaṭṭār allatu; ekkālattum evviṭattum ñāṉattāṉumkuṇattāṉum uruviṉāṉum tiruviṉāṉum poruvilaṉ tāṉ ēeṉpatu; ivaḷ um aṉṉaḷ eṉa ~ē, iruvar um poruviṟantāreṉpataṉi+ payakkum.

<P>niṉṟa ēkāram, aintu ēkārattuḷḷum eṉṉa ēkāram ō eṉiṉ,āṇ kuḻuviṉ ivaṉi ~ē pirittu vāṅkiṉamiyāṉ um, peṇkuḻuviṉ ivaḷi ~ē pirittu vāṅkiṉamiyāṉ um piriniliēkāram eṉappaṭṭatu; palavaṟṟuḷ oṉṟu pirippatu piriniliēkāram eṉappaṭum ākalāṉ eṉpatu.

<P>aḵtu* ē ~eṉiṉ, kantaruva vaḻakkattōṭu okkum eṉa ~ē,ettiṟattāṉum^ kuṟipāṭu iṉmi muṭiyātu* ō eṉiṉ,muṭiyātu; kantaruvarkku* um ñāṉa+ kuṟipāṭu* um taruma+kuṟipāṭu* um āḷviṉi+ kuṟipāṭu* um uṇṭu. i+collappaṭṭaṉa ciṟitu* ē ~eṉṟu* ē oppittu, poruviṟappu+cūttirattāṉ+ colla vēṇṭum eṉpatu.

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P30">{{iṟi: Page 30}}</A>
<HR>
tamiyar kāṇa eṉpatu -- tam uṇarviṉar aṉṟi etirppaṭaeṉṟavāṟu.

<P>aḵtu* ē ~eṉiṉ, ivar tam uṇarviṉar allar ākiṉṟatu,kāṇāmuṉ āpa ~ō, kaṇṭa piṉ āpa ~ō, kāṭciyōṭu uṭaṉ āpa ~ōeṉiṉ, kāṇāmuṉ tam uṇarviṉar allar āpa eṉiṉ, kāṭcikāraṇam aṉṟu* āyiṟṟu* ām, tam uṇarviṉar allar ātaṟku;allatūum kāraṇam iṉṟi ākalāṉ eppoḻutum tam uṇarviṉarallar ākal vēṇṭum.

<P>iṉi+, kaṇṭa piṉ tam= uṇarviṉar allār eṉiṉ, kāṭciyatunīkkattukkaṇ= um tam uṇarviṉar allār ākal vēṇṭum, `uṇṭapiṉ vantāṉ cāttaṉ' eṉṟāl, uṇṭal+ karuma+ kaḻiviṉkaṇvantatu pōla. allatūum kaṇṭa piṉ tam uṇarviṉar ākalvēṇṭum; āka ~ē, kaṇṭum tam uṇarviṉar āy niṉṟār piṉṉimayaṅkutaṟku+ kāraṇam eṉṉi ~ō eṉpatu.

<P>iṉi+, kāṭci ~um, tam uṇarviṉar allar ākal um uṭaṉnikaḻum ē ~eṉiṉ, kāṭci eṉṉum^ kāraṇattāl tam uṇarviṉarallar ātal+ ^taṉmi nikaḻaṟpāṟṟu* aṉṟu. oru kālattu ōriṭattu oruṅku tōṟṟiṉa poruḷ oṉṟaṉi oṉṟu muṭittaṉaeṉappaṭāmi kāṇṭum, āviṟku iru kōṭu pōla eṉpatu.ataṉāl, mūṉṟu allatu nāṉkāvatu kālam illi. iṉmiyiṉ,avar kāṭciyāṉ ē tam uṇarviṉar allar eṉpatu muṭikkalvēṇṭum. eṅṅaṉam muṭikkumāṟu eṉiṉ, kāṇāmuṉ= ē tamuṇarviṉar allar ākal+ ^taṉmi uṭiyar ātaliṉ eṉpatu.eṉṉi, ēṉāti mōtiram ceṟittal+ ^tiru ~uṭiyāṉ oruvaṉ,ēṉāti mōtiraram^ ceṟikkum a+ tiru avaṉ ceṟikkiṉṟapoḻutu* ē uṇṭāyiṟṟu* aṉṟu; muṟkoṇṭu amintu kiṭantatu.aracu vīṟṟirunta tiru ~uṭiyāṉ oruvaṉ, aracuvīṟṟirukkum a+ tiru aracu vīṟṟirukkiṉṟa poḻutu* ēuṇṭāyiṟṟu aṉṟu; muṟkoṇṭu amintu kiṭantatu, atu piṉṉioru kālattu ōr iṭattu oru kāraṇattāṉ eytuvikkum. atupōla, iṉṉa nāḷ, iṉṉa pakkuvattu, iṉṉa poḻutu, iṉṉaiṭattu ivaḷ kāraṇam āka ivaṉ taṉ uṇarviṉaṉ allaṉ āmeṉpatūum, ivaṉ kāraṇam āka ivaḷ taṉ uṇarviṉaḷ allaḷ āmeṉpatūum muṉ= ē muṭintu kiṭantaṉa. atu piṉ= um^koṇarntu eytuvikkum; eṉṉi,

<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`oḷippiṉum ūḻviṉi ~ūṭṭātu kaḻiyātu'.
<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉpatu* ākalāṉ.

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P31">{{iṟi: Page 31}}</A>
<HR>
kāṭci tuṇikkāraṇam avviṉi payattaṟku; vittumuḷittaṟku nilaṉum nīrum irutuvum tuṇikkāraṇamāyiṟṟu+ pōla ~um, cōṟu* ātal iyalpiṟṟu* ākiya aricicōṟu* ātaṟku aṭuvāṉi+ toṭakkamāka ~uṭiya kāraṇamtuṇikkāraṇam āyiṟṟu+ pōla ~um eṉpatu. aḵtu* ē ~eṉiṉ,kāṭci tuṇikkāraṇam piṟa eṉiṉ, kāṭciyiṉ muṉ kiḷarntatu*ō? piṉ kiḷarntatu* ō? uṭaṉē kiḷarntatu* ō uḷḷattu+ tāṉkiḷarkiṉṟatu eṉiṉ, muṉṉi+ kaṭā vantu eytumāl, eṉṉi ~ōeṉiṉ, kāṭciyōṭu uṭaṉē kiḷarum; eṉṉi, iruṭṭu* akattuviḷakkukkoṇṭu pukkāl, viḷakku vārāta muṉṉar um iruḷnīṅkātu; viḷakku vanta piṉṉar um iruḷ nīṅkātu; viḷakkuvarutal um iruḷ nīkkam um uṭaṉē nikaḻum. atu pōla+,kāṭci ~um ñāṉa ~oḻukka+ kuṇaṅkaḷatu taṉmi ~aḻivu* umuṭaṉē nikaḻum. viḷakkiṉi+ kāṭci ~āka+ koṇṭu, ñāṉa~oḻukkaṅkaḷi iruḷ āka+ koḷka.

<P>iṉi+, kāma+ puṇarcci eṉpatu -- talimakaṉumtalimakaḷum tamiyarāy oru poḻilakattu etirppaṭṭu+ tamuṇarviṉaraṉṟi vēṭki mikaviṉāṉ+ puṇarvatu eṉpatu.

<P>āyiṉ ivar, mēṟ poruviṟantār talimakaṉ um talimakaḷ umeṉṟamiyāṉ, avaṉ um, kaṟkantum eṟipōttum kaṭuṅkaṇ yāṉi~um taṟukaṭ paṉṟi ~um karuvari ~um irunilaṉ umperuvicumpu* um aṉiyār, āḷi moympiṉar, arimāṉ tuppiṉarpaṟpal nūṟāyiravar kūrvēl iḷiyar taṟcūḻa+ celvaṉeṉpatu muṭintatu.

<P>ivaḷum uṭaṉ piṟantu, uṭaṉ vaḷarntu, nīr uṭaṉāṭi+,cīr uṭaṉperuki, ol uṭaṉāṭṭa+, pāl uṭaṉuṇṭu, paluṭaṉeḻuntu, col uṭaṉkaṟṟu, paḻami ~um payiṟṟi ~umpaṇpum naṇpum viḻuppam um oḻukkam um māṭci ~um uṭiyār,paṟpal nūṟāyiravar kaṇṇum maṉam um kavarum oṇṇutalmakaḷir taṟcūḻa+, tāraki naṭuvaṇ taṇmatipōla+ celvāḷeṉpatu muṭintatu.

<P>muṭiya ~ē, tamiyar āy+ puṇarntār eṉpataṉoṭumāṟukoḷḷum eṉiṉ, māṟukoḷḷātu; eṉṉi, avaḷ āyaṅkaḷumpoḻiliṭam pukutal um viḷiyāṭṭu viruppiṉāṉ+ piriyum.eṉṉi piriyumāṟu eṉiṉ, oruvar oruvariṉ muṉṉar+taḻiviḻitakkaṉa toṭuttum eṉṟum, kaṇṇi taṇṇaṟunāṟṟattaṉa ceytum eṉṟum, pōtu mētakkaṉa koytum //
<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P32">{{iṟi: Page 32}}</A>
<HR>
// eṉṟum, mayiloṭu māṟāṭutum eṉṟum, kuyiloṭu māṟukūvutum eṉṟum, aruviyāṭi añcuṉi kuṭitum eṉṟum,vācamalarkkoṭiyil ūcalāṭutum eṉṟum parantu, appāluḷḷārippāluḷḷāḷkollō eṉṟum iv vaki niṉittu+ piripa eṉpatu.

<P>ivvaki avaḷi+ tamiyaḷ āy+ piripa ~ō eṉiṉ, eṭṭi ~um^cuṭṭi ~um^ kāṭṭappaṭum kulattaḷ allaḷ ākalāṉ um, pāṉmiavvakittu* ākalāṉ um piṟavāṟu niṉiyār piripa eṉpatu.āyiṉ, iv vakippaṭṭa āyattiṭi mēṉāḷ pirintupayiṉṟaṟiyātāḷ tamiyaḷ āy niṟkum ō eṉiṉ, niṟkum; tāṉpayiṉṟa iṭam taṉ āyattiṉōṭu okkum ākalāṉ eṉpatu.

<P>yāṅṅaṉam niṟkum -ō eṉiṉ, cantaṉam -um caṇpakam -umtēmā ~um tīmpala ~um āciṉi ~um acōku* -um kōṅkum vēṅki~um kuravam um virintu, nākam um tilakam um naṟavumnanti ~um mātavi ~um malliki ~um muvaloṭumaṇaṅkamaḻntu, pātiri ~um pāviñāḻal um piṅkoṉṟi ~umpiṇiyaviḻntu, porippuṉkum puṉṉākam um murukkoṭumukiciṟantu, vaṇṭaṟintu tēṉārntu varikkuyilkaḷicipāṭa, taṇteṉṟal iṭivirāy+ taṉiyavari muṉivuceyyumpoḻilatu naṭuvaṇ, oru māṇikka+ ceykuṉṟiṉmēl, vicumputuṭittu, pacumpoṉ pūttu, vaṇṭu tuvippa+ taṇtēṉtuḷippatōr veṟiyuṟu naṟumalar vēṅki kaṇṭāḷ; kaṇṭu,periyatōr kātal kaḷikūrntu, taṉ cemmalar+ cīṟaṭimēṟcilampu kiṭantu cilampupuṭippa, am malar aṇikkomparnaṭi kaṟpateṉa naṭantu ceṉṟu, naṟiviri vēṅkināṇmalar koytāḷ; koytaviṭattu, marakatamaṇi viḷimpuaṭutta māṇikkaccuṉi maruṅkiṉatōr mātavivallimaṇṭapattu+, pōtu vēynta pūnāṟu koḻuniḻaṟkīḻ+kaṭikkurukkatti+ koṭi piṭittu+ takaṭupaṭu pacumpoṟcikaraṅkaḷiṉ mukaṭutāṭuttu vantu iḻitarum aruvi, poṉkoḻittu, maṇi varaṉṟi, māṇikkattoṭu vayiram unti,aṇikiḷar aruvi āṭaka+ pāṟi mēl atirkural muraciṉkaṇṇiraṭṭa, vaṇṭum tēṉum yāḻmurala, varikkuyilkaḷicipāṭa+, taṇ tātu tavicupaṭa+ pōrttatu* ōr paḷikku+pāṟi maṇittalattu mici, nīla ālavaṭṭam virittāṟpōla+taṉ kōla+ kalāvam koḷa virittu, muḷi ~iḷa ñāyiṟu iḷaveyil eṟippa, ōr iḷa mayil āṭuvatu nōkki niṉṟāḷ.

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P33">{{iṟi: Page 33}}</A>
<HR>
appāl, talimakaṉ um paṟpal nūṟāyiravarkūrvēliḷiyaroṭu kuḷir maliccāral vēṭṭam pōyviḷiyāṭukiṉṟāṉ, āṇṭu eḻuntatu* ōr kaṭumāviṉ piṉ ōṭi+,kāval iḷiyari+ kiyakaṉṟu, neṭu māṉtēroṭu pākaṉinilavu maṇal+ kāṉiyāṟṟu niṟka+ paṇittu+, toṭukaḻal aṭi~atira+ curuḷ iruṅkuñci poṉ ñāṇiṟ piṇittu+, kaṭi kamaḻnaṟum^ kaṇṇi mēl koṇṭu vaṇṭu maṇaṉayara, añcāntiṉ naṟunāṟṟam akaṉpoḻiliṭi+ parantu nāṟa, aṭuciliyoṭu kaṇiēnti, vaṭivu koṇṭa kāmaṉ pōla+ ceṉṟu, avaḷ niṉṟairumpoḻil pukum. aḵtu^ yāṅṅaṉam ō eṉiṉ, vaṭakaṭal iṭṭaoru nukam orutuḷi, teṉkaṭal iṭṭa orukaḻi ceṉṟukōttāṟpōla ~um, veṅkatir+ kaṉali ~um taṇkatir matiyamum tam kativaḻuvi+ talippeytāṟ pōla ~um talippeytu,oruvar oruvari+ kāṇṭal nimittamāka+ tamiyar āvar.

<H3>((talimakaṉ kuṇam nāṉku))</H3>

<P>tamiyar ātal eṉpatu, tam uṇarviṉar allar ātal. tamuṇarviṉar allar ātal eṉpatu eṉṉō eṉiṉ, talimakaṟkuaṟivu, niṟi, ōrppu, kaṭippiṭi eṉpaṉa kuṇam.

<P>aṟivu eṉṉō eṉiṉ,
<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`e+ poruḷ e+ taṉmittu* āyiṉum a+ poruḷ
<BR>	meypporuḷ kāṇpatu* aṟivu'.
<BR>		(([kuṟaḷ  355]))
<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉṟār ākaliṉ, e+ poruḷ āyiṉum apporuṭkaṇ niṉṟu a+meymmiyi uṇarvatu aṟivu.

<P>niṟi eṉpatu eṉṉō eṉiṉ, kāppaṉa kāttu+ kaṭivaṉakaṭintu oḻukum oḻukkam.

<P>ōrppu eṉpatu oru poruḷi ārāyntu uṇartal eṉpatu.
kaṭippiṭi eṉpatu koṇṭaporuḷ maṟavāmi.
i+ nāṉmi ~um talimakaṟku vēṭkiyāṉ mītūrappaṭṭu+,puṉal ōṭuvaḻi+ puṟcāyntāṟpōla+ cāyntu kiṭappatu.

<H3>((talimakaḷ kuṇam nāṉku))</H3>

<P>iṉi+ talimakaṭku nāṇ, maṭam, accam, payirppu eṉpaṉakuṇam; avaṟṟuḷ,

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P34">{{iṟi: Page 34}}</A>
<HR>
nāṇ eṉpatu peṇṭirkku iyalpāka uḷḷatu* oru taṉmi;

<P>maṭam eṉpatu koḷutta+ koṇṭu koṇṭatu viṭāmi;

<P>accam eṉpatu peṇmiyiṉ tāṉ kāṇappaṭātatu* ōr poruḷkaṇṭaviṭattu añcuvatu;

<P>payirppu eṉpatu payilāta poruṭkaṇ aruvaruttu niṟkumnilimi.

<P>i+ nāṉmi ~um, puṉal oṭuvaḻi+ puṟcāyntāṟpōla,vēṭkiyāṉ mītūrappaṭṭu+ cāyntu kiṭakkum.

<P>vēṭki eṉpatu eṉṉō eṉiṉ, oruvar oruvariiṉṟiyamiyāmi. av= iṉṟiyamiyātu niṉṟa vēṭki ellāuṇarviṉi ~um nīkki+ tāṉ ē ~āy, nāṇvaḻi+ kācu pōla ~um,nīrvaḻi mitavi pōla ~um, pāṉmivaḻi ~ōṭi iruvari ~umpuṇarvikkum eṉpatu. ākalāṉ, tamiyar āy+ puṇarvatutalimiyoṭu māṟukoḷḷātu eṉpatu. itu kāmappuṇarccieṉpatu.

<H3>((kaḷavuppuṇarcci - uḷḷappuṇarcci))</H3>

<P>itaṉi, ōr āciriyaṉ, uḷḷattāṉ ē puṇarntār eṉṉum;eṉṉi, meyyuṟupuṇarcci poruviṟantār eṉpataṉoṭumāṟukoḷḷum. yāṅṅaṉam māṟukoḷḷum ō eṉiṉ, ēkatēcattu+piṟarkku* uriya poruḷi vuviṉāṉi+ perumicollappaṭātu; atu pōla, ivaṉ um koṭuppa aṭuppaeytaṟpālāṉ, ēkatēcattu etirppaṭṭu+ ceṉṟu* eytimuyaṅkiṉamiyiṉ. eṉṉi, piṟarkku uriya poruḷ eḷitu*āka+ ceyyappaṭāmiyiṉ ām, periyaṉ āy+ ceṉṟatu. aṅṅaṉamākil, ulakattu+ paṉmakkaḷ ellām periyar, cīrātapoḻutupiṟar uṭimi koḷḷātu, cīrtta poḻutu vuvutalāl.

<P>iṉi, ivaḷ um kuravaratu paṇiyāṟ ceṉṟu avaṉivaḻipaṭaṟpālāḷ, ēkatēcattu+ talippaṭṭuvaḻipaṭṭamiyāṉ+ perumi ilaḷ; eṉṉi, tērntu kāṇātu,uḷḷam ōṭiṉa vaḻi ōṭutalāṉ. uḷḷattāṉ vēṭkappaṭāta poruḷilli; av vēṭkappaṭṭavaṟṟukkaṇ ellām, aṟattiṉ vaḻuvāmi~um poruḷiṉ vaḻuvāmi ~um taṉakku+ takavum ārāyātu, //
<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P35">{{iṟi: Page 35}}</A>
<HR>
// uḷḷam ōṭiṉavaḻi ōṭuvittal takkatu* aṉṟu eṉpataṉālatu ~um māṟukoḷḷum eṉpatu.

<P>maṟṟu eṉṉiyō urikkumāṟu eṉiṉ, avar tammuḷmeyyuṟṟu+ puṇarntilar, iruvar tam kāmam um ē tammuḷ+puṇarntaṉa eṉṟu, iṅṅaṉam uḷḷaṅkaḷāṉ iṉṟu puṇarvatupuṇarcci; itu piṟiroruvar uṇara neṭuṅkālam puṇartalākātu eṉa nīṅkum nīkkam pirivu; a+ piriviṉkaṇ+colluvatu meyyuṟupuṇarccikku+ colluvaṉa ellām^ colla ~ēamiyum. pāṅkaṉ+ kūṭṭattiṉkaṇ= um tōḻiyiṟ kūṭṭattiṉkaṇ=um ellām atu ~ē.

<P>varintu eytiya ñāṉṟu meyyuṟu puṇarcci uṇṭu* āvatueṉpa.

<H3>((kaḷavuppuṇarcci - meyyuṟupuṇarcci))</H3>

<P>atu poruntātu eṉṟu meyyuṟupuṇarcci vēṇṭuvārcolluvatu; meyyuṟupuṇarcci takkiṉṟu eṉṟu ākātu* ē uḷḷappuṇarccivēṇṭiyatu; aṅṅaṉam^ karutiṉ, piṟarkku uriya poruḷ% mēluḷḷatti ōṭaviṭutal takkiṉṟu eṉṟu mīṭka amiyātu* ōeṉpatu. allatūum, uḷḷattāṉ vēṭki celliṉum meyyuṟṟārāyiṟṟu. ataṉkaṇ irupuṭi karuti ākātu* ē; āka ~ē,ivaṭku+ kaṟpaḻi ~um piṟar oruvari vaḻipaṭa. iṉi,uḷḷam^ ceṉṟa poḻutu* ē amintu iraṇṭu* āvatu* illieṉṟu karutiṉāṉ ē eṉiṉum meyyuṟa ~ē; kuṟṟam eṉṉō eṉpatu.allatūum, mey= um moḻi ~um eṉpaṉa uḷḷattiṉ vaḻiya~aṉṟu* ē, aḵtu iṟantapiṉṉi iṟavātu niṉṟatu eṉṉōeṉpatu. allatūum, pārppāṉ pātakam āyiṟṟu* oṉṟuniṉikkum āyiṉ pirāyaccittattiṟku uriyaṉ ām; ataṉāṉ+ceyki ~um niṉippu* um okkum eṉpatu. allatūum,meyyuṟuvatu ākātu eṉṉum^ terintuṇarcci uṇṭāyiṉ tamiyareṉpataṉoṭu māṟukoḷḷum eṉpatu.

<P>allatūum, kantaruvar uḷḷattāṉ+ puṇarntār āyiṉ, ivarum uḷḷattāṉ+ puṇarpa eṉpatu; eṉṉi, kantaruvavaḻakkattōṭu okkum eṉṟamiyiṉ eṉpatu. allatūumterintuṇarvu uṇṭām ē eṉiṉ, aṉpiṉāṉ niṟintār eṉpatuamiyātu; eṉṉi, niṟintiruntatu* ōr koḷkalam piṟituoṉṟaṟku iṭam^ koṭātatu pōla eṉpatu. ivar uttamar ākalāṉuḷḷattāṉ ē puṇara+ pōkam muṭiyum //
<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P36">{{iṟi: Page 36}}</A>
<HR>
// eṉiṉ, piṉṉi ~um eññāṉṟum meyyuṟavu* uvaki kūṭātu*ām. puttira lāpattiṟku meyyuṟupa ~ē eṉiṉ, karuma+poruṭṭu* aṉṟi vēṭki ~illi eṉpataṉāl, uḷḷappuṇarcciuri ~aṉṟu, meyyuṟupuṇarcci ~ē vēṇṭum eṉpatu.

<H3>((coṟpāṭu))</H3>

<P>iṉi, oru cārār urikkumāṟu: meyyuṟupuṇarcci takkatu,iṉcol= um kūṟṟu* um iṉṟi+ pacu+ pōla+ puṇarntār eṉpatutakātu, coṟpaṭukāl muṟimiyāṉ nikaḻntu puṇartaltakavu* uṭittu. avi yāvi ~ō eṉiṉ, kāṭci, aiyam,teḷital, tēṟal eṉa ivi. avaṟṟuḷ,

<P>kāṭci eṉpatu -- iruvar um tammuḷ+ kaṇṇuṟuvatu.ataṟku+ ceyyuḷ;

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 1}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
aiyam eṉpatu -- kaṇṇuṟṟa piṉṉi aiyappaṭuvatu. eṅṅaṉamō eṉiṉ, vari ~aramakaḷ kollō, vāṉ aramakaḷ kollō, nīraramakaḷ kollō, ittuṇi mētaka ~uṭiyāḷ! aṉṟi, makkaḷuḷḷāḷ kollō ! eṉṟum aiyappaṭuvatu. ataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 2}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
ivaḷ um avaṉi aiyappaṭum. kaṭampu* amar kaṭavuḷ kollō,iyakkaṉ kollō! aṉṟi, makkaḷ uḷḷāṉ kollō eṉṟu iṅṅaṉamaiyappaṭum.

<P>ivvaki niṉintapiṉṉi+ teḷivu varumāṟu: āṭi mācu*uṇṭalāṉ um, kāl nilam^ tōytalāṉ um, kaṇ imittalāṉ um,kaṇṇi vāṭutalāṉ um, cāntu pulartalāṉ um eṉṟu iṅṅaṉam^teriyum; terinta piṉṉi+ tuṇiyum eṉpatu. ataṟku+ceyyuḷ:

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 3}}

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P37">{{iṟi: Page 37}}</A>
<HR>
<P>{{C URAI}}
ivaḷ um avaṉi ivvāṟu* ē terintu makkaḷ uḷḷāṉ eṉpatutuṇiyum. tuṇinta piṉṉi iruvarkku* um vēṭki mika+tammiṟ kūṭuvatu. ivvāṟu puṇara+ peritum vaṉappu*uṭittu* āy+ kāṭṭum eṉpatu.

<P>iv= uri poruntātu. eṉṉi kāraṇam eṉiṉ, itu kikkiḷiilakkaṇam teyvam^ kollō, makaṭūu+ kollō eṉa aiyamuṟṟaaiyanili ~um, teyva ilakkaṇam^ tīṇṭā ~ākaliṉ aiyam^teḷintu makaṭūu ~ātal tuvara uṇarnta a+ tuṇivu nilimi~um eṉa+ kikkiḷi ~ilakkaṇam āka+ collappaṭṭamiyiṉ.īṅku akattiṇiyuḷ aḵtu urippatu tiṇimayakkam ākaliṉ,mēlatu* ē poruḷ.

<P>`kāmappuṇarcci' eṉṟamiyiṉ kāmattiṉ vēṟu puṇarcci ~ākalvēṇṭum piṟa, `vāḷāṟ koṇṭa koṭi' eṉṟatu pōla eṉiṉ, aṟṟu*aṉṟu, `poṉṉāṉ+ ceyta mañciki', `maṇṇāṉ+ ceyta kuṭam'eṉpatu pōla, vēṟu* aṉṟi niṟpuḻi+ koḷka eṉpatu.

<P>iḵtu iyaṟkippuṇarcci eṉappaṭum; pulavarāṉ+ kūṟappaṭṭaiyalpiṉāṉ+ puṇarntār ākalāṉ um, kantaruva vaḻakkattōṭuotta iyalpiṉāṉ+ puṇarntār ākalāṉ um eṉpatu.

<P>iṉi+, teyvappuṇarcci eṉa ~um paṭum; iruvar umteyvattaṉmiyāṉ+ puṇarntār ākaliṉ eṉpatu. allatūum,muyaṟci ~um uḷappāṭu* um iṉṟi oruvaṟku oru karumam kikūṭiṉaviṭattu+ teyvattiṉāṉ āyiṟṟu eṉpatu. atu pōlaivarkku* um muyaṟci ~um uḷappāṭu* um iṉṟi+ puṇarvumuṭintamiyāṉ um teyvappuṇarcci eṉappaṭṭatu. itu ~ēmuṉṉuṟupuṇarcci eṉa ~um paṭum; ivaḷ nalam ivaṉāṉ ēmuṉṉuṟa eytappaṭṭamiyāṉ um, ivaṉ nalam ivaḷāṉ ēmuṉṉuṟa eytappaṭṭamiyāṉ um eṉpatu.

<P>iṉi+, teyvappuṇarcci, muṉṉuṟu puṇarcci, iyaṟki+puṇarcci eṉpaṉavaṟṟuḷ oṉṟu collātu, kāmappuṇarcci~eṉṟu* ē kūṟiya kāraṇam eṉṉi ~eṉiṉ, ivaṟṟuḷ oṉṟu* ēcolliṉum okkum; allatu, avi ellām aṉpiṉāṉ ē nikaḻumākaliṉ kāmappuṇarcci ~eṉṟār eṉpatu; pala kāraṇattiṉ āyaporuḷi oru kāraṇattiṉāṉ+ colluvatu ciṟappu* uṭiminōkki. eṉṉi, nilaṉ um nīr um kālam um vittu* um eṉaivaṟṟiṉatu kūṭṭattiṉ āya muḷiyi nelmuḷi //
<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P38">{{iṟi: Page 38}}</A>
<HR>
// eṉpa. nel muḷikku nel ciṟippuṭi+ kāraṇam. nilaṉum nīr um mutalāka ~uṭiyaṉa potukkāraṇam, avipayaṟṟumuḷi mutalāka ~uṭiyaṉavaṟṟiṟku* um^ kāraṇamākalāṉ. atu pōla īṇṭu* um teyvam um iyaṟki ~um muṉṉuṟa~um potukkāraṇam, kāmam ciṟappukkāraṇam, ātalāṉkāmappuṇarcci eṉappaṭṭatu.

<P>iṉi, iruvayiṉ ottal eṉpatu -- eṉ colliyavāṟu* ō eṉiṉ,puṇarātamuṉ niṉṟa aṉpu puṇarnta piṉ= um appeṟṟi ~ēniṟkum eṉṟavāṟu. āyiṉ, ulakiṉōṭu ovvātu piṟa, ulakiṉiṟpuṇarātamuṉ niṉṟa aṉpu puṇarnta piṉṟi+ tavirtalāṉ um,uṇṇātamuṉ niṉṟa vēṭki uṇṭapiṉṟi+ tavirtalāṉ umeṉpatu. eṉṟāṟku, aṟiyātu colluti, iḵtu ulakattu* uḷḷapāṉmi muṉ= ē kēṭṭāy aṉṟu* ē, illatu iṉiyatu nallatueṉṟu pulavarāl nāṭṭappaṭṭatu eṉa nūl eṭuttu+ kōṭaṟkaṇ=ē collippōntu, iṉi oru kāl ulakiṉōṭu ovvātu* eṉalvēṇṭum ō eṉpatu. āyiṉ, ulakiṉuḷ aṉpu* aṉṟu* āka,puṇarātamuṉ niṉṟa aṉpu puṇarnta piṉ= um appeṟṟi ~ēniṟkum eṉiṉ, puṇarcciyāṉ āya payam illi ~ām piṟa,uṇṇāta muṉ ^niṉṟa vēṭki uṭṭa piṉṟi ~um tavirātuappeṟṟi ~ē niṟkum āyiṉ uṇṭataṉāṉ āya payam illi; atupōla eṉṟārkku, atu ~aṉṟu; puṇarātamuṉ niṉṟa vēṭkipuṇarcciyuḷ+ kuṟipaṭum, a+ kuṟipāṭṭi+ kūṭṭattiṉkaṇtammuḷ+ peṟṟa ceykuṇaṅkaḷāṉ āya aṉpu niṟivikkum; piṉ=um muṉṉiṉṟa aṉpu kūṭṭattiṟ kuṟipaṭum. ataṟkuiṭiyiṉṟi+ ē kuṇattiṉāṉ āya aṉpu niṟivikkum;niṟivitta piṉ muṉṉiṉṟa aṉpu kūṭṭattiṟ kuṟiyātueññāṉṟum oru peṟṟi ~ē ~āy niṟkum eṉpatu.

<P>iṉi, avvaki puṇarāta muṉ= um puṇarnta piṉ= um ottaaṉpiṉaṉ āy niṉṟa talimakaṉ piriyum eṉṟum ō, piriyāṉeṉṟum ō; piriyum eṉṟum ē eṉiṉ, aṉpilaṉ āyiṉāṉ ām;eṉṉi? pirivu aṉpiṟku maṟutali ~ākalāṉ. iṉi+ piriyāṉ ēeṉiṉum, aṉpilaṉ āyiṉāṉ ām, eṉṉi? piriyātiruppa iv=oḻukalāṟu piṟarkku+ pulaṉ ām; āka ~ē avaḷ iṟantupaṭum;avaḷ iṟantupāṭṭiṟku+ pariyāṉ āyiṉāṉ ām. āka ~ē,mūṉṟāvatu ceyyappaṭuvatu illiyāl ō eṉiṉ, piriyumeṉpatu. āyiṉ, aṉpu* iṉmi taṅkātu* ō eṉiṉ, taṅkātu.piriyum aṉpiṉāṉ ē nikaḻumāṟu collutum.

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P39">{{iṟi: Page 39}}</A>
<HR>
teyvappuṇarcci puṇarnta talimakaṉ iyaṟki ~aṉpiṉāṉ umceyaṟki ~aṉpiṉāṉ um kaṭāvappaṭṭu+ taṉatu nayappuuṇarttum. iyaṟki-~aṉpu eṉpatu kāraṇam iṉṟi+ tōṉṟumaṉpu; ceyaṟki-~aṉpu eṉpatu avaḷ taṉ kuṇaṅkaḷāl tōṉṟiyaaṉpu. av= iraṇṭiṉāṉ -um kaṭāva+-paṭṭu-niṉṟu talimakaṉcolvatu nayappu eṉpatu.

<P>nayappu eṉpatu talimakaṉ vaṇṭiṟku urippāṉ āy+talimakaḷ kēṭpa+ taṉ nayappu uṇarttiyatu eṅṅaṉam -ōeṉiṉ, `avaḷ kiyiṉi+ cem^-kāntaḷ eṉa -~um, kaṇṇiṉi+karum^-kuvaḷi eṉa -~um, vāyiṉi arakkāmpal eṉa -~umceṉṟu taṭumāṟi+ kuḻal mēl -um kōti mēl -um cuḻalvāy,ivaḷ cevvāyatu naṟunāṟṟam aṟiti ~aṉṟu* ē! iṉi, nīr+ pūnila+ pū kōṭṭu+ pū koṭi+ pū eṉṟu i+ pal-vēṟuvaki+-paṭṭa pūviṉ mēl -um^ celvāy, āmpaṟ pūviṉatunāṟṟam aṟiti ~aṉṟu* ē! aṟivāy, ivvakippaṭṭāḷ cevvāypōla nāṟum^ takimiya uḷa ~ē āmpal naṟumalar? eṉṉāltēṟappaṭum vaṇṭē, uriyāy' eṉa uṇarttiṉāṉ eṉpatu.ataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 4}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉṟatu, vēṟum eṉa-niṉṟu ikaṉ malintār viḻiñattu viṇpōyēṟum^ tiṟaṅkaṇṭa kōṉ teṉpotiyil irumpoḻilvāyvaṇṭātalāl, tēṟum^ takimiya eṉṟavāṟu.

<P>eṉṟataṉāṉ+ pōnta poruḷ: velluvatu karuti viḻiñattu+kaṭaṟkōṭiyuḷ malinta pal vēntari ~um paṭuvittu, ivareṉ pakiñar eṉa niṉiyātu, avarkku+ tavattāṉumtāṉattāṉum aṉṟi+ pukal ākā+ cuvarkkam^ koṭuttaperuntaṉmiyāṉatu nilattu vaṇṭu* ātaliṉ nī ~umperuntaṉmiyi; ākaliṉ, teḷiyappaṭuti, allatūum,potiyil eṉpatu ellā+ tēvarkaḷukku* um potu ~ākiya ileṉṟavāṟu; a+ tēvarkaḷ uṭiya vaṉam av= irum-poḻileṉṟavāṟu; a+ poḻil vāḻvāy nī ~um attaṉmiyi aṉṟu* ē!ākalāṉ -um teḷiyappaṭuti. aṉṉāy nī poy uriyāy; ivaḷvāypōla nāṟum āmpaṟpū uḷa ~ō eṉṟavāṟu. eṉṟataṉāl taṉnayappu uṇarttiṉāṉ.

<P>iṉi melliyal eṉpatu -- meṉmiyi+ taṉakku iyalpākauṭiyāḷ eṉṟavāṟu; meṉmi eṉpatu //
<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P40">{{iṟi: Page 40}}</A>
<HR>
// peṇṭirkku mika iyalpu; ataṉi+ taṉakku+ ceytukōḷaṉṟi iyalpu* āka uṭiyāḷ eṉṟavāṟu; eṉa ~um taṉ nayappuuṇarttiṉāṉ.

<P>iṉi+ centuvarvāy eṉpatu -- cemmiyi+ taṉakku mika~uṭiya vāy eṉṟavāṟu. cemmi ~uṭiyār eṉpatu ulakattu+tam kuṇaṅkaḷi maṟiyātu oḻukuvāri. ivaḷ vāy um taṉkuṇam ākiya vaṭivu* um moḻi ~um naṟunāṟṟam um eṉṟuivaṟṟāṉ viḷaṅki+ polintu tōṉṟuvatu eṉṟavāṟu; eṉṟataṉāṉum taṉ nayappu uṇarttiṉāṉ ām.

<P>iṉi, nāṟum^ takimiya ~ē eṉpatu, aintu ēkārattuḷ= umiv= ēkāram viṉāviṉkaṇ vanta ēkāram eṉa+ koḷka.
<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`tēṟṟam viṉā ~ē pirinili ~eṇ= ē
<BR>	~īṟṟaci ~iv= aintu* ēkāram= ē'.
<BR>		(([iṭiyiyal -- 9]))
<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉpa ~ākaliṉ,

<P>aṇi āmpal naṟumalar eṉpatu -- aḻakiya āmpal naṟumalareṉṟavāṟu. aṇiyāmpal naṟumalar eṉṟataṉāṉ+ pōntatuaḻakiyāriṉ kuṇaṅkaḷ um perumpāṉmi ~um aḻakiya ~ākalāṉ,av= āmpaṟkaṇṇatu mikka naṟunāṟṟam eṉṟaṟku+collappaṭṭatu. avvaki naṟunāṟṟam mika ~uṭiya āmpalivaḷ vāy pōla nāṟum ē eṉṟavāṟu.

<P>malar ē eṉṟu niṉṟa ēkāram īṟṟaci ēkāram.

<P>iṉi, itaṉi+ cōtikkumāṟu; `centuvar vāy nāṟum^takimiya ~ē' eṉṟatu* allatu, pōla eṉṟatu illiyāleṉiṉ, uvamam tokku niṉṟatu eṉṟu koḷka.

<P>eṉṉi,
<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`vēṟṟumi+ toki ~ē uvamam+ toki ~ē
<BR>	viṉiyiṉ toki ~ē paṇpiṉ toki ~ē
<BR>	ummi+ toki ~ē paṉmoḻi+ toki ~eṉṟu*
<BR>	av= āṟu* eṉpa tokimoḻi nili ~ē'.
<BR>		(([eccaviyal -- 16]))
<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉṟu ōtiṉamiyiṉ.

<P>āyiṉ, uvamam tokuka; uvamikkum muṟimi ~aṉṟiuvamittīr. ulakattu+ peṇpālkaḷ vāyatu naṟunāṟṟattiṟkuuvami ~āvatu āmpal eṉṟavāṟu.

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P41">{{iṟi: Page 41}}</A>
<HR>
eṉṉi,
<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`āmpal nāṟum^ tēmpoti tuvarvāy'.
<BR>		(([kuṟun.-- 300]))
<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉpa ~ākaliṉ.

<P>ivvāṟu* aṉṟi, ivaḷ vāypōla nāṟum āmpal uḷa ~ē eṉa,vāyi uvami ~ākki, āmpali uvamikkappaṭum poruḷ āka+collutal kuṟṟam piṟa eṉiṉ, aṟiyātu colliṉāy, ulakattu,ivi uvami, ivi uvamikkappaṭum poruḷ eṉṟunilipeṟṟaṉa uḷa ~ē ~illi. urikkum^ kaviyatukuṟippiṉāṉ uvami ~um uvamikkappaṭum poruḷ ām;uvamikkappaṭum poruḷ ē uvami ~āka ~um amiyum.

<P>eṉṉi,
<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`poruḷatu purivu* ē puṇarppōṉ kuṟippiṉ
<BR>	maruḷaṟa varūum* marapiṟṟu* eṉpa'
<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉṟu ōtiṉamiyāṉ.

<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`kaṇ pōl neytal pōrviṟ pūkkum'.
<BR>		(([naṟṟiṇi -- 8]))
<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉa ~um,

<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`kaṇ= eṉa malarum^ kuvaḷi'
<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉa ~um,

<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`kuvaḷi uṇkaṇ ivaḷ um yāṉ um'.
<BR>		(([akam -- 156]))
<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉa ~um,

<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`neytal uṇkaṇ pital kūra'
<BR>		(([naṟṟiṇi -- 113]))
<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉa ~um iruvakiyāṉ um^ collupa ākaliṉ, iruvakiyāṉ umuvamikka amiyum eṉpatu.

<P>iṉi, marutanilattu āmpali+ kuṟiñci nilattu āmpalāka+ collutal tiṇivaḻu ~ām piṟa eṉiṉ, ākātu; kuṟiñcinilattu vaṇṭu kuṟiñcinilattu* ē tirivaṉa alla; ellānilattu* um^ ceṉṟu, ellā+ pū ~um ūtum ākalāṉ umamiyum. allatūum,
<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`e+ nila maruṅkiṟ pū ~um puḷ= um
<BR>	a+ nilam poḻutoṭu vārā ~āyiṉum
<BR>	vanta nilattiṉ payatta ~ākum'.
<BR>		(([akattiṇiyiyal -- 21]))
<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉpatu* ākalāṉ um amiyum.

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P42">{{iṟi: Page 42}}</A>
<HR>
iṉi+, cuṉikkuvaḷi ~um cuṉiyāmpal um uṇmiyāṉ umamiyum. atu peruṅkuṟiñciyiṟ kaṇṭukoḷka.

<P>iṉi+, talimakaṉ eṉṉum^ colloṭu māṟukoḷḷum, piṟaṉ orutalimakaṉ nilattu+ puṇarntāṉ eṉṟamiyiṉ eṉiṉ,māṟukoḷḷātu; eṉṉi? niṉṟa oruvaṉ āya pāṇṭiyaṉatupotiyil iṭam āka+ coṉṉamiyāṉ. eṉṉi? a+ kulattuḷtōṉṟuvār tēvarkaḷ ē ~ākalāṉ nammāl vēṇṭappaṭṭatalimakaṉ tēvaruḷ mikkāṉ eṉappaṭāṉ, makkaḷuḷ% mikkāṉāyatu* allatu. ākaliṉ, ivaṉ nilattu+ puṇarntāṉ eṉpatutalimiyoṭu māṟukoḷḷātu eṉpatu. allatūum,
<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`maḻi vaḷam^ tarūum* mā vaṇ tittaṉ
<BR>	piṇṭa nelliṉ uṟanti ~āṅkaṇ+
<BR>	kaḻi nili peṟāa+ kāviri nīttam^
<BR>	kuḻi māṇ oḷ= iḻi nī veyyōḷoṭu
<BR>	vēḻa veṇ puṇi taḻīi+ pūḻiyar
<BR>	kayam* nāṭu^ yāṉiyiṉ mukaṉ amarntāaṅku*
<BR>	ēntu* eḻil ākattu+ pūm^ tār kuḻiya
<BR>	nerunal āṭiṉi puṉal ē'.
<BR>		(([akam -- 6]))
<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉṟu* um,

<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`pakuvāy varāal+ pal vari ~irum pōttu'.
<BR>		(([akam -- 36]))
<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉṟu* um, kiḷavi+ talimakaṉi+ pāṭṭuṭi+ talimakaṉnilattu+ puṉal āṭiṉāṉ eṉṟu* um, puṇarntāṉ eṉṟu* um piṟacāṉṟōr ceyyuḷuḷ= um^ collappaṭṭatu* ākaliṉāl um amiyumeṉpatu. i+ pāṭṭiṉāl, taṉkaṇ niṉṟa aṉpu veḷippaṭuttu+talimakaḷi+ pukaḻntu, nayappu uṇarttiṟṟu* āyiṟṟu+pōnta poruḷ. iṉṉum^ ceyyuḷ:

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 5}}

<P><P>{{S 6}}

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P43">{{iṟi: Page 43}}</A>
<HR>
<P>{{S 7}}

<P><P>{{S 8}}

<P><P>{{S 9}}

<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`koṅku tēr vāḻkki am^ ciṟi+ tumpi
<BR>	kāmam^ ceppātu kaṇṭatu moḻimō
<BR>	payiliyatu keḻīiya naṭpiṉ mayil iyal+
<BR>	ceṟi ~eyiṟṟu* arivi kūntaliṉ
<BR>	naṟiya ~um uḷa ~ō nī ~aṟiyum pū ~ē'.
<BR>		(([kuṟun. 2]))

<P>{{C URAI}}
ivi ~um appāṟpaṭuttukkoḷka.

<P>avvaki taṉṉi+ pukaḻa+ talimakaḷ āṟṟāḷ āyiṉāḷ ām;eṉṉi, ciṟiyavar um, tam muṉṉiṉṟu tammi+pukaḻntaviṭattu, nāṇi varuntupa ~ākalāṉ; tāṉ perumi~um perunāṇ um uṭiyāḷ, talimakaṉ muṉṉiṉṟu pukaḻaāṟṟāḷ āvatu colla vēṇṭum ō? avvaki āṟṟāḷ āyiṉāḷatuāṟṟāmi talimakaṟku+ pulaṉ āyiṟṟu. pulaṉ āka, ataṉi+kaṇṭu, nīr uṭi nilattu nivanta nīḷmaram veppattālteṟappaṭātatu pōla, yāṉ uḻiyēṉ āka iv vēṟupāṭu ivaṭkuākātu* aṉṟu* ē! iḵtu eṟṟiṉāṉ āyiṟṟu+ kollō eṉaniṉintāṉ. niṉintu, aṟintēṉ eṉṉatu kātal mikaviṉāṉ+pārāṭṭappōlum eṉa uṇarntāṉ. uṇarntu, yāṉ taṉ muṉ ^niṉṟutaṉṉi+ pārāṭṭa ~um ivvaki melivu ceṉṟa perunāṇuṭiyāḷ, puṟattu yārāṉum oruvar iv= oḻukkatti uṇarvārkollō eṉṟu uṭkoṇṭa ñāṉṟu ivaḷ iṟantupaṭum pōlum eṉa+periyatu* ōr āṟṟā+ taṉmiyaṉ āyiṉāṉ. āṟṟā+ taṉmiyaṉeṉpatu ev= uṇarvu* um iṉṟi av= āṟṟāmi tāṉ ē ~āvatu.avvaki āṟṟāṉ āya talimakaṉatu āṟṟāmikku+ kavaṉṟu muṉnāṇiṟ ceṉṟu eytiya āṟṟāmi nīṅki+ talimakaḷ āṟṟāḷāyiṉāḷ, vēl ēṟu paṭa+ tēḷ ēṟu māyntāṟpōla. atutalimakaṟku+ pulaṉ āyiṟṟu. //
<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P44">{{iṟi: Page 44}}</A>
<HR>
// pulaṉ āka, ivaḷ evviṭattum taṉ taṉmi eṉpatuoṉṟilaḷ, eṉ taṉmiyaḷ ē; yāṉ āṟṟa āṟṟi, yāṉ āṟṟātaiṭattu+ tāṉ um āṟṟāḷ ām ākalāṉ, yāṉ pirintaviṭattu eṉkuṟippu* aṉṟi iṟantupaṭāḷ; allatūum, yāṉ piriyātu viṭa+puṟattār uṇarvar. puṟattār uṇara ~ē, ivaḷ āṟṟāḷ ām.ākalāṉ, yāṉ piriya ~ē puṟattār uṇarār āka ~ē, ivaḷāṟṟum eṉa+ karuti, ivaḷ karuṅkuḻaṟkaṟṟi maruṅkutirutti, aḷakam um nutal um takipeṟa nīvi, ākam um tōḷum aṇipeṟa+ tivantu, kuḷirppa+ kūṟi+, taḷirppamuyaṅki+ pirival eṉṟu valittāṉ. valittu+, pirivaccameṉpatu oṉṟu collum.

<H3>((pirivaccam))</H3>

<P>pirivaccam eṉpatu, tāṉ pirivu añciṟṟum pirivaccam;avaḷi+ pirivu añcuvittatu* um pirivaccam; ākaliṉ,pirivaccam eṉappaṭṭatu. atu yāṅṅaṉam^ collum ō eṉiṉ,`niṉṉiṟ piriyēṉ, piriyiṉ āṟṟēṉ' eṉṉum. ataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:
<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 10}}

<P><P>{{S 11}}

<P><P>{{S 12}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉa, ivvaki kēṭṭa talimakaḷ, `emperumāṉ niṉṉiṟpiriyēṉ, piriyiṉum āṟṟēṉ āval' eṉkiṉṟāṉāl, pirivueṉpatu* um oṉṟu uṇṭu pōlum; kēṭṭa takimiyāl atu tamkātalari+ kāṇātu* um kēḷātu* um kiyiṉ akaṉṟu meyyiṉnīṅkuvatu eṉa+ kalaṅki+, kārmaruṅkiṉ miṉṉu+ pōlavum,nīr maruṅkiṟ koṭi+ pōlavum, taḷir um muṟi ~um tatintu,kuḷirum naḷirum kaviṉi eḻāniṉṟatu* ōr kaviṉ peṟu koṭi+pōlum kāriki, kaṇṇāṭi maṇṭilattu ūtu āvi pōla+ kāṇaoḷi maḻuṅki+, kaṉal muṉ iṭṭa meḻuku+ //
<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P45">{{iṟi: Page 45}}</A>
<HR>
// pāvi pōla maṉam uruki+ pacantu kāṭṭiṉāḷ. kāṭṭiyumāṟṟiṉāḷ, `yāṉ āṟṟā viṭiṉ emperumāṉ um iṟantupaṭum' eṉa.aṅṅaṉam āṟṟiṉāḷatu nīrmiyi+ kaṇṭu, `ivaḷ evviṭattumtaṉ taṉmi eṉpatu oṉṟu ilaḷ, eṉ taṉmiyaḷ ē pōlum' eṉa+periyatu* ōr kaḻiyuvaki mītūra niṉṟu, vaṉpuṟi eṉpatu*ōr col+ collum.

<H3>((vaṉpuṟi))</H3>

<P>vaṉpuṟi eṉpatu vaṟpuṟuttuvatu. aḵtu^ yāṅṅaṉam ōeṉiṉ, aṇittu em iṭam eṉpatu ataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 13}}

<P><P>{{S 14}}

<P><P>{{S 15}}

<P><P>{{S 16}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉa, aṅṅaṉam^ kēṭṭa talimakaḷ, `emperumāṉ aṇittu emiṭam eṉkiṉṟāṉāl, aṇiyataṟku arumi ~illi eṉkiṉṟāṉ ām.arumi ~illi eṉṟataṉāṉ+ pōnta poruḷ, palkālum^ kēṭka~um kāṇa ~um ām eṉṟavāṟu pōlum. palkālum^ kēṭpār um^kāṇpār um āṟṟiyuḷar ākātu* ē; ataṉāl emperumāṉ, eṉṉi+kāṇṭaṟku* um kēṭṭaṟku* um āṟṟiyuḷaṉ ām pōlum' eṉa,āṟṟuvāḷ ām. aṅṅaṉam āṟṟutali aṟinta piṉṟi+ pirivāṉām.

<P>iṉi, `ivaḷ um perunāṇiṉaḷ; yāṉ piriyātuviṭa iv=oḻukkam puṟattārkku+ pulaṉ ām. āka ~ē, ivaḷorutaliyāka iṟantupaṭum' eṉa, ivvaki pirivaccam um //
<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P46">{{iṟi: Page 46}}</A>
<HR>
// vaṉpuṟi ~um colli+ piriyum ākaliṉ, pirivu* umaṉpiṉāṉ ē nikaḻntatu eṉpatu.

<H3>((talivaṉ taliviyatu arumi ~aṟital))</H3>

<P>ivvāṟṟāl talimakaḷi āṟṟi+ pirinta talimakaṉavaḷi+ tamiyaḷ āka nīṅkum ō eṉiṉ, nīṅkāṉ. avaḷ taṉṉi kāṇāmi+tāṉ avaḷi+ kāṇpatu* ōr aṇmikkaṇ, maḻikkoṇṭaluḷmiṉṉu+ pukku oḷittāṟpōla, oru taḻippotumpar iṭimaṟintu niṟkum eṉpatu. aṅṅaṉam niṟpa+, talimakaḷ umtaṉ kuḻaṟkaṟṟi+ poṟi ~um kōti ~um tuyalvara+,koṭiyiṭi naṭuvu taḷara+, paravi alkul tukil aciya+,pimpoṟṟōṭu miṉṉu+ paṭippa, arava vaṇṭaṟi ~um tāmariaka ~itaḻ puriyum am^ cem^ cīṟaṭi mēṟ cempoṟ cilampuaraṟṟa aṉṉam pōla meṉmela otuṅki+ kāmavalli+ koṭi ~um,kaṟpaka+ koḻuntu* um naṭappatu* eṉa naṭantu ceṉṟu, a+paṉi vari +cāral arukiṉatu oru maṇi ~aruvi maruṅkuōluṟutta+ paḷiṅku viḷimpu aṭutta nīla+ piñcuṉimaruṅkiṉatu* ōr marakata+ cilāvaṭṭattayal māṇikka+catura+ pāṟi mēl, tātu tavicu viḷimpaṭutta mātavi+pantar+ pōtu vēynta pū nāṟu koḻu niḻal iruntāḷ. iruntāḷāka+, tātu* um taḷir um pōtu* um mētakkaṉavaṟṟālkuṟuṅkaṇṇi ~um, neṭum^ kōti ~um, viravuttaḻi ~um,cūṭṭukkattiki ~um, mōṭṭu valayam um, piṟavum āka+puṉintu, vaṇṭu* um tēṉ um puṭimaruṭṭa, aṭiyuṟi ~eṉaēnti+, pirinta āyam peyarntu eyti+, pōṟṟum pallāṇṭumkūṟiniṉṟār. niṟpa, avaḷ um tāraki naṭuvaṇ taṇmatipōlvatu* ōr poliviṉaḷ āy+ kāṭṭiṉāḷ, kāṭṭiṉāḷi+ kaṇṭu,`ivaḷi yāṉ eytiṉēṉ eṉa+ karutiṉaṉ eytiyatu uṇṭēlkaṉavēpōlum! naṉavu* ē ~āyiṉum ivaḷ eṉakku eytutaṟkuariyaḷ ām' eṉa āṟṟāṉ āyiṉāṉ. ataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 17}}

<P><P>{{S 18}}

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P47">{{iṟi: Page 47}}</A>
<HR>
<P>{{S 19}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉa, iv vakiyāṉ avaḷatu arumi niṉintu iv= oḻukkamkikūṭātu* eṉṟu karutuvāṉ āyiṉ variyum; yāṉivvakiyāḷi+ puṇarumāṟu eṉṉikollō eṉpāṉ āyiṉkūṭṭattiṟku* ē muyalvāṉ ām. avvaki niṉintu nīṅkuvāṉāyattōṭu* um^ cellāniṉṟa talimakaḷi nōkki+ collum;ataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 20}}

<P><P>{{S 21}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉa, ivvāṟu colli, iṉi ivaḷi+ kikūṭātu* eṉa āṟṟāṉāyiṉāṉ. av= āṟṟāttaṉmi āṟṟuvatu oṉṟaṉi+ paṟṟum.āṟṟuvatu yātu* ō eṉiṉ, tāṉ eytiya āraṇaṅku* ākiyaavvuruviṉi niṉintu, tāṉ eytum upāyam āvatu taṉkātaṟṟōḻaṉi itukoṇṭu muṭikkum^ kollō eṉpatu. atupaṟṟukkōṭu* āka āṟṟi nīṅkum eṉpatu.

<H2>3</H2>
<P>	āṅṅaṉam puṇarnta kiḻavōṉ taṉvayiṉ
<BR>	pāṅkaṉōriṟ kuṟi talippeytal um
<BR>	pāṅkilaṉ tamiyōḷ iṭantalippaṭal um eṉṟu
<BR>	āṅka iraṇṭu* ē talippeyal marapu* ē.

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉ ^nutaliṟṟu* ō eṉiṉ, iyaṟkippuṇarcci puṇarntatalimakaṉ ataṉ piṉ= ē teruṇṭu varital tali; eṉṉi,vaḻippōkāniṉṟāṉ oruvaṉ piḻittu+ cēṟāṉum cāṇakamāṉummitittaviṭattu+ kālikkaḻīi+ pātukāttu+ taṉ illampukkatu pōla, avaṉ um ñāṉa ~oḻukka+ kuṇaṅkaḷiṉ //
<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P48">{{iṟi: Page 48}}</A>
<HR>
// vaḻi ~ē cellāniṉṟāṉ iḻukkiṉāl, av= iḻukkiṉi iḻukku*āvatu aṟintu, ataṉkaṇiṉṟu mīṭal mikkatu; mīṇṭu niṟkilāṉeṉiṉ, ivvāṟu oḻukum eṉṟu avaṉ oḻukum tiṟam uṇarttutalnutaliṟṟu.

<P>itaṉ poruḷ: āṅṅaṉam puṇarnta kiḻavōṉ eṉpatu -- avvāṟukūṭi+ pirinta talimakaṉ eṉṟavāṟu; taṉvayiṉ pāṅkaṉōriṟkuṟi talippeytal um eṉpatu -- taṉ pāṅkaṉāṉ+kuṟiyiṭattu+ talippeytal um eṉṟavāṟu; pāṅkilaṉ tamiyōḷiṭantalippaṭal um eṉpatu -- pāṅkaṉi ~iṉṟi+ taṉiyāḷiiṭattu etirppaṭutal um eṉṟavāṟu; āṅka eṉpatu aciccol;iraṇṭu eṉpatu toki; talippeyal marapu* ē eṉpatu --talippeytaṟku ilakkaṇam eṉṟavāṟu.

<P>avvāṟu puṇarntu nīṅkiya talimakaṉ piṟṟi ñāṉṟu taṉpāṅkaṉāṉ+ kuṟiyiṭattu+ talippeytal um, pāṅkaṉi ~iṉṟi~ē taṉiyāḷi iṭattu etirppaṭutal um eṉa av= iraṇṭiloṉṟu* ē talippeytaṟku ilakkaṇam eṉṟavāṟu.

<P>avvaki puṇarnta kiḻavōṉ eṉpatu, teyvam iṭi niṟpa+pāṉmiyāl uykkappaṭṭu yār um il oru ciṟi+ talippeytatalimakaṉ eṉṟavāṟu. eṉa ~ē, avvāṟu puṇarappaṭṭāḷtalimakaḷ eṉappaṭṭatu.

<P>kiḻami ~uṭimiyiṉ kiḻavaṉ eṉappaṭṭatu, talimi~uṭimiyiṉ talimakaṉ eṉṉappaṭṭatu; avaṭku* um avvāṟu*ē koḷka.

<H3>((pāṅkaṟ kūṭṭam))</H3>

<P>iṉi+ pāṅkaṉ+ kūṭṭam āmāṟu collutum: iyaṟkippuṇarccipuṇarntu āṟṟuvittu+ pirinta talimakaṉ āṅku+ paṭṭavārtti ~ellām niṉikkum. niṉikkumāṟu yātu* ō eṉiṉ,`niṉṉiṟ piriyēṉ, piriyiṉ āṟṟēṉ' eṉa+ colli+,`piriyappaṭṭāḷ taṉṉi+ kāṇāta eṉ nilimi niṉintuaṟṟāḷ ām^ kollō' eṉa ~um, `āṟṟāḷ āki niṉṟāḷ taṉatuvēṟupāṭṭi+ puṟattār aṟiyāmi maṟikkumāṟu aṟiyātuvaruttum^ kollō' eṉa ~um, ivi mutal āyiṉa niṉintuāṟṟāṉ ām.

<H3>((uṟṟatu viṉātal))</H3>

<P>āṟṟā nilimiyāṉi+ piṟṟiñāṉṟu ciṟukāli ~ētalippaṭum pāṅkaṉ; talippaṭṭu, aṭiyiṟkoṇṭu muṭikāṟum//
<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P49">{{iṟi: Page 49}}</A>
<HR>
// nōkkuvāṉ, putiyiruḷ iriyal pōka+ poṉtāḻ aruvi maṇineṭum^ kōṭṭu utayam eṉṉum maṇi vari ~ucci ulaku tuyilpeyarttu+ tōṉṟiya vaḷar oḷi iḷa ñāyiṟṟiṉ vaṉappu oḻittatiru ~oḷi maḻuṅkiyatu nōkki, `eṉṉi kollō emperumāṟkuiṟṟi vēṟupāṭṭu vāṭṭam?' eṉṉum. ataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 22}}

<P><P>{{S 23}}

<P><P>{{S 24}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
<H3>((uṟṟaturittal))</H3>

<P>ivvaki pāṅkaṉ viṉāvāṉ āyiṉ talimakaṟku uṟṟatukaṭippiṭiyātu viṭṭāṉ ām. ivvaki kaṭippiṭittuviṉaviya pāṅkaṟku, `nerunal ivvakiyār oruvari+kaṇṭēṟku eṉ uḷḷam paḷḷattu vaḻi veḷḷam pōla ōṭi,ivvakittu āyiṟṟu' eṉṟu collum; ataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 25}}

<P><P>{{S 26}}

<P><P>{{S 27}}

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P50">{{iṟi: Page 50}}</A>
<HR>
<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`ciṟu veḷ= araviṉ avvari+ kuruḷi
<BR>	kāṉa yāṉi ~aṇaṅkiyāaṅku
<BR>	iḷiyaḷ muḷi vāḷ eyiṟṟaḷ
<BR>	vaḷi ~uṭi+ kiyaḷem aṇaṅkiyōḷ ē'.
<BR>		(([kuṟun. 119]))

<P>	`eluva ciṟāar ēmuṟu naṇpa
<BR>	pulavar tōḻa kēḷā yatti
<BR>	mā+ kaṭal naṭuvaṇ eṇ ^nāḷ+ pakkattu+
<BR>	paku veṇ tiṅkaḷ tōṉṟiyāṅku+
<BR>	katuppu* ayal viḷaṅkum^ ciṟu nutal
<BR>	putu+ kōḷ yāṉiyiṟ piṇittu* aṟṟāl em= ē'.
<BR>		(([kuṟun. 129]))

<P>{{C URAI}}
<H3>((kaḻaṟiyurittal))</H3>

<P>ivvāṟu colla+ kēṭṭa pāṅkaṉ kaḻaṟum. kaḻaṟutal eṉpatuaṉpuṭiyār māṭṭu+ tīyaṉa kaṇṭāl av= aṉpiltalippiriyāta coṟkaḷāl neruṅkuvatu. kaḻaṟumāṟu: kuṉṟamuruṇṭāṟ kuṉṟi vaḻiyaṭi ~ākātavāṟu pōla ~um, yāṉitoṭuvuṇṇiṉ mūṭuṅkalam illatu pōla ~um, kaṭal vetumpiṉvaḷāvunīr illatu pōla ~um, emperumāṉ, niṉ uḷḷam, aṟivuniṟi orppu+ kaṭippiṭiyiṉ varittu* aṉṟi+ kimmikkuōṭum ē ~eṉiṉ niṉṉi+ teruṭṭaṟpāla nīrmiyār uḷar ō, nīpiṟari+ teruṭṭiṉ allatu? a+ peṟṟi ~āya nī, iṉṉatu* ōriṭattu iṉṉatu* ōr uruvu kaṇṭu, "eṉ uṇarvu aḻiya+pōntēṉ" eṉṟal takkiṉṟu' eṉṉum. ataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 28}}

<P><P>{{S 29}}

<P>{{C URAI}}

<H3>((kaḻaṟṟetirmaṟi))</H3>
ivvāṟu pāṅkaṉ kaḻaṟa+, talimakaṉ āṟṟāṉ āy+ collumcoṟkaḷ kaḻaṟṟetirmaṟi eṉpatu. ataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P51">{{iṟi: Page 51}}</A>
<HR>
<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 30}}

<P><P>{{S 31}}

<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`amma vāḻi kēḷir muṉ ^niṉṟu
<BR>	kaṇṭaṉir āyiṟ kaḻaṟalir maṉṉō
<BR>	nuṇ tātu potinta cem^ kāṟ koḻu muki
<BR>	muṇṭakam^ keḻīiya mōṭṭu maṇal aṭikari+
<BR>	pēey+ taliiya piṇar ari+ tāḻi
<BR>	eyiṟuṭi neṭum^ tōṭu kāppa+ pala ~uṭaṉ
<BR>	vayiṟuṭi+ pōtu vālitiṉ virii+
<BR>	pulavu+ porutaḻitta pū nāṟu parappiṉ
<BR>	ivartiri tanta vīrṅkatir muttam^
<BR>	kavar naṭi+ puravi+ kālvaṭu+ tapukku
<BR>	naṟṟēr vaḻuti koṟki muṉ tuṟi
<BR>	vaṇṭu vāy tiṟanta vāṅku kaḻi neytaṟ
<BR>	pōtu puṟaṅkoṭutta uṇkaṇ
<BR>	mātar vāṇ muka matiiya nōkku* ē'.
<BR>		(([akam -- 130]))

<P>	`iṭikkum^ kēḷir num^ kuṟi ~āka
<BR>	niṟukkal āṟṟiṉ ō naṉṟu maṉ+ ^tilla
<BR>	ñāyiṟu kāyum vevvaṟi maruṅkiṟ
<BR>	kiyil ūmaṉ kaṇṇiṟ kākkum
<BR>	veṇṇey uṇaṅkal pōla+
<BR>	parantaṉṟu* i+ nōy nōṉṟukoḷaṟku* aritu* ē'.
<BR>		(([kuṟun. -- 58]))

<P>{{C URAI}}
<H3>((kavaṉṟurittal))</H3>

<P>ivvāṟu talimakaṉ taṉatu āṟṟāmiyiṉ kaḻaṟṟetirmaṟuttu urippa+ kēṭṭa pāṅkaṉ, `tāṉu* ē takātaṉavaṟṟi+takā eṉṟu uṇaraṟpālāṉ, yāṉ, emperumāṟku+ takkatō ivvāṟuuḷmelivatu? eṉa ~um teruṇṭilaṉ; teruḷāviṭṭatu tāṉkāṇappaṭṭa uruvam annīrmittu* ē ~ām; aṉṟu* āyiṉ,teruḷum aṉṟu* ē' eṉa+ kavaṉṟāṉ. a+ kavaṟṟiṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P52">{{iṟi: Page 52}}</A>
<HR>
<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 32}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
<H3>((iyal iṭam kēṭṭal))</H3>

<P>ilvaki cintittu, `avaṉi iṭaṉaṉṟi+ kaḻaṟiṉeṉ, eṉpākkiyam piṟa, kaḻaṟṟetir maṟuttu+ colvāṉ āyiṟṟu;collātu iṟantupaṭṭāṉ eṉiṉum ceyyal āvatu* illi;periyatōr iḻukkam ceytēṉ eṉa āṟṟāṉ āyiṉāṉ. āṟṟāṉāyiṉāṉatu āṟṟāmi aṟṟuvatoṉṟaṉi+ paṟṟum; `yāṉiṟantupaṭṭaviṭattu ivaṉi iḵtu eytuvikkal ākātu; yāṉuḷēṉ āvatu* ē poruḷ' eṉa iṟantupaṭāṉāy niṉṟu`evviṭattu? ettaṉmittu? niṉṉāṉ+ kāṇappaṭṭa uru' eṉṉum.ataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 33}}

<P><P>{{S 34}}

<P>{{C URAI}}

<H3>((iyal iṭam kūṟal))</H3>

<P>eṉpatu kēṭṭu+, kōṭiyāl teṟappaṭṭu vāṭi niṉṟacantaṉamaram maḻipeṟṟu+ taḷirttāṟpōla+, periyatōrkaḻiyuvaki mītūra avaḷi eytiṉāṉēpōla, `iṉṉaviṭattuittaṉmittu eṉṉāṉ+ kāṇappaṭṭa uru' eṉṉum. ataṟku+ceyyuḷ:

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 35}}

<P><P>{{S 36}}

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P53">{{iṟi: Page 53}}</A>
<HR>
<P>{{S 37}}

<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`niṇaṅkoḷ pulāluṇaṅkal* ^niṉṟu puḷ= ōpputaltalikkīṭāka+
<BR>	kaṇaṅkoḷ vaṇṭu* ārttu* ulām^ kaṉṉi naṟu ñāḻalkiyil ēnti
<BR>	maṇam^ kamaḻ pūṅkāṉal maṉṉi maṟṟu* āṇṭu* ōr
<BR>	aṇaṅku* uṟiyum eṉpatu* aṟiyēṉ aṟivaṉēl aṭiyēṉmaṉṉō'.
<BR>		(([cilappatikāram, kāṉalvari -- 9]))

<P>{{C URAI}}
ivvāṟu uṇarttappaṭṭa pāṅkaṉ, `nī iṉiyiyākal; eṉṉiṉāvatu uṇṭēṟ kāṇpal' eṉṟu talimakaṉi āṟṟuvittu, avaṉcoṉṉa iṭam nōkki+ celvāṉ āvatu. itu talimakaṉnilimi.

<P>iṉi+, talimakaḷatu nilimi: piṟṟiñāṉṟu taṉ āyaveḷḷattōṭum vantu, tāṉ viḷiyāṭum iṭam pukutaluṭiyāḷ,nerunalināḷāl, "niṉṉiṟ piriyēṉ piriyiṉ āṟṟēṉ" eṉṟucolliṉāṉ āyattuḷ= ē varuvāṉ kollō!' eṉṉumperunāṇiṉāṉum, `āṟṟāmiyāṉ iṟantupaṭṭāṉ kollō!' eṉṉumaccattiṉāṉ um mītūrappaṭṭu+ taṉ taṉmiyaḷ aṉṟi+ taṉ āyaveḷḷam puṭipeyarumāṟu puṭipeyarntu varukiṉṟāḷ,nerunali nāḷāl talimakaṉi vaḻipaṭṭa iṭametirppaṭṭu+, talimakaṉi+ kaṇṭāḷ ē pōl niṉṟāḷ. eṉṉi,iṉiyāroṭu talippeyta iṭam kāṇṭal um avviṉiyāri+kaṇṭāl ē pōlvatu ulakattu+ taṉmi. avvāṟu niṟpa,āyaṅkaḷum nerunalināḷāṟ pirintāṟpōla+, taḻiviḻitakkaṉa toṭuttum eṉṟum, kaṇṇi taṇṇaṟu nāṟṟattaṉaceytum eṉṟum, pōtumētakkaṉa koytum eṉṟum, ivvāṟuviḷiyāṭṭu viruppiṉāṉ+ piriyum. piriyaniṉṟāḷ, eppeṟṟiniṉṟāḷō eṉiṉ, āyattuḷ= ē varuvāṉ kollō eṉṉum nāṇnīṅkiṟṟu; eṉṉi, āyaṅkaḷ nīṅkiṉamiyāṉ, iṉi,iṟantupaṭṭāṉ kollō eṉṉum accattiṉāṉ mītūrappaṭṭuniṉṟāḷ, niṉṟa nilimikkaṇ pāṅkaṉ ceṉṟu, avaḷ taṉṉi+kāṇāmi+, tāṉ avaḷi+ kāṇpatōr aṇmikkaṇ kāṇum. kaṇṭu,`iv= iṭam ē avaṉāṉ+ kāṇappaṭṭa iṭam um, iv= uru ~ēavaṉāṉ+ kāṇappaṭṭa uruvum' eṉa+ tuṇiyum, ataṟku+ceyyuḷ:

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P54">{{iṟi: Page 54}}</A>
<HR>
<H3>((kuṟivaḻi+ kāṇṭal))</H3>
<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 38}}

<P><P>{{S 39}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
<H3>((talivaṉi viyanturittal))</H3>

<P>eṉa niṉintu niṉṟu, `iv= uruviṉi+ kaṇṭa emperumāṉāṟṟutaṟku+ kāraṇam eṉṉi? periyārkku* ē ākātu* ē!ariyaṉa tām kaṟṟu vallaṉ avaṉ ākalāṉ āṟṟiṉāṉ; piṟarāyiṉ iṟantupaṭupa. iṟantupaṭātu eṉkāṟum vantairuntuṇi+ peruntakkāṉi yāṉ periyatōr iṭaṉ aṉṟi+kaḻaṟiṉēṉ' eṉa niṉikkum. ataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 40}}

<P><P>{{S 41}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
maṟṟu ivvaki ~um cintikkum:

<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`tuṟi mēy valampuri tōyntu maṇal uḻuta tōṟṟam*māyvāṉ
<BR>	poṟi mali pūm puṉṉi+ pū ~utirntu nuṇ tātupōrkkum^ kāṉal
<BR>	niṟimati vāṇ mukattu nēr kayaṟkaṇ ceyta
<BR>	uṟi mali ~uyyā nōy ūr cuṇaṅku meṉ muli ~ētīrkkum pōlum'.
<BR>		(([cilappatikāram, kāṉalvari -- 8]))

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉa ~um,

<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`maṇaṅkamaḻ kuḻalivaḷ vaṭikkaṇ ceyta mammarvennōy
<BR>	cuṇaṅkaṇi vaṉamuli ~allatu tīrkkallā'.

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉa ~um, ivvaki niṉintu āṟṟāṉ āy um, iṟantupaṭāṉāyiṉāṉ, avaṉi aḵtu eytuvikkum^ tiṟam eṉṉikollōeṉpataṉāṉaṉ. āṟṟiyuḷaṉāy+ talimakaṉi+ ceṉṟeyti, `yāṉkaṇṭa iṭam mētakkatu* ē kāṇ' eṉṉum; ataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P55">{{iṟi: Page 55}}</A>
<HR>
<H3>((kaṇṭami kūṟal))</H3>
<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`iravōr aṉṉa koḻu niḻal tāay
<BR>	nilavōr aṉṉa veḷ% maṇal oḻuki
<BR>	vaṇṭu* um^ tēṉ um varikkaṭi+ piracam um^
<BR>	koṇṭu puṇar narampu* eṉṟu muraṉṟu
<BR>	viḻivu viṭutta viḻumiyōri ~um
<BR>	viḻivu tōṟṟuvikkum paṇpiṟṟu'.

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 42}}

<P><P>{{S 43}}

<P><P>{{S 44}}

<P>{{C URAI}}

<H3>((moḻipeṟa varuntal))</H3>

<P>eṉṟu colli, `nī ~ākātu* ē ivvaki mētakkaṉaeytaṟpālāy' eṉa+, talimakaṉ um avviṭam nōkki+ cellum,ceṉṟaviṭattu+ taṉiyaḷ āy niṉṟa talimakaḷi etirppaṭum.etirppaṭa ~ē, talimakaḷ kāṇum. kāṇa ~ē, āṟṟāmiyāṉiṟantupaṭṭāṉ kollō eṉṉum accam nīṅkum. nīṅka+ taṉtaṉmiyaḷ āyiṉāḷ. taṉ ^taṉmi eṉpatu nāṇ, maṭam, accam,payirppu eṉṉum ivaṟṟoṭu* um^ kūṭi niṟpatu. attaṉmiyaḷāy niṟpa+, talimakaḷatu kuṟippu* iṉṟi+ cāral ākāmiyiṉāṟṟāṉ āyiṉāṉ talimakaṉ. āṟṟāmi eṉpatu piṟitu ev=uṇarvu* um iṉṟi av= āṟṟāmi tāṉ ē āvatu. av= āṟṟāmiāṟṟuvatu oṉṟaṉi+ paṟṟum. āṟṟuvatu piṟitu iṉmiyiṉ orucol+ collum. eṉ collum ō eṉiṉ, `niṉṉi yāṉ i+ poḻil uṟuteyvam eṉa aiyuṟuval, alli ~āyiṉ vāy tiṟavāy, āviceṉṟāl peyarppatu aritu* aṉṟu* ō' eṉṟu ivvaki pōlvaṉacollum; ataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P56">{{iṟi: Page 56}}</A>
<HR>
<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 45}}

<P><P>{{S 46}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
<H3>((maruṅku aṇital))</H3>

<P>eṉṟāṉ talimakaṉō eṉiṉ, allaṉ; talimakaṉ iṭaṉāka+piṟanta āṟṟāmi. atu ~um talimakaṉ eṉa vēṇṭum. a+ coṟkēṭṭal um, iṟantupaṭṭāṉ eṉa+ karuti+ kavaṉṟu nōkkiṉāḷ.nōkki, uṇmi kaṇṭāḷ; kaṇṭāṭku+ keṭuttu+ tēṭum naṉkalameṭuttu+ koṇṭāṟ pōṉṟu periyatōr uvaki āyiṟṟu; āka,avvuvaki orumūral muṟuval tōṟṟiṟṟu; tōṟṟa, `emperumāṉmuṉṉar+ periyatōr nāṇiṉmi ceytēṉ' eṉa āṟṟāḷ āyiṉāḷ,`yāṉ muṉ niṟpavum āṟṟāṉ āyiṉāṉ emperumāṉ; eṉatu āṟṟāmikaṇṭaviṭattu iṟantupaṭumpiṟa' eṉa āṟṟāmi nīṅkum.nīṅka, nāṇ vantu aṭiyum; aṭiya ~ē, maṟivatu kāṇātu,mātupaṭunōkki naṉ maṇikkāntaḷ melviralāṉ+ pōtupurineṭuṅkaṇ putittāḷ. putippa, `iṉi+ cāra āṟṟum' eṉaniṉintu, `niṉ karuneṭuṅkaṇ putittatu ivaṟku+periyatōr āṟṟāmiyi+ ceyyum eṉṟu* ākātu* ē? avaṟṟiṉparattaṉa ~ō, curumpuṭi+ kōti, niṉ karum puṭittōḷ?'eṉṉum; ataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 47}}

<P><P>{{S 48}}

<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`colliṟ colletir koḷḷā yāḻa niṉ
<BR>	tirumukam iṟiñci nāṇuti katumeṉa+
<BR>	kāmam^ kimmikil tāṅkutal eḷitō
<BR>	koṭuṅkēḻ irumpuṟam naṭuṅka+ kutti+
<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P57">{{iṟi: Page 57}}</A>
<HR>
<BR>	puli viḷiyāṭiya pulavu nāṟu vēḻattiṉ
<BR>	tali maruppu* ēyppa+ kaṭi maṇi civanta niṉ
<BR>	kaṇ= ē katava ~alla naṇṇār
<BR>	araṇ tali matilar ākavum* muracu koṇṭu*
<BR>	ōmpu* araṇ kaṭanta aṭu pōr+ ceḻiyaṉ
<BR>	perumpeyar+ kūṭal aṉṉa niṉ
<BR>	karumpu* uṭi+ tōḷum uṭiyavāl aṇaṅku* ē'
<BR>		(([naṟṟiṇi -- 39]))

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉpatu colli, kuḻal um kōti ~um tiruttuvāṉākaccārum.itu pāṅkaṟ kūṭṭam āmāṟu.

<H3>((iṭantalippāṭu))</H3>

<P>iṉi+ pāṅkilaṉ tamiyōḷ iṭantalippaṭumāṟu: `yāṉivaḷi eytiṟṟu vitiyāṉ ē; iṉṉum av viti kitarumēṟkāṇpal' eṉa+ pāṅkaṟku+ collātu* ē tāṉ muṉ etirppaṭṭaiṭam nōkki+ cellum; ataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:


<H3>((poḻiliṭi+ cēṟal))</H3>
<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 49}}

<P><P>{{S 50}}

<P>{{C URAI}}

<H3>((poḻilkaṇṭu uvattal))</H3>

<P>eṉa nerunalināḷāl avaḷi+ kaṇṇuṟṟa poḻil ē pukkāṉ.pukkāṟku, a+ poḻil periyatu* ōr cārvu* āyiṟṟu* āka,āṟṟāmi nīṅkiṉāṉ. eṉṉi, iṉiyāroṭu talippeytaiṭaṅkaṇṭālum avviṉiyāri+ kaṇṭāl ē pōlum eṉpa; ataṟku+ceyyuḷ:

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 51}}

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P58">{{iṟi: Page 58}}</A>
<HR>
<P>{{S 52}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉṟu, muṉ pāṅkaṟ kūṭṭattu+ coṉṉavāṟu* ē niṉṟatalimakaḷi āṅku+ coṉṉavāṟu* ē ceṉṟu talimakaṉpuṇarvatu, itu pāṅkilaṉ tamiyōḷ iṭantalippaṭumāṟu.

<P>pāṅkaṟ kūṭṭam nikaḻiṉ, iṭantalippāṭu nikaḻātu;iṭantalippāṭu nikaḻiṉ, pāṅkaṟ kūṭṭam nikaḻātu; eṉṉi,attuṇi eḷiyaḷ allaḷ ākalāṉ. aḵtu* ē ~eṉiṉ, `pāṅkilaṉtamiyōḷ iṭantalippaṭal um pāṅkaṉōriṟ kuṟi talippeytalum' eṉṟu eḻaṟpāṟṟu i+ cūttiram; eṉṉi, iṭantalippāṭuteyvappuṇarcciyōṭu okkum ākalāṉ. aḵtu* ē, aṅṅaṉamcoṉṉāṉ ē ~eṉiṉum moḻimāṟṟikkoḷka eṉpatu; atu poruntātu.moḻimāṟṟutal eṉpatu, ceyyuḷ kiṭantavāṟuceyyalākātavaḻi+ ceyvatu. avvāṟu ceyyum^ cūttiramiṉiyatu* āy+ kiṭappa moḻi-māṟṟu+ cūttiram -āka+ ceyyalvēṇṭum ō eṉṟāṟku+ perumpāṉmi ~um pāṅkaṉāṉ ām eṉpatucintikkum; ciṟupāṉmi vitiyiṉāṉ ām eṉpatu cintikkum.ākalāṉ, avaṉ cintittavāṟṟāṉ ē cūttiram^ ceyyappaṭṭatu;moḻimāṟṟu+ cūttiram aṉṟu eṉpatu. ulakattōr iṭukkaṇuṟṟālvitiyāṉ ē tīrum eṉṟu irār, muṉṉam tīrttaṟku+cuṟṟattāri ~um naṭṭāri ~um niṉippar; ākalāṉumavvāṟu* ē collappaṭṭatu. aḵtu* ē ~eṉiṉ, puṟattu yārāṉumuṇarntār uḷar eṉpatu uṇarnta ñāṉṟu ivaḷ iṟantupaṭumeṉṉum karuttu* uṭiyāṉ, piṟṟi ñāṉṟu* ē ceṉṟu pāṅkaṟkuuṇarttaṟpālaṉ ō eṉiṉ, kuṟṟam kuṇam eṉpatu teruḷātuuṇarttum eṉṉum oruvaṉ. atu poruntātu; aṅṅaṉam teruḷātuuṇarttiṉ pāṅkaṟku* ē uṇartta+ kaṭavaṉ ō vaḻippōvārkkuuṇartta amiyātu* ō eṉpatu. maṟṟu* eṉṉō eṉiṉ, tāṉuṇarntāṉ aṉṟu* ē iv= oḻukkattiṉi! tāṉ uṇarntataṉōṭuokkum aṉṟu* ē ivaṉ uṇarntatu! avaṉi+ taṉṉiṉ vēṟallaṉeṉṟu karutiṉamiyāṉ amiyum.

<P>iṉi+ pāṅkaṉāṉ+ kuṟitalippeytal um eṉṟu orumippaṭa+cūttiram^ ceyyātu, `pāṅkiṉōriṉ' eṉṟu paṉmippaṭa+kūṟiyatu eṟṟiṟku, avaṉ oruvaṉ allaṉ ō eṉiṉ, //
<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P59">{{iṟi: Page 59}}</A>
<HR>
// pāṅkaṉ pārppāṉ ākaliṉ paṉmi vācakattāṉ+ coṉṉāreṉpatu. allatūum, irumutukuravarāl um ivaṉi empōla+koṇṭu oḻuku eṉṟu talimakaṟku+ kāṭṭi+ koṭukkappaṭṭāṉpāṅkaṉ eṉpatūum, nī ~um empōla+ koṇṭu oḻukuvāy eṉṟutalimakaṉi+ pāṅkaṟku+ kāṭṭi+ koṭukkappaṭṭāṉ eṉpatūumpōtaralvēṇṭi ivvāṟu paṉmippaṭa+ coṉṉār eṉpatu. aḵtu* ē~eṉiṉ, iyaṟki+ puṇarcci puṇarnta piṟṟiñāṉṟu ivaḷvēṟupāṭu kaṇṭu tāy iṟceṟikkil eṉ ceyyumō eṉiṉ, pārppārcāṉṟōri muṉṉiṭṭu aruṅkalaṅkaḷōṭu pāṅkaṉ ceṉṟu varintueytuvikkum, aṅṅaṉam kiṭantatu* ē viti eṉṉiṉ, aṉṟu;ivvāṟṟāṉ+ puṇartaṉ muṟimiyākkum viti eṉil, tāykku+pulaṉākāmikkoḷḷum eṉpatu. aḵtu* ē ~eṉiṉ āyamkaḻikkāṉaliṭi ~ē koṇṭu pukutātu maṟṟōr kāṉaliṭam ēkoṇṭupukkaviṭattu+ talimakaṉ kuṟi piḻippum, pāṅkaṉaṅku+ ceṉṟa celaviṉ piḻippum ivi ~ellām^ taṅkum piṟaeṉiṉ, atu ~aṉṟu; avvāṟupaṭiṉum varintu pukum.

<P>atu ~aṉṟi+ piṟṟiñāṉṟu i+ kūṭṭam nikaḻvippāṉniṉṟaviti piṟitōr kāṉaliṭaṅkoṇṭu pukuḷḷam piṟappikkumōeṉpatu. aḵtu* ē ~eṉiṉ, iyaṟki+ puṇarcci puṇarntapiṟṟiñāṉṟu pāṅkaṉ talimakaṉi+ kaṇṭu, `eṟṟiṉāṉ āyiṟṟuniṉakku iv vēṟupāṭu?' eṉṟu viṉāviṉavāṟu pōla, aṉṟu* ē~āṉum piṟṟiñāṉṟu* ē ~āṉum talimakaḷatu vēṟupāṭukaṇṭu, `niṉakku iḵtu eṟṟiṉāṉ āyiṟṟu?' eṉṟu tōḻiviṉāvāmikku+ kāraṇam eṉṉiyō eṉiṉ, talimakaḷatuvēṟupāṭṭi viti tōḻikku+ pulaṉ ākāmi+ koḷḷaṟpāṟṟu,aḵtu aṉṟu* ātaṟku+ kāraṇam^ kūṟaṟpāṟṟu eṉiṉ, vitikku+kāraṇam kūṟaṟpāṟṟu* aṉṟu eṉpatum oṉṟu; kāraṇam^ kūṟiṉumpāṅkaṟku+ pulaṉāyataṉāl āya payaṉuṇṭu; a+ kūṭṭam pāṅkaṉaṟintu viṉāva muṭiyum. tōḻi talimakaṇmāṭṭu vēṟupāṭukaṇṭaṟintu viṉāva+ pāṅkaṟkūṭṭam muṭiyātu; tōḻi taṉṉālāvatu* um illi. itu kāraṇam eṉpatu. aḵtu* ē ~eṉiṉ,`āṅka ~iraṇṭu* ē talippeyal' eṉa amiyum. `marapu'eṉṟatu eṟṟiṟkō eṉiṉ; talippeyaṟku ilakkaṇam eṉṟavāṟu.marapu eṉiṉum ilakkaṇam eṉiṉum ellām oruporuṭpaṉmoḻieṉṟavāṟu.

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P60">{{iṟi: Page 60}}</A>
<HR>
<H2>4</H2>
<P>	av= iyalpu* allatu kūṭṭa+ kūṭal
<BR>	ev= iṭattāṉ um^ kaḷaviṟku* illi.

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉpatu eṉ ^nutaliṟṟu* ō eṉiṉ, i+ nūlakattu+ kaḷaviṉatuilakkaṇatti ~um kaṟpiṉatu ilakkaṇatti ~um tokuttuuṇarttutal nutaliṟṟu.
cūttira+ kiṭakki nāṉku vakippaṭum: āṟṟoḻukku,arimānōkku, tavaḷippāyttu, paruntuvīḻkkāṭu eṉa.

<P>avaṟṟuḷ, āṟṟoḻukku eṉṉum cūttira+ kiṭakki, āṟṟunīrtoṭarpaṟātu oḻukumāṟupōla+ cūttiraṅkaḷum tammuḷiyipupaṭa+ kiṭappatu.

<P>arimānōkku eṉpatu, ciṅkam nōkkumiṭattu muṉṉiyāri~um piṉṉiyāri ~um nōkkuvatu pōla, iṟantataṉōṭumetirvataṉōṭum iyipupaṭa+ kiṭappatu.

<P>tavaḷi+ pāyttu eṉpatu, tavaḷi pāykiṉṟuḻiiṭinilaṅkiṭappa+ pāyvatu pōla+ cūttiram iṭiyiṭṭuppōyiyipukoḷvatu.

<P>paruntiṉ vīḻkkāṭu eṉpatu, paruntu vīḻkiṉṟuḻi naṭu ~ēvīḻntu tāṉ karutiṉaporuḷ koṇṭupōm, atu pōla itu ~um tāṉkaruti muṭikkiṉṟa poruḷi muṭittuppōm iyipu* iṉṟi ~ēeṉpatu.

<P>iḵtu avaṟṟuḷ arimānōkku eṉpatu, eṉṉō kāraṇam eṉiṉ,iṟanta pāṅkaṟ kūṭṭattiṉi ~um nōkki, varukiṉṟa tōḻiyiṟkūṭṭattiṉi ~um kaṟpiṉi ~um ellām nōkkiṉamiyiṉeṉpatu.

<P>itaṉ poruḷ: av= iyalpu allatu eṉpatu -- mēl+collappaṭṭa iyaṟkippuṇarcci puṇarnta iyalpu* allatueṉṟavāṟu; kūṭṭakkūṭal eṉpatu -- oruvar iṭi niṉṟupuṇarppār uṇṭāka+ puṇartal eṉṟavāṟu; evviṭattāṉumkaḷaviṟku illi eṉpatu -- ennērattukkaṇṇum^ kaḷavu*eṉappaṭṭa oḻukkattiṟku* um illi eṉṟavāṟu.

<P>eṉa ~ē, ulakiṉuḷ oruvaṉōṭu oruttiyiṭi nikaḻumoḻukkam aṉṟu, ulakiṉuḷ+ kūṭṭavum nikaḻntu, kūṭṭāmi ~um//
<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P61">{{iṟi: Page 61}}</A>
<HR>
// nikaḻtal uṭimiyāl; itu pulavarāl nāṭṭappaṭṭaoḻukkam eṉpatu aṟivikkappaṭṭatu eṉpatu.

<P>`kūṭṭa+ kūṭal evviṭattāṉum kaḷaviṟku* illi' eṉa ~ē,kūṭṭāmi+ kūṭal ē uriyatu eṉpatu* ām.

<P>talimakaṉ ulāppōyiṉa iṭattu+ paratti māṭṭu+ pirintāṉeṉṟu karuti oru civappu uṇṭām. a+ civappu nīkkivāyilkaḷ kūṭṭa ~ē kūṭum eṉpatu. aḵtu* ē ~eṉiṉ, iḵtu*aṉṟu* ē neṭuntoki+ pāṭṭiṉuḷ kūr muṇ muḷḷi kūṭṭāmaṟkūṭiṟṟu eṉiṉ? atu ~um kūṭṭa ~ē kūṭiṟṟu. ev vāyilāṉ+kūṭiṉāṉ ō eṉiṉ, āṟṟāmi vāyilāṉ+ kūṭiṉāṉ ām; kūṭiṉavāṟuataṉ akattu+ kaṇṭukoḷka. aḵtu* ē ~eṉiṉ, kaḷaviṉiṟ,`kūṭṭa+ kūṭal illi' eṉṟatu eṟṟiṟku? atu ~um āṟṟāmikūṭṭa+ kūṭupa eṉṉām ō eṉiṉ, aṅku āṟṟāmi kūṭṭum ē~eṉiṉum vāyil ilakkaṇam iṉṟu; iṅku vāyil ilakkaṇamuṭittu. eṉṉi, vāyilkaḷ um avaḷatu poṟāmiyinīkkuvatu* aṉṟu* ē ceyvatu. itu ~um avaḷatu poṟāmiyinīkkiṉamiyiṉ amiyātu* ō eṉiṉ, amiyātu; iṅku vāyililakkaṇam uṭittu* ākaliṉ amiyum eṉpatu.

<P>`av= iyalpu allatu kūṭṭa+ kūṭal kaḷaviṟku illi' eṉaamiyum. `evviṭattāṉum' eṉṟatu eṟṟiṟku* ō eṉiṉ, uṇarttauṇartal ōr iṭattu uṇṭu eṉṟaṟku+ colliṉār. yār uṇarttayār uṇarpa ~ō eṉiṉ, tōḻi uṇarntami talimakaṉ uṇarumeṉpatu. aḵtu āmāṟu:

<P>pakaṟkuṟi vantu oḻukāniṉṟa talimakaṉ puṇarcciyatuiṟutikkaṇ orunāḷ talimakaḷi+ kōlam^ ceytāṉ. ceyya,avaḷ iṟappa nāṇiṉāḷ. nāṇa+, talimakaṉ karutuvāṉ: `yāṉceykiṉṟatu iyaṟki+ kōlam allatu pōlum eṉṟām ivaḷvēṟupaṭukiṉṟatu' eṉa uṇarntu, avaḷi āṟṟuvittaṟku, `niṉtōḻi ceyyumāṟu* ē kōlam^ ceytēṉ' eṉa+ collum. colla,okkum; `eṉ tōḻiyōṭu talippeytuṭiyar pōlum' eṉauṇarvāḷ āvatu.

<P>avvāṟu uṇarntāḷ perunāṇiṉaḷ ākalāṉ iṟantupaṭāḷ ōeṉiṉ, iṟantupaṭāḷ; ivaḷi+ taṉṉiṉ vēṟaṉṟi+ karutumākaliṉ. vēṟaṉṟi+ karutum eṉiṉ, iv= oḻukkam^ taṉṉiuṇartta amiyātu* ō eṉiṉ, uṇarttāḷ; //
<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P62">{{iṟi: Page 62}}</A>
<HR>
// `yāṉ kāvaṟku* uṟṟappaṭṭēṉ' eṉa+ tōḻi kavalum ākalāṉ.talimakaṉ uṇarttiyataṉāṉ+ payaṉ eṉṉō eṉiṉ, neṭuṅkālamoḻuka+ karutuvāṉ, `yāṉ pirintapōtu ivaḷiāṟṟuvittukkoṇṭu irukkum' eṉpataṉāṉ um, `oru nāḷ itaṉi~aṟiyum, aṟintakkāl katumeṉa āṟṟāḷ ām^ kollō' eṉpataṉāṉum, ivvāṟu uṇarttal āṟṟutaṟku+ kāraṇam ām eṉpataṉāṉ umuṇarttum.

<P>itu poruntātu eṉpa oru cārār; eṉṉi, pakaṟkuṟikkaṇitu nikaḻuntuṇi ~um naṭavātu; ivvaki vanta cāṉṟōrceyyuḷ um illi. itaṉāṉ ē, `evviṭattāṉum' eṉpatu, naṉṟumaṟuttaṟku+ collappaṭṭatu; miki ~aṉṟu eṉpatu. `kūṭṭa+kūṭal kaḷaviṟku illi' eṉṟir āl, pāṅkaṟkūṭṭam,tōḻiyiṟkūṭṭam eṉṟu pēr iṭṭatu eṟṟiṟku* ō eṉiṉ, avartuṇi ~āyiṉamiyiṉ avvāṟu collappaṭṭatu, tuṇi~āyiṉāri+ kūṭṭiṉār eṉṉām ō eṉiṉ, eṉṉām; kūṭum iruvarum a+ karuttiṉar allar ākalāṉ eṉpatu.

<H2>5</H2>
<P>	puṇarnta piṉṟi yāṅṅaṉam oḻukātu
<BR>	paṇinta moḻiyāl tōḻi tēettu
<BR>	irantukuṟi ~uṟutal um^ kiḻavōṉ mēṟṟu* ē.

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉpatu eṉ nutaliṟṟu* ō eṉiṉ, pāṅkaṉāṉātal, tamiyāḷiiṭattu etirppaṭṭātal puṇarnta talimakaṉ, ataṉ piṉ= ēteruṇṭu varital tali; allāviṭiṉ, ivvāṟu oḻukum eṉṟu,avaṉ oḻukum^ tiṟam uṇarttutal nutaliṟṟu.

<P>itaṉ poruḷ: puṇarnta piṉṟi eṉpatu -- pāṅkaṉāṉāṉumtamiyāḷi iṭattu etirppaṭṭāṉum puṇarnta piṉṟieṉṟavāṟu; āṅṅaṉam oḻukātu eṉpatu -- piṟṟi ñāṉṟumappeṟṟi ~ē oḻukātu eṉṟavāṟu; paṇinta moḻiyāṉ eṉpatu --iḻinta coṟkaḷāṉ eṉṟavāṟu; iḻinta col eṉpatu, vāypāṭṭuiṉṉāmi nōkki+ paṇinta moḻi eṉappaṭṭatu! paṇinta moḻi~aṉṟu* ē, `i+ taḻi nalla, i+ kaṇṇi nalla' eṉṟu iṅṅaṉamkiyuṟi pārāṭṭi+ ceṉṟu niṟṟal; taṉakku+ takātu,iḻintārkku* aṉṟu* ē aḵtu uriyatu eṉpatu; tōḻi tēettueṉpatu -- tōḻi māṭṭu eṉṟavāṟu; //
<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P63">{{iṟi: Page 63}}</A>
<HR>
// irantu kuṟiyuṟutal um kiḻavōṉ mēṟṟu* ē eṉpatu --irattal um kuṟiyuṟutal um ceytuniṟṟal talimakaṟkuurittu eṉṟavāṟu.

<P>irattal eṉpatu, kuṟiyuṭiyār ceyyum ceyki ceytuoḻukuvatu.

<P>kuṟiyuṟutal eṉpatu, i+ kuṟi iṉṟiyamiyāṉ eṉpatupaṭa+pacintu oḻukutal, aḵtu* ē ~eṉiṉ, ivaḷāl i+ kuṟimuṭiyum eṉṟu irakkum ō, muṭiyātu* eṉṟu irakkum ō eṉiṉ,muṭiyum eṉṟu irakkum ē ~eṉiṉ, ivaḷi ikaḻntu matittāṉām; tōḻi eṉpāḷ kuṟṟēval makaḷ, avaḷāl eytalām eṉṟukarutiṉamiyāṉ eṉpatu; ikaḻntu matippa ~ē, `arumi ~umperumi ~um kāval um uṭiyaḷ ivaḷi ettiṟattāṉumeytuvatu aritu' eṉṟu karutiṉāṉ eṉpataṉōṭu māṟukoḷḷumeṉpatu.

<P>iṉi, muṭiyātu* eṉṟu irakkum ē eṉiṉ, irattaṟāṉ ē payamiṉṟu; oruvarāl oru karumam ākāmi aṟintu* ē avar uḻi+ceṉṟu a+ karumattiṟku muyalvār neṟi ~aṟiyātār aṉṟu* ōeṉpatu.

<P>maṟṟu eṉṉō eṉiṉ, muṭiyum muṭiyātu eṉṟu cīrtūkkikkoṇṭu irappāṉ allaṉ; taṉatu āṟṟāmi mītūrappaṭṭuirakkum eṉpatu. aḵtu* ē ~eṉiṉ, ivaḷāl muṭiyum muṭiyātueṉṟu karutāṉ ākalāṉ, piṟarāṉ um muṭiyum muṭiyātu eṉṟukarutāṉ ākal vēṇṭum; ākalāṉ piṟari ~um irakkaamiyātu* ō eṉiṉ, eṉṟārkku aḵtu* aṉṟu; itu muṭiyuñāṉṟuivaḷāl ē muṭivatu* āka+ kiṭantatu* ākalāṉ, av viti ivaḷuḻi ~ē cellum uḷḷam piṟappikkum eṉpatu. aḵtu* aṉṟu* ēulakattārkku+ paṇpiṉvaḻi ~ē ūkkam nikaḻum eṉpatu.

<P>itaṉi e+ peṟṟi karutum ō ivaḷ eṉiṉ,aiyappaṭṭu-niṟkum. `ivaṉ oru kuṟiyuṭiyāṉ pōlum, a+kuṟi iṉṟiyamiyāṉ; aḵtu eṉ māṭṭatu eṉṟu karutuvēṉāyiṉ, iṟappa ~um peruntaṉmiyaṉ ākaliṉ iṟappa ~umciṟiyēṉ uḻi vēṇṭum^ karumam ilaṉ aṉṟu* ē! ataṉāl, eṉkaṇṇatu eṉa ~um ākātu. yār aṟivār, ciṟiyarāṉ+ periyārmuṭikkum^ karumaṅkaḷ um uḷa! ataṉāl eṉ kaṇṇatu eṉpataṉkaṇ= um aiyam ē ~ām' eṉpatu.

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P64">{{iṟi: Page 64}}</A>
<HR>
`iṉi, emperumāṭṭi kaṇṇatu eṉṟu karutuvēṉ āyiṉ, avaḷoruvarāṉ+ cuṭṭa ~um colla ~um paṭum taṉmiyaḷ allaḷākalāṉ avaḷ kaṇṇatu eṉa ~um ākātu. yār aṟivār,ivartaram um avaḷ tuṇi+ perum^ taṉmiyar ākalāṉ avaḷkaṇṇatu eṉa ~um aiyam ē ~ām'.

<P>`iṉi, iv= āyattuḷ oruvar kaṇṇatu* ē kollō eṉa ~um aiyamē ~ām' pērārāycciyaḷ ākalāṉ katumeṉa+ tuṇiyāḷ aṉṟu* ēoṉṟaṉ tiṟattu.

<P>`iṉi, aruḷ kāraṇam āka+ kollō i+ taḻi ~um kaṇṇi ~umkoṇṭuvaruvatu eṉa ~um ākātu, āṟṟāta iyalpiṉaṉ āy varumākalāṉ, ataṉkaṇ= um aiyam ē ~ām' eṉpatu. ataṟku+ceyyuḷ:

<P>	`muṉṉuṟa ~uṇartal kuṟiyuṟa ~uṇartal'.
<BR>		(([iṟiyaṉār -- 7]))
eṉṉum cūttirattuḷ+ kāṭṭutum.

<P>aḵtu* ē ~eṉiṉ, ivaḷi avaṭku+ ciṟantami avaṉ aṟiyumāṟueṉṉi? piṟar colliṉār um illi ~āl ō eṉiṉ, aṟintāṉaṉṟu* ē, iyaṟki+ puṇarcci puṇarnta piṉṉar+ taṉṉi avaḷkāṇāmi+ tāṉ avaḷi+ kāṇpatu* ōr aṇimikkaṇ niṉṟāṉ āka,maṟṟiyār ellām talimakaṭku+ ceyyum vaḻipāṭu* um, ivaḷvicēṭattāṟ ceyyum vaḻipāṭu* um, ellārkkum talimakaḷaruḷicceyyum aruḷicceyki ~um, ivaṭku vicēṭattāṟ ceyyumaruḷicceyki ~um kaṇṭamiyāṉ, `ivaḷ ām ivaṭku+ciṟantāḷ; itu ~um eṉakku* ōr cārpu' eṉpataṉi uṇarntāṉ.uṇarntamiyāṉ, avaḷ uḻi ~ē cellum eṉpatu. aḵtu* ē~eṉiṉ, avaḷ uḻi+ celkiṉṟa āyaṅkaḷ aiyuṟā ~ō eṉiṉ,eṅṅaṉam aiyuṟum; taḻi ~um kaṇṇi ~um kōṭal+ poruṭṭākavēṟōriṭattu+ taṉiyaḷ āy niṉṟa nilimikkaṇ cellumeṉpatu. avaḷ iṉṉaṇam taṉiyaḷ āy niṟpatu aṟintu cellum ōeṉiṉ cellāṉ ; viti ~ē koṇṭuceṉṟu talippaṭuvikkumeṉpatu.

<P>aḵtu* ē ~eṉiṉ, `irattal kiḻavōṉ mēṟṟu* ē' eṉṉātu,`kuṟiyuṟutal' eṉṟatu eṟṟiṟku* ō eṉiṉ, irattal eṉpatu.kuṟiyuṭiyār ceyyum^ ceyki ceytu oḻukuvatu;kuṟiyuṟutal eṉpatu. i+ kuṟi iṉṟiyamiyāṉ eṉpatu paṭa+pacintu oḻukuvatu. aḵtu* ē ~eṉiṉ, `irantukuṟiyuṟutal' eṉa amiyātu* ō, `irantu kuṟiyuṟutal um'eṉṟu ummi koṭuttatu eṟṟiṟku* ō eṉiṉ, teruṇṭu varitalciṟappu* uṭittu; //
<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P65">{{iṟi: Page 65}}</A>
<HR>
// teruḷāṉ āyiṉ, ivvāṟu oḻukutal eṉpataṟku+collappaṭṭatu.

<P>iṉi, oru cārār colluvatu: `puṇarnta piṉṟi' eṉpatu-- iyaṟki+ puṇarcci puṇarnta piṉṟi eṉṟavāṟu; `āṅṅaṉamoḻukātu' eṉpatu -- pāṅkaṉāṉāṉum tamiyāḷi etirppaṭṭāṉumpuṇarātu, tōḻiyi irantu piṉṉiṟṟal+ kaṇ= ē muyalumeṉpār um uḷar. atu poruntātu; eṉṉi kāraṇam eṉiṉ, taṉpāṅkaṉ taṉakku+ ciṟanta tuṇi, avaḷ pāṅku* āya tōḻiciṟakkumāṟu uṇṭu* ō eṉpataṉāṉ. appoḻutu avaḷiniṉiyāṉ, taṉ pāṅkaṉ taṉi ~ē niṉikkum eṉpatu.

<H2>6</H2>
<P>	irantu kuṟiyuṟātu kiḻavi ~um^ tōḻi ~um
<BR>	oruṅku talippeyta cevvi nōkki+
<BR>	pati ~um peyar um piṟa ~um viṉāay+
<BR>	putuvōṉ pōla+ poruntupu kiḷantu
<BR>	mati ~uṭampaṭuttaṟku* um uriyaṉ eṉpa.

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉpatu eṉ ^nutaliṟṟu* ō eṉiṉ, mati ~uṭampaṭukkum^ tiṟamitu eṉpatu uṇarttutal nutaliṟṟu. mēṟ cūttirattiṉōṭuiyipu eṉṉi ~ō eṉiṉ, mēl paṇinta moḻiyāl tōḻiyiirantu piṉṉiṟkum eṉappaṭṭatu; aṅṅaṉam irantu piṉṉiṉṟaiṭattu, `ettiṟattu+ kollō ivaṉuṭiya kuṟi' eṉṟuaiyappaṭṭu niṟpatu* allatu, iṉṉatu* eṉṟu uṇarāḷ aṉṟu*ē! uṇarāmiyāl, eṉ kuṟi iṉṉatu eṉṟu aṟivittu irantupiṉṉiṟpeṉ' eṉṉum karuttiṉāl itu ceyyum eṉpatu iyipu.

<P>itaṉ poruḷ: irantu kuṟiyuṟātu eṉpatu -- irantuvittu+ kuṟiyuṟavu tōṉṟāmi eṉṟavāṟu; kiḻavi ~um tōḻi~um eṉpatu -- kiḻavi eṉappaṭuvāḷ talimakaḷ, tōḻieṉappaṭuvāḷ cevilittāy makaḷ, eṉṉi,
<BR>	`tōḻi tāṉ ē cevili makaḷ ē,
<BR>		((tol -- kaḷaviyal. 34.))
eṉṟār ākaliṉ, av= iruvar um; oruṅku eṉpatu -- ōriṭattarātal; talippeytal eṉpatu -- kūṭiyiruttal; cevvi nōkkieṉpatu -- aṉṉatu* ōr patam* nōkki+ ceṉṟuniṟṟaleṉṟavāṟu. aṅṅaṉam niṟpāṟku orucoṟpaṭukāl muṟimivēṇṭum; //
<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P66">{{iṟi: Page 66}}</A>
<HR>
// pati ~um peyar um piṟa ~um viṉāay eṉpatu -- pativiṉātal eṉpatu ev= ūr eṉpatu, peyar viṉātal eṉpatu eṉṉapeyar eṉpatu, piṟa viṉātal eṉpatu, `iṅku* ē cila māpōntaṉa uḷa ~ō, iḷiyar pōntār uḷar ō, yāṉi pōntaṉauḷa ~ō' eṉṟu i+ toṭakkattaṉa viṉātal eṉṟavāṟu, ataṟku+ceyyuḷ:

<H3>((pati ~um peyar um viṉātal))</H3>

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 53}}

<P><P>{{S 54}}

<P><P>{{S 55}}

<P><P>{{S 56}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
`piṟa ~um' eṉṟataṉāl, ivi ~um^ colli+ ceṉṟu niṟkum;avaṟṟiṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<H3>((vēḻam viṉātal))</H3>

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 57}}

<P><P>{{S 58}}

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P67">{{iṟi: Page 67}}</A>
<HR>
<H3>((kalimāṉ viṉātal))</H3>


<P><P>{{S 59}}

<P><P>{{S 60}}
<P>{{S 61}}

<H3>((vaḻi viṉātal))</H3>

<P><P>{{S 62}}

<H3>((moḻipeṟātu kūṟal))</H3>

<P><P>{{S 63}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉpaṉa koḷka.

<P>putuvōṉ pōla eṉpatu -- eññāṉṟum annilattu+ ceṉṟuaṟiyātāṉum avari+ kaṇṭaṟiyātāṉum pōla eṉṟavāṟu;poruntupu kiḷantu eṉpatu -- a+ nilattiṟku* um avariviṉātaṟku* um poruntuvaṉa kiḷantu eṉṟavāṟu; matiuṭampaṭuttaṟku* um uriyaṉ eṉpa eṉpatu -- mati eṉpatuaṟivu; av= aṟiviṉi oruppaṭuttaṟku* um uriyaṉ eṉṟavāṟu.

<P>yār aṟivi ~ō eṉil, tōḻi ~aṟivi eṉa+ koḷka. avaḷatuaṟiviṉi oruppaṭukkum eṉa ~ē, muṉ kavarntu niṉṟatueṉpatu pōntatu. eṅṅaṉam kavarntu niṉṟatu* ō eṉiṉ,iyaṟkippuṇarcci puṇarnta ñāṉṟu* uṭkoṇṭu kaṇ civantunutal vēṟupaṭṭu+ kāṭṭiṟṟu; `ivaṭku iv //
<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P68">{{iṟi: Page 68}}</A>
<HR>
// vēṟupāṭu teyvattiṉāṉ āyiṟṟu+ kollō' eṉa ~um,`makkaḷiṉāṉ āyiṟṟu+ kollō' eṉa ~um, iṉi `avaṉ ataṟkoṇṭutaḻi ~um kaṇṇi ~um koṇṭu piṉṉili muṉiyātu irantupiṉṉiṟkiṉṟāṉ, ivaṉuṭiya kuṟi yār māṭṭatu kollō' eṉa~um eṉa+ koḷka. aṅṅaṉam kavarnta tōḻi, `ivaḷvēṟupaṭṭatu ivaṉ kāraṇam pōlum, ivaṉ irantupiṉṉiṟkiṉṟatu ivaḷ kāraṇam pōlum' eṉa oruṅku kaṇṇivēṟu* āka vakuttu* uṇarum eṉpatu. ataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<H3>((iruvar niṉivu* um oruvaḻi ~uṇartal))</H3>

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 64}}

<P><P>{{S 65}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉa, i+ toṭakkattaṉa koḷka. aḵtu* ē ~eṉiṉ, `irantukuṟiyuṟātu kiḻavi ~um tōḻi ~um talippeyta cevvinōkki' eṉa amiyātu* ō? `oruṅku' eṉa vēṇṭiyatu eṉṉi?kaḷavu kālattu+ talimakaṉ tēroṭu* um oruṅku cellaamiyum eṉṟaṟku vittār; eṉṉi? cāṉṟōr ceyyuḷ aṅṅaṉamvantatu* ākaliṉ. atu varumāṟu:

<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`nērntanam^ kātalar nēmami neṭum^ tiṇ tēr
<BR>	ūrnta vaḻicitiya ūrntāy vāḻi kaṭal ōtam
<BR>	ūrnta vaḻicitiya ūrntāy maṟṟu* emmoṭu
<BR>	tīrntāy pōl tīrntili ~āl vāḻi kaṭal ōtam.'
<BR>		(([cilappatikāram -- kāṉalvari: 36]))

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉṟu i+ toṭakkattaṉa koḷka.

<P>`mati ~uṭampaṭuttaṟku* um uriyaṉ' eṉṟa ummi yātu* ōeṉiṉ, varintu eytutal mikkatu* ē eṉpatu pōtara āṅṅaṉamurittār.

<H2>7</H2>
<P>	muṉṉuṟa uṇartal kuṟiyuṟa uṇartal
<BR>	iruvarum uḷvaḻi avaṉ varavu* uṇartal eṉṟu
<BR>	a+ mūṉṟu* eṉpa tōḻikku* uṇarcci.

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P69">{{iṟi: Page 69}}</A>
<HR>
<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉpatu eṉ ^nutaliṟṟu* ō eṉiṉ, tōḻi uṇarcciyi+, peyarum muṟi ~um toki ~um uṇarttutal nutaliṟṟu.

<P>itaṉ poruḷ: muṉṉuṟa ~uṇartal eṉpatu -- iyaṟki+puṇarcci puṇarnta piṟṟiñāṉṟu avaḷ kaṇ civappu* umnutal vēṟupāṭu* um^ kaṇṭu karavu nāṭi uṇarvatu* āyiṟṟueṉṟavāṟu; eṅṅaṉam uṇarum ō eṉiṉ, `emperumāṭṭikku+paṇṭi+ taṉmittu* aṉṟāl iv vēṟupāṭu, iḵtu eṟṟiṉāṉāyiṟṟu, eṉakku+ collāy' eṉṉum; eṉa, `nerunal niṉṉiṉnīṅki mētakkatu* ōr cuṉi kaṇṭu āṭiṉēṉ, neṭuṅkālam umniṉṟāṭiṉēṟku āyiṟṟu; ākātu* ē, kaṇ civappu* um nutalvēṟupāṭu* um' eṉṉum; `aḵtēl, cuṉi ~āṭiṉōrkku* ellām i+kāriki nīrmi peṟalām ē ~eṉiṉ, yāṉ um āṭi+ kāṇkēṉ'eṉṉum. ataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<H3>((cuṉi viyantu* urittal))</H3>

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 66}}

<P><P>{{S 67}}

<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`piyuḷ māli+ paḻumaram paṭariya
<BR>	novvu+ paṟi vāval nōṉ ciṟaku* ēykkum
<BR>	maṭi cevi+ kuḻavi taḻīi+ piyān
<BR>	tiṭukukavuḷ maṭa+ piṭi evvam^ kūra
<BR>	vem^ tiṟal āḷiverīi+ cantiṉ
<BR>	poriyari miḷira+ kutti vāṉkēḻ
<BR>	uruva veṇkōṭu* uyakkoṇṭu kaḻiyum
<BR>	kaṭum^ kaṇ yāṉi kāl uṟa oṟṟaliṟ
<BR>	kōvā āram vīḻnteṉa+ kuḷirkoṇṭu
<BR>	pēem nāṟum tāḻ nīr+ paṉi+ cuṉi
<BR>	kōṉēr el vaḷi teḷirppa niṉ pōl
<BR>	yāṉ um āṭi+ kāṇkō tōḻi
<BR>	varivayiṟu kiḻitta niḻal tikaḻ neṭu vēl
<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P70">{{iṟi: Page 70}}</A>
<HR>
<BR>	tikaḻ pūṇ murukaṉ tīm puṉal alivāy+
<BR>	kamaḻ pūm puṟaviṟ kārpeṟṟu+ kalitta
<BR>	oṇ poṟi maññi pōlvatu* ōr
<BR>	kaṇkavar kāriki peṟutal uṇṭu* eṉiṉ ē'.

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉa+ kēṭṭu+ tali cāyttu nilam^ kiḷiyāniṟpa+ puṇarcci~uṇṭu* eṉṟu uṇarntu koḷvāḷ āvatu.

<P>allatūum, aṅṅaṉam vēṟupaṭṭa vēṟupāṭu kaṇṭu aiyuṟṟuniṉṟāḷ. antivākaṭṭu+ ceṅkōṭṭu matarvi+ kuḻavi+tiṅkaḷi+ kaṇṭu tāṉtoḻutu, `nī ~um toḻutukāṇ' eṉṉum.ataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<H3>((piṟi toḻuka* eṉṟal))</H3>

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 68}}

<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`muṉṉum^ toḻattōṉṟi muḷ= eyiṟṟāy attici ~ē
<BR>	iṉṉum^ toḻa+ tōṉṟiṟ ṟītēkāṇ -- maṉṉum
<BR>	poru kaḷi māl yāṉi+ pukaḻ+ kiḷḷi pūṇ pōl+
<BR>	perukoḷiyāṉ mikka piṟi'.

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉa+ kēṭṭu+ talimakaḷ toḻātuniṟkum, kaṟpaḻiyumeṉpataṉāṉ; atu kaṇṭu puṇarcci ~uṇmi aṟintukoḷḷumeṉpatu.

<P>aḵtu* aṉṟi, avaḷi vari ~aṇaṅkāka ~um^ collum;ataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<H3>((taki ~aṇaṅkuṟuttal))</H3>

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 69}}

<H3>((cuṉiviyanturittal))</H3>

<P><P>{{S 70}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
ivi nāṇa nāṭiṉa.

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P71">{{iṟi: Page 71}}</A>
<HR>
iṉi, naṭuṅka nāṭumāṟu: nam puṉattu utiramaḷintakōṭṭatu* ōr kaḷiṟu uṇṭu eṉṉum; ataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<P><P>{{S 71}}

<P><P>{{S 72}}

<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`paṇṭu* i+ puṉattu+ pakal iṭattu* ēṉaluḷ+
<BR>	kaṇṭi+ kaḷiṟṟi aṟivaṉ maṟṟu* -- iṇṭi+
<BR>	katiraṉ paḻiyaṉūr+ kār nīla+ kaṇṇāy
<BR>	utiram uṭittu* itaṉ kōṭu'.

<P>{{C URAI}}
atu kēṭṭu+, `palkālum iv= iṭattu vantu* iyaṅkuvāṉemperumāṉ ātalāṉ, avaṉi+ kaḷiṟu ōr ētam^ ceytatukollō!' eṉṟu naṭuṅkuvāḷ ām. atu kaṇṭu kūṭṭam uṇmiuṇarum.

<H3>((nāṇanāṭṭam um naṭuṅkanāṭṭam um akattiṇi~ilakkaṇam aṉṟu* eṉpatu))</H3>

<P>ivvaki uṇartal poruntātu, nāṇa ~um naṭuṅka ~umnāṭutal akattiṇi ilakkaṇam aṉṟu* eṉka.
eṉṉi,

<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`nāṇavum naṭuṅkavum nāṭāḷ tōḻi
<BR>	kāṇum^ kāli+ talimakaḷ tēettu'.

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉpatu* ākalāṉ.
allatūum, ivaḷ perunāṇiṉaḷ ākalāṉ um pēraccattiṉaḷākalāṉ um iṟantupaṭum ākalāṉ, avaḷ ētattiṟku+ kavalāḷāyiṉāḷ um ām.

<P>allatūum, avaḷi avamatittu+ karutiṉāḷ um ām;avaḷatu kuṟippu* aṟiyātu urittalāṉ ācāram aṟiyāḷ um āmeṉpatu. i+ kuṟṟam ellām^ taṅkum, avvaki urippārkku.

<H3>((muṉṉuṟa ~uṇartal))</H3>

<P>maṟṟu* eṉṉō uri ~eṉiṉ, muṉṉuṟa ~uṇartal eṉpatu,iyaṟkippuṇarcci puṇarnta piṉṟi avaḷatu vēṟupāṭu //
<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P72">{{iṟi: Page 72}}</A>
<HR>
// kaṇṭu, `teyvattiṉāṉ āyiṟṟu+ kollō! maṟṟoruvāṟṟāṉāyiṟṟu+ kollō!' eṉa aiyuṟṟu niṟpatu; ataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<H3>((tōṟṟattāṉ ārāytal))</H3>

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 73}}

<P><P>{{S 74}}

<H3>((kuṟiyuṟavu* uṇartal))</H3>

<P>iṉi+, kuṟiyuṟa ~uṇartal eṉpatu -- avaṉ taḻi ~umkaṇṇi ~um koṇṭu piṉṉili muṉiyātu niṟpa, okkum, ivaṉirantu piṉṉiṟkiṉṟatu ivaḷ kāraṇam āka+ pōlum eṉauṇarvatu. atu poruntātu; eṉṉi, yārāṉum oruvar taṉṉuḻioru kuṟiyuṭiyar āy+ ceṉṟaviṭattu ivaḷ kaṇṇatu* eṉṟukarutuvaḷ āyiṉ avaḷi avamatittu+ karutiṉāḷ ām, avaḷatuperumiyōṭu māṟukoḷḷum eṉpatu, maṟṟu* eṉṉō kuṟiyuṟavu*uṇarumāṟu eṉiṉ, avaṉ irantu piṉṉiṟkiṉṟatu, eṟṟiṟku+kollō eṉa uṇarvatu* āyiṟṟu; ataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<H3>((ivar maṉattu* eṇṇam yātu* eṉa+ tērtal))</H3>

<P><P>{{S 75}}

<P><P>{{S 76}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
ivi iraṇṭum aiyavuṇarvu* ē, tuṇivuṇarvu* alla.

<H3>((iruvarum uḷvaḻi avaṉ varavu* uṇartal))</H3>

<P>iruvarum uḷvaḻi avaṉvaravu uṇartal eṉpatu -- avviya ~uṇarvōṭu niṉṟāḷ, iruvarum uḷvaḻi avaṉ vantu //
<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P73">{{iṟi: Page 73}}</A>
<HR>
// niṉṟu, pati ~um peyarum piṟavum viṉāva+ tuṇintuuṇarum eṉa+ koḷka; ataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 77}}

<P><P>{{S 78}}

<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`ēṉal kāval ivaḷ um allaḷ
<BR>	māṉvaḻi varukuvaṉ ivaṉ um allaṉ
<BR>	narantam^ kaṇṇi ivaṉōṭu* ivaḷiṭi+
<BR>	karanta uḷḷamoṭu karutiyatu piṟitu* ē
<BR>	nam muṉ nāṇunar pōla+ tammuḷ
<BR>	matu maṟintu* uṇṭōr makiḻcci pōla
<BR>	uḷḷattuḷ= ē makiḻpa
<BR>	collum āṭupa kaṇṇiṉāṉ ē'.

<P>{{C URAI}}
itaṉi matiyuṭampāṭu eṉṟamiyāṉ muṉṉi ~aṟivu kavarntuniṉṟatu eṉpatu peṟṟām, tuṇivuṇarvu peṟṟilam eṉpatu.aḵtu* ē ~eṉiṉ,

<P>`ammūṉṟu* eṉpa tōḻikku* uṇarcci' eṉṟu, mūṉṟiṉi ~umuṇarcci eṉṟu coṉṉamiyāl tuṇivuṇarvu* ē ākaṟpālatueṉiṉ, tuṇivuṇarvu* um uṇarvu* ē ~eṉappaṭum,aiyavuṇarvu* um uṇarvu* ē ~eṉappaṭum, uṇarvu* eṉṉumpotumi nōkka; cantaṉam um kāñciri ~um marameṉappaṭṭatu pōla. ivvāṟāka ~ē, tōḻi ārāycciyuṭimi~um, ācāramuṭimi ~um, ētattiṟku+ kavaṟal um,naṉkumatittal um veḷippaṭum eṉpatu. aḵtu* ē ~eṉiṉ,`ammūṉṟum eṉpa tōḻikku uṇarcci' eṉṟu, mūṉṟu* um ē ~eṉṟutuṇintāṉ ākil, ummi koṭuttu+ colla vēṇṭum.
eṉṉi,
<BR>	`iṉitteṉa aṟinta ciṉimutaṟ kiḷavikku
<BR>	viṉippaṭu tokutiyiṉ ummi vēṇṭum'.
<BR>		(([kiḷavi -- 33]))

<P>eṉṟār ākaliṉ; aḵtēl, ummi īṇṭu+ tokuttu+ kūṟiṉār,ummi īṇṭu+ tokuttaṟku ilakkaṇam uṇmiyāṉ. //
<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P74">{{iṟi: Page 74}}</A>
<HR>
// āyiṉ, `iruvarum uḷvaḻi avaṉ varavu' eṉṟu ākātu*aṉṟu* ē, avaṉ celavu eṉṟatu* aṉṟi eṉpatu;
eṉṉi,
<BR>	`tarucol varucol āy iru kiḷavi ~um
<BR>	taṉmi muṉṉili āy īr iṭattu'.
<BR>		(([kiḷaviyākkam -- 29]))

<P>	`ēṉi iraṇṭum ēṉi ~iṭatta'.
<BR>		(([kiḷaviyākkam -- 30]))
eṉṟār ākaliṉ. aḵtu aṟiyātu coṉṉāy,
<BR>	`celaviṉ um varaviṉ um^ taraviṉ um^ koṭiyiṉ um'.
<BR>		(([kiḷavi -- 28]))
eṉṉum^ cūttirattuḷ, ilēciṉāṉ muṭiyum ākalāṉ amiyum;atu ~ākaliṉ aṉṟu* ē,
<BR>	`tūṇṭil vēṭṭuvaṉ vāṅka vārātu'
<BR>		(([akam -- 36]))
eṉṟu cāṉṟōr colliyatu eṉpatu.

<H2>8</H2>
<P>	āṅku* uṇarntu* allatu kiḻavōḷ tēettu+
<BR>	tāṉ kuṟi uṟutal tōḻikku* illi.

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉpatu eṉ ^nutaliṟṟu* ō eṉiṉ, itu ~um tōḻikku* uriyatu*ōr ilakkaṇam uṇarttutal nutaliṟṟu.

<P>itaṉ poruḷ: āṅku uṇarntu* allatu eṉpatu -- aṅṅaṉamaṟinta piṉṟi ~allatu eṉṟavāṟu; kiḻavōḷ tēettu eṉpatu-- talimakaḷ māṭṭu eṉṟavāṟu; tāṉ kuṟi uṟutal tōḻikkuilli eṉpatu -- tāṉkuṟiyuṟṟu muṭippal eṉṉum^ coltōḻikku illi eṉṟavāṟu.

<P>eṉa ~ē, eṉ collappaṭṭatu* ām eṉiṉ, karavunāṭṭamvēṇṭuvāri ~um maṟukkappaṭṭatu* ām. aḵtu* ē ~eṉiṉ,`kuṟiyuṟutal tōḻikku illi' eṉa amiyātō, `tāṉ' eṉṟatueṟṟiṟkō eṉiṉ, piṉṉi ~um tāṉ allaḷ kuṟi nayappu+kūṟuvāḷ, avaṉatu āṟṟāmiyi+ taṉkaṭkoṇṭu niṉṟamiyālavaṉ ē ~eṉappaṭum.

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P75">{{iṟi: Page 75}}</A>
<HR>
<H2>9</H2>
<P>	muṉṉuṟa uṇariṉum avaṉkuṟi uṟṟa
<BR>	piṉṉar allatu kiḷavi tōṉṟātu.

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉpatu eṉ ^nutaliṟṟu* ō eṉiṉ, talimakaṉ muṉ niṉṟu tōḻicollāṭumiṭam uṇarttutal nutaliṟṟu.
itaṉ poruḷ: muṉṉuṟa uṇariṉum eṉpatu -- mati~uṭampaṭuppa+ kūṭṭam uṇmi uṇarntāḷ āyiṉum eṉṟavāṟu;avaṉ kuṟiyuṟṟa piṉṉar allatu eṉpatu -- avaṉ irantupiṉṉiṉṟa piṉṉar allatu eṉṟavāṟu; avaṉ irantupiṉṉiṟkumāṟu,
<BR>	`kuṟiyuṟum^ kiḻavaṉi uṇarnta tōḻi'.
<BR>		(([iṟiyaṉār -- 12]))
eṉṉum^ cūttirattuḷ+ collutum; kiḷavi tōṉṟātu eṉpatu --muṭippal eṉṉum^ col tōṉṟātu eṉṟavāṟu.

<P>aḵtu* āmāṟu, mati ~uṭampaṭuttu+ taṉ karuttu*aṟivittu+ piṉṉi+ taḻi ~um kaṇṇi ~um koṇṭu piṉṉiṟkum.niṉṟāṉoṭu, muṭippa+ karutuvāḷ, taṉkaṇ nāṇu+ keṭuntuṇi~um^ kuṟiyāṭum; āṭa, aṟṟikkaṉṟu āṟṟāmi avaṟku+perukum; perukuvatu kaṇṭu, aṟṟikkaṉṟu ivaṭku nāṇu+curuṅka, iraṇṭu* um tulāttalippaṭṭu eṭāniṉṟaṉa;niṉṟuḻi, avaṉatu āṟṟāmi ~um itaṉiṉ ūṅku+ perukumāṟu*illi ~eṉa+ perukkattiṟku varampu* eyti niṉṟatu;ivaḷatu nāṇ um itaṉiṉ ūṅku nuṇukumāṟu* illi ~eṉanuṇukkattiṟku varampu* eyti niṉṟatu. niṉṟa nilimikkaṇtalimakaṉ oru col+ collum. eṉ collum ō eṉiṉ, iṉṟiṉūṅku* ellām i+ karumam niṉṉāṉ muṭiyum eṉa+ karuti vantuuḻantēṉ; iṉi niṉṉāṉ muṭiyāmi uṇarappaṭṭatu;paṭṭamiyāṉ, iṉi iḷivantaṉa ceytāyiṉum muṭippal, itaṉiiṉṟiyamiyēṉ ākalāṉ, eṉṉum. iḷivantaṉa ceytal āvatu,maṭal ūrntāṉum vari pāyntāṉum eṉṟavāṟu; ataṟku+ceyyuḷ:

<H3>((maṭal ūrtal))</H3>

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 79}}

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P76">{{iṟi: Page 76}}</A>
<HR>
<P>{{S 80}}

<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`mā ~eṉa māṭal um ūrpa pū ~eṉa+
<BR>	kuvi mukiḻ erukkam^ kaṇṇi ~um^ cūṭupa
<BR>	maṟukiṉ ārkka ~um paṭupa
<BR>	piṟitum ākupa kāmam^ kāḻ+ koḷiṉ ē'.
<BR>		(([kuṟun. -- 17]))

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉṟāṉ talimakaṉ ō eṉiṉ, allaṉ; talimakaṉ iṭaṉāka+piṟanta āṟṟāmi. atu kēṭṭu muṉ kuṟipāṭṭiṉkaṇ+ ceṉṟuniṉṟa nāṇ uṇṭu* aṉṟu* ē, atu keṭum; keṭa, avaṉatuāṟṟāmi+ taṉmiyi+ taṉkaṇ+ koṇṭu talimakaṉiāṟṟuvippatu* ōr col+ collum. aḵtu^ yātu* ō eṉiṉ,`ariyaṉa tāṅkal aṉṟu* ē periyāratu peṟṟimi; nīyiritaṉṟiṟattiṉar ākaṉmiṉ, yāṉ um ataṉṟiṟattu eṉṉiṉ āvatu*uṇṭēṟ kāṇpaṉ' eṉṉum eṉa, avaṉatu āṟṟāmi nīṅkum, atunīṅka+, talimakaṉatu nilimi nōkki, ivaṉ iṟantupaṭāṉeṉpatu uṇarntu, ivi collum; avi yāvi ~ō eṉiṉ, `maṭalēṟuveṉ eṉṟir āl, numakku maṭal ēṟutal  iyivatu kollō,eṉṉi, nīyir pēraruḷiṉir ākalāṉ' eṉṉum; ataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<H3>((aruḷiyal kiḷattal))</H3>

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 81}}

<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`veḷḷām^ kurukiṉ piḷḷi ~um pala ~ē
<BR>	aviyiṉum pala ~ē ciṟu karum^ kākki
<BR>	aviyiṉum aviyiṉum pala ~ē kuvi maṭal
<BR>	ōṅku* irum peṇṇi mīmici+ toṭutta
<BR>	tūṅkaṇam^ kurīi+ kūṭṭuḷa ciṉi ~ē'.

<P>{{C URAI}}
`aṉṟi ~um, "maṭal ēṟuvaṉ" eṉṟir āl, a+ maṭalēṟappaṭuvār uruvu eḻutikkoṇṭu* aṉṟu* ē ēṟuvatu; numakkuuruvu* eḻutal ām ō?' eṉṉum! ataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P77">{{iṟi: Page 77}}</A>
<HR>
<H3>((moḻi naṭi ~eḻutal aritu* eṉa+ kiḷattal))</H3>

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 82}}

<P><P>{{S 83}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
allatūum, eḻutu ñāṉṟu iṅṅaṉam ō nīr eḻutuvatu?' eṉṟucollum; ataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<H3>((avayavam eḻutal aritu* eṉa+ kiḷattal))</H3>

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 84}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
atu kēṭṭu+ talimakaṉ peyarttum āṟṟāṉ ām; āka, iṉiiṟantupaṭal ākātu* eṉṟu, `nīr i+ nīrar ākaṉmiṉ, numakkui+ kuṟi muṭittu+ taruvaṉ; nummāṟ karutappaṭuvāḷ eṉmāṭṭu+ peritum aruḷ uṭiyavaḷ āyiṉāḷ' eṉṉum; ataṟku+ceyyuḷ:

<H3>((uṭampaṭṭu vilakkal))</H3>

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 85}}

<P><P>{{S 86}}

<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`talippuṇi+ koḷiṉ ē talippuṇi+ koḷḷum
<BR>	kaṭippuṇi+ koḷiṉ ē kaṭippuṇi+ koḷḷum
<BR>	puṇi kiviṭṭu+ puṉalōṭu* oḻukiṉ
<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P78">{{iṟi: Page 78}}</A>
<HR>
<BR>	āṇṭum varukuvaḷ pōlum māṇṭa
<BR>	māri+ pittikattu nīr vār koḻu muki+
<BR>	cevverin uṟaḻum^ koḻuṅkaṭi maḻikkaṇ
<BR>	tuḷitali+ taliiya taḷir aṉṉōḷ ē'.
<BR>		(([kuṟun-222]))

<H3>((koṇṭunili kūṟṟu))</H3>

<P>{{C URAI}}
atu kēṭṭu+ talimakaṉ, `ivaḷ iṉi eṉakku i+ kuṟimuṭikkum' eṉa, muṉṉiṉṟa āṟṟāmi nīṅki āṟṟum eṉpatu.eṉṉi, ulakattu oru poruḷ muṭiyātu* eṉa+ kavaṉṟuniṉṟār, muṭippatu* ōr upāyam^ kaṇṭa ñāṉṟu apporuḷeytiṉār ē pōla makiḻpa ~ākaliṉ, ivaṉ um taṉ uṭiyakuṟi eytiṉāṉ ē pōla+ peyarntāṉ. itaṉi+ koṇṭunilikūṟṟu eṉṟu colluvatu; eṉṉi, talimakaṉ iṟantupaṭuvāṉia+ col tāṅkikkoṇṭu niṉṟamiyāṉ eṉpatu. itu colli,ivaṉi āṟṟuvittu+ talimakaḷ māṭṭu+ ceṉṟu, i+ kuṟimuṭikkum upāyam ārāyvāḷ āvatu.

<P>
<H2>10</H2>
<P>	uḷḷattu* uṇarcci teḷḷitiṟ karantu
<BR>	kiḻavōḷ tēettu+ kuṟiyuṟūum uḷa ~ē
<BR>	kuṟippu* aṟivuṟūum^ kāliyāṉa.

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉpatu eṉ ^nutaliṟṟu* ō eṉiṉ, talimakaṟku+ kuṟinērnta tōḻi talimakaḷi+ kuṟi nayappikkumāṟuuṇarttutal nutaliṟṟu.

<P>itaṉ poruḷ: uḷḷattu uṇarcci teḷḷitiṟ karantu eṉpatu-- taṉ uḷḷattu niṉṟa uṇarcciyi naṉku pulappaṭāmimaṟittu eṉṟavāṟu; kiḻavōḷ tēettu eṉpatu -- talimakaḷmāṭṭu eṉṟavāṟu; kuṟiyuṟūum uḷa ~ē eṉpatu -- kuṟivēṇṭal um uḷa eṉṟavāṟu; kuṟippu aṟivuṟūum^ kāli āṉaeṉpatu -- talimakaṉatu āṟṟāmi+ kuṟippiṉiaṟivuṟuttumiṭattu eṉṟavāṟu.

<P>`uḷḷattu* uṇarcci' eṉpatu yātu* ō eṉiṉ, kūṭṭam uṇmiuṇarnta uṇarcci ~eṉṟum ām; allatūum, avar i+ kuṟiiṉṟiyamiyār eṉa uṇarnta uṇarcci eṉṟumām; allatūum, yāṉkuṟiyuṟa avaḷ itaṉi āṟṟum^ kollō eṉa uṇarnta uṇarcci~eṉṟumām; allatūum, eṉṉiṉ āya kūṭṭam muṭiyātuviṭiṉ ivaṉ//
<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P79">{{iṟi: Page 79}}</A>
<HR>
// iṟantupaṭum ākalāṉ ivaḷi+ kuṟi nayappittu+ koṇṭumuṭikkalām^ kollō eṉa uṇarnta uṇarcci ~eṉṟu* um ām.

<P>`teḷḷitiṟ karantu kiḻavōḷ tēettu+ kuṟiyuṟūum uḷa ~ē'eṉpatu, ivaḷ kūṭṭam uṇmi uṇarntāḷ pōṉṟu kuṟiyuṟṟuniṉṟāḷ eṉa+ talimakaṭku+ pulaṉ ākāmi naṉku maṟittu+kuṟiyuṟūum^ kuṟiyuṟa ~um uṭiyaḷ talimakaḷ māṭṭu+kuṟinayappu+ kūṟumiṭattu eṉṟavāṟu.

<P>`uṇṭu' eṉṉātu, `uḷa' eṉṟa paṉmiccol eṟṟiṟkō eṉiṉ,kuṟiyuṟavu tām pala eṉṟaṟku+ collappaṭṭatu. avi yāvi~ō eṉiṉ, melitāka+ colli+ kuṟi nayappittal um,valitāka+ colli+ kuṟi nayappittal um eṉa ivi.

<P>avaṟṟuḷ, melitāka+ colli+ kuṟi nayappikkumāṟu: `iṅkuvantu oḻukāniṉṟāṉ oru tōṉṟal uḷaṉ, avaṉ eṉṉiṉ āyatu*oru kuṟi ~uṭiyāṉ pōlum, oruvarāl oru kuṟiyuṟavukoḷḷum^ takimiyāṉ um allaṉ, oruvarkku oru kuṟimuṭippiṉ allatu; ataṉāl, avaṉ, a+ kuṟi iṉṟiyimiyāṉ;amiyāmi nōkki, yāṉ a+ kuṟi muṭippār taṉmiyēṉ āyiṉēṉāy vittu oru poy poyttēṉ, poyppēṉum poyppal eṉṟupoyttēṉ; ēṉ eṉil, ippoḻutikku* uḷḷāy a+ poyyiṉāṟpiṉṉum ōr upāyattāṉ muṭittukkoḷḷa+ peṟār ō eṉṟupoyttēṉ; eṉṉi, uyir uṭiyār eytā+ poruḷ illieṉpataṉāṉ avvāṟu karuti+ poyttēṟku avar ataṉi mey=eṉṟu karutikkoṇṭu ceṉṟār, tām poy= aṟiyāmiyiṉ; aṉṉāriṉṟu varuvar, vantāl, i+ kuṟi muṭiyāmiyiṟ poyyeṉauṇarvār ākār ō?' eṉṉum; ataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 87}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
allatūum,

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 88}}

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P80">{{iṟi: Page 80}}</A>
<HR>
<P>{{S 89}}

<P><P>{{S 90}}

<P><P>{{S 91}}

<P><P>{{S 92}}

<P><P>{{S 93}}

<P><P>{{S 94}}

<P><P>{{S 95}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉa ivvaki kūṟa+ kēṭṭu, `niṉṉiṉ+ piriyēṉ, piriyiṉāṟṟēṉ' eṉṟa emperumāṉ vantu ivaḷi irantu piṉ^niṉṟamiyāṉ iṟantupaṭṭilaṉ eṉa ēmāppāḷ āvatu.

<P>iṉi, valitāka+ colli+ kuṟi nayappikkumāṟu: `iṅkuvantu oḻukāniṉṟāṉ oru tōṉṟal uḷaṉ, avaṉ eṉṉiṉ āyatu*oru kuṟi ~uṭiyāṉ pōlum, oruvarāṉ oru kuṟi koḷḷum^taṉmiyaṉ um allaṉ, tāṉ piṟarkku oru kuṟi //
<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P81">{{iṟi: Page 81}}</A>
<HR>
// muṭippiṉ allatu; ataṉāl i+ kuṟi iṉṟiyamiyāminōkki+ kuṟi muṭippaṉ eṉa+ poyttu oḻukiṉēṉ; oḻuka,nerunali nāḷāl i+ kāṉaluḷ vantu eṉṉi etirppaṭṭu+ taṉtuṇi+ puṟantaruvatu* ōr alavaṉi+ kaṇṭu, "itu ~ākātu*ē aṟivu* um āṇmi ~um āvatu!" eṉa, ataṉi naṉkumatittuāṟṟāṉ āy eṉṉi ~um nōkki alavaṉi ~um nōkki, `uṇarviṉieṉkaṇ= um av= alavaṉ kaṇ= um oḻiya+ pōyiṉāṉ, e+taṉmiyaṉ āyiṉāṉ kollō! iṉṟu vantilaṉ' eṉṉum; ataṟku+ceyyuḷ:

<P><P>{{S 96}}

<P><P>{{S 97}}

<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`puṇar tuṇiyōṭu* āṭum poṟi ~alavaṉ nōkki
<BR>	iṇar kiti+ pūṅkāṉal eṉṉi ~um nōkki
<BR>	uṇarvu* oḻiya+ pōṉa oli tiri nīr+ cērppaṉ
<BR>	vaṇar curi aimpālāy vaṇṇam uṇarēṉ āl'.
<BR>		(([cilappatikāram, kāṉalvari -- 31])).

<P>	`orunāḷ vāralaṉ irunāḷ vāralaṉ
<BR>	paṉṉāḷ vantu paṇimoḻi payiṟṟi ~eṉ
<BR>	naṉṉar neñcam nekiḻnta piṉṟi
<BR>	vari mutir tēṉiṟ pōkiyōṉ ē
<BR>	ācu* āku* enti yāṇṭu* uḷaṉ kollō
<BR>	vēṟu pulaṉ naṉṉāṭṭu+ peyta
<BR>	ēṟu* uṭi maḻiyiṟ kaluḻum eṉ neñcu* ē'.
<BR>		(([kuṟun-176]))

<P>{{C URAI}}
itu kēṭṭu iṟantupaṭātatu eṟṟiṟku* ō eṉiṉ, iṟantupaṭāḷaṉṟu* ē, `ivaṉ uḷaṉ āyiṉum iṟantupaṭum piṟa, yāṉiṟantupaṭiṉ' eṉṟataṉāṉ.

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P82">{{iṟi: Page 82}}</A>
<HR>
<H2>11</H2>
<P>	taṉṉuḷ+ kuṟippiṉi arukum^ tōḻikku
<BR>	muṉṉuṟu puṇarcciyiṉ arukal um uṇṭu* ē.

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉpatu eṉ ^nutaliṟṟu* ō eṉiṉ, aṅṅaṉam^ kuṟinayappu+kūṟappaṭṭa talimakaḷ iṉṉa taṉmiyaḷ eṉpatu uṇarttutalnutaliṟṟu.
itaṉ poruḷ: taṉ uḷ kuṟippiṉi eṉpatu -- tōḻi taṉuḷḷattu+ kuṟippiṉi eṉṟavāṟu; arukum^ tōḻikku eṉpatu --cārttum^ tōḻikku eṉṟavāṟu; muṉṉuṟu puṇarcciyiṉ eṉpatu-- iyaṟkippuṇarcci, aṅku, `niṉṉiṟ piriyēṉ piriyiṉāṟṟēṉ' eṉṟatu uṇṭu* aṉṟu* ē, ataṉāṉ eṉṟavāṟu; arukal umuṇṭu eṉpatu -- talimakaḷ taṉatu taṉmiyi+ cārttal umuṭiyaṉ eṉṟavāṟu.

<P>eṉpatu eṉ colliyavāṟō eṉiṉ, aṟiya niṟṟal um uṭiyaḷ,aṟiyāmi niṟṟal um uṭiyaḷ eṉṟavāṟu.

<P>melitāka+ colli+ kuṟinayappu+ kūṟiṉa iṭattu,emperumāṉ taṉakku+ takāta iḷivaravu* oḻukāniṉṟāṉ eṉa+kavaṟci uṇṭu* aṉṟu* ē, atu pulappaṭāmi niṟkum.valitāka+ colli+ kuṟinayappu+ kūṟiṉavaḻi, nerunalvārāṉ āyiṉāṉ eṉṟamiyiṉ iṟantupaṭṭāṉ eṉa āṟṟāmiperitu* ām, aṅku+ pulappaṭa niṟkum eṉpatu.

<P>iṉi, orutiṟattār vēṇṭuvatu: col nikaḻtal -um uṇṭu,col nikaḻāmi -~um uṇṭu eṉpatu; aḵtu* āmāṟu melitāka+colli+ kuṟinayappu+ kūṟiyavaḻi, muṉ iṟantupaṭṭāṉ kollōeṉa+ karuti āṟṟāmiyoṭu niṉṟāḷ, uḷaṉāyatu kēṭṭu āṟṟāminīṅkum; nīṅka, nāṇuvantaṭiyum; aṭiya+, tōḻimuṉṉarniṟkalāḷ, `vēṅkippū+ koytum, mayilāṭumāṟu kāṇṭum,aruviyāṭukam' eṉa oṉṟaṉmēliṭṭunīṅkum; ataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 98}}

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P83">{{iṟi: Page 83}}</A>
<HR>
<P>{{S 99}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉa+ coṉṉikaḻntavāṟu.

<P>valitāka+ colli+ kuṟinayappu+ kūṟiṉavaḻi, `nerunalvārāṉ āyiṉāṉ, ātaliṉ iṟantupaṭṭāṉ' eṉa āṟṟāmi nikaḻntuperumiyāṟ col+ piṟavātu eṉa+ koḷka.

<P>iṉi, oru cārār colluvatu: iyaṟki+ puṇarccipuṇarntataṟku iṭiyiṉṟi ~ē iṟceṟikkappaṭṭa talimakaḷtōḻikku aṟattoṭu niṟkumāṟu uṇarttutal nutaliṟṟu eṉpa.

<P>avar kūṟum poruḷāmāṟu: taṉṉuḷ+ kuṟippiṉi arukum^tōḻikku eṉpatu -- taṉkaṇ vēṟupāṭṭi aṟitaluṟum^ tōḻikkueṉṟavāṟu; muṉṉuṟu puṇarcciyiṉ arukal um uṇṭu eṉpatu --muṉṉuṟu puṇarcci kāraṇamāka+ cārtal um uṇṭu eṉṟavāṟu.eṉṉi,

<P>	`muṟpaṭu puṇarcciyiṟ kaṭipaṭu kiḻatti
<BR>	meyppāṭṭu* avalam puriyum^ tōḻikku
<BR>	ētīṭāka eṇṇiya muṟiyāṟ
<BR>	kūṟavum peṟūum kuṟippoṭu puṇarntu* ē
<BR>	kaṟpukkaṭi kākkum karuttiṉāṉa'.

<P>eṉpataṉ poruḷāl, talimakaḷ tōḻikku aṟattoṭu niṉṟatueṉpatu.
aḵtu īṅku+ colla vēṇṭuvatu* illi. pōkki,

<P>	`a+ nāl iṭattu* um meynnāṇ orīi
<BR>	aṟattoṭu niṟṟal tōḻikku* um urittu* ē'.
<BR>		(([iṟiyaṉār-29]))

<P>eṉpataṉkaṇ+ collutum.

<P>oruvarkku oru coṟ colliyaviṭattu a+ col collappaṭṭāriṉṉa nīrmiyarāyiṉār eṉpatu colla vēṇṭum aṉṟu* ē, mēṟcūttirattuḷ, `tōḻi talimakaḷi+ kuṟiyuṟum' eṉṟār, i+cūttirattuḷ, `kuṟiyuṟappaṭṭa talimakaḷiṉṉanilimiyaḷāyiṉāḷ' eṉpatu collavēṇṭum; ataṉāṉ,mēlatu* ē uri.

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P84">{{iṟi: Page 84}}</A>
<HR>
ivvaki kuṟinayappu+ kūṟappaṭṭa talimakaḷtalimakaṉi+ kāṇaluṟaviṉaḷ ām. a+ kuṟippu uṇarntatōḻi, talimakaḷ kuṟi nērntāḷ eṉpatu talimakaṟkuaṟiyaniṟkum eṉpār um uḷar; ataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<H3>((taḻi viruppu* urittal))</H3>

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 100}}

<P><P>{{S 101}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉa+ koḷka.

<H2>12</H2>
<P>	kuṟiyuṟum^ kiḻavaṉi uṇarnta tōḻi
<BR>	ciṟiyuṟa+ kiḷantu cēṭpaṭa niṟuttal um
<BR>	eṉṉi maṟittal evaṉ ākiyar eṉa
<BR>	muṉṉuṟu puṇarcci muṟimuṟi ceppal um
<BR>	māya+ puṇarcci avaṉoṭu nakāa
<BR>	nī ~ē ceṉṟu kūṟu* eṉa viṭuttal um
<BR>	aṟiyāḷ pōṟal um kuṟiyāḷ kūṟal um
<BR>	paṭittumoḻi kiḷavi ~um kuṟippuvēṟu koḷal um
<BR>	aṉṉa piṟa ~um^ talippeyal vēṭki
<BR>	muṉṉuṟu puṇarccikku* uriya eṉpa.

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉpatu eṉ ^nutaliṟṟu* ō eṉiṉ, talimakaḷi+kuṟinayappittu avaḷatu kuṟippu uṇarntu taṉṉiṉ ām^kūṭṭam kūṭṭaluṟum^ tōḻi, talimakaṉ teruṇṭuvarinteytal vēṇṭi, ivi ~ellām^ kūṟi+ cēṭpaṭuttuniṟuttappeṟum eṉpatu uṇarttutal nutaliṟṟu.

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P85">{{iṟi: Page 85}}</A>
<HR>
matiyuṭampaṭuttu+ piṉ ^niṉṟāṉ āka+ tāṉ itaṉi muṭikka+karutuvāḷ taṉkaṇ nāṇu+ keṭuntuṇi ~um^ kuṟiyāṭikkoṇṭuoḻukumāṟu uṇarttutal nutaliṟṟu eṉa ~um amiyum.

<P>itaṉ poruḷ: kuṟiyuṟum^ kiḻavaṉi uṇarnta tōḻi eṉpatu-- kuṟiyuṟavanta talimakaṉi+ kaṭippiṭitta tōḻieṉṟavāṟu; kaṭippiṭiyātu ceṉṟa kālam um uḷa ~ākaliṉ,iṉi aṉṉatu* aṉṟu eṉṟavāṟu; allatūum^, kuṟiyuṟum^kiḻavaṉi uṇarnta tōḻi eṉpatu -- kuṟiyuṟaviṉāṉ āṟṟāṉākiya talimakaṉi uṇarnta tōḻi eṉṟumām; allatūum,irattal um^ kuṟiyuṟutalum^ ceytu āṟṟāṉ āki+ cellāniṉṟatalimakaṉi+ taṉṉiṉ ākiya kūṭṭam muṭiyātuviṭiṉ āṟṟāṉeṉpataṉi+ tiripiṉṟi uṇarnta tōḻi eṉṟumām.

<P>ciṟi uṟa+ kiḷantu cēṭpaṭa niṟuttal um eṉpatu --ciṟi eṉpatu kāppu, uṟa eṉpatu mikuti, kiḷattal eṉpatucollutal, cēṇ eṉpatu akaṟṟal, paṭa eṉpatu nikaḻtal,niṟuttal eṉpatu taḻīikkōṭal eṉṟavāṟu; kāppu mikuticolli akaṟṟi+ taḻīi+ kōṭaluṟum eṉṟavāṟu; āṟṟā+taṉmikkaṇ niṟuttal eṉṉum^ col taḻīikkoḷḷum eṉpatu; eṉa~ē, talimakaṉi āṟṟāmi ceyvaṉapōṉṟu vittuāṟṟuvippaṉa cilacoṟ collum eṉpatu pōntatu. i+ niṟuttaleṉṉum^ collāl taḻīikkoḷḷum eṉpatu* aṉṟu, nīkkiniṟuttār,uyntuviṭṭār, pōkkiviṭṭār eṉpaṉapōla orucolviḻukkāṭupaṭaniṉṟatu eṉpār um uḷar.

<P>aṅṅaṉam^ kāppu mikuti collumāṟu: `iv= iṭam mikkakāvaluṭittu, nīyir varaṟpālirallīr' eṉa+ collum;ataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<H3>((kāppu* uṭittu* eṉṟu maṟuttal))</H3>

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 102}}

<P><P>{{S 103}}

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P86">{{iṟi: Page 86}}</A>
<HR>
<P>{{S 104}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
ivvāṟu tōḻi colla+ talimakaṉ āṟṟiṉavāṟu eṉṉiyō eṉiṉ,a+ col= ē āṟṟuvikkum; `ivaḷ iv= iṭattu nilimiyimaṟiyātu eṉakku urippāḷāyatu eṉkaṇ+ kiṭanta pariviṉāṉākātu* ē; ittuṇi eṉkaṇ+ parivuṭiyāḷ, eṉakku itumuṭiyāmi ~illi' eṉa āṟṟuvāṉ ām. ippaṭiarumiyuṭittākalāl, ivaḷiṉ ākātu eṉṟu uṇarvāṉ āyiṉ,varintu eytuvāṉ ām. ivaḷ ivi ~ellām^ talimakaṉi+collutaṟ kāraṇam eṉṉiyō eṉiṉ, taṉatu āṟṟāmiyāṉmuṭikkiṉṟataṉi eḷiteṉa uṇarum, atu paṭāmi ariteṉauṇarvāṉ āka eṉṟaṟku. iṉi, a+ col= ē āṟṟuvittaṟku+kāraṇam eṉṉi ~eṉiṉ, itu muṭiyātu* eṉa uṇariṉiṟantupaṭuvāṉ kollō eṉṉum accattiṉāṉ eṉpatu. itaṉi i+cūttirattuḷ eṅkum^ tanturikka.

<P>eṉṉi maṟittal evaṉākiyareṉa eṉpatu -- āṟṟāṉ ākiniṉṟa talimakaṉi iḵtu iṟappa ivaṉ iṟantupaṭumeṉaniṉṟa tōḻi, `eṉṉi nīyir ivvakiyiṟ ^tiritaṟku+ kāraṇameṉṉi?' eṉṉum. eṉatu āṟṟāmi iṉṉatiṉāyateṉa ataṉiaṟintilaḷ, aṟiyātāṭku iṉṉatu eṉ kuṟi ~eṉpēṉ āyiṉ ivaḷmaṟukkavumpeṟum, ivaḷi iṉṉum palkāl nekiḻa oḻukiṉ, tāṉē aṟintu muṭikkum' eṉa uṇarntu, `iṉṉatu eṉkuṟi~eṉṉātāṉi, nuṅkuṟiyi eṉṉi maṟittatataṉāl numakku*āvatu eṉṉi?' eṉṉum; ataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<H3>((maṟittami kūṟal))</H3>

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 105}}

<P><P>{{S 106}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉa ~ē, `maṟiyātu viṭṭaviṭattu muṭivuṇṭu' eṉṟāḷeṉpatu.

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P87">{{iṟi: Page 87}}</A>
<HR>
muṉṉuṟu puṇarcci muṟi muṟi ceppal um eṉpatu --muṉṉuṟu puṇarcci eṉpatu iyaṟki+ puṇarcci, ataṉ muṟieṉpatu pāṅkaṟkūṭṭam, ataṉ muṟi eṉpatu tōḻitaṉṉiṉāṉāyakūṭṭam, aḵtu eṉṉi maṟiyātu viṭiṉ muṭippaṉ eṉṟāḷ ām;ataṉāṉ, `eṉ kuṟi aṟintilaḷ, aṟintañāṉṟu muṭittuttarum'eṉa āṟṟuvāṉ ām eṉṟavāṟu.

<P>māya+ puṇarcci avaṉoṭu nakāa nī ~ē ceṉṟu kūṟu* eṉaviṭuttal um eṉpatu -- avaṉ irantupiṉṉiṉṟaviṭattumāyamāṉa puṇarttu+ collukiṉṟatu, iḵtu ulakattunikaḻvatu* oṉṟu* aṉṟu* ālō eṉṟu avaṉoṭu nakāniṉṟu* ē,`yār aṟivār, nikaḻa ~um peṟum nikaḻāmi ~um peṟum ēeṉiṉum, yām kuṟṟēval% makaḷir ākalāṉ tuṇintucollakillēm avaḷatu kuṟippaṟiyātu; nī ~ē ceṉṟu niṉkuṟicollāy' eṉṉum; ataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<H3>((niṉkuṟi nī ~ē kūṟu* eṉṟu maṟuttal))</H3>

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 107}}

<P><P>{{S 108}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉṉum; eṉṟaviṭattu āṟṟāṉ ām; eṉṉi, ulakattār oruvarioruvar, `i+ kuṟi muṭittuttaral vēṇṭum' eṉṟuirantaviṭattu, `eṉṉiṉ ākā, nīr ē ceṉṟu muṭittu+ koṇmiṉ'eṉṟāl, ettuṇi ~um iṉṉātu* aṉṟu* ē, atu pōla eṉpatu.avvaki āṟṟāṉ āy niṉṟāṉatu āṟṟāmi āṟṟuvatu oṉṟaṉi+paṟṟum, eṉṉi, `nakāniṉṟu* aṉṟu* ē colliyatu, a+ nakioṉṟu* uṭittu' eṉa āṟṟuvāṉ āvatu.

<P>iṉi, aṟiyāḷ pōṟal um eṉpatu -- talimakaṉ taḻi ~umkaṇṇi ~um koṇṭu piṉṉiṉṟaviṭattu, `nummāṟcollappaṭuvāḷi aṟiyēṉ' eṉṉum, ataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P88">{{iṟi: Page 88}}</A>
<HR>
<H3>((aṟiyāḷ pōṉṟu niṉivu kēṭṭal))</H3>

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 109}}

<P><P>{{S 110}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉṉum; eṉa, itu kēṭṭu āṟṟāṉ āy niṉṟu, `eṉ kuṟi iṉṉārkaṇṇatu eṉṟu aṟintilaḷ, aṟinta ñāṉṟu muṭittu+ tarum'eṉa āṟṟuvāṉ āvatu.

<P>kuṟiyāḷ kūṟal um eṉpatu -- `i+ taḻi nalla, i+ kaṇṇinalla, ivi koḷḷaṟpāla' eṉṟu kiyuṟi pārāṭṭi niṉṟanilimikkaṇ, avaṟṟi ēṟṟu+ koḷḷātu maṟṟoṉṟu collinīṅkuvatu; ataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 111}}

<P><P>{{S 112}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉpatu kēṭṭu, `ivaḷ i+ kuṟi muṭiyāḷ, avattam ēvaruntiṉēṉ, yāṉ colliyatu iruppa ētilatu* oṉṟucolliṉamiyiṉ' eṉṟu āṟṟāṉ āyiṉāṉ. av= āṟṟāmi āṟṟuvatu*oṉṟaṉi+ paṟṟum; āṟṟuvatu* āvatu^ yātō eṉiṉ, `ivaḷpiṟitoṉṟiṟku+ puṭi kavaṉṟu niṉṟa nilimikkaṇ vantēṉ,allākkāl maṟumāṟṟam tārāmi illi, ivaḷ kavaṉṟu nillānilimikkaṇ varuveṉ' eṉa a+ naciyāl āṟṟum.

<P>paṭittu moḻi kiḷavi ~um eṉpatu -- ivaṉ i+ taḻinalla, i+ kaṇṇi nalla, i+ muttu nalla, ivi koḷḷaṟpālaeṉṟu kiyuṟi pārāṭṭi niṉṟa nilimikkaṇ iṅṅaṉam^ //
<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P89">{{iṟi: Page 89}}</A>
<HR>
// collum; yātō ~eṉiṉ, `iv= iṭam eṉṉiyarāṉum^taṉṉiyarāṉum palkālum pukutarappaṭumāl ; avar nummi+kaṇṭāl ētam^ ceyvar, kūṟṟiṉum^ kaṭuñciṉattar ākalāṉ;nīr uṭiyatu* ōr kuṟi uṇṭu* ē ~eṉiṉ, akaṉṟu niṉṟumuṭittukkoḷḷaṟpāṟṟu eṉṉum; ataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<H3>((paṭittumoḻiyāṉ maṟuttal))</H3>

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 113}}

<P><P>{{S 114}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
itu paṭittu moḻi kiḷavi āyiṉavāṟu eṉṉiyō eṉiṉ,periyārkaḷiṭam eṉappaṭuvaṉa, peṇpālkaṭku uriyavaḻiāṇpālkaḷ pukutal um, āṇpālkaṭku uriyavaḻi+ peṇpālkaḷpukutalum^ ceyyappaṭātaṉa. avaṟṟi+ ceyyappaṭṭaṉa ~ākaillatu paṭittu moḻintamiyāṟ paṭittumoḻikiḷavi ~eṉa+koḷka. atu kēṭṭu āṟṟāṉ ām; eṉṉi, `ivaḷ orutiṟattiṉnīkkutaṟku ivvāṟu collukiṉṟāḷ' eṉa āṟṟāṉ āyiṉāṉ.avvāṟṟāmi āṟṟuvatoṉṟaṉi+ paṟṟum; eṉpaṟṟumō eṉiṉ,`ivvaki eṉkaṇ ētattiṟku+ kavalvāḷ, yāṉ eytātuviṭiṉuḷatu* ām ētattiṟku* um^ kavalum' eṉa āṟṟuvāṉ ām.

<P>kuṟippu vēṟu koḷal um eṉpatu -- tāṉ kūṭṭam vēṇṭum^kuṟippiṉaḷ āyiṉum^ collum^ kūṟṟum iṉṟi vēṇṭātakuṟippiṉaḷāy+ kāṭṭuvatu; atu kaṇṭum āṟṟāṉ ām eṉṉi,`ivaḷ eṉkuṟi muṭiyāḷ; avattam ē varuntukiṉṟēṉ. itu tāṉē āṟṟutaṟku+ kāraṇam; `piṟitu, oṉṟiṟku+ puṭi kavaṉṟuniṉṟa nilimikkaṇ vantēṉ, puṭikavaṟṟiyillānilimikkaṇ vantāl oru maṟumāṟṟam^ collum piṟa eṉaāṟṟi+ peyarum aḵtu* ē ~eṉiṉ, mēlaṉa ~um ellām^ kuṟippuvēṟukoḷal ē ~alla ~ē? itaṉi ~ē kuṟippu vēṟukoḷal eṉa+colliyatu eṟṟiṟkō ~eṉiṉ, avi ~ellām^ coṉṉikaḻcci~uṭiya, itu col nikaḻcci ~iṉṟi+ kūṭṭam //
<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P90">{{iṟi: Page 90}}</A>
<HR>
// vēṇṭā+ kuṟippiṉaḷ āvatu eṉa+ koḷka. iṉi+, piṟar,`kuṟippu vēṟu koḷal um' eṉpataṉi+ collumāṟu: `taṉkuṟippiṉaḷaṉṟi niṉṟāṭku eṉ colli+ celkēṉ?' eṉṉum;ataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<H3>((talivi taṉ kuṟippiṉaḷallaḷ eṉṟal))</H3>

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 115}}

<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`neri nīr irum^ kaḻi nīlam um cūṭāḷ
<BR>	poṟi māṇ vari ~alavaṉ āṭal um āṭāḷ
<BR>	ciṟu nutal veyarvu* arumpa+ cintiyā niṉṟāṭku
<BR>	eṟi nīr+ taṇ cērppu* ayāṉ eṉ colli+ celkō'.

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉa ivvāṟu colla āṟṟāṉ āyiṉāṉ, a+ col= ē paṟṟukkōṭu*āka āṟṟum eṉpatu. eṉṉi ~eṉiṉ, `avaḷ taṉ kuṟippiṉaḷaṉṟi niṉṟāḷ' eṉa+ colliṉamiyiṉ kuṟippiṉaḷ āyniṉṟapoḻutu collum eṉa āṟṟuvāṉ ām.

<P>aṉṉa piṟa ~um^ talippeyal vēṭki muṉṉuṟupuṇarccikku uriya eṉpa eṉpatu -- aṉṉa maṟṟum uḷamuṉṉuṟu puṇarcciyi +pōla+ talippeyvippal eṉṉumuḷḷattāḷ collutaṟku uriya kiḷavikaḷ eṉa+ koḷka. aṅṅaṉamōtuvāṉ puka+ perukuvatu kaṇṭu cila ~ōti+ cilapuṟaṉaṭuttār aḵtu ilakkaṇam ākalāṉ eṉpatu.

<P>`aṉṉa piṟavum' eṉṟataṉāṉ iṅṅaṉam um^ collum; `nīyirviruntiṉir ākalāṉ avaḷatu arumi ~um perumi ~um aṟiyīraṉṟu* ē, avaḷ tāmari+ koṭṭiyiṉ alli ~ē pōla+ kiḷipuṟaṅkāppa+ celvāḷ, i+ nilattukku mikkāḷ orutalimakaḷ, emakku+ kaṇkūṭu* āka+ celvatu* ōr teyvamallaḷ ō? avaḷi+ kaṇṇiṟ kaṇṭu, kiyiṟ kūppi+, taliyiṟpaṇintu vaḻipaṭṭu+ celvatu* allatu em pōlvārkaḷāl orukuṟiyuṟavu* uṇarttum^ taṉmiyaḷ ō' eṉṟu collum;ataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<H3>((collaṟku arumi cāṟṟal))</H3>

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 116}}

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P91">{{iṟi: Page 91}}</A>
<HR>
<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`nerunalu muṉṉāḷ elliyum oruciṟi+
<BR>	putuvi ~ākaliṟ kiḷattal nāṇi
<BR>	nēr iḻi vaḷi+ tōḷ niṉtōḻi ceyta
<BR>	ār uyir varuttam^ kaḷiyāy ō ~eṉa
<BR>	eṟkuṟi ~uṟutir āyiṟ coṟkuṟi
<BR>	empata+ teḷiyaḷ allaḷ emakku* ōr
<BR>	kaṭkāṇ kaṭavuḷ allaḷ ō peruma
<BR>	vāykōṉ miḷakiṉ maliyam^ koḻuṅkoṭi
<BR>	tuñcupuli varippuṟam^ tivarum
<BR>	mañcu cūḻ maṇi vari maṉṉavaṉ makaḷ ē'.

<P>{{C URAI}}
iṉi, ivvaki ~um^ collum: nīyir periyīr, yām ciṟiyēm,nummoṭu emmiṭi+ kaṭṭuri poruntātu' eṉṉum; ataṟku+ceyyuḷ:

<H3>((kulamuṟi kūṟi maṟuttal))</H3>
<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 117}}

<P><P>{{S 118}}

<P><P>{{S 119}}

<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`ivaḷ ē,
<BR>	kāṉam naṇṇiya kāmar ciṟukuṭi
<BR>	nīṉiṟa+ peruṅkaṭal kalaṅka uḷpukku
<BR>	mīṉeṟi paratavar makaḷ ē nī ~ē
<BR>	neṭuṅkoṭi nuṭaṅkum niyama mūtūr+
<BR>	kaṭuntēr+ celvaṉ kātal makaṉ ē
<BR>	niṇaccuṟā vaṟutta uṇaṅkal vēṇṭi
<BR>	iṉappuḷ oppum emakku nalaṉ evaṉō
<BR>	pulavu nāṟutum^ cela niṉṟīmō
<BR>	perunīr viḷiyuḷ em^ ciṟunal vāḻkki
<BR>	nummoṭu purivatu* ō aṉṟu* ē
<BR>	emmaṉōriṟ cemmal um uṭittu* ē'.
<BR>		(([naṟṟiṇi -- 45]))

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P92">{{iṟi: Page 92}}</A>
<HR>
<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉa, āṟṟāṉ āyiṉāṉ; āṟṟāṉ āy, `nīyir periyīr, yāmciṟiyēm' eṉpatu* aṉṟu* ē colliyatu; yāṉ um attaṉmiyēṉāka eytal ām aṉṟu* ē eṉṟu āṟṟum eṉpatu.

<P>iṉi, ivvāṟum collum; ataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`nīṭu nīr+ kāṉal nerunalu nittilam^ koṇṭu* aiyavantīr
<BR>	kōṭu* uyar veḷ% maṇal+ koṟkiyam mūrivaṟṟāṟkuṟivilam yām
<BR>	āṭum kaḻaṅkum aṇiviḷaṅkum ammaṉi ~um piṟa ~umellām
<BR>	pāṭiya vippaṉa ~um pantar+ paṭuvaṉa ~um paṉi nīrmuttam'.

<P>	`muṉṉi+ tam^ ciṟṟil muḻaṅku kaṭal ōtam mūḻki+peyara
<BR>	aṉṉikku* urippaṉ aṟivāy kaṭal ē ~eṉṟu*alaṟippērun
<BR>	taṉmi maṭavār taṇantukutta veḷ% muttam^ taki cūḻkāṉal+
<BR>	puṉṉiyarumpu* ēyppa+ pōvāri+ pētuṟukkum pukār ē~em= ūr'.

<P>{{C URAI}}
iṉṉum, `aṉṉapiṟavum' eṉṟataṉāṉ ētaḻīikkoḷappaṭuvaṉavaṟṟiṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<H3>((taḻiyetirtal))</H3>

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 120}}

<P><P>{{S 121}}

<P><P>{{S 122}}

<P><P>{{S 123}}

<P><P>{{S 124}}

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P93">{{iṟi: Page 93}}</A>
<HR>
<P>{{S 125}}

<P><P>{{S 126}}

<P><P>{{S 127}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
ivi ~ellām ēṟkaccolli+ koḷka, mēlaṉa pōla.

<P>aḵtu* ē ~eṉiṉ, ivaṟku muṭikka+ karutuvāḷ ivvāṟṟāṉivaṉi varuttuvatu eṟṟiṟkō eṉiṉ, taṉkaṇ nāṇu+ keṭum^tuṇiyum^ kuṟiyāṭi, nāṇiṉatu nīkkattukkaṇ+ koṇṭunilikūṟuvāḷ eṉpatu. aḵtu* ē ~eṉiṉ, muṉṉuṟu puṇarccipōla+talippeyvippal eṉṉum vēṭki avaṭku uriya eṉṟamiyāṉ,muṉṉuṟupuṇarcciyi uṇarntāḷō eṉiṉ, uṇarntāḷallaḷ;annīrmikku varampeyta+ puṇarppal eṉṉum niṉippiṉaḷ

<P>anniṉippiṉi āciriyaṉtāṉ muṉṉuṟu puṇarcciyāoppittāṉ eṉpatu.

<H2>13</H2>
<P>	kuṟiyuṟu puṇarcci tōḻi tēettu+
<BR>	kiḻavikku* illi talippeyal āṉa.

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉpatu eṉ ^nutaliṟṟu* ō eṉiṉ, talimakaḷatu ilakkaṇamuṇarttutal nutaliṟṟu.

<P>itaṉ poruḷ: kuṟiyuṟu puṇarcci eṉpatu --kuṟiyuṟaviṉāṟ puṇarum puṇarcci eṉṟavāṟu; tōḻi tēettueṉpatu -- tōḻimāṭṭu eṉṟavāṟu; kiḻavikku illi eṉpatu --talimakaṭku illi eṉṟavāṟu; talippeyal āṉa eṉpatu --talippeytaṟku ilakkaṇam eṉṟavāṟu.

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P94">{{iṟi: Page 94}}</A>
<HR>
tōḻipakkalniṉṟa kuṟiyuṟaviṉāṉ āya kūṭṭam talimakaṭkuilli eṉṟavāṟu. aḵtu^ yāṅṅaṉam ō eṉiṉ, `iṅku vantuoḻukāniṉṟāṉ oru tōṉṟal uḷaṉ, avaṉ eṉṉiṉ āyatu* ōr kuṟi~uṭiyāṉ pōlum, a+ kuṟi iṉṟiyamiyāṉ; a+ kuṟimuṭittu* aruḷāy āyiṉ eṉṉi+ kuṟṟēval iḻatti' eṉa, av=iḻappiṟku* añci+ kuṟinērntu, talimakaḷ talimakaṉiēṟṟukkoṇṭu kūṭum^ kūṭṭam illi, vaḻakkiṉuḷ+ pōlaeṉpatu.

<P>	`av= iyalpu* allatu kūṭṭa+ kūṭal
<BR>	evviṭattāṉum^ kaḷaviṟku* illi'.
<BR>		(([iṟiyaṉār -- 4]))

<P>eṉa amiyātō eṉiṉ, atu colli+ pōntu,

<P>	`uḷḷattu* uṇarcci teḷḷitiṟ karantu
<BR>	kiḻavōḷ tēettu+ kuṟiyuṟūum uḷa ~ē
<BR>	kuṟippu* aṟivuṟūum^ kāliyāṉa'.
<BR>		(([iṟiyaṉār -- 10]))

<P>eṉṟatu colla ~ē, ivvaki tōḻiyāṟ kuṟiyuṟa+ puṇarumpuṇarcci uṇṭu kollō eṉṟu aiyam ām eṉṟu mēlataṉi ~ēvaliyuṟuttaṟku+ cūttiram vēṇṭiṟṟu eṉpatu.

<P>iṉi, oru cārār collumāṟu: `kuṟiyuṟu puṇarcci tōḻitēettu+ kiḻavikku* illi' eṉa amiyātō, talippeyalāṉaeṉṟatu eṟṟiṟkō eṉiṉ, tōḻiyiṟ kūṭṭantāṉ, tali iṭikaṭi eṉa, mūṉṟu vakippaṭum. avaṟṟuḷ talikkaṇ= ēaṟiyanillātu iṭiyāntarattum iṟuti+ kaṇ= um ellām`ivaḷkūṭṭa ~ē kūṭukiṉṟēṉ' eṉpataṉi aṟintu* ē kūṭum.iṅṅaṉam illāviṭattu,

<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	aruḷpuri neñcamōṭu* eḵku tuṇiyāka
<BR>	vantōṉ koṭiyaṉum allaṉ tanta
<BR>	nī tavaṟu* uṭiyi ~um alli niṉvayiṉ
<BR>	āṉā arumpaṭar ceyta
<BR>	yāṉ ē tōḻi tavaṟu* uṭiyēṉ ē'.
<BR>		(([akam-72]))

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉṉum āṟu uṇṭu* ō eṉpatu. maṟṟum ippeṟṟi ~ē vantaṉa~ellām^ koḷka.

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P95">{{iṟi: Page 95}}</A>
<HR>
<H2>14</H2>
<P>	tōḻikku* uriyaṉa kōṭāy tēettu
<BR>	māṟukōḷ illā moḻiyumār uḷa ~ē.

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉpatu eṉ ^nutaliṟṟu* ō eṉiṉ, pōy aṟattoṭuniliuṇarttuvār avvaṟattoṭu niliniṟkum muṟimi ~uṇarttutalnutaliṟṟu.

<P>itaṉ poruḷ: tōḻikku uriyaṉa eṉpatu -- tōḻi collutaṟkuuriya eṉṟavāṟu; kōṭāy tēettu eṉpatu -- cevili+ tāymāṭṭueṉṟavāṟu; māṟukōḷ illā moḻiyumār uḷa ~ē eṉpatumāṟukoḷḷāmi collum^ coṟkaḷ um uṇṭu eṉṟavāṟu.

<P>eṟṟiṉoṭu māṟukoḷḷāmiyō eṉiṉ, tāyaṟiviṉoṭu māṟukoḷḷāmi~um, talimakaḷ perumiyoṭu māṟukoḷḷāmi ~um,talimakaḷ kaṟpiṉoṭu māṟukoḷḷāmi ~um, tōḻi taṉatukāvaloṭu māṟukoḷḷāmi ~um, nāṇiṉoṭu māṟukoḷḷāmi ~um,ulakiṉoṭu māṟukoḷḷāmi ~um eṉa+ koḷka. eṉṉōttukkaṇṇōeṉiṉ,

<P>	`kāppu+ kimikku+ kāmam perukiṉum' (([iṟiyaṉār --29]))

<P>eṉṉum^ cūttirattuḷ+ collappaṭṭa nāṉku iṭattumvēṟupāṭu uṇṭām; aḵtu eppoḻutu uṇṭāyiṟṟu appoḻutu* ētōḻikku+ pulaṉ ām; eṉṉi, tāṉ avaḷ eṉṉum vēṟṟumiyilaḷākalāṉ. avvāṟu* āyiṉaviṭattu+ tōḻi eṉakku+ pulaṉāyiṉavāṟu* ē pōla yāykkum pulaṉ ām; āyiṉañāṉṟu, vāḷāoḻiyāḷ aṟivāriviṉāvum; viṉāviṉaviṭattu, viṉāvappaṭṭārteyvattiṉāṉ āyiṟṟu eṉpa.

<P>eṉṉi, piṟitoṉṟu cuṭṭi ~uṇarum^ taṉmittu* aṉṟu i+kulam ākalāṉ um, atu ~ē collutal+ payattatu tam^karumam ākalāṉ um, aṟiyātu* ē ~um^ collupa. colla, ivaḷteyvattiṟku vaḻipāṭu ceyvikkum; ceyvikka+,talimakaṭku+ kaṟpaḻiyum; eṉṉi, taṉ talimakaṉi~aṉṟi+ piṟitu* ōr teyvam vaṇaṅkār pattiṉiyār ākaliṉ.teyvatti vaṇaṅka+ kaṟpaḻiyum eṉṟu talimakaḷ āṟṟāḷ ām.allatūum, `oḻukka+ kuṟṟa+ kuṟipāṭu nīṅki ōṅkivarāniṉṟa tol kulam, maṇi+ kalam^ katuvāyppaṭṭatu pōla,yāṉ tōṉṟi ivvaki aṇaṅkāṭṭu aṟiyātu aṇaṅkāṭṭueṭuttukkoḷḷappaṭṭatu' eṉa ~um, `yām uṟṟatunirappappāṭṭāṉum vēlaṉ ^taṉatu //
<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P96">{{iṟi: Page 96}}</A>
<HR>
// veṟiyāṭṭu valattiṉāṉum emperumāṉi veṟikkaḷattu+koṇṭuvarum^ kollō' eṉṉum pēraccattiṉāṉum, `em perumāṉiav veṟikkaḷattu+ koṇṭuvaruka* allātu eṉ kaṇ niṉṟavēṟupāṭṭi+ puṟattārkku+ pulaṉ ākāmi maṟippatu kollō'eṉa ~um, aṅṅaṉam maṟikka ataṉi+ kēṭṭu, emperumāṉ,`eṉṉiṉ ākiya vēṟupāṭu piṟitu* oṉṟiṉāṉum nīṅkum pōlum'eṉṟu uṭkoḷḷum eṉa ~um talimakaḷ āṟṟāḷ ām eṉṟu tōḻiāṟṟāḷ ām.

<P>āṟṟāḷ āyiṉāḷatu āṟṟāmi āṟṟuvatu* oṉṟiṉi+ paṟṟum;eṉṉi ~eṉiṉ, āṟṟuvatu piṟitu* iṉmiyiṉ, `yāy aṟivāriviṉāvumiṭattu, eṉṉi viṉāvi, yāṉ aṟiyēṉ eṉṟataṉpuṟattu* ām piṟari viṉāvuvatu; aṅṅaṉam eṉṉiviṉāviṉaviṭattu iṉiyātu colluvēṉ' eṉṟu kūṭṭam ilnāṭṭavakiyāṟ cintittukkoṇṭu iruntāḷ; iruntanilimikkaṇ, tāy piṟṟi ñāṉṟu ciṟukālipaṭimakkalattoṭum pukkāḷ, makaḷi aṭiyiṟkoṇṭu muṭikāṟumnōkki, `aṉṉāy, eṉ makaḷ paṇṭiyaḷ allaḷ āl, iv vēṟupāṭueṟṟiṉāṉ āyiṟṟu, niṉṉāl aṟiyappaṭuvatu* uṇṭō?' eṉṉum,eṉṟaviṭattu ivaḷ aṉṟukoṇṭu eṉṉālum ciṟitu* uṇṭuaṟiyappaṭuvatu aḵtu^ yātu eṉiṉ, `emmi+ kūḻikkaṟṟi+kuḻavi+ pirāyattu māḻi kalanta ēḻi nīrmiyāroṭu nāṭkōlañceytu, "viḷiyāṭi vammiṉ" eṉṟu pōkkiṉāy; pōṉavaḻi,yām pōy oru veṇmaṇal paranta taṇmalar+ poḻiliṭiviḷiyāṭāniṉṟēm āka, oru tōṉṟal oru cuṉi+ kuvaḷi+ pū+koṇṭu avvaḻi ~ē pōntāṉ; pōtara, niṉ makaḷ avaṉi nōkki,"a+ kuvaḷi+ pūvi eṉ pāvikku aṇiya+ tammiṉ" eṉṟāḷ;avaṉ um piṟitu* oṉṟu* um^ cintiyātu koṭuttu nīṅkiṉāṉ;iḵtu aṟiyā+ kālattu nikaḻntatu' eṉṉum; ataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<H3>((aṟattoṭu niṟṟal))</H3>

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 128}}

<P><P>{{S 129}}

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P97">{{iṟi: Page 97}}</A>
<HR>
<P>{{C URAI}}
`iḵtu aṟivatu aṟiyākkālattu nikaḻntataṉi aṟivatu*aṟintu, koṇṭārkku* uriyār koṭuttār eṉpatu* um,uṟṟārkku* uriyār poṟṟoṭi makaḷir eṉpatu* um niṉintu,avaṉi vaḻi paṭātu piṟitoṉṟu āvatu* āyiṉ, i+ kulattukkuvaṭu ~ām^ kollō eṉa+ karutiṉamiyāṉ, niṉmakaḷvēṟupaṭṭatu' eṉṉum. eṉa ~ē, tāy aṟiviṉoṭu māṟukoḷḷātu*āyiṟṟu. eṉṉi, `viḷiyāṭi vammiṉ' eṉṟamiyiṉ.

<P>iṉi+, perumiyoṭu māṟukoḷḷātu* āyiṟṟu, akkālattunaṟceyki ceytataṉi ikkālattu niṉintamiyiṉ.

<P>iṉi+, kaṟpiṉoṭu māṟukoḷḷātu* āyiṟṟu, ivvāṟaṉṟi+piṟitōrāṟu āyiṉa iṭattu+ kuṭikku vaḻu ~ām eṉa+karutiṉamiyiṉ.

<P>iṉi+, taṉatu kāvaloṭu māṟukoḷḷātu* āyiṟṟu, iruvarumirunta nilimikkaṇ nikaḻntatu eṉṟamiyiṉ.

<P>iṉi, nāṇiṉoṭu māṟukoḷḷātu* āyiṟṟu, aṟivatuaṟiyākkālattu nikaḻntatu eṉṟamiyiṉ.

<P>iṉi, ulakiṉoṭu māṟukoḷḷātu* āyiṟṟu, uṟṟārkku uriyārpoṟṟoṭi makaḷir eṉṟamiyiṉ. itu māṟukōḷ illā moḻi ~āynikaḻntavāṟu. itu pū+ taru puṇarcci.

<P>iṉi+, kaḷiṟu taru puṇarccikku+ ceyyuḷ:

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 130}}

<P><P>{{S 131}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
ivvaki ~um avvāṟē urittukkoḷka.

<P>iṉi+, puṉaltaru puṇarcci; ataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 132}}

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P98">{{iṟi: Page 98}}</A>
<HR>
<P>{{S 133}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
ivi ~um avvāṟē urittukkoḷka.

<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`kāmar kaṭum puṉal kalantu* emmōṭu* āṭuvāḷ
<BR>	tāmarikkaṇ putittu* añci+ taḷarntu* ataṉōṭu*oḻukalāṉ
<BR>	nīḷ nāka naṟum pim^ tār tayaṅka+ pāyntaruḷiṉāṟ
<BR>	pūṇ ākam uṟa+ taḻīi+ pōtantāṉ akaṉ akalam
<BR>	varu muli puṇarntaṉa eṉpataṉāṉ eṉ tōḻi
<BR>	aru maḻi taral vēṇṭiṉ tarukiṟkum perumiyaḷ ē'.
<BR>		(([kali, kuṟiñci -- 3]))

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉa, itu ~um puṉal taru puṇarcci.

<P>iṉi, ummiyāṉ māṟukōḷ illā+ kuṟippu* um uḷaeṉakkoḷka. a+ kuṟippu nikaḻumāṟu: ivaḷi viṉāvātu* ēaṟivāri viṉāviṉaviṭattu, aṟivār, `teyvattiṉāṉ āyiṟṟu'eṉpa; eṉṟakkāl, teyvattiṟku vaḻipāṭu ceyvippāṉvēlaṉikkūvi veṟiyāṭṭu* eṭuttukkoṇṭu veṟiyāṭumiṭattu,vēlaṟku+ colluvāḷ āka+ collum; ataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<H3>((veṟi vilakkal))</H3>

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 134}}

<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`muruku* ayarntu vanta mutuvāy vēla
<BR>	ciṉaval ōmpumati viṉavuvatu* uṭiyēṉ
<BR>	palvēṟu* uruviṉ+ cil= aviḻ maṭiyoṭu
<BR>	ciṟu maṟi koṉṟu* ivaḷ naṟunutal nīvi
<BR>	vaṇaṅkiṉi koṭutti āyiṉ aṇaṅkiya
<BR>	viṇ tōy māmali+ cilampaṉ
<BR>	taṇtār akalam um uṇṇum ō pali ~ē'.
<BR>		(([kuṟun. 362]))

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉpaṉavaṟṟāl eṉ collappaṭṭatu* ām? cilampaṉ taṇtārakalam um pali ~uṇṇum ēl, takkatu niṉṉāṟceyappaṭukiṉṟatu eṉṟavāṟu. atu kēṭṭu+ tāy,`eṉcolliyavāṟō' eṉṉum, avaḷ kuṟippaṟitaṟku;eṉṟaviṭattu, mēṟ colliyavāṟu* ē aṟattoṭu niṟpāḷ ām.iṉi+, teyvam ēṟiyatu //
<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P99">{{iṟi: Page 99}}</A>
<HR>
// kaṇṭu arukuniṉṟārkku urippāḷāy urikkum; ataṟku+ceyyuḷ:

<H3>((aṟivilaṉ vēlaṉ eṉṟu* ayalōrkku* urittal))</H3>

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 135}}

<P><P>{{S 136}}

<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`kaṭavuḷ+ kaṟcuṉi aṭi ~iṟantu* aviḻnta
<BR>	paṟiyā+ kuvaḷi malaroṭu kāntaḷ+
<BR>	kuruti oṇ pū uru keḻa+ kaṭṭi+
<BR>	peru vari aṭukkam poṟpa+ cūrmakaḷ
<BR>	aruvi iṉ= iyattu* āṭu nāṭaṉ
<BR>	mārpu tara vanta paṭar mali aru nōy
<BR>	niṉ= aṇaṅku* aṉmi aṟintum aṇṇāntu
<BR>	kār naṟum^ kaṭampiṉ kaṇṇi cūṭi
<BR>	vēlaṉ vēṇṭa veṟi maṉi vantōy
<BR>	kaṭavuḷ āyiṉum āka
<BR>	maṭavi maṉṟa vāḻiya muruku* ē'.
<BR>		(([naṟṟiṇi -- 34]))

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉa, ivvāṟu colla+ kēṭṭa tāy, `eṉ colliyavāṟō' eṉṉum,avaḷ kuṟippaṟitaṟku; eṉṟaviṭattu, mēṟcolliyavāṟu* ēaṟattoṭu niṟpāḷ ām.

<H2>15</H2>
<P>	muṟpaṭa+ puṇarāta col= iṉmiyiṟ
<BR>	kaṟpeṉa+ paṭuvatu kaḷaviṉ vaḻittu* ē.

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉpatu eṉnutaliṟṟō eṉiṉ, kaṟpilakkaṇam āmāṟu uṇarttutalnutaliṟṟu.

<P>itaṉ poruḷ: muṟpaṭa+ puṇarāta col iṉmiyiṉ eṉpatu --moḻimāṟṟu+ cūttiram, ataṉi+, `puṇarāta muṟpaṭa+ coliṉmiyiṉ' eṉṟu moḻimāṟṟikkoḷka. kaṟpu eṉappaṭuvatukaḷaviṉ vaḻittu* ē eṉpatu -- kaṟpu eṉpataṟku+ciṟappuṭiyatu kaḷaviṉvaḻittu eṉṟavāṟu.

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P100">{{iṟi: Page 100}}</A>
<HR>
eṉṉi, puṇarātamuṉ col iṉmiyiṉ, kaṟpu* eṉṟuciṟappikkappaṭṭa oḻukkam kaḷavu* eṉṉum oḻukkattiṉvaḻittu eṉṟavāṟu.

<P>kaḷaviṉkaṇ+ puṇarātamuṉ col illi eṉa ~ē,puṇarātamuṉ col nikaḻum eṉpāri maṟuttār ām. iṉi+puṇarātamuṉ col illi eṉa ~ē, puṇarcciyuḷ= um puṇarcci+piṉ= um col uḷa eṉappaṭṭatu* ām. āyiṉum, puṇarcciyuḷ+pulaṉ alla avarkku+ tuppu* āyiṉ allatu eṉpatu.

<P>iṉi+, puṇarcciyiṉ piṉ coṟkaḷ pulaṉ ām; avi yāvi ~ōeṉiṉ, nayappu* uṇarttiṉa ~um pirivaccam um vaṉpuṟi ~umeṉa+ koḷka. a+ peṟṟi+ paṭṭa kaḷavu* oḻukkiṉ vaḻinikaḻntu, piṉṉi+ tamarāṟpeṟṟu eytutal kaṟpu eṉa+koḷka. eṉa ~ē, ivvāṟṟāṉum ulaka+ kaḷavu* aṉṟu eṉpatupeṟṟām. eṉṉi? ulaka+ kaḷavu puṇarāta muṉ= um^coṉṉikaḻcci ~uṭimiyiṉ. kaṟpu+ kaḷaviṉvaḻittu eṉṉātu,`eṉappaṭuvatu' eṉṟatu eṟṟiṟkō eṉiṉ, kaḷaviṉvaḻinikaḻātu* ē ~um uṇṭu ulakakkaṟpu. aḵtu attuṇi+ciṟappiṟṟu* aṉṟu eṉṟaṟku+ collappaṭṭatu. eṉa ~ē, i+cūttiram perumporuṭṭa+ kaḷaviṉi ~um kaṟpiṉi ~umtaḻīiyiṟṟu eṉpatu.

<H2>16</H2>
<P>	kaḷaviṉuḷ tavircci kāppumikiṉ urittu* ē
<BR>	variviṭi vitta kāli āṉa.

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉpatu eṉ ^nutaliṟṟu* ō eṉiṉ, kaḷavukālattu+ ceṉṟuoḻukāniṉṟa talimakaṟku iṭiyiṭum iṭiyīṭu ivi ~eṉpatuuṇarttutal nutaliṟṟu.

<P>itaṉ poruḷ: kaḷaviṉuḷ tavircci eṉpatu -- kaḷavukālattu+ talimakaḷ puṇarātu iṭiyiṭum iṭiyīṭueṉṟavāṟu; talimakaḷi eytāta nāḷ eṉiṉum okkum; kāppumikiṉ urittu* ē eṉpatu -- kāppu+ kimikkavaḻi ~umurittu eṉṟavāṟu; variviṭi vitta kāli āṉa eṉpatu --variviṭi vitta kālattāṉum urittu eṉṟavāṟu.

<P>kaḷaviṉuḷ tavircci kāppumikka vaḻi ~um urittu,variviṭivitta kālattukkaṇṇum urittu eṉṟavāṟu.

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P101">{{iṟi: Page 101}}</A>
<HR>
kāppu eṉpatu -- tāy tuñcāmi, nāy tuñcāmi, ūrtuñcāmi, kāvalar kaṭukutal, nilavu veḷippaṭutal, kūkikuḻaṟal, kōḻi kuraṟkāṭṭal eṉa ivi.

<P>mikutal eṉpatu perukutal; aḵtu oṉṟu paṉṉāḷum varutalum, pala mayaṅki varutal um, muṟiyāṉ+ ^tōṉṟi varutalum eṉa ittiṟattāṉ ām eṉpatu.

<P>avaṟṟuḷ, tāy tuñcāmi eṉpatu -- iravukkuṟi vantu oḻukāniṉṟa kālattu orunāḷ tāy kaṇpaṭāḷāki, makaḷiaṟivu* um ācāram um kaṟpittal+ poruṭṭāka irukkum;iruntakkāl atu ~um iṭiyīṭu* ām eṉpatu.

<P>nāy tuñcāmi eṉpatu -- vaḻiyaṟi ñamali paṭṭataṟku*ellām eppoḻutum^ kurittakkāl atu ~um ākātu eṉṟavāṟu.eṉṉi kollō iv= iṭattu+ palkāṟ kuriyā niṉṟatu eṉaārāycci varum, ataṉāl iṭiyīṭu* ām eṉpatu.

<P>ūr tuñcāmi eṉpatu -- ūrkoṇṭa peruviḻā nāḷāy+ kaṇpaṭi~illi ~ām āka, atu ~um iṭiyīṭu* ām eṉpatu. avi,maturi āvaṇiyaviṭṭam ē, uṟiyūr+ paṅkuṉiyuttiram ē,karuvūr uḷḷiviḻā ~ē eṉa ivi pōlvaṉa. piṟa ~um ellām a+peṟṟi ~āṉa poḻutu* um iṭiyīṭu* ām eṉpatu.

<P>kāvalar kaṭukutal eṉpatu -- kāvalar eṉpār kāppāḷar,ūrkāttal iṭaṅkāttal eṉa ivaṟṟi+ kaṭitu kāttum eṉṟu,kāvalāḷar ēmañcūḻntu kiviḷakkiṉoṭu tiritaruvār aṉṟu*ē, a+ peṟṟi ~āṉa poḻutu* um iṭiyīṭu* ām eṉpatu.

<P>nilavu veḷippaṭutal eṉpatu -- nilā+ pakal pōlumpeṟṟittu* āy ñāyiṟu paṭṭavāṟu* ē eḻuntu, ñāyiṟueḻuntuṇi ~um viḷakkiṉa ñāṉṟum iṭiyīṭu* ām eṉpatu.

<P>piṟavum aṉṉa; ivaṟṟukku* ellām,

<P>	`kāma mikka kaḻi paṭar kiḷavi'
<BR>		(([iṟiyaṉār -- 30]))

<P>eṉṉum^ cūttirattuḷ+ ceyyuḷ kāṭṭutum.

<P>`variviṭi vitta kāliyāṉa' eṉpatu* ē cūttiramākiṉ, kāppu mikiṉum, variviṭi vitta kāli ~umkaḷaviṉuḷ iṭiyīṭu* ām eṉpatu poruntātu, variviṭi+kāppu mikiṉum iṭiyīṭu* ām eṉpatu* aṉṟi ~eṉiṉ, aḵtu* ēvariviṭi vitta kāliyāṉ um eṉṉum ummi īṟu tirintu,`variviṭi //
<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P102">{{iṟi: Page 102}}</A>
<HR>
// vitta kāliyāṉa' eṉa niṉṟatu. ummi iṭiccol=ākaliṉ īṟu tiriyum;
eṉṉi,

<P>	`tam= īṟu tirital um piṟitavaṇ niliyal um
<BR>	aṉṉavi ~ellām uriya ~eṉpa'.
<BR>		(([iṭiyiyal -- 3]))

<P>eṉpatu ilakkaṇam ākalāṉ eṉpatu.

<H2>17</H2>
<P>	alla kuṟi+ paṭutal um avvayiṉ urittu* ē
<BR>	avaṉ varavu* aṟiyum^ kuṟippiṉ āṉa.

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉpatu eṉ ^nutaliṟṟu* ō eṉiṉ, itu ~um kaḷaviṉuḷiṭiyīṭu āmāṟu uṇarttutal nutaliṟṟu.

<P>itaṉ poruḷ: alla kuṟi+ paṭutal um eṉpatu -- kuṟi~allataṉi+ kuṟi ~āka+ karutal um eṉṟavāṟu; kuṟi ~āmāṟupōkki+ collutum; avvayiṉ urittu* ē eṉpatu -- itu ~umkaḷaviṉuḷ iṭiyīṭu* ātaṟku urittu eṉṟavāṟu; avaṉ varavuaṟiyum^ kuṟippiṉ āṉa eṉpatu -- avaṉ varaviṉiaṟivikkum^ kuṟippu avaṉāṉ aṉṟi+ piṟitu* oṉṟiṉāṉnikaḻntaviṭattu eṉṟavāṟu.

<P>aḵtu* āmāṟu, talimakaṉ iravukkuṟi vantu oḻukāniṉṟakālattu orunāḷ, talimakaṉ cellām ē avaṉāṉ+ceyyappaṭum^ kuṟippukkaḷ tām ē veḷippaṭṭaṉa. avipuṉṉikkāy nīril iṭutal um, puḷ= eḻupputal um eṉa ivi.

<P>avi vēṟu* āy nikaḻumāṟu: puṉṉikkāy mūkku ūḻttu* umviḻum, vaḷi eṟiya ~um viḻum, puḷ tuḷakka ~um viḻum.

<P>puḷ eḻumpum iṭattu veruvi ~um eḻum, vēṟṟu+ puḷ vara~um eḻum.

<P>ivi kaṇṭu ivaṉiṉ āyiṉa eṉa+ karutikkoṇṭu pōntu,avviṭam pukuntu avaṉiṉ ākāmi uṇarntu pōntu, maṉiyakampukunta piṉṉi, avaṉ vantu a+ kuṟi ceyyum; ceytakkāliraṇṭāvatu koṇṭupōkal ākātu* aṉṟu* ē; eṉṉi, `ciṟitumuṉṉāka+ pōṉār aṉṟu* ē, akki puṭipeyarāmi+ pōkiṉṟār'eṉṟu uṟṟār piṉ niṉṟu ārāytalāṉ eṉpatu. akattiṉiṉṟu,`niṉṉiṉ ākātaṉa kaṇṭu vantu //
<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P103">{{iṟi: Page 103}}</A>
<HR>
// niṉṟu pōntōm' eṉpataṉi avaṉukku urikkum, tiṅkaṇmēl iṭṭu* āṉum aṉṉattiṉ mēl iṭṭu* āṉum eṉpatu; ataṟku+ceyyuḷ:

<H3>((allakuṟippāṭṭiṉi aṇṇaṟkuṇarttal))</H3>

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 137}}

<P><P>{{S 138}}

<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`puṉṉi nayappiṉum pūñciṉi tōyiṉum
<BR>	piṉṉirum^ kūntal eṉ tōḻi naṭi ~okkum
<BR>	aṉṉa naṉiyāti vāḻi kaṭalōtam'.

<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`aravaḷi meṉ tōḷ aṉuṅka+ tuṟantu
<BR>	karavalam eṉṟōri+ kaṇṭatu* iliyāl
<BR>	iravelā niṉṟāyāl īrṅkatir+ tiṅkāḷ'.

<P>{{C URAI}}
ivaṟṟuḷ yātāṉum oṉṟaṉmēl vittu+ colla; `iravelāmeṉpālār āy niṉṟu tuyilār āyiṉār pōlum; eṉṉi, tāmtuyilātuniṉṟār aṉṟu* ē tuyilātaṉa aṟivār, ivaṟṟiṉtuyileḻa viṉiyēṉ kuṟi ~eṉṟu vantu peyarntārpōlum' eṉaāṟṟāṉ āy+ peyarum peyarvāṉ iṟantupaṭāṉ āyiṟṟu eṟṟiṟkōeṉiṉ, iṟantupaṭāṉ aṉṟu* ē, `yāṉ iṟantupaṭiṉ ivaḷ umiṟantupaṭum' eṉa+ karuti ~eṉpatu. avvaki peyarvāṉ taṉneñciṉi neruṅkiyataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<H3>((kuṟi ~etirpeṟātu neñcoṭu kūṟal))</H3>

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 139}}

<P><P>{{S 140}}

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P104">{{iṟi: Page 104}}</A>
<HR>
<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`kuṇakaṭal tiriyatu paṟitapu nāri
<BR>	tiṇtēr+ poṟiyaṉ toṇṭi muṉṟuṟi
<BR>	ayiri āririkku aṇavantāaṅku+
<BR>	cēyaḷ ariyōḷ+ paṭarti
<BR>	nōyi neñcu* ē nōyppālōy ē'.
<BR>		(([kuṟun-128]))

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉa+ kaṇṭukoḷka.

<H2>18</H2>
<P>	kuṟi ~eṉa+ paṭuvatu* iraviṉ um pakaliṉ um
<BR>	aṟiya+ kiḷanta iṭam eṉa moḻipa.

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉpatu eṉ ^nutaliṟṟu* ō eṉiṉ, kuṟi ~āmāṟu uṇarttutalnutaliṟṟu.
itaṉ poruḷ: kuṟi ~eṉappaṭuvatu eṉpatu -- kuṟi ~eṉṟucollappaṭuvatu eṉṟavāṟu; iraviṉum pakaliṉum eṉṟārāyiṉum, moḻimāṟṟi+ pakaliṉkaṇ= um iraviṉkaṇ= um eṉa+koḷka, eṉṉi? pakaṟkuṟi nikaḻnta piṉṉi iravukkuṟinikaḻaṟpālatu* ākalāṉ; av= oḻukkam nikaḻnta muṟiminōkki moḻimāṟṟi+ cūttiram urikkappaṭum. aḵtu* ē ~eṉiṉ,kuṟi ~eṉappaṭuvatu pakaliṉ um iraviṉ um eṉa amiyātō?eṉpatu kaṭā; ataṟku viṭi, av= oḻukkam maṟittali+taṉakku aṇikalam āka uṭittu* ākalāṉ iravukkuṟiporuntiyatuṇi+ pakaṟkuṟi poruntiṟṟu* aṉṟu eṉpataṉiuṇarttutaṟporuṭṭu+ cūttirattuḷ. `iraviṉum pakaliṉum'eṉa iravukkuṟi muṉvikkappaṭṭatu; aṟiya+ kiḷanta iṭameṉa moḻipa eṉpatu -- uṇara+ collappaṭṭa iṭam eṉa+collupa āciriyar eṉṟavāṟu.

<P>yārkku yārō collupa eṉiṉ, tōḻi talimakaṟku+colliyatu. aḵtu* āmāṟu, talimakaṉ tōḻiyi irantukuṟiyuṟṟu+ piṉṉiṉṟa iṭattu āṟṟuvaṉa cila coṟ colliāṟṟuvittu+ kuṟinayappittu, avvāṟu niṉṟa tōḻiyi+piṉṉum^ talimakaṉ etirppaṭum; etirppaṭṭāṉi, `iṉṉaiṭattu vara' eṉṟu kuṟippiṉāṉ uṇarttum. ataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P105">{{iṟi: Page 105}}</A>
<HR>
<H3>((kuṟiyiṭam talivaṉ koḷḷakkūṟal))</H3>

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 141}}

<P><P>{{S 142}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
atu kēṭṭu, `iv= iṭattukkaṇ vara' eṉṟāḷ eṉpataṉiuṇarntu, avviṭattu+ cellum. cella+, talimakaṉ varavuuṇarntu, tōḻi talimakaḷi+ kuṟiyiṭattu+ koṇṭuceṉṟu,`yāṉ ceṅkāntaḷ+ pū+ koṇṭu varuvēṉ, avviṭattu+ teyvamuṭittu, niṉṉāl varappaṭātu, nī avvaḷavum i+ poḻilakattu* ē nil' eṉṟu niṟīi nīṅkum. ataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<H3>((kuṟiyiṭattuyttu maṟipavaḷ urittal))</H3>

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 143}}

<P><P>{{S 144}}

<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`ceṅkaḷam paṭa+ koṉṟu* avuṇar+ tēytta
<BR>	ceṅkōl ampiṉ ceṅkōṭṭu^ yāṉi+
<BR>	kaḻal toṭi+ cēey kuṉṟam
<BR>	kuruti+ pūviṉ kuli+ kāntaṭṭu* ē'.
<BR>		(([kuṟun. 1]))

<P>{{C URAI}}
ivvāṟu colli nīṅkum. nīṅka+, talimakaḷ appoḻiliṭattuniṟkum; niṉṟāḷi+ talimakaṉ etirppaṭṭu+ puṇarum.puṇarcciyiṟutikkaṇ tōḻivantu, `niṉ kipōla+ kāntaḷmalarntaṉa koṇṭuvantēṉ, emperumāṭṭi, nīṭṭittāḷ eṉṟucīṟiyaruḷātu pōntaruḷ' eṉṟu, avaḷi+ koṇṭu pōyāyaveḷḷattoṭum^ kūṭṭum. itu pakaṟkuṟi ~āmāṟu.

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P106">{{iṟi: Page 106}}</A>
<HR>
ivvaki pakaṟkuṟi vantu oḻukāniṉṟa talimakaṉi+kāṇumpoḻutiṟ kāṇāppoḻutu peritu* ākalāṉ āṟṟāḷ āy, neñcumikkatu vāycōrntu, kaṭaliṟkāṉum^, kāṉaliṟ kāṉum,puḷḷiṟkāṉum, neñciṟkāṉum, vaṟitu* ē kuḻavi aḻutāṟpōla,oru col+ collum; avvaki collumataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<H3>((neñcoṭu varuntal))</H3>

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 145}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
talimakaḷ avvāṟu colliṉaviṭattu+ talimakaṉ kēṭpiṉvarintu pukuvāṉ ām; tōḻi kēṭpiṉ talimakaṉi varivukaṭāvuvāḷ ām. yār um^ kēṭpār illi ~āyiṉ, talimakaḷcolli āṟṟuvāḷ ām. mūṭiyirunta vēvatu* ōr koḷkalammūṭiyatu tiṟantaviṭattu, āvi eḻuntu muṉ niṉṟaveppamnīṅkiṉāṟpōla, a+ col+ colla āṟṟāmi paṇṭiyiṟciṟitaḷavu paṭutalām.

<P>iṉi+, pakaṟkuṟi vantu oḻukāniṉṟa talimakaṉi+ kāṇumpoḻutiṟ kāṇāppoḻutu peritu* ākalāṉ talimakaḷ āṟṟāḷāyiṉaviṭattu+, tōḻi avaḷ āṟṟāmikku+ parintu,uṭaṉāyirunta puḷḷunōkki ivikaṇṭum āṟṟiccelvāṭku, ivi~um nīṅkiṉa. iṉi eṅṅaṉam āṟṟuṅkollō eṉa+ talimakaṟku+ciṟippuṟaṉāka+ collum; ataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<H3>((āṟṟumvāyil akaṉṟamiyuṇarttal))</H3>

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 146}}

<P><P>{{S 147}}

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P107">{{iṟi: Page 107}}</A>
<HR>
<P>{{S 148}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
ivvaki collakkēṭṭa talimakaṉ, `yāṉ vantoḻukā niṉṟaiv= oḻukalāṟutāṉ ivaṭku āṟṟāmikku+ kāraṇam āyiṟṟu+pōlum' eṉa, avvāṟu vantoḻukātu varintu pukuvāṉ ām.ivvaki ~ellām pakaṟkuṟiyuḷ= ē aṭaṅkum eṉa+ koḷka.

<P>iṉi, iravukkuṟi ~ām āṟu:

<P>pakaṟkuṟi vantu oḻukāniṉṟa talimakaṉ iṉṟuteruḷumnāḷitteruḷum eṉa+ teruḷāṉāy neṭuṅkālam um vantu oḻuka,iv= oḻukkam puṟattārkku+ pulaṉāyataṟinta viṭattu ivaḷiṟantupaṭum, ivaḷ iṟantupaṭa ivaṉum iṟantupaṭum eṉaāṟṟāḷ āy, varivu kaṭātaṟku+ ceṟippu* aṟivuṟukkiṉṟumuṉṉuṭittāka aṟivuṟūum. eṉṉi, katumeṉa+ tamariṟceṟittaviṭattu emar emmi iṟceṟintār eṉṟa ñāṉṟu āṟṟāṉāka ~um peṟum; ataṉāṉ, muṟpaṭa ~ē ceṟippaṟivuṟūum;eṉṉi, āṟṟāṉ ām eṉiṟ colluvatu teḷiya+ coṉṉēṉ eṉa+teruṭṭutaṟporuṭṭu eṉpatu.

<P>iṉi+, tōḻi varivukaṭāvukiṉṟuḻi, kuṟippiṉāṉ varivukaṭāvutal um, veḷippaṭiyāṉ varivukaṭāvutal um eṉa irutiṟattaṉa.

<P>avaṟṟuḷ, kuṟippiṉāṉ varivukaṭāvumāṟu: `yāy emmiuṟuppiṟ kuṟikkoṇṭu nōkkiṉāḷ' eṉṉum; eṉa ~ē, talimakaṉ,`ivar iṟpuṟattu+ pōy viḷiyāṭum patattar allar, ivariiṟceṟikka vēṇṭum eṉṟu pōlum avvāṟu nōkkiyatu' eṉa+teruṇṭu varinteytappeṟum.

<P>yāy uṟuppiṟ kuṟikkoṇṭu nōkkiṉāḷ eṉṉumataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<H3>((tāyaṟivurittal))</H3>

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 149}}

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P108">{{iṟi: Page 108}}</A>
<HR>
<P>{{S 150}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
allatu, ivvāṟṟāṉ um^ ceṟippu* aṟivuṟūum; ataṟku+ceyyuḷ:

<H3>((puṉattoṭuvittu+ kuṟippuri kiḷattal))</H3>

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 151}}

<P><P>{{S 152}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
iṉi, iv= iṭattu varappeṟāy eṉpatupaṭa+ talimakaṟku+tōḻi muṉṉiṉṟu collavum peṟum.

<P>iṉi, muṉṉilippuṟamoḻiyāka+, talimakaṉvaravuṇarntu, vēṅkikku urippāḷāy+ talimakaṉ kēṭpaivvāṟu colliyum^ ceṟippu* aṟivuṟuttum; ataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<H3>((paṇimoḻippāṅki kaṇiyoṭukūṟal))</H3>

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 153}}

<P><P>{{S 154}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
ivvaki ~um^ collum; ataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 155}}

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P109">{{iṟi: Page 109}}</A>
<HR>
<P>{{C URAI}}
iṅṅaṉam um^ collum; ataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 156}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
ivvāṟu* um^ collum; ataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 157}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
iṅṅaṉam um^ collum; ataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 158}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
ivvaki ceṟippaṟivuṟukkappaṭṭa talimakaṉ teruḷvāṉāyiṉ, `iṉṉa nāḷ varival, attuṇi ~um ivaḷiāṟṟikkoṇṭiru, niṉakku aṭikkalam' eṉa+ kippaṟṟum;kippaṟṟa, ataṉi+ tōḻi cūḷuṟavāka+ karutiṉāḷ.ulakattu+ cūḷuṟuvār, pārppāri ~um pacuvi ~um peṇṭiri~um toṭṭu+ cūḷuṟupa ~ākalāṉ, cūḷuṟṟāṉ eṉpataṉiniṉintu, `nīr varival eṉṟatu* ē amiyātu* ō? cūḷuṟavēṇṭum ō? poyttatum vāyttatum uṭiyār aṉṟu* ēcūḷuṟuvār? mey= allatu collātārkku+ cūḷuṟavu vēṇṭumō?niṉkaṇ= um poy= uṇṭākiṉ, mey= eṉpatu iv= ulakattunilipeṟṟavaḻi illi ~ākātu* ē' eṉṉum; ataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<H3>((cūḷuṟūum^ tōṉṟaṟku+ tōḻi kūṟal))</H3>

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 159}}

<P><P>{{S 160}}

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P110">{{iṟi: Page 110}}</A>
<HR>
<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`veḷḷi viḻu+ toṭi meṉ karuppu* ulakki
<BR>	vaḷḷi nuṇ= iṭi vayiṉvayiṉ nuṭaṅka
<BR>	mīṉ ciṉi aṉṉa veṇmaṇaṟ kuvii+
<BR>	kāñci nīḻal tamar vaḷam pāṭi
<BR>	ūr+ kuṟumakaḷir kuṟuvaḻi ~iṟanta
<BR>	āral aruntiya ciṟuciral marutiṉ
<BR>	tāḻ ciṉi uṟaṅkum taṇ tuṟi ūra
<BR>	viḻiyā uḷḷam viḻivatu* āyiṉum
<BR>	kēṭṭavi tōṭṭi ~āka mīṭṭu* āṅku*
<BR>	aṟaṉ um poruḷ um vaḻāami nāṭi+
<BR>	taṟ ^takavu* ~uṭimi nōkki maṟṟataṉ
<BR>	piṉ= ākum= ē muṉṉiyatu muṭittal
<BR>	aṉiya periyōr+ tērum^ kāli
<BR>	nummōr aṉṉōr māṭṭum iṉṉa
<BR>	poyyoṭu miṭintavi tōṉṟiṉ
<BR>	mey yāṇṭu* uḷatu* ō ~iv= ulakattāṉ ē'.
<BR>		(([akam-286]))

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉa, `yāṉ taṉakku avaḷi aṭikkalam eṉṟu kippaṟṟa,ataṉi+ cūḷuṟavāka+ karuti+ tiriya ~uṇarntāḷ ākalāṉnīṭṭikkal ākātu' eṉa+ piṟṟiñāṉṟu varivoṭu pukuvāṉ ām.

<P>iṉi+, teruḷāṉ āyiṉ, `iravukkuṟi vārā varival'eṉṉum. atu kēṭṭa tōḻi iravukkuṟiyatu ētaṅkāṭṭimaṟukkum. yāṅṅaṉam maṟukkumō eṉiṉ, `aravum urum um puli~um eṇkum veṇkōṭṭiyāṉi ~um eṉṟu ivaṟṟatu ētamuṭittu;ēṟṟiḻivuṭittāya aruvariyiṭattu oru vēl tuṇiyāka nīrāriruḷ naṭunāḷvaravu āṟṟunīrmiyaḷō?' eṉṉum.eṉpatukēṭṭa talimakaṉ āṟṟuvāṉ āyiṉ, varintu eytum;āṟṟāṉ āyiṉ iṟantupaṭum eṉa+ karuti, iṟantupāṭṭuaccattiṉāl iravukkuṟi nērum; nērntāḷ talimakaṟku,`niṉṉāṭṭār eṉṉa pūviṉar? eṉṉa cāntiṉar? eṉṉamarattiṉkīḻ viḷiyāṭupa?' eṉṉum. atu kēṭṭu+ talimakaṉ,`muṉ= ellām eṉakku maṟuttāḷ aṉṟu* ē, maṟuttāḷ itucolliṟṟu oru kāraṇam nōkki' eṉa uṇarntu, tāṉum,`niṉṉāṭṭār eṉṉa pūviṉar? eṉṉa cāntiṉar? eṉṉamarattiṉkīḻ viḷiyāṭupa?' eṉṉum. eṉṟakkāl tōḻi,`kāntaḷum vēṅki ~um cūṭutum, cantaṉa+ cāntu //
<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P111">{{iṟi: Page 111}}</A>
<HR>
// pūcutum, vēṅkimarattiṉkīḻ viḷiyāṭutum' eṉṉum;ataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<H3>((kuṟiyiṭam^ kūṟal))</H3>

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 161}}

<P><P>{{S 162}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
kuṟiñcinilamākiyāṉ ivvaki collum. allāta nilattiṟkumavaṟṟiṟku+ takkavāṟu* ē collum. ivvaki colla, `okkum,"ivi ceytuvantu niṉmiṉ" eṉṟatu pōlum' eṉa uṇarntu,piṟṟi ñāṉṟu a+ pū+ koṇṭu cūṭi, a+ cāntu pūci, ammarattiṉkīḻ viḷiyāṭaṟ kuṟiceytu niṟkum; niṉṟaviṭattuavaṉatu varavu uṇarntu tōḻi collum; ataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<H3>((varavuṇarntu varital))</H3>

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 163}}

<P><P>{{S 164}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
ivvāṟu talimakaṉatu varavuṇarntu, tōḻi, `kuvaḷialarntaṉavēṟ kāṇpām, pantar mulli arumpiṉavēṟ kāṇpām'eṉa+ colli+, talimakaḷi+ koṇṭupōtarum; ataṟku+ceyyuḷ:

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P112">{{iṟi: Page 112}}</A>
<HR>
<H3>((kuṟiyiṭattu+ koṇṭucēṟal))</H3>

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 165}}

<P><P>{{S 166}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉṟu talimakaḷi+ koṇṭupōntu a+ kuṟiyiṭam pukuntu,pakaṟkuṟiyiṉkaṇ nīṅkiṉavāṟu* ē nīṅka+, taṉiyaḷāyniṉṟatalimakaḷi etirppaṭṭu+ puṇarum; puṇarcciyiṟutikkaṇtōḻi talimakaḷi+ koṇṭupōtarum. iḵtu iravukkuṟi~āmāṟu.

<P>kuṟi iraviṉ um pakaliṉ um eṉṉātu, `eṉappaṭuvatu' eṉṟatueṟṟiṟkō eṉiṉ, kuṟi ~eṉṟaṟku+ ciṟappu* uṭiyatueṉṟavāṟu.

<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`vaṇṭu* um tumpi ~um varikkaṭi+ piracam um
<BR>	koṇṭu puṇar narampu* eṉṟu muraṉṟu'.

<P>{{C URAI}}
aintu vāyilāṉ um^ koḷḷappaṭum^ tuppuraviṉi+taṉṉakattu* uṭittu* āy+, palvakippaṭṭa maraṅkaḷāṉumpolivu* uṭittāy+, puṟattār akattāri+ kāṇpatu* aritu*āy, akattār puṟattāri+ kāṇpatu* eḷitu* āy, viḻivuviṭutta viḻumiyōri ~um viḻivu tōṟṟuvikkum paṇpiṟṟueṉpataṟku+ collappaṭṭatu eṉpatu. aḵtu* ē ~eṉiṉ,aṟiyakkiḷakkappaṭṭa iṭam eṉṉātu, `kiḷanta iṭam' eṉṟatueṟṟiṟkō eṉiṉ, viṉiccoṟkaḷ nāṉku vikaṟpam uṭiyaeṉṟaṟku; yāvi av vikaṟpam eṉiṉ, karuttaṉ ētukkaruttaṉkaruvikkaruttaṉ karumakkaruttaṉ eṉa ivi; avaṟṟuḷ,

<P>karuttaṉ eṉpatu -- taccaṉ eṭutta māṭam, kollaṉ ceytavāḷ;

<P>ētu+ karuttaṉ eṉpatu -- ēviṉāṉi+ karuttāvāka+ceyvatu; aracar toṭṭa kuḷam, aracar eṭutta tēvakulam,ittoṭakkattaṉa;

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P113">{{iṟi: Page 113}}</A>
<HR>
iṉi+, karuvi+ karuttaṉ eṉpatu -- vāḷ eṟiyum, curikikuṟṟum, immiṭā nāṟkuṟuṇi arici+ cōṟu aṭum eṉaittoṭakkattaṉa;

<P>iṉi+, karuma+-karuttaṉ eṉpatu -- tiṇṇi meḻukiṟṟu,kalam^ kaḻuviṟṟu, maram^ kuṟittatu eṉṟu colluvatu.

<P>`aṟiya+ kiḷanta iṭam' eṉṉum a+ col karumakkaruttaṉāy ilakkaṇam uṇṭu* ō eṉiṉ, uṇṭu;

<P>	`ceyappaṭu poruḷi+ ceytatu pōla+
<BR>	toḻiṟpaṭa+ kiḷattal um vaḻakku* iyal marapu* ē'.
<BR>		(([viṉiyiyal-49]))

<P>eṉpatu.

<P>aḵtu* ē ~eṉiṉ, kuṟi ~eṉappaṭuva eṉṟu* ākātu* ēcūttiram^ ceyaṟpālatu; eṉṉi, iravukkuṟi pakaṟkuṟi eṉṟuiraṇṭu collukiṉṟamiyiṉ. aḵtu* aṉṟu iṭam eṉṉum oruminōkki+ `kuṟi ~eṉappaṭuvatu' eṉṟār eṉpatu.

<H2>19</H2>
<P>	iravu+ kuṟi ~ē ilvari ikavātu.

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉpatu eṉ ^nutaliṟṟu* ō eṉiṉ, mēṟcūttirattuḷ+ kuṟiiraṇṭeṉṟār, avaṟṟuḷ iravukkuṟi nikaḻumiṭam uṇarttutalnutaliṟṟu.
itaṉ poruḷ: iravu+ kuṟi eṉpatu -- iraviṉkaṇ+ kuṟiyiṭameṉṟavāṟu; ilvari ikavātu eṉpatu -- illiṭattiviṭṭunīṅkātu eṉṟavāṟu.

<P>eṉa ~ē, puṟattu* aṉṟu eṉṟavāṟu* ām.

<P>	`iravu+ kuṟi ~ē ilvari ikavātu*
<BR>	uṇara uṇartatta uriyiṉāṉa'.

<P>eṉṟār piṟarum eṉakkoḷka.

<P>iraviṉkaṭkuṟi ilvari ikavātu eṉa+, pakaṟkuṟiivvari ikakkum eṉpatu colliṉār; eṉṉi, irāppuḷ uṇṇāeṉṟārkku, pakaṟpuḷ uṇṇum eṉpatu muṭintatu. iṉi,irākkuṟi ~eṉṟu ākaṟpālatu iravukkuṟi ~eṉṟu* āyiṟṟu+ceyyuḷ ākalāṉ.

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P114">{{iṟi: Page 114}}</A>
<HR>
eṉṉi,

<P>	`kuṟiyataṉ iṟuti+ ciṉikeṭa ukaram
<BR>	aṟiya varutal ceyyuḷuḷ urittu* ē'.
<BR>		(([uyirmayaṅkiyal-32]))

<P>eṉṟār ākaliṉ.

<H2>20</H2>
<P>	pakaṟkuṟi tāṉ ē ikappiṉum variyār

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉpatu eṉ ^nutaliṟṟu* ō eṉiṉ, pakaṟkuṟiyiṭam uṇarttutalnutaliṟṟu.

<P>itaṉ poruḷ: pakaṟkuṟi tāṉ ē eṉpatu -- pakaṟkuṟiyiṭam^tāṉ eṉṟavāṟu; ikappiṉum variyār eṉpatu --ikantupaṭiṉum kuṟṟam^ kūṟār eṉṟavāṟu.

<P>ikattal eṉpatu oṉṟiṉ iṟattal eṉṟavāṟu. ikattal eṉiṉumiṟattal eṉiṉum okkum; oṉṟiṉ iṟattal eṉpatu palavātaleṉṟavāṟu.

<P>oru ñāṉṟu vēṅki+ potumpiṉuḷ ām; oru ñāṉṟu kōṅkampotumpiṉuḷ ām, kuṟiñcinilam āyiṉ.

<P>oru ñāṉṟu puṉṉiyam^ kāṉaluḷ ām; oru ñāṉṟukitiyam^ kāṉaluḷ ām, neytaṉilam āyiṉ.

<P>ivvaki ēṉinilattiṟkum okkumāṟu aṟintu urikka.

<P>	`pakal+ kuṟippu* uṇarvukaḷ pala ~ākum= ē'. eṉṟārākaliṉ.

<P>`ikappiṉum variyār' eṉṟa ummiyāl, pakaṟkuṟi ~umoṉṟu* ākal ē valiyuṭittu; eṉṉi ~eṉiṉ, taṅkuṟimuṭittaṟporuṭṭu oru poḻil akattu* ē koṇṭuceṉṟuviḷiyāṭum āyaṅkaḷ um taṉvaḻiya ākalāṉ eṉpatu.

<P>iṉi, yār aṟivār, paṇṭu pōlātu ipparuvam orukāṉalakattu* ē koṇṭupukukiṉṟāḷ eṉṟu karutuvārkku,aṟintu pala poḻiliṉuḷ= um pukutaliṟ pala poḻil āka ~umpeṟum.

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P115">{{iṟi: Page 115}}</A>
<HR>
<H2>21</H2>
<P>	iravu maṉi ikanta kuṟiyiṭattu* allatu
<BR>	kiḻavōṟ cērtal kiḻattikku* illi.

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉpatu eṉ ^nutaliṟṟu* ō eṉiṉ, iravu+ kuṟi vakukkappaṭṭaiṭam vēṟupāṭu* uṭiyatu kaṇṭu, av vēṟupāṭu uṇarttutalnutaliṟṟu.

<P>mēl, `iravu+ kuṟi ilvari ikavātu' eṉa, ilvari~akattatu* aṉṟu* eṉiṟ cārāṉ. avaṟṟuḷ= um iravu+ kuṟi~ātal ceṉṟatu; ceṉṟataṉi nīkkiyavāṟu.

<P>itaṉ poruḷ: iravu maṉi ikanta eṉpatu -- iraviṉ kaṇmaṉiyakattu nīṅkiya eṉṟavāṟu; kuṟiyiṭattu allatueṉpatu -- kuṟikkappaṭṭa iṭattu* allatu eṉṟavāṟu;kiḻavōṟ cērtal kiḻattikku illi eṉpatu -- talimakaṉ+cērtal talimakaṭku illi eṉṟavāṟu.

<P>eṉa ~ē, ilvarippakattu* ē āka eṉpatūum, maṉiyakattuākaṟka eṉpatūum uṇarappaṭṭatu. aṭṭil, koṭṭakāram,paṇṭaṭacāli, kūṭakāram, paḷḷiyampalam, urimiyiṭam,kūttappaḷḷi eṉa ivaṟṟuḷ nīṅki+, ceykuṉṟu* um,iḷamarakkā ~um, pūmpantar um, viḷiyāṭiṭam um, avaṟṟi+cārntaṉavaṟṟuḷ= um piṟavaṟṟuḷ= um āka eṉṟavāṟu. eṉa ~ē,pakaṟkuṟiyiṭam pōla vēṟupaṭṭatu ākaṟka iraviṟkuṟiyiṭameṉṟavāṟu. aḵtu* ē ~eṉiṉ, maṉiyakattu āka aḻivatu*uṇṭu* ō eṉiṉ, kuravarkaḷ uṟiyum iṭam ātaliṉteyvattāṉam eṉṟu karutappaṭum. allatūum, puka ~um pōka~um arumi ~uṭimiyāṉum ākātu eṉpatu; eṉṟārkku+ceyyuḷ:

<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`vāla maṉiyakattu+ cārntāṉ talimakaṉ'.

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉpatupaṭa vantaṉa eṉiṉ, avi akam alla, akappuṟattu* ēaṭaṅkum eṉpatu.

<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`iravu+ kuṟi ~oṉṟu* eytum atu ~ē
<BR>	maṉiyōr kiḷavi kēṭkum iṭattu+
<BR>	celavu varavu* illā+ toḻiliṟṟu* āki
<BR>	maṉi ~iṟantu* elliyiṉ māṇpu* uṭittu* ākum
<BR>	akappuṟam āyiṉ maṟutali+ paṭum ē'.

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉṟār piṟar um eṉa+ koḷka.

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P116">{{iṟi: Page 116}}</A>
<HR>
<H2>22</H2>
<P>	ampal um alarum^ kaḷavu.

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉpatu eṉ ^nutaliṟṟu* ō eṉiṉ, kaḷavoḻukkiṉatuneṭuṅkāla+ celaviṉkaṇ ivarkku nikaḻum uḷḷanikaḻcci iṉṉatu eṉṟuuṇarttutal nutaliṟṟu.

<P>itaṉ poruḷ: ampal um alarum kaḷavu eṉpatu -- avviraṇṭumnikaḻntaṉa eṉpatu tām aṟiyiṉ allatu yāvar um aṟivārilli; iṉmiyiṉ, avi kaḷavu eṉṟavāṟu; kaḷavu eṉpatu,ceytār ē aṟintu maṟṟoruvar aṟiyātatu* ākalāṉ eṉpatu.

<P>	ampal eṉpatu mukiḻmukiḻttal
<BR>	alar eṉpatu kol nikaḻtal;
<BR>	ampal eṉpatu col nikaḻtal,
<BR>	alar eṉpatu il aṟital;
<BR>	ampal eṉpatu il aṟital,
<BR>	alar eṉpatu ayal aṟital;
<BR>	ampal eṉpatu ayal aṟital,
<BR>	alar eṉpatu cēri aṟital;
<BR>	ampal eṉpatu cēri aṟital,
<BR>	alar eṉpatu ūr aṟital;
<BR>	ampal eṉpatu ūr aṟital,
<BR>	alar eṉpatu nāṭu aṟital;
<BR>	ampal eṉpatu nāṭu aṟital,
<BR>	alar eṉpatu tēcam aṟital.

<P>atu poruntātu; eṉṉi, ampal eṉappaṭṭatu* ē alar um,alar eṉappaṭṭatu* ē ampal um āyiṉa. iḵtu ampaṟkuilakkaṇam, iḵtu alarukku ilakkaṇam eṉṟu vicēṭam^kāṭṭiṟṟilar; ivi iraṇṭāl tammuḷ vēṟṟumi peṟappaṭumākalāṉ eṉpatu.

<P>maṟṟu eṉṉō eṉiṉ, ampal eṉpatu col nikaḻātu* ēmukiḻmukiḻttu+ colluvatu* āyiṟṟu; iṉṉatiṉ kaṇṇatueṉpatu aṟiyal ākātu eṉpatu.

<P>alar eṉpatu iṉṉāṉōṭu iṉṉāḷiṭi itu pōlum paṭṭateṉaviḷaṅka+ colli niṟpatu.

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P117">{{iṟi: Page 117}}</A>
<HR>
ampal eṉpatu, perumpōtu* āy+ ciṟitu niṟka alar um eṉaniṟpatu.

<P>alar eṉpatu, a+ perumpōtu tātu* um alli ~um veḷippaṭamalarntāṟpōla niṟkum nilimi ~eṉa vēṟṟumicollappaṭṭatu* ām.

<P>tām neṭuṅkālam iv= oḻukkatti oḻukiṉār ātalāṉ, vēṟuniṉṟu tam^ karumam ucāvuvāri uṇarntu, i+ taṉmittuivar ārāyvatu itu pōlum eṉṟu karutupa. tam maṉattuorukōṭṭam uṭiyār appeṟṟi ~ē karutuvatu ulakattu+taṉmi; iv= oḻukkam piṟarkku+ pulaṉ ākātu* aṉṟu* ē,teyvattiṉāṉ āyatu* ākalāṉ.

<P>ampal um alar um evviṭattu nikaḻum ō eṉiṉ, kāppu+kimikkaviṭattu nikaḻum eṉpatu. kaḷaviṉatuneṭuṅkālattukkaṇ iv= oḻukkam veḷippaṭum^ kollō eṉṉumayirppiṉāṉ nikaḻum eṉpatu. `aṅṅaṉam ayirtta ayirppiṉāṟkaḷavu* oḻukkam oḻintuniṉṟa nilimi kaṟpu eṉṟukoḷḷuvēṉ āyiṉ, varintu pukuntatu* iṉmiyiṉ+ kaṟpu eṉalum ākātu; kaḷaviṉ akattu* eṉṟu koḷḷuvēṉ āyiṉ, oḻukkamnikaḻkiṉṟu* iṉmiyiṉ+ kaḷavu eṉal um ākātu; eṉṉi kollōitaṉi orupāṟ cārttumāṟu?' eṉṟu aiyappaṭṭu niṉṟamāṇākkaṟku, ampal um alar um eṉṟu niṉṟa nilimiyi+kaḷaviṉpāl ē koḷka eṉpatu. itu poruntātu.

<P>eṉṉi,

<P>	`tanti tāy ē taṉṉiyar eṉṟāṅku
<BR>	aṉṉavar aṟiya+ paṇpu* ākum= ē'.
<BR>		(([iṟiyaṉār-26]))

<P>eṉṟamiyiṉ. ivar aṟiyāta muṉ= ellām^ kaḷavu* eṉpatupōtum eṉpatu.

<H2>23</H2>
<P>	veḷippaṭṭa piṉṟi ~um uriya kiḷavi.

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉ ^nutaliṟṟu* ō eṉiṉ, ampal um alarum āyiṟṟu* eṉṟuuḷḷattu veḷippaṭṭa piṉṟi nikaḻaṟpālatu uṇarttutalnutaliṟṟu.

<P>itaṉ poruḷ: `veḷippaṭṭa piṉṟi ~um uriya kiḷavi'eṉṟār eṉiṉum, veḷippaṭṭapiṉṟi+ kiḷavi ~um uriya eṉamoḻimāṟṟi+ koḷka. kiḷavi eṉpatu, makaṭkūṟutal; //
<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P118">{{iṟi: Page 118}}</A>
<HR>
// atu ~um urittu eṉa, maṟṟum oṉṟu* uṇṭu kūṟaṟpālatu;aḵtu^ yātō eṉiṉ, avaṉ uṭaṉpōkkum urittu eṉṟavāṟu.

<P>aḵtu uriya ~āmāṟu collutum; itu palarāl umaṟiyappaṭṭatu eṉṉum^ karuttāl nikaḻkiṉṟa, talimakaṭku*um tōḻikku* um uṭaṉē nikaḻum. iruvar um yām ē uṇarntēmeṉa+ karututalāṟ katumeṉa i+ nilimikkaṇ variṉumvārāmi+ koḷvēṉ eṉṉum^ karuttiṉāl, paṇṭu avaṉ vantupayiṉṟa iṭattu* ē tōḻi cellum; cella+, tōḻi, taṉetirppaṭṭa talimakaṉi valaṅkoṇṭu cārntu, `niṉṉāltaliyaḷikkappaṭṭa taliyaḷi alar āyiṟṟu, palarāl umaṟiyappaṭṭu' eṉṉum; ataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<H3>((alar aṟivuṟuttal))</H3>

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 165}}

<P><P>{{S 166}}

<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`aṟintōr aṟaṉ ilar eṉṟalar ciṟanta
<BR>	iṉ= uyir kaḻiyiṉum naṉi ~iṉṉām ē
<BR>	puṉṉiyam^ kāṉal+ puṇar kuṟi vāytta
<BR>	piṉṉīr ōtiyeṉ tōḻikku* aṉṉō
<BR>	paṭu maṇi yāṉi+ pacum pūṇ cōḻar
<BR>	koṭi nuṭaṅku maṟukiṉ ārkkāṭṭu* āṅkaṭ
<BR>	kaḷ= uṭi+ taṭaviṟ puḷ= olittu* ōvā+
<BR>	tēr vaḻaṅku teruviṉ aṉṉa
<BR>	kuvi ākiṉṟatu* aiya niṉ aruḷ ē'.
<BR>		(([naṟṟiṇi-227]))

<P>{{C URAI}}
itu colli+, piṉṉum, `nī itu pukutaruntuṇi ~um ivvāṟuoḻukuvāy āyiṉāy, aṟaṉ aṟiyāmiyāṉ; aṟiti ~eṉṉiṉ itupukutāmi varinteytuvāy maṉṉō, allatūum, piṟarumvarinteytutaṟku muliviliyoṭu pukuntu poṉ= aṇivāṉniṉṟār um uḷar' eṉa+ paṭittu moḻintu collum; ataṟku+ceyyuḷ:

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P119">{{iṟi: Page 119}}</A>
<HR>
<H3>((makaṭpēccurittal))</H3>

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 167}}
 
<P>{{S 168}}

<P><P>{{S 169}}

<P><P>{{S 170}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
iṅṅaṉam um^ collum:

<H3>((poṉṉaṇivurittal))</H3>

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 171}}

<P><P>{{S 172}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
iṅṅaṉam^ collappaṭṭa talimakaṉ, `eṉṉāṟ ceyyappaṭṭatueṉṉō'? eṉṉum. eṉa+, tōḻi, `eṉṉi viṉavaṟpāliyalli, nīitaṟku+ takkavāṟu aṟintu ceyaṟpāli' eṉṉum eṉpatu.

<P>	`nuṇ= aṟivu* uṭiyōr nūloṭu paḻakiṉum
<BR>	peṇ= aṟivu* eṉpatu perum pētimittu* ē'.

<P>eṉpatu* ākalāṉ, `nī oru poruḷi vikaṟpittuaṟiyuntuṇi, yāṉ aṟiyumāṟu* illi piṟa; allatūum, yāmkuṟṟēval% //
<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P120">{{iṟi: Page 120}}</A>
<HR>
// makaḷir, nīr ēyiṉavāṟu oḻukuvatu* allatu, "itu koṇṭuitu ceymiṉ" eṉṟaṟku+ takkēm allēm' eṉṉum; ataṟku+ceyyuḷ:

<H3>((muli vili kūṟal))</H3>

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 173}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
itu kēṭṭa talimakaṉ, `uṭaṉkoṇṭu pōvatu tuṇintēṉeṉiṉum, niḻal um nīr um illāta aḻal veṅkāṉam āṟṟakillāḷ kollō' eṉṉum; eṉṉa, `aṉṉa veṅkāṉam eṉiṉumemperumāṭṭi nummoṭu vara+ peritum iṉiya ~ām' eṉṉum;ataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<H3>((ātaram^ kūṟal))</H3>

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 174}}

<P><P>{{S 175}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
atu kēṭṭu, `āyiṉ, uṭaṉpōkku valittēṉ, nī itaṉi avaṭku+colla vēṇṭum' eṉa, `naṉṟu, emperumāṉ aruḷicceytatuemperumāṭṭikku uṇarttuval' eṉṟu, talimakaṉivalaṅkoṇṭu pōntu, talimakaḷ uḻi+ ceṉṟu, avaḷ kuṟippu*aṟintu, `emperumāṭṭi, namperumāṉ nammi+ tammōṭuuṭaṉkoṇṭucella+ karutukiṉṟār, niṉ kuṟippu eṉṉi? eṉṉum;eṉṟaviṭattu, uṭampaṭutal um uṭampaṭātu* oḻital um eṉairaṇṭu* allatu* illi; ceṉṟu vaḻipaṭum ē ~eṉiṉ nāṇ ilaḷāyiṉāḷ ām; uṭaṉpaṭāḷ āyiṉ kaṟpu* ilaḷ āyiṉāḷ ām;iraṇṭiṉuḷ= um ettiṟattaḷ āyiṉāḷ ō eṉiṉ, nāṇu+ kaṟpueṉṉum iraṇṭu* alla ~ē avaḷkaṇ= uḷḷaṉa, avaṟṟuḷ nāṇiṟkaṟpu vali ~uṭittu; eṉṉi vali ~uṭiyavāṟu eṉiṉ,

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P121">{{iṟi: Page 121}}</A>
<HR>
<BR>	`uyiriṉum^ ciṟantaṉṟu nāṇ ē nāṇiṉum
<BR>	ceyir tīr kāṭci+ kaṟpu+ ciṟantaṉṟu'.
<BR>		(([kaḷaviyal-22]))

<P>eṉpatu* ākalāṉ, nāṇ aḻiyiṉum kaṟpu aḻiyāminiṉikkum; niṉittu, uṭaṉpōkku nērntu, tali cāyttunilam^ kiḷiyāniṟkum nilimi itu colluvatu* ē pōṉṟatu;ataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<H3>((nāṇ iḻantu varuntal))</H3>

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 176}}

<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`aḷitu* ō tāṉ ē nāṇ ē nammoṭu
<BR>	naṉi nīṭu* uḻantaṉṟu maṉ= ē iṉi ~ē
<BR>	vāṉ pūm^ karumpiṉ ōṅku maṇal+ ciṟu ciṟi+
<BR>	tīm puṉal neritara vīntu* ukkāaṅku+
<BR>	tāṅkum aḷavi tāṅki+
<BR>	kāmam neṟitara+ kinnillātu* ē'.
<BR>		(([kuṟun.-149]))

<P>{{C URAI}}
iṉṉum itu colluvatu* ē pōṉṟatu a+ nilimi:

<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`cilar um palar um^ kaṭikkaṇ nōkki
<BR>	mūkkiṉ ucci+ cuṭṭuviral cērtti
<BR>	maṟukiṉ+ peṇṭir ampal tūṟṟa+
<BR>	ciṟukōl valattaṉaḷ aṉṉi alippa
<BR>	alintaṉeṉ vāḻi tōḻi kāṉal+
<BR>	putu malar tīṇṭiya pū nāṟu kurūuccuvaṟ
<BR>	kaṭumā pūṇṭa neṭum^ tēr kaṭii
<BR>	naṭunāḷ varūum iyal tēr+ koṇkaṉoṭu
<BR>	celavu* ayarnticiṉāl yāṉ ē
<BR>	alar cumantu* oḻika ~iv aḻuṅkal ūr ē'.
<BR>		(([naṟṟiṇi -- 149]))

<P>{{C URAI}}
iṅṅaṉam ivaḷ uṭaṉpaṭum. uṭaṉpaṭṭatu uṇarntu vittu+ tāyuḻi+ cellum; tāy um makaḷatu vēṟupāṭu kaṇṭu, uṟṟatu*aṟiyātu, naṟṟiṟam paṭarntu celkiṉṟa kālam aṉṟu* ē,ākalāṉ, kaṇṭavāṟu* ē, `aṉṉāy, eṉ makaṭku iv vēṟupāṭueṟṟiṉāṉ āyiṟṟu? eṉakku+ collāy' eṉṉum. eṉa, `eṉṉālaṟiyappaṭṭatu* um^ ciṟitu uṇṭu' eṉṟu aṟattoṭuniṟkumāṟu,

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P122">{{iṟi: Page 122}}</A>
<HR>
<BR>	`tōḻikku* uriyavi kōṭāy tēettu'.(([iṟiyaṉār-14]))

<P>eṉṟa cūttirattiṟ colli+ pōntām; avvaki aṟattoṭuniṟkum. niṟka+, cevilittāy iṉpuṟṟa maṉattaḷāy, `eṉmakaḷperitu aṟivuṭiyaḷēkāṇ' eṉṟu, avvāṟu naṟṟāykku aṟattoṭuniṟkum. naṟṟāy um iṉpuṟṟa maṉattaḷāy+ tantikkum taṉaiyaṉmārkkum aṟattoṭu niṟkum. niṟka, avarum avaḷatuaṟivum ācāram um kēṭṭu iṉpuṟṟa maṉattarāy+ coṉmaṟuttu+taliyiṟiñci niṟpar. iṅṅaṉam^ ceṉṟu māṭcippaṭṭu+kāṭṭum ē ~eṉiṉ, peritum māṭcippaṭṭu+ kāṭṭiṟṟu. kāṭṭa,`ivaḷ nīril āṟṟiṭippōy varuntum^ kuṟi yeṉṉi?' eṉṟutalimakaṉi+ celavaḻuṅkuvikkum; avvakiyāṟcollumataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<H3>((celluntalivaṉi+ celavaḻuṅkuvittal))</H3>

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 177}}

<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`viḷampaḻam^ kamaḻum kamam^ cūl kuḻici+
<BR>	pācam^ tiṉṟa tēy kāl mattam
<BR>	ney teri iyakkam veḷil mutal muḻaṅkum
<BR>	viku pular viṭiyal mey karantu taṉ kāl
<BR>	ari ~ami cilampu kaḻīi+ pal% māṇ
<BR>	vari+ puṉi pantoṭu viiya celvōḷ
<BR>	ivi kāṇtōṟum* nōvar mātō
<BR>	aḷiyarō aḷiyar eṉ āyattōr eṉa
<BR>	nummoṭu varavu tāṉ ayaravum
<BR>	taṉ varittu* aṉṟi ~um^ kaluḻntaṉa kaṇ= ē'.
<BR>		(([naṟṟiṇi -- 12]))

<P>{{C URAI}}
itu kēṭṭa talimakaṉ celavaḻuṅkum. aḻuṅka, `nāḷi nīrvarintu pukutum' eṉṟu tavirttu+ peyarntutalimakaḷuḻi vantu, `niḻal um nīrum uṭiyavāy+ kāṉam^taṇṇiyavāṉāṟ cēṟum' eṉṟu uṭaṉpōkku aḻuṅkuvittaviṭattu+,talimakaṉum annāḷ varivoṭu virintu pukuvāṉ ām. ituveḷippaṭṭa piṉṟi+ kiḷavi ~um uriyavāyiṉavāṟu.

<P>iṉi, ummiyāl, uṭaṉpōkkum urittāmāṟu: avvāṟuaṟattoṭunili māṭcimippaṭṭatu illi ~āyiṉ,iravukkuṟikkaṇ talippeyvikkumāṟu pōla+, talimakaḷi//
<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P123">{{iṟi: Page 123}}</A>
<HR>
// muṟpaṭuttu uṭaṉpōkka māṭcippaṭum; paṭuttu, ōmpaṭicollum; ataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<H3>((ōmpaṭutturittal))</H3>

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 178}}

<P><P>{{S 179}}

<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`aṇṇāntu* ēntiya vaṉa muli taḷariṉum
<BR>	poṉ ^nēr mēṉi maṇiyiṉ tāḻnta
<BR>	naṉ ^neṭum^ kūntal nariyoṭu muṭippiṉum
<BR>	nīttal ōmpumati pū+ kēḻ ūra
<BR>	iṉ kaṭum^ kaḷḷiṉ iḻi ~aṇi neṭum^ tēr+
<BR>	koṟṟa+ cōḻar koṅkar+ paṇīiyar
<BR>	veṇkōṭṭu^ yāṉi+ pēer kiḻavōṉ
<BR>	paḻiyaṉ vēl vāyttaṉṉa niṉ
<BR>	piḻiyā naṉmoḻi tēṟiya ivaṭku* ē'.
<BR>		(([naṟṟiṇi-10]))

<P>	`peru naṉṟu* āṟṟiṉ+ pēṇār um uḷar ē
<BR>	oru naṉṟu* uṭiyaḷ āyiṉum puri māṇṭu
<BR>	pulavi tīra aḷimati ili kavarpu*
<BR>	āṭu* ami oḻukiya taṇ ^naṟum cāral
<BR>	meṉṉaṭi mariyā tuñcum
<BR>	naṉ mali nāṭa niṉ= alatu* ilaḷ ē'.
<BR>		(([kuṟun-115]))

<P>	`naṉimutir ñāḻal ciṉi maruḷ tiraḷ vī
<BR>	neytal mā malar+ peyta pōla
<BR>	ūti tūṟṟum uravunīr+ cērppa
<BR>	tāy uṭaṉṟu* alikkum^ kāli ~um vāyviṭṭu
<BR>	aṉṉāy eṉṉum^ kuḻavi pōla
<BR>	iṉṉā ceyiṉum iṉitu taliyaḷippiṉum
<BR>	niṉ varippiṉaḷ eṉ tōḻi
<BR>	taṉ= uṟu viḻumam kaḷiñar ō ilaḷ ē'.
<BR>		(([kuṟun-397]))

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P124">{{iṟi: Page 124}}</A>
<HR>
<BR>	`ivaḷ ē niṉ= alatu* ilaḷ ē yāy um
<BR>	kuvaḷi uṇkaṇ ivaḷ alatu* ilaḷ ē
<BR>	yāṉ um āyiṭiyēṉ ē
<BR>	māmali nāṭa maṟavātīmē'.

<P>ivvaki ōmpaṭuttu+ tāṉ tavirum eṉṟavāṟu.

<P>tāṉ tavirvatō ceyaṟpālatu? pōkāḷō? eṉiṉ, taṉatuvaruttattiṟku+ kavaṉṟu pōkātāḷallaḷ, itaṉi+ paṇpākaurittaṟporuṭṭu+ tavirum eṉpatu. cevilittāykku urittāḷaṉṟu* ē, avaḷ ataṉi+ paṇpāka uriyāḷō eṉiṉ, ivaḷcolliyatu teḷiyumāṟu cevilittāy colliyatu teḷiyāreṉṟavāṟu; eṉṉi eppoḻutum^ kiviṭāta marapiṉaḷ ākalāṉeṉpatu.

<P>iṉi+, talimakaḷi+ talimakaṉ āṟṟuvittu+ koṇṭuceṉṟataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<H3>((mellam^ koṇṭēkal))</H3>

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 180}}

<P><P>{{S 181}}

<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`aḻivilar muyalum ārva mākkaḷ
<BR>	vaḻipaṭu teyvam^ kaṭ kaṇṭāaṅku
<BR>	alamaral varuttam tīra yāḻa niṉ
<BR>	nilameṉ paṇittōḷ eytiṉam ākaliṟ
<BR>	porippūm puṉkiṉ eḻiṟṟaki oṇmuṟi
<BR>	cuṇaṅkaṇi vaṉamuli aṇaṅkukoḷa+ timiri
<BR>	niḻalkāṇ tōṟum neṭiya viki
<BR>	maṇalkāṇ tōṟum vaṇṭal tii
<BR>	varuntātu* ēkumati vāl eyiṟṟōy ē
<BR>	mānaṉi koḻuti makiḻkuyil ālum
<BR>	naṟuntaṇ poḻila kāṉam
<BR>	kuṟum pal ūra yām^ cellum āṟu* ē'.
<BR>		(([naṟṟiṇi 9]))

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P125">{{iṟi: Page 125}}</A>
<HR>
<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉa+ talimakaḷi+ taṉ āyattōṭu* um^ celvāḷpōla+koṇṭucellum. avvaki pōvāri iṭiccurattu+ kaṇṭārcolliyataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<H3>((neṟivilakki+ kūṟal))</H3>

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 182}}

<P><P>{{S 183}}

<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`em= ūr allatu* ūr naṇittu* illi
<BR>	vem muraṭ celvaṉ katir um ūḻttaṉaṉ
<BR>	cērntaṉi ceṉmō pūm^ tār mārpa
<BR>	iḷiyaḷ melliyaḷ maṭanti
<BR>	ariya cēya peruṅkal āṟu* ē'.
<BR>		(([aiṅkuṟunūṟu, iṇippu-5]))

<P>{{C URAI}}
iṉṉum iṭiccurattu+ kaṇṭār ivvāṟu* um^ collupa:

<H3>((nakaraṇimi kūṟal))</H3>

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 184}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
piṟṟiñāṉṟu makaḷatu pōkku uṇarntu cevili mayaṅki+periyatōr kavaliyaḷāy, `nerunali ivi ceytatu itukarutippōlum' eṉṉum; ataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<H3>((kavaṉṟurittal))</H3>

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 185}}

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P126">{{iṟi: Page 126}}</A>
<HR>
<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`peyarttaṉeṉ muyaṅka yāṉ viyarttaṉeṉ eṉṟaṉaḷ
<BR>	iṉi ~aṟintēṉ atu tuṉi ~ākutal ē
<BR>	kaḻal toṭi ~āay maḻi tavaḻ potiyiṉ
<BR>	vēṅki ~um kāntaḷ um nāṟi
<BR>	āmpal malariṉum tāṉ taṇṇiyaḷ ē'.
<BR>		(([kuṟun-84]))

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉṟu, piṉṉum^ kavaṉṟu āṟṟāḷ āy, `ivvakippaṭṭa kāṉamivvakippaṭṭāḷ evvaki celluṅkollō?' eṉṉum; ataṟku+ceyyuḷ:

<H3>((curamniṉintiraṅkal))</H3>

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 186}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
`ivvaki melliyavākiya aṭi ivvaki veyyavākiya kāṉamevvaki ceṉṟaṉakollō' eṉṉum; ataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<H3>((aṭiniṉintiraṅkal))</H3>
<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 187}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
iṉi+, cevili piṉceṉṟāḷ curattiṭi+ kuraviṉoṭu pulampi+colliyataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<H3>((kuravoṭu varuntal))</H3>
<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 188}}

<P><P>{{S 189}}

<P><P>{{S 190}}

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P127">{{iṟi: Page 127}}</A>
<HR>
<P>{{C URAI}}
curattiṭi+ cellum^ talimakaṉi ~um talimakaḷi ~umkaṇṭu etirvarukiṉṟār, `yār kol ivvāṟu pōntār'? eṉa+colliyataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<H3>((curattiṭikkaṇṭōr kuṟippoṭukūṟal))</H3>

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 191}}

<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`villōṉ kālaṉa kaḻal ē toṭiyōḷ
<BR>	mellaṭi mēla ~um cilampu* ē nallōr
<BR>	yār kol aḷiyar tām ē āriyar
<BR>	kayiṟu* āṭu paṟiyiṟ kāl pora+ kalaṅki
<BR>	vāki veṇṇeṟṟu* olikkum
<BR>	vēypayil aḻuvam muṉṉiyōr ē'.
<BR>		(([kuṟun-7]))

<P>{{C URAI}}
iṉi+, cevili etirvarukiṉṟa pārppāri+ kaṇṭuviṉāyataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:
vētiyari viṉātal

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 192}}

<P><P>{{S 193}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
curattiṭi+ cellāniṉṟa talimakaḷ niṉṟa cūḻal um,talimakaṉ eyta vēḻam um kaṇṭu cevili colliyataṟku+ceyyuḷ:

<H3>((viyanturittal))</H3>

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 194}}

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P128">{{iṟi: Page 128}}</A>
<HR>
<P>{{S 195}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
piṉceṉṟa cevilittāy etirvaruvārikkaṇṭu viṉava,avviṉavappaṭṭār talimakaḷi ~um talimakaṉi ~umiṉṉatōriṭam cērvarkaḷ eṉṉumataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<H3>((aḻuṅkutāykkurittal))</H3>

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 196}}

<P><P>{{S 197}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
iṭiccurattu+ pulampum^ ceviliyi etirvaruvār kaṇṭuteruṭṭiyataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<H3>((ulakiyalpurittal))</H3>

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 198}}

<P><P>{{S 199}}

<P><P>{{S 200}}

<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`eṟittaru katir tāṅki ~ēntiya kuṭi nīḻal
<BR>	uṟittāḻnta karakam um uri cāṉṟa mukkōl um
<BR>	neṟippaṭa+ cuval acii vēṟu* ōrā neñcattu+
<BR>	kuṟippu* ēval ceyal māli+ koḷi naṭi antaṇīr
<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P129">{{iṟi: Page 129}}</A>
<HR>
<BR>	vev= iṭi+ celal māli oḻukkattīr iv= iṭi
<BR>	eṉ makaḷ orutti ~um piṟaḷ makaṉ oruvaṉ um
<BR>	tammuḷ ē puṇarnta tām aṟi puṇarcciyar
<BR>	aṉṉār iruvari+ kāṇirō peruma!
<BR>	kāṇēm allēm kaṇṭaṉam kaṭattiṭi
<BR>	āṇ eḻil aṇṇalōṭu* arum^ curam* muṉṉiya
<BR>	māṇ iḻi maṭavaral tāyir nīr pōṟir;

<P>	pala ~uṟu naṟum^ cāntam paṭuppavarkku* allati
<BR>	maliyuḷ ē piṟappiṉum malikku* avi tām eṉ ceyyum
<BR>	niṉiyuṅkāl num makaḷ numakku* um āṅku* aṉiyaḷ ē;

<P>	cīr keḻu veṇ muttam aṇipavarkku* allati
<BR>	nīruḷ ē piṟappiṉum nīrkku* avi tām eṉ ceyyum
<BR>	tēruṅkāl num makaḷ numakku* um āṅku* aṉiyaḷ ē;

<P>	ēḻ puṇar iṉ= ici muralpavarkku* allati
<BR>	yāḻuḷ ē piṟappiṉum yāḻkku* avi tām eṉ ceyyum
<BR>	cūḻuṅkāl num makaḷ numakku* um āṅku* aṉiyaḷ ē;

<P>	eṉa ~āṅku,
<BR>	iṟanta kaṟpiṉāṭku* evvam paṭaraṉmiṉ
<BR>	ciṟantāṉi vaḻipaṭīi+ ceṉṟaṉaḷ
<BR>	aṟam^ talipiriyā āṟu* um* maṟṟu* atu ~ē'.
<BR>		(([kali. pāli -- 9])).

<P>{{C URAI}}
cevili curattiṭiccellātu, maṉiyakattiliruntu collumeṉpārumuḷar; atu poruntumāṟṟiṉ aṟintukoḷka. allatūum,āṅṅaṉam puṇarntu uṭaṉpōy+ cila nāṭkaḻinta piṉṉi.

<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`aṟattoṭu niliyiṉ aḵtu* aṟintirunta
<BR>	ciṟappu* uṭi marapiṉ teyvam aṉṉa
<BR>	iru perum^ kuravaroṭu poruvil āṟṟal
<BR>	taṉṉiyar tammi+ cālpuṭi marapiṉ
<BR>	maṉṉiya ciṟappiṉ matiyōr tēṟṟa
<BR>	atu paṇpu* ātal vitiyuḷi teruṇṭapiṉ
<BR>	mīṇṭu vantu viyanakar virumpa
<BR>	māṇ ^taku ciṟappiṉ varinteytum eṉpa'.

<P>{{C URAI}}
avvaki maṟittu vārāniṉṟāḷ curattu* iṭi muṉṉuṟa+celvāri, `eṉ āyattārkku eṉatu varaviṉi+ collumiṉ'eṉṉum; ataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P130">{{iṟi: Page 130}}</A>
<HR>
<H3>((vaḻi+ celvōri varavu* urimiṉ eṉṟal))</H3>

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 201}}

<P><P>{{S 202}}

<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`kaviḻmayir eruttiṟ cennāy ēṟṟi
<BR>	kuruḷi+ paṉṟi koḷḷātu kaḻiyum
<BR>	curanaṉi vārā niṉṟaṉaḷ eṉpatu
<BR>	muṉṉuṟa virintaṉir urimiṉ
<BR>	iṉṉaki muṟuvaleṉ āyattōrku* ē'.
<BR>		(([aiṅkuṟu-397]))

<P>{{C URAI}}
allatūum, makaḷ varukiṉṟāḷ eṉa+ kēṭṭa tāy, `namneṭunakarkku* ē koṇṭu varumō? taṉ kaṭimaṉikku* ēkoṇṭupōmō?' eṉa, avaṉ kuṟippu* aṟitaṟku vēlaṉi+kūviyaṟiyum; ataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<H3>((vēlaṉi viṉātal))</H3>

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 203}}

<P><P>{{S 204}}

<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`arum^ curam iṟanta eṉ perum^ tōḷ kuṟumakaḷ
<BR>	tiruntu vēl viṭaliyoṭu varum eṉa+ tāy ē
<BR>	puṉi māṇ iñci pūval ūṭṭi
<BR>	maṉi maṇal aṭuttu māli nāṟṟi
<BR>	uvantu* iṉitu* ayarum eṉpa yāṉ um
<BR>	māṉ piṇi nōkkiṉ maṭa nallāḷi
<BR>	īṉṟa naṭpiṟku* aruḷāṉ āyiṉum
<BR>	iṉ ^naki muṟuval ēḻiyi+ pal% ^nāḷ
<BR>	kūntal vāri nucuppu* ivarntu* ōmpiya
<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P131">{{iṟi: Page 131}}</A>
<HR>
<BR>	kalampuṉi utaviyō uṭiyēṉ maṉ= ē
<BR>	aḵtu* aṟikiṟpiṉ ō naṉṟu maṉ+ ^tilla
<BR>	aṟuvi tōyum oru perum^ kuṭumi+
<BR>	ciṟu pi nāṟṟiya paḵṟali+ karuṅkōl
<BR>	ākuvatu* aṟiyum mutuvāy vēla
<BR>	kūṟuka mātō kaḻaṅkiṉ tiṭpam
<BR>	māṟā arumpaṉi kaluḻum kaṅkul
<BR>	āṉātu tuyarum em kaṇ= iṉitu paṭīiyar
<BR>	em maṉi muntuṟa+ tarum ō
<BR>	tam maṉi uykkum ō yātu* avaṉ kuṟippu* ē'.
<BR>		(([akam-195]))

<P>{{C URAI}}
iṅṅaṉam pukuntu peyarnta piṉṟi+ talimakaṉ taṉ akattu*ē vatuvi+ kaliyāṇam^ ceyvāṉ eṭuttukkoṇṭāṉ eṉpatu kēṭṭanaṟṟāy, `oḻinta kaliyāṇam^ ceyyiṉum nam= akattu* ēvatuvi+ kaliyāṇam^ ceyvāṉ nērum^ kollō kāḷiyi+payantāḷ' eṉṉum; ataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<H3>((naṟṟāy maṇaṉayar vēṭkiyiṟ ceviliyiviṉātal))</H3>

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 205}}

<P><P>{{S 206}}

<P><P>{{S 207}}

<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`num maṉi+ cilampu kaḻīi ayariṉum
<BR>	em maṉi vatuvi nal% maṇam^ kaḻikeṉa+
<BR>	colliṉ evaṉō maṟṟu* ē veṉvēl
<BR>	miyaṟa viḷaṅkiya kaḻal aṭi+
<BR>	poyval kāḷiyi īṉṟa tāykku* ē'.
<BR>		(([aiṅkuṟu-399]))

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉa+ koḷka.

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P132">{{iṟi: Page 132}}</A>
<HR>
<H2>24</H2>
<P>	kaḷavu veḷippaṭā muṉṉuṟa varital
<BR>	kaḷavu veḷippapaṭṭa piṉṟi varital eṉṟu
<BR>	āy iraṇṭu* eṉpa varital āṟu* ē.

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉpatu eṉnutaliṟṟō eṉiṉ, kaḷavu,
<BR>	`veḷippaṭṭa piṉṟi+ kiḷavi ~um uriya'.(([iṟiya-23]))
eṉṟamiyāṉ, veḷippaṭṭa piṉṟi varital muṟimiyāṉallatu illi eṉa+ koṇṭuniṉṟa māṇākkaṟku, maṟṟumvaritalāṟu uṇṭu* eṉpatu uṇarttutal nutaliṟṟu.

<P>itaṉ poruḷ: kaḷavu veḷippaṭā muṉṉuṟa varital eṉpatu --palarāṉum cilarāṉum aṟiyappaṭṭatu iv= oḻukkam eṉṉum^karuttu eytā muṉṉam varital eṉṟavāṟu;

<P>iyaṟki+ puṇarcci puṇarnta piṉ= ē teruṇṭu varital umuriyaṉ,

<P>aṅku+ teruḷāṉ āyviṭiṉ, pāṅkaṟkūṭṭam^ kūṭi+ teruṇṭuvarital um uriyaṉ,

<P>aṅku+ teruḷāṉ āyviṭiṉ, tōḻiyi irantupiṉṉiṉṟu avaḷtaṉiyuṟā+ takimi ceyya+ teruṇṭu varital um uriyaṉ,

<P>aṅku+ teruḷāṉ āyviṭiṉ, mati ~uṭampaṭuttu irantupiṉṉiṉṟa nilimikkaṇ tōḻi cēṭpaṭuppa+ teruṇṭu varitalum uriyaṉ,

<P>aṅku+ teruḷāṉ āyviṭiṉ, tōḻiyiṟ kūṭṭam^ kūṭiyātal,ceṟippu* aṟivuṟukkappaṭṭātal, iravukkuṟiyatu ētamkāṭṭavātal, varivu kaṭāvappaṭṭātal teruṇṭu varital umuriyaṉ,

<P>ītu* ellām kaḷavu veḷippaṭā muṉṉuṟa varitalvikaṟpam eṉa+ koḷka.
iṉi, veḷippaṭṭa piṉṟi varital vikaṟpam iṉṟu eṉa+koḷka. avaṟṟuḷ, kaḷavu veḷippaṭā muṉṉuṟa varitalciṟappuṭittu. itu taṉakku* ākāmiyāl varintamiyiṟciṟappiṉṟu eṉa+ koḷka. itu kaḷavu veḷippāṭu aṉṟu* eṉṟumaṟuttu+ kaḷavu veḷippaṭā muṉṉuṟa varital,aṟattoṭunili nikaḻāmuṉ varital eṉṟavāṟu.

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P133">{{iṟi: Page 133}}</A>
<HR>
kaḷavu veḷippaṭṭa piṉṟi varital eṉpatu --aṟattoṭunili nikaḻnta piṉṟi varital eṉṟavāṟu;

<P>kaḷavu veḷippaṭā muṉṉuṟa varital um kaḷavuveḷippaṭṭa piṉṟi varital um āmāṟu muṉ= ē colli+pōntām; av= uri ~ē itaṟku* um urittukkoḷka.

<P>eṉṟu āyiraṇṭu eṉpa varitalāṟu eṉpatu -- eṉṟu iraṇṭuvaki eṉpar varital muṟi eṉṟavāṟu.

<H2>25</H2>
<P>	paṭṭa piṉṟi variyā+ kiḻavaṉ
<BR>	neṭṭiṭi kaḻintu poruḷvayiṉ pirital um
<BR>	poruḷvayiṉ piriyātu* oruvaḻi+ taṇattal um
<BR>	purivatu* eṉpa kaṟpāl āṉa.

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉpatu eṉ ^nutaliṟṟu* ō eṉiṉ, aṟattoṭu niliniṉṟa piṉṟivarum vikaṟpam uṇarttutal nutaliṟṟu.

<P>mēṟ cūttirattu variyum iṭam uṇarttiṉār,avvariviṟkuvarum iṭiyīṭu ivi eṉpatu uṇarttutalnutaliṟṟu.

<P>iṉi+, `talimakaḷi varinteytiṉāṉallaṉ, aṟattoṭuniṉṟavāṟu* ē pirintāṉ, ākalāṉ, aṉṉāḷ kaṟpiṉāḷ ō?kaḷaviṉāḷ ō?' eṉṟa māṇākkaṟku, ivaḷ kaṟpiṉāḷ ēeṉappaṭum eṉṟavāṟu.

<P>itaṉ poruḷ: paṭṭa piṉṟi variyā+ kiḻavaṉ eṉpatu --aṟattoṭu niliniṉṟa piṉṟi varinteytāta talimakaṉeṉṟavāṟu; neṭṭiṭi kaḻintu poruḷvayiṟ pirital um eṉpatu-- nāṭum kāṭum iṭiyiṭṭa palkātam um nīṅki+ poruṭku+piriyum pirivum eṉṟavāṟu; poruḷvayiṟ piriyātuoruvaḻittaṇattal um eṉpatu -- poruṭku+ piriyātuōriṭattiṉaṉāy uṟital um eṉṟavāṟu; purivatu eṉpakaṟpāl āṉa eṉpatu -- avi poruntum kaṟpiṉāḷākaṟkueṉṟavāṟu.

<P>aṟattoṭu niliniṉṟami eṉṉi talimakaṉ aṟiyumāṟueṉiṉ, tōḻiyāl uṇarttappaṭṭu aṟiyum eṉpatu.

<P>itaṉ karuttu, iv= iraṇṭu iṭiyīṭṭiṉkaṇṇum talimakaḷāṟṟāḷ āya kālattu+ tōḻaḻi āṟṟuvittal um, //
<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P134">{{iṟi: Page 134}}</A>
<HR>
// āṟṟuvittu ataṉ etir moḻital um, piṟa ~um ellāmkaṟpiṉoṭu okkum eṉpatu.

<P>i+ pirivu talimakaḷ aṟiya+ piriyum ō eṉiṉ, aṟiya ~ēpiriyum, tōḻikku* um talimakaṭku* um ellām uṇarttieṉpatu. avvāṟu pirintaviṭattu+ talimakaḷ vēṟupaṭṭāḷ;vēṟupaṭa, `emperumāṉ itaṟku nallatu purivāṉ pirivāṉ;piriya, nī āṟṟāy āvatu* ō takātu' eṉṟa tōḻikku, `yāṉpiriya āṟṟēṉ āyiṉēṉ allēṉ; avar ceṉṟa kāṉattu+taṉmiyi nōkki avarkku+ kavaṉṟu niṉintu āṟṟēṉāyiṉēṉi ētilar ataṉi+ tiriya uṇarntār' eṉa ūr mēlvittu+ collum; ataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<H3>((talivi ūravar taṉmi kūṟal))</H3>

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 208}}

<H3>((iyaṟpaṭa moḻital))</H3>

<P>{{C URAI}}
i+ piriviṉkaṇ= ē āṟṟāḷ āy vēṟupaṭṭa talimakaḷiivvāṟu* aṉṟi āṟṟuvikkal ākātu eṉa+ karuti+ talimakaṉiiyaṟpaḻitta tōḻikku+ talimakaḷ iyaṟpaṭa moḻiyum;ataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`tol kaviṉ toliya+ tōḷ nalam cāay
<BR>	nalkār nīttaṉar āyiṉum nalkuvar
<BR>	naṭṭaṉar vāḻi tōḻi kuṭṭuvaṉ
<BR>	akappā aḻiya nūṟi+ cempiyaṉ
<BR>	pakal+ ^tī vēṭṭa ñāṭpiṉum mika+ peritu
<BR>	alar eḻa+ ceṉṟaṉar āyiṉum malarkavintu
<BR>	mā maṭal aviḻnta kāntaḷ am^ cāraliṉ
<BR>	ñālvāy+ kaḷiṟu pāntaṭ paṭṭeṉa+
<BR>	tuñcā+ tuyara+ tañcu piṭi+ pūcal
<BR>	neṭu vari viṭar akattu* iyampum
<BR>	kaṭu māṉ pulliya kāṭu* iṟantōr ē'.
<BR>		(([naṟṟiṇi-14]))

<H3>((iyaṟpaḻittal))</H3>

<P>{{C URAI}}
allatūum, neṭṭiṭi kaḻintu poruḷvayiṟ pirinta viṭattu+talimakaḷatu āṟṟāmikaṇṭu tōḻi talimakaṉiiyaṟpaḻikkum; //
<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P135">{{iṟi: Page 135}}</A>
<HR>
// eṅṅaṉam iyaṟpaḻikkumō eṉiṉ, `ivaḷi iṅṅaṉam āṟṟāḷāka+ pirinta avariṉum^ koṭiya, ivaḷatu āṟṟāmi kaṇṭumataṟku nallatu puriyātu tam nāṇ iṉmiyāṉ+ pakal ēpukuntu iritērkiṉṟa nāṇā+ paṟavikaḷ eṉṉum; ataṟku+ceyyuḷ:

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 209}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉpatu kēṭṭa talimakaḷ, `eṉ āṟṟāmi kaṇṭu* aṉṟu* ēivaḷ ivvaki colluvāḷ āvatu' eṉa+ taṉatu āṟṟāminīṅkuvāḷ āvatu payaṉ.
iṉi, oruvaḻittaṇantaviṭattu+ talimakaḷ vēṟupaṭa`ivvakippaṭṭa nilattil talimakaṉ nammi+ tuṟavāṉ, nīeṟṟiṟku āṟṟāyākiṉṟāy?' eṉa+ tōḻi colliyataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 210}}

<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`kuḻaliciya vaṇṭiṉaṅkaḷ kōḻiliya ceṅkāntaṭkulimēṟ pāya
<BR>	aḻaleriyiṉ mūḻkiṉavāl antō aḷiyaveṉ ṟayalvāḻ manti
<BR>	kaluḻvaṉapōl neñcacintu kallaruvi tūum
<BR>	niḻalvari naṉṉāṭaṉ nīppaṉō allaṉ'.

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉa+ koḷka.

<H2>26</H2>
<P>	veḷippaṭi tāṉ ē virikkum kāli+
<BR>	tanti tāy ē taṉṉiyar eṉṟāṅku
<BR>	aṉṉavar aṟiya+ paṇpu* ākum= ē.

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉpatu eṉ ^nutaliṟṟu* ō eṉiṉ, mēl veḷippaṭi ~ē colli+pōntār, av veḷippaṭi ivi ~eṉpatu uṇarttutalnutaliṟṟu.

<P>itaṉ poruḷ: veḷippaṭi tāṉ ē eṉpatu -- kaḷavuveḷippaṭi tāṉ ē eṉṟavāṟu; virikkuṅkāli eṉpatu -- //
<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P136">{{iṟi: Page 136}}</A>
<HR>
// virittu uṇarttum iṭattu eṉṟavāṟu; tanti tāy ētaṉṉiyar eṉṟāṅku aṉṉavar aṟiya+ paṇpu ākum= ē eṉpatu-- tanti tāy taṉṉiyar eṉṟu avar aṟiya+ paṇpu* ākumeṉṟavāṟu.

<P>paṇpu eṉiṉum, ilakkaṇam eṉiṉum, iyalpu eṉiṉum okkum.veḷippaṭi ~eṉpatu aṟattoṭunili eṉṟavāṟu. veḷippaṭieṉiṉum, aṟattoṭunili eṉiṉum okkum eṉa, iv= iraṇṭum oruporuḷmēl+ kiṭantaṉa ~āyiṉum, karuttu vēṟupāṭu* uṭiya~ām. yāvar um aṟiyappaṭāta kaḷavu, tanti ~um tāy umtaṉṉiyar um aṟiyappāṭu nikaḻntamiyiṉ, kaḷavuveḷippaṭi ~eṉappaṭṭatu; iṉi+, talimakaḷ aṟaṉ aḻiyāminiṟṟaliṉ, aṟattoṭunili ~eṉa ~um paṭṭatu.

<H2>27</H2>
<P>	avaruḷ
<BR>	tāy aṟivuṟutaliṉ ēṉōr um aṟipa.

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉpatu eṉ ^nutaliṟṟu* ō eṉiṉ, ivar tām aṟiyumiṭattu+tāy colla ~aṉṟi+ tāmāka aṟivilar eṉpatu uṇarttutalnutaliṟṟu.

<P>itaṉ poruḷ: avaruḷ eṉpatu -- mēṟkūṟappaṭṭamūvaruḷḷum eṉṟavāṟu; tāy aṟivuṟutaliṉ ēṉōrum aṟipaeṉpatu -- tāy aṟivuṟukkappaṭṭu+ tanti ~um taṉṉiyaṉmārum aṟivar eṉṟavāṟu.

<P>eṉa ~ē, cevilittāy tōḻiyāl aṟattoṭu niṟkappaṭṭunaṟṟāykku aṟattoṭu niṟkum; ammuṟiyāṉ ē, naṟṟāytantikku* um taṉṉiyaṉmārkku* um aṟattoṭu niṟkumeṉpatu.

<P>cevilittāy naṟṟāykku aṟattoṭu niṟkum eṉpatupeṟṟavāṟu eṉṉi ~eṉiṉ, uriyiṟkōṭal eṉṉum^tantiravuttiyāṟ peṟutum eṉpatu.

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P137">{{iṟi: Page 137}}</A>
<HR>
<H2>28</H2>
<P>	tanti taṉṉiyar āy iru vīṟṟum
<BR>	muṉṉam allatu kūṟṟu* avaṇ illi.

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉpatu eṉ ^nutaliṟṟu* ō eṉiṉ, tantikku* um taṉṉiyaṉmārkku* um naṟṟāy aṟattoṭu niṟkumāṟu uṇarttutal nutaliṟṟu.

<P>itaṉ poruḷ: tanti taṉṉiyar āy iru vīṟṟu* um eṉpatu --tanti eṉṟu* um taṉṉiyaṉmār eṉṟu* um collappaṭṭa iraṇṭu kūṟṟārkku* um eṉṟavāṟu; muṉṉam allatu kūṟṟu avaṇilli eṉpatu -- avarkku muṉṉattāṉ allatu cevvaṉam^collappeṟāḷ eṉṟavāṟu.

<P>aḵtu* āmāṟu: naṟṟāy tantikkum taṉṉiyaṉmārkkum aṟattoṭu niṟkumiṭattu, `iṉṉatoṉṟuṇṭāl, aḵtu eṉṉō eṉiṉ, kulattāṉum kuṇattāṉum celvattāṉum mikkāṉ oruvaṉ,ulakattār ellām orukuṟi vēṇṭappaṭum^ taṉmiyaṉ, tāṉoruvarpāl orukuṟi vēṇṭum^ ciṟumiyāṉ allaṉ, ittaṉmiyāṉavaṉ nammi vaḻipaṭṭu vāḻaluṟum, avaṉi yāmkiḻamikoḷḷa aḻivatu* uṇṭu* ō?' eṉṉum; eṉa, atu kēṭṭu,avar eṉ karutupavō eṉiṉ, `ivaḷ karuti+ collukiṉṟakuṟippu* āvatu itu pōlum, taṉmakaḷ tiṟattiṉ ākātu* ē'eṉa uṇarvār āvatu.

<P>`avaṇ' eṉṟa mikivāypāṭṭāṉ, muṉṉattāṉ aṉṟi ~um muṉṉam pōlum^ collāṉum ciṟupāṉmi collappeṟum eṉpatu.

<P>atu varumāṟu: talimakaṉ pārppāri muṉṉiṭṭu aruṅkalaṅkaḷōṭu varivu vēṇṭi viṭṭa -~iṭattu+ tanti-~um taṉṉiyaṉmār -um varivu maṟuttār, maṟuppār cūḻtal-um arukutal -um uṭimiyāṉ, nūṟṟiyāṭṭi+ karumam nūṟṟavarōṭu eṇṇi+ ceyyappaṭumākalāṟ cūḻappaṭum.

<P>iṉi+, `kaṇṭīrē, tam makaḷi vēṇṭuvāri+ pārttiruntārākātu* ē, nām i+ nūṟṟiṭi+ karumanūṟṟavar ē,ivarkaḷiṭi makaṭpeṟuvār yār!' eṉa ~um, `peṟutaṟku arumiyuṭittu' eṉa ~um karuta arukupa.

<P>iṉi+, `kaṇṭīrē, tam makaḷi vēṇṭuvār urippaṉa ~um poy pōlum' vēṇṭutaṟku iṭiyiṉṟi ~ē peṟṟār āyiṉ, //
<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P138">{{iṟi: Page 138}}</A>
<HR>
// `ivvaki virintu koṭuttārāl' eṉṉum puṟavuri nōkki~um arukupa.

<P>allatūum, iṟappa+ ciṟiyār um, tammiṉ mikkār, makaḷ vēṇṭi+ ceṉṟaviṭattu* um arukupa.

<P>iṉi, ulakiyalāṉ -um arukupa.

<P>allatu, ulakiyalpu* allāvaḻi ivar arukuvataṟku+colla vēṇṭum -ō eṉpatu; eṉa+, talimakaṉ varivu maṟukkappaṭṭāṉ eṉpataṉi uṇarnta talimakaḷ āṟṟāḷ āmāka+, tōḻi yāykku aṟattoṭu niṟpa, cevilittāy naṟṟāykku aṟattoṭu niṟkum; avaḷ tantikku* -um taṉṉiyaṉmārkku* -um aṟattoṭu niṟkum, muṉṉam pōlum^ collāṉ eṉṟavāṟu. avvāṟu collumataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<H3>((aṟattoṭu niṟṟal))</H3>

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 211}}

<P><P>{{S 212}}

<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`cāṉṟōr varuntiya varuttam um numatu
<BR>	vāṉtōy vaṉṉa kuṭimi ~um nōkki+
<BR>	tirumaṇi varaṉṟum kuṉṟam koṇṭivaḷ
<BR>	varumuli yākam vaḻaṅkiṉōm naṉṟu* ē

<P>		aḵtu* āṉṟu,

<P>	aṭiporuḷ karutuvir āyiṉ kuṭiyoṭu
<BR>	kaḻumalam tanta naṟṟēr+ cempiyaṉ
<BR>	paṅkuṉi viḻaviṉ uṟantiyōṭu
<BR>	uḷḷi viḻaviṉ vañci ~um ciṟitu* ē'.

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉa ivvāṟu naṟṟāy colla+ kēṭṭu+ koṭātuviṭiṉ, i+kulattukku vaṭuvuṇṭupōlum eṉa uṇarvār āvatu. ataṉāṟpōnta poruḷ aṟattoṭunili māṭcippaṭuvatu.

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P139">{{iṟi: Page 139}}</A>
<HR>
<H2>29</H2>
<P>	kāppu+ kimikku+ kāmam perukiṉum
<BR>	notumalar variyum paruvam āyiṉum
<BR>	varivu* etirkoḷḷātu tamar avaṇ maṟuppiṉum
<BR>	avaṉ ūṟu* añcum^ kālam āyiṉum
<BR>	a+ nāl iṭattu* um meynnāṇ orīi
<BR>	aṟattoṭu niṟṟal tōḻikku* um urittu* ē.

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉpatu eṉ ^nutaliṟṟu* ō eṉiṉ, mēṟ cūttirattuḷ aṟattoṭuniṟkum nili uṇarttati+ pōntār; iṉi, aṟattoṭu niṟkumiṭam kūṟuvāṉ eṭuttukkoṇṭār eṉpatu, aḵtu uṇarttutalnutaliṟṟu.

<P>mēṟ cūttirattōṭu iyipu eṉṉi ~ō eṉiṉ, mēlaṟattoṭunili ~atikāram vārāniṉṟatu* ākalāṉ eṉpatu.

<P>itaṉ poruḷ: kāppu+ kimikku+ kāmam perukiṉum eṉpatu --kāval kimikappāṭṭiṉ vēṭki perukiṉum eṉṟavāṟu;notumalar variyum paruvam āyiṉum eṉpatu -- ayalārvarintupukum^ kālamāyiṉum eṉṟavāṟu; varivuetirkoḷḷātu tamar avaṇ maṟuppiṉum eṉpatu -- varivuēṟṟukkoḷḷātu tamar avviṭattu maṟuppiṉum eṉṟavāṟu; avaṉūṟu añcum kālam āyiṉum eṉpatu -- avaṟku nikaḻum ētamañciṉa iṭattum eṉṟavāṟu; annāliṭattum meynāṇ orīieṉpatu -- annāliṭattum meykkaṇ niṉṟa nāṇ nīṅkieṉṟavāṟu; aṟattoṭu niṟṟal tōḻikku* um urittu* ē eṉpatu-- aṟattoṭu niṟkum nilimi tōḻikkum urittu eṉṟavāṟu.

<P>`kāppu+ kimikku+ kāmam perukiṉum' eṉpatu -- kāppueṉpatu iraṇṭu vakittu, niṟikāval ciṟikāval eṉa.

<P>avaṟṟuḷ, niṟikāval eṉpatu -- kāppaṉa kāttu+kaṭivaṉa kaṭintu oḻukutal eṉṟavāṟu,

<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`ciṟi kākkum kāppu* evaṉ ceyyum makaḷir
<BR>	niṟi kākkum kāppu* ē tali'.
<BR>		(([kuṟaḷ -- 57]))

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉpatu* ākalāṉ.

<P>iṉi+, ciṟikāval eṉpatu -- tāy tuñcāmi, nāytuñcāmi, ūrtuñcāmi, kāvalarkaṭukutal,nilavuveḷippaṭutal, kūkikuḻaṟal, kōḻikuraṟkāṭṭal eṉaivi.

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P140">{{iṟi: Page 140}}</A>
<HR>
avaṟṟuḷ, īṇṭu+ ciṟikāval koḷḷappaṭum. a+ ciṟikāvalatumikaviṉkaṇ iṭiyīṭu* ām; iṭiyīṭu* āyiṉaviṭattu+talimakaṭku+ periyatu* ōr vēṟupāṭu uṇṭām;uṇṭāyiṉaviṭattu+ tōḻikku+ pulaṉ ām; pulaṉ āyiṉavāṟu* ēyāykku* um pulaṉ ām; pulaṉ āyiṉaviṭattu, yāy aṟivāriviṉāvum; viṉāviṉaviṭattu, aṟivār teyvattiṉāṉ āyiṟṟueṉpa; atu collutaṟ payattatu tam karumam ākalāṉ um,piṟitoṉṟu cuṭṭiyuṇarum^ taṉmittu* aṉṟu i+ kulam ākalāṉum teyvattiṉāṉ āyiṟṟu eṉpa. eṉṟaviṭattu, ivaḷimuṉṉiṟīi+ teyvattiṟku vaḻipāṭu ceyvikkum ceytaviṭattu+kaṟpaḻiyum. ivaṭku+ kaṟpaḻivu vantatu* eṉṟu* um, ivaṭkuāṟṟāmi taṇiyātu* aṉṟu* ē teyvattiṉāṉ āyiṟṟu eṉṟamiyiṉpeyarttum atu kaṇṭu yāykku āṟṟāmi perukum eṉṟu* umtalimakaḷatu kaṟpaḻivukku* um tāy āṟṟāmikku* um tōḻitāṉ āṟṟāḷ ām. āṟṟāmi ~eṉpatu piṟitu* ev= uṇarvu* umiṉṟi āṟṟāmi tāṉ ē ~āvatu. āṟṟāmi āṟṟuvatu* oṉṟaṉi+paṟṟum. āṟṟuvatu piṟitu* iṉmiyiṉ aṟivāri viṉāvum;viṉāvumiṭattu eṉṉi viṉāvum; yāṉ aṟiyēṉ eṉṟataṉpuṟattām piṟari viṉāvuvāḷ āvatu; eṉṉi viṉāviṉaviṭattuitu colluvaṉ eṉṟu kūṭṭam il nāṭṭavakiyāṉ+cintittukkoṇṭirukkum. irunta nilimikkaṇ, tāypaṭimakkalattoṭum pukum; pukku, makaḷi aṭiyiṟkoṇṭumuṭikāṟum nōkki, `aṉṉāy, eṉ makaṭku iv vēṟupāṭu eṟṟiṉāṉāyiṟṟu?' eṉṉum. eṉṟaviṭattu, `eṉṉāl aṟiyappaṭuvatu* um^ciṟitu uṇṭu' eṉṟu mēṟcolliyavāṟu* ē māṟukōḷ illātavakiyāṉ aṟattoṭu niṟkum; aṅṅaṉam avaḷ naṟṟāy+toṭakkattārkku* ellām aṟattoṭu niṟkum eṉpatu.

<P>iṉi; `notumalar variyum paruvam āyiṉum' eṉpatu --notumalar eṉpār ētilar, avar tām varivoṭu vantāreṉpatu kēṭṭaviṭattu+ talimakaḷ āṟṟāḷ ām; āṟṟāḷāyiṉaviṭattu, mēṟcolliyavāṟu* ē tōḻi cevilittāykkuaṟattoṭu niṟkum eṉpatu.

<P>`varivetirkoḷḷātu tamar avaṇ maṟuppiṉum' eṉpatu --talimakaṉtamar pārppār cāṉṟōri muṉṉiṭṭuaruṅkalaṅkaḷōṭum varitaṟku+ pukuvar; pukkaviṭattu, orukālikku maṟuppar piṟa, pōkā+ kumariyi uṭiyārpōla+katumeṉa nērntiṭār aṉṟu* ē! pariyam ciṟitu eṉṟāṉum,iḷiyaḷāl eṉṟāṉum, nāḷum puḷḷum tirutti vārīrō eṉṟāṉum//
<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P141">{{iṟi: Page 141}}</A>
<HR>
// aṅṅaṉam tamarmaṟuttār eṉpataṉi+ talimakaḷ kēṭṭañāṉṟum āṟṟāḷ ām. eṉṉi, `namperumāṉ oruvarkku orukuṟimuṭippiṉ allatu oruvari orukuṟi vēṇṭum^ taṉmiyaṉallaṉ; allātāṉ i+ kuṟi vēṇṭiyatu eṉkaṇ kiṭanta aruḷākātu* ē! ivaṟku iv= iḷivaravu ākkiṉēṉ pāviyēṉ!' eṉa~um, `emperumāṟku maṟuttār, iṉi maṟṟoruvāṟu* ākātu* ē!'eṉa ~um talimakaḷ vēṟupaṭum. av vēṟupāṭu tōḻikku+pulaṉ ām; pulaṉ āyiṉaviṭattu mēṟcolliyavāṟu* ē aṟattoṭuniṟkum eṉpatu.

<P>`avaṉ ūṟu añcum^ kālam āyiṉum' eṉpatu -- talimakaṉiravukkuṟi vantu oḻukāniṉṟa nilimikkaṇ `emperumāṉvarumvaḻi, eṇkum veṇkōṭṭiyāṉi ~um aravum urum um puli~um variyaramakaḷirum vāṉaramakaḷirum uṭittu, maṟṟumteyvaṅkaḷ vuvum vaṇṇattaṉa, ētam nikaḻvatu kollō!' eṉavēṟupaṭum. avvēṟupāṭu tōḻikku+ pulaṉ ām; pulaṉāyiṉaviṭattu mēṟcolliyavāṟu* ē aṟattoṭu niṟkum eṉpatu.

<P>`annāliṭattum' eṉpatu -- a+ collappaṭṭa nāṉku iṭattumeṉṟavāṟu;

<P>`mey nāṇ orīi' eṉpatu -- meykkaṇ niṉṟa nāṇ nīṅkieṉṟavāṟu; nāṇ uṇṭāyiṉaviṭattu+ tāy muṉ niṉṟu collāḷeṉpatu.

<P>`aṟattoṭu niṟṟal tōḻikku* um urittu* ē' eṉpatu --aṟam eṉpatu takkatu; takkataṉi+ colliniṟṟal tōḻikkumurittu eṉṟavāṟu; allatūum, peṇṭirkku aṟam eṉpatu kaṟpu,kaṟpiṉ taliniṟṟal eṉpatūum ām.

<P>iṉi+, `tōḻikkum urittu' eṉṟa ummiyāl, talimakaṭkumaṟattoṭunili urittu eṉpatu. aḵtu* āmāṟu: iyaṟki+puṇarcci puṇarntāṉum, pāṅkaṟkūṭṭamkūṭiyāṉum teruṇṭuvarinteytaluṟṟu+ tamariviṭum; viṭṭaviṭattu avarmaṟuppar, aḵtu ilakkaṇam ākalāṉ. aṅṅaṉammaṟuttaviṭattu+ talimakaḷ vēṟupaṭum. `emperumāṉmaṟukkappaṭṭamiyāṉ maṟṟoruvāṟāṅkollō!' eṉa+ kalaṅkivēṟupaṭum; vēṟupāṭu eytiṉapoḻutu* ē tōḻikku+ pulaṉ ām;pulaṉ āyiṉaviṭattu, `emperumāṭṭi, niṉakku iv vēṟupāṭueṟṟiṉāṉ āyiṟṟu?' eṉṉum. eṉṟaviṭattu, iḵtueṉakkuppaṭṭatu, iṉṉaviṭattu oru ñāṉṟu nī ~um āyam //
<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P142">{{iṟi: Page 142}}</A>
<HR>
// um taḻi ~um kaṇṇi ~um kōṭaṟku, eṉṉiṟ ciṟitunīṅkiṉāy āka, īṅku niṉṟēṉ oru maṇi+ cuṉi kaṇṭēṉ; a+maṇi+ cuṉi tāṉ āmpal ē kuvaḷi ~ē neytal ē tāmari ~ēeṉṟi+ pūkkaḷāl mayaṅki mētakkatu kaṇṭu, vēṭkiyāṉāṭuvāṉ iḻintēṉ; iḻukki+ kuṭṭam pukkēṉ; pukku+;"tōḻiyō!" eṉa, nī kēḷāy āyiṉāy; āka, oru tōṉṟal vantutōṉṟi eṉatu tuyar nīkkutaṟkāka+ taṉ ki nīṭṭiṉāṉ;nīṭṭa, yāṉ um malakkattāṉ niṉ kiyeṉa+ paṟṟiṉēṉ; paṟṟa, vāṅki+ kari mēl niṟīi nīṅkiṉāṉ; nī aṉṟu kavaluti ~eṉa+collēṉ āyiṉēṉ; nī ev= ellikkaṇ= um^ kiviṭātāy aññāṉṟukiviṭuvāy āyiṟṟu viti ~ākātu eṉiṟ piṟitu* oṉṟu* āvatukollō eṉa+ kalaṅki vēṟupaṭṭēṉ' eṉṟu tōḻikku+ talimakaḷaṟattoṭu niṟkum, piṉṉi+ toḻi cevilikku aṟattoṭuniṟkum, mēṟcoṉṉavāṟṟāṉ eṉpatu.

<P>aṅṅaṉam āyiṉ, tōḻi kāvaloṭu māṟukoḷḷātu* ō eṉiṉ,koḷḷātu, tōḻikku aṟattoṭu niṟkum ākalāṉ eṉpatu.kāvaloṭu māṟukoḷḷiṉum kāvaṟku* uṟṟappaṭṭēṉ eṉṟu tōḻiiṟantupaṭāmi+ kākkum viti eṉpatu. aḵtu* ē ~eṉiṉ,nikaḻnta oḻukkam maṟittu+ kaḷintupaṭittumoḻintamiyāṟ poyyurittavāṟu* ām piṟa eṉiṉ,poyyurikkappaṭṭatu* ākātu; eṉṉi, paḻi ~um pāvam umataṉāl vārāmiyiṉ.

<P>eṉṉi,

<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`poymmi ~um vāymi ~iṭatta puri tīrtta
<BR>	naṉmi payakkum eṉiṉ'.
<BR>		(([kuṟaḷ-292]))

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉṟār ākaliṉ kuṟṟam iṉṟu eṉpatu.

<P>aṟattoṭu niṟkum iṭaṅkaḷi+ peyar um muṟi ~umcolliṉa māttiri ~ē i+ cūttirattu+ poruḷ. aṟattoṭuniṟkum ilakkaṇam um, avaṟṟukku+ ceyyuḷ um mēl ēkāṭṭippōntām.

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P143">{{iṟi: Page 143}}</A>
<HR>
<H2>30</H2>
<P>	kāma mikka kaḻipaṭar kiḷavi ~um
<BR>	kāppu+ ciṟimikka kiyaṟu kiḷavi ~um
<BR>	āṟupārttu* uṟṟa acca+ kiḷavi ~um
<BR>	iraviṉum pakaliṉum nī varuka* eṉṟal um
<BR>	kiḻavōṉ taṉṉi vāral eṉṟal um
<BR>	taṉṉuḷ kiyāṟu* eytiṭu kiḷavi ~um
<BR>	aṉṉa marapiṉ piṟavum tokii+
<BR>	taṉṉi aḻinta kiḷavi ellām
<BR>	varital vēṭki+ poruḷa eṉpa.

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉpatu eṉ ^nutaliṟṟu* ō eṉiṉ, varivukaṭāvum ilakkaṇamellām tokuttu uṇarttutal nutaliṟṟu.

<P>mēlataṉōṭu iyipu eṉṉiyō eṉiṉ, mēlum^ kaḷavu nīkki+kaṟpāvatōr ilakkaṇam uṇarttiṉār; iv varivu* um aṉṉatu*ākalāṉ ataṉ piṉ= ē vikkappaṭṭatu.

<P>itaṉ poruḷ: kāmam mikka kaḻi paṭar kiḷavi ~um eṉpatu-- kāmam eṉpatu vēṭki, mikutal eṉpatu perukutal, kaḻieṉpatu ciṟattal, paṭar eṉpatu niṉittal, kiḷavi eṉpatucol, vēṭki mikku+ ciṟappa+ cintittu+ collum^ col= umeṉṟavāṟu; kāppu+ ciṟimikka kiyaṟu kiḷavi ~um eṉpatu-- kāppucciṟi mikaviṉāṟ kiyaṟṟu+ collum^ coṟkaḷ umeṉṟavāṟu; āṟupārttuṟṟa accakkiḷavi ~um eṉpatu -- avaṉvarum vaḻiyatu ētam^ cintittu āṟṟāḷ āy+ collum^ coṟkaḷum eṉṟavāṟu; iraviṉ um pakaliṉ um nī varuka eṉṟal umeṉpatu -- iraviṉkaṇ= um pakaliṉkaṇ= um nīyir vantuoḻukuvatu ākātō eṉa+ collum^ coṟkaḷ um eṉṟavāṟu;kiḻavōṉ ^taṉṉi vāral eṉṟal um eṉpatu -- talivaṉiiraviṉkaṇ= um pakaliṉkaṇ= um varavēṇṭā eṉṟu collum^coṟkaḷ um eṉṟavāṟu; taṉṉuḷ kiyāṟu eytiṭu kiḷavi ~umeṉpatu -- taṉṉuḷ+ kiyāṟṟiṉi ētilatu  oṉṟiṉmēliṭṭu+collum^ coṟkaḷ um eṉṟavāṟu; aṉṉa marapiṟ piṟavum tokiieṉpatu -- aṉṉa ilakkaṇatta piṟavum^ tokuttu eṉṟavāṟu,taṉṉi aḻinta kiḷavi ellām eṉpatu -- taṉ āṟṟāmiyāṟcollum^ col= ellām, //
<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P144">{{iṟi: Page 144}}</A>
<HR>
// eṉṟavāṟu; varital vēṭki+ poruḷa eṉpa eṉpatu --varital vēṭṭu+ collum^ col eṉṟavāṟu.

<H3>((kāmamikka kaḻipaṭarkiḷavi))</H3>

<P>iṉi+, `kāmamikka kaḻipaṭar kiḷavi' ~āmāṟu:pakaṟkuṟiyāṉum iravukkuṟiyāṉum talimakaṉ oḻukāniṉṟanilimikkaṇ orunāḷ orukāṟ kaṇṭu tarikkum^ taṉmittu*aṉṟu* ām vēṭki; eṉṉi, kāṇum poḻutiṟ kāṇāppoḻutuperitu* ākalāṉ. avvaki vēṭkiyaḷāy niṉṟu puṉṉikkāṉumaṉṉattiṟkāṉum kaṭaliṟkāṉum kaḻikkāṉum avvakipiṟavaṟṟiṟkāṉum taṉkaṭpoṟi taṇippaṉa ~āka+ cintittu+colluvatu* āyiṟṟu; ataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 213}}

<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`oṇtūvi nārāy niṉ cēval um nī ~um āy
<BR>	vaṇṭūtu pūṅkāṉal vikalum cēṟirāl
<BR>	peṇtūtu vantēm eṉavurittem kātalari+
<BR>	kaṇṭīr kaḻaṟiyakkāl kāṉal kaṭipavō'.

<P>{{C URAI}}
ivi kaṭalukku* -um nārikku* -um colliya ~eṉa+ koḷka.

<P>itaṉi+ talimakaṉ kēḷā varum ē ~eṉiṉ, `iṅṅaṉamvantu* oḻuka ivaḷ āṟṟāḷ ām' eṉṟu oruvakiyāṉ muṟpaṭṭu+piṟṟiñāṉṟu varivoṭu pukuvāṉ ām; tōḻi kēṭkum ē ~eṉiṉ,talimakaṉi muṉṉiṉṟu varivu kaṭāvuvāḷ ām; yār um^kēṭpār illi ~eṉiṉ, āṟṟutali+ payakkum. eṉṉi, mūṭivēvāniṉṟatōr kalatti mūytiṟantaviṭattu akattuniṉṟaveppam^ kuṟipaṭum; atu pōla, ivaṭkum ayarvuyirppu* ām,a+ coṟkaḷ puṟappaṭutalāṉ eṉpatu. i+ mūṉṟiṉuḷ oṉṟu*ākāmi ~illi ~eṉpatu. talimakaṉ kēṭpiṉ iṉṉatu* oṉṟu*ām, tōḻi kēṭpiṉ iṉṉatu* oṉṟu* ām, yār um^ kēṭpār illi~āyiṉ iṉṉatu* oṉṟu* ām eṉṟu oru payaṉ cintittu+ collumō eṉiṉ+, collāḷ; kuḻavi aḻutāṟpōla vēṭki mikutiyāṟcolliṉaviṭattu a+ payaṉ nikaḻum. kuḻavi aḻukiṉṟatu,`eṉakku+ pāl tammiṉ; nīr āṭṭumiṉ eṉṟaḻātu, tukkamvantatāka aḻum; aḻa, aṟivār payam eytuvippar eṉpatu.

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P145">{{iṟi: Page 145}}</A>
<HR>
<H3>((kāppu+ ciṟimikka kiyaṟukiḷavi))</H3>

<P>`kāppu+ ciṟimikka kiyaṟu kiḷavi ~um' eṉpatu,kāppu+ ciṟimikaviṉāṟ kiyaṟṟu+ colluñcol. kāpputtāṉiruvakiya, niṟikāval ciṟikāval eṉa; avaṟṟuḷ,niṟikāval eṉpatu niṟiyiṉ vēṟupāṭu puṟattārkku+pulaṉākāmi+ kāppāṭku ākātu muṟiyiṉ vēṭkiperuka+kāṇaluṟaviṉāṉ āṟṟāḷ āy+ collum; ataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 214}}

<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`puṉkaṇkūr māli+ pulampumeṉ kaṇṇēpōl
<BR>	tuṉpam uḻavāy tuyila+ peṟutiyāl
<BR>	iṉkaḷvāy neytālnī eytum kaṉaviṉuḷ
<BR>	vaṉkaṇṇār kāṉal varakkaṇṭu* aṟitiyō'
<BR>		(([cilap. kāṉal -- 33]))

<P>eṉa+ koḷka.

<P>ciṟikāval eṉpatu, tāytuñcāmi, nāytuñcāmi,ūrtuñcāmi, kāvalarkaṭukutal, nilavuveḷippaṭutal, kūkikuḻaṟal, kōḻikuraṟkāṭṭal eṉa ivi. avaṟṟuḷ,

<P>tāy tuñcāmikku+ ceyyuḷ:

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 215}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
iṉi, nāy tuñcāmikku+ ceyyuḷ:

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 216}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
iṉi, ūr tuñcāmikku+ ceyyuḷ:

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 217}}

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P146">{{iṟi: Page 146}}</A>
<HR>
<P>{{C URAI}}
iṉi+, kāvalar kaṭukutaṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 218}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
iṉi, nilavu veḷippaṭutaṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 219}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
iṉi+, ciṟikāval ellām vanta ceyyuḷ:

<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`irum piḻi makāar iv aḻuṅkal mūtūr
<BR>	viḻavu* iṉṟu* āyiṉum^ tuñcātu* ākum
<BR>	mallal āvaṇam maṟuku* uṭaṉ maṭiyiṉ
<BR>	val= uri+ kaṭum^ col aṉṉi tuñcāḷ
<BR>	piṇi koḷ arum^ ciṟi aṉṉi tuñciṉ
<BR>	tuñcā+ kaṇṇar kāvalar kaṭukuvar
<BR>	ilaṅkuvēl iḷiyar tuñciṉ vi ~eyiṟṟu
<BR>	valam^ curi+ tōki ñāḷi makiḻum
<BR>	ara vāy ñamali kuriyātu maṭiyiṉ
<BR>	pakal uru ~uṟaḻa nilavu kāṉṟu vicumpiṉ
<BR>	akalvāy maṇṭilam niṉṟu viriyum= ē
<BR>	tiṅkaḷ kal cērpu kaṉi ~iruḷ maṭiyiṉ
<BR>	il= eli valci valvāy+ kūki
<BR>	kaḻutu vaḻaṅku^ yāmattu* aḻitaka+ kuḻaṟum
<BR>	vaḷikaṇ cēval vāḷātu maṭiyiṉ
<BR>	maṉi+ ceṟi kōḻi māṇ kural iyampum
<BR>	ellām maṭinta kālattu* orunāḷ
<BR>	nillā neñcattu* avar vāralar ē
<BR>	ataṉāl, aripey puṭṭil āra+ pari ciṟantu
<BR>	āti pōkiya pāypari naṉ mā
<BR>	nocci vēli+ tittaṉ uṟanti+
<BR>	kal mutir puṟaṅkāṭṭu* aṉṉa
<BR>	pal muṭṭiṉṟāl tōḻi nam^ kaḷavu* ē'.
<BR>		(([akam-122]))

<H3>((āṟu pārttuṟṟa accakkiḷavi))</H3>

<P>{{C URAI}}
iṉi, `āṟupārttuṟṟa accakkiḷavi ~um' eṉpatu: āṟu eṉpatuvaḻi, pārttuṟutal eṉpatu parivuṟutal, accam //
<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P147">{{iṟi: Page 147}}</A>
<HR>
// eṉpatu kuṟippu* iṉṟi ~ē tōṉṟum naṭukkam; kiḷavieṉpatu col; aḵtu* āmāṟu, talimakaṉ iravukkuṟivantuoḻukā niṉṟa nilimikkaṇ, emperumāṉ varumvaḻi iṟappavumiṉṉātu, nīruṭittu+ kalluṭittu muḷḷuṭittu ēṟṟuṭittuiḻivuṭittu eṉa+ kavaṟal; iḵtu* ām āṟupārttuṟṟaaccakkiḷavi ~eṉpa oru tiṟattār; avaraṟiyār, iḵtuāṟupārttuṟṟa kiḷavi ~ē. iṉi, accakkiḷavi ~eṉpatu,kaḷḷar uṭittu, puli ~uṭittu, eṇkuṭittu,veṇkōṭṭiyāṉi ~uṭittu, urum uṭittu, pāntaḷ uṭittueṉa+ kavalum^ kavaṟciyāṉ+ colluvatu. avaṟṟuḷ,

<P>āṟu pārttuṟṟataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 220}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
itu kēṭṭa talimakaṉ varivāṉ ām.

<P>iṉi, accakkiḷavikku+ ceyyuḷ:

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 221}}

<P><P>{{S 222}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
iṉṉum avaṟṟiṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 223}}

<P><P>{{S 224}}

<P><P>{{S 225}}

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P148">{{iṟi: Page 148}}</A>
<HR>
<P>{{S 226}}

<P><P>{{S 227}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
ivi tōḻikku uriyaṉa.

<P>iṉi+, talimakaṭku uriyaṉa varumāṟu:

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 228}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
ivvaki colliṉaviṭattu+ talimakaṉ kēṭpāṉ āyiṉ varivāṉām; tōḻi kēṭpiṉ varivu kaṭāvuvāḷ ām; yārum^ kēṭpārilli ~āyiṉ tāṉ ē colli āṟṟuvāḷ ām. iḵtu iravukkuṟi+kaṇṇatu* ē.

<H3>((iraviṉum pakaliṉum nīvarukeṉṟal))</H3>

<P>iṉi, `iraviṉ um pakaliṉ um nī varuka* eṉṟal um'eṉpatu: pakaṟkuṟi ~āṉum iravukkuṟi ~āṉum vantoḻukāniṉṟatalimakaṉi iravu* um pakal um vā ~eṉṟu collutal;ataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 229}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
itu kēṭṭu, `ivvaki yāṉ vantoḻuka+ poṟātu pōlum ivvakicolvāḷ āyiṟṟu' eṉa varintu pukuvāṉ ām eṉpatu.

<P>iṉi, orucār āciriyar iraviṉumpakaliṉum nī varukaeṉṟataṉi iravuvaruvāṉi+ pakalvarukeṉṟal um,pakalvaruvāṉi iravuvarukeṉṟal um eṉṟavāṟu eṉpa.avaṟṟukku+ ceyyuḷ vēṟu kāṭṭupa. avaṟṟuḷ iravuvaruvāṉi+pakal varukeṉṟataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P149">{{iṟi: Page 149}}</A>
<HR>
<H3>((pakalvarukeṉṟal))</H3>

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 230}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉpatu kēṭṭu, yāṉ iravu vantoḻuka+ poṟāḷāy+ pakalvammiṉ eṉkiṉṟatu eṉakkaruti varintu pukuvāṉ ām.

<P>iṉi+ pakalvaruvāṉi iravuvarukeṉṟaṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<H3>((iravuvarukeṉṟal))</H3>

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 231}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉa, itu colla+ pakal varuvēṉi iravu varukeṉṟatu iv=oḻukkam poṟāmiyiṉām eṉa varintu pukuvāṉ ām.

<H3>((kiḻavōṉtaṉṉi vāral eṉṟal))</H3>

<P>iṉi, `kiḻavōṉtaṉṉi vāral eṉṟal um' eṉpatu.talimakaṉi iraviṉkaṇṇum pakaliṉkaṇṇum vāral eṉṟucollutal ; ataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<H3>((iravum pakal um vāral eṉṟal))</H3>

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 232}}

<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`kaṟaṅku veḷ= aruvi piṟaṅku mali+ kavāaṉ
<BR>	tēm^ kamaḻ iṇara vēṅki cūṭi+
<BR>	toṇṭaka+ paṟi+ cīr+ peṇṭiroṭu tokii
<BR>	maṟuku vāṅkum^ ciṟukuṭi+ pākkattu
<BR>	iyal muruku* oppiṉi vaya nāy piṟpaṭa+
<BR>	pakal variṟ kuvi añcutum ikal ku
<BR>	irum piṭi kaṉṟoṭu virii+ kaya vāy+
<BR>	perum^ ki yāṉi kōṭ piḻittu* irīi
<BR>	aṭu puli vaḻaṅkum ār iruḷ naṭu nāḷ
<BR>	taṉiyi varutal ataṉiṉum añcutum
<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P150">{{iṟi: Page 150}}</A>
<HR>
<BR>	eṉ= ākuvaḷ kol tāṉ ē pal% ^nāḷ+
<BR>	puṇar kuṟi ceyta pularkural eṉal
<BR>	kiḷi kaṭi pāṭal um oḻintaṉaḷ
<BR>	aḷiyaḷ tāṉ* ^niṉ aḷi ~alatu* ilaḷ ē'.
<BR>		(([akam-118]))

<P>{{C URAI}}
oṉṟu maṟuppiṉ oṉṟiṉkaṇ= ē niṟkum^ kollō eṉṟu, iraṇṭu*um maṟuttu variviṉkaṇ= ē paṭuttavāṟu eṉa+ koḷka.

<H3>((taṉṉuḷ kiyāṟu eytiṭukiḷavi))</H3>

<P>`taṉṉuḷ kiyāṟu eytiṭu kiḷavi ~um' eṉpatu, taṉṉuḷ+kiyāṟṟiṉi ētilatu oṉṟiṉmēliṭṭu+ collutal; ataṟku+ceyyuḷ:

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 233}}

<P><P>{{S 234}}

<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`paṟi vāy oli ~ōtam pantar ukaḷum
<BR>	tuṟi cēr ciṟukuṭiyār tuñciṉum tuñcāy
<BR>	niṟiyiṉ maruḷ māli empōla nītta
<BR>	tuṟivaṉ uṭiyi ~ō nī vāḻi vīrāy'.

<P>{{C URAI}}
`eṉpōl iraviṉ ellām^ tuyilāy nī ~um niṉ kātalar māṭṭueṉpōl aṟivu* iḻantāy ō?' eṉṉum; eṉṟatu tali makaṉkēṭpiṉ varivāṉ ām; tōḻi kēṭpiṉ varikaṭāvuvāḷ ām; yārum^ kēṭpār illi ~āyiṉ tāṉ ē colli āṟṟuvāḷ ām.

<P>`aṉṉa marapiṉ+ piṟa ~um^ toki i+ taṉṉi aḻintakiḷavi ellām' eṉpatu, aṉṉa marapiṉ+ piṟa ~um^ taṉatuāṟṟāmiyāṉ+ collum^ col ellām, eṉṟavāṟu.

<P>`varital vēṭki+ poruḷa eṉpa' eṉpatu, varitalvēṭpu* um, varital vēṭṭu+ collum^ coṟkaḷ um eṉṟavāṟu;varital vēṭpu+ talimakaḷ collum col= ellām;talimakaṉi+ tōḻi collum^ col= ellām varital vēṭṭu+collum^ coṟkaḷ eṉṟavāṟu.

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P151">{{iṟi: Page 151}}</A>
<HR>
`aṉṉamarapiṟ piṟavum' eṉṟataṉāṟ pakaṟkuṟikkaṇṇumiravukkuṟikkaṇ= um vantu oḻukum^ talimakaṟku+talimakaḷum tōḻi ~um āṟṟāttaṉmiyarāy varivu payappa+collum^ col= ellām^ koḷka. a+ kiḷavi pala; avaṟṟuḷ+cila varumāṟu:

<H3>((nilikaṇṭurittal))</H3>

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 235}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉpatu, `iravukkuṟiyiṭattu vantu niṉṟāl, kaṇṭār nummimurukavēḷ eṉṟu karutātu, meymmi uṇarpa ~āyiṉ, ivaḷperunāṇiṉaḷ ākaliṉ iṟantupaṭum ē!' eṉṉum; atu kēṭṭu+talimakaṉ, `periyatōr iḻukkuṭittāka oḻukiṉēṉkāṇ' eṉa,aṉṟu oruvakiyāṉ muṟpaṭṭu+ piṟṟiñāṉṟu varivāṉ ām.

<P>iṉṉum, `aṉṉamarapiṟ piṟavum' eṉṟataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<H3>((paṭittu moḻikiḷavi))</H3>

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 236}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉpatu iravukkuṟiyiṉkaṇ talimakaṉ ciṟippuṟattāṉāvatu* aṟintu talimakaṭku+ tōḻi paṭittu moḻintucollaliyatu. eṅṅaṉam ō ~eṉiṉ, `nerunal, "eṉṉi nīrviḷiyāṭum^ kāṉaliṭattu oru tēr vantu pōyiṟṟu?" eṉamuṉintu eṉṉi mukanōkki+ pōyiṉāḷ aṉṉi, iṉṉatu karuti~eṉpatu aṟiyēṉ' eṉṉum; eṉa, `okkum, yāṉ vantuoḻukukiṉṟa oḻukkam puṟattārkku+ pulaṉ āyiṟṟu+ pōlum'eṉa+ piṟṟi ñāṉṟu* ē varintu pukuvāṉ ām.

<P>iṉṉum, `aṉṉamarapiṟ piṟavum' eṉṟataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 237}}

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P152">{{iṟi: Page 152}}</A>
<HR>
<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉpatu, pakaṟkuṟivantu oḻukum^ talimakaṟku+ tōḻipaṭittu moḻintu varivu kaṭāyatu. avvakittāṟkaḷiṟṟōṭu orupiṭi vēṅki+ kīḻ niṉṟapaṭi kaṇṭu, `itupōla nam perumāṉ um namakku vaḻipaṭa muṭiyum^ kollō'eṉṟāḷ eṉpatu.

<P>iṉṉum, `aṉṉa marapiṟ piṟavum' eṉṟataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 238}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
itu ~um a+ poruṭku ēṟpa+ collikkoḷka.

<P>aḵtu* ē ~eṉiṉ, i+ cūttirattuḷ+ collappaṭṭaṉa ellāmtalimakaṭku* ē ~uriyaṉa ~um, tōḻikku* ē ~uriyaṉa ~um,talimakaṭku* um tōḻikku* um uriyaṉa ~um eṉa mūṉṟuvakippaṭum:

<P>kāma mikka kaḻi paṭar kiḷavi ~um, taṉṉuḷ+ kiyāṟu*eytiṭu kiḷavi ~um ellām talimakaṭku* ē uriya.

<P>iraviṉ um pakaliṉ um nī varuka eṉṟal um, kiḻavōṉ^taṉṉi vāral eṉṟal um iv= iraṇṭu* um tōḻikku* ē uriya.

<P>āṟupārttuṟṟa acca+ kiḷavi ~um, kāppu+ ciṟi mikkakiyaṟu kiḷavi ~um iruvarukku* um uriya.

<P>urimiyāl tammi ~aḻinta kiḷavi ~ellām eṉṟupaṉmiyāṟ collātu orumiyāṟ colliyatu eṟṟiṟku* ō eṉiṉ,tōḻi talimakaḷ eṉa iruvari ~um vēṟupaṭuttu+ karutātuoruvar āka ~ē karutal+ poruṭṭāka orumiyāṉ+ puṇarttāreṉpatu.

<H2>31</H2>
<P>	āṟu* iṉṉāmi ~um ūṟum accam um
<BR>	taṉṉi aḻital um kiḻavōṟku* illi.

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉpatu eṉ ^nutaliṟṟu* ō eṉiṉ, kaḷavukālattu+talimakaṉatu ilakkaṇam uṇarttutal nutaliṟṟu. mēṟcūttirattōṭu iyipu eṉṉi ~ō ~eṉiṉ, mēṟcūttirattuḷāṟupārttuṟṟa accakkiḷavi eṉṟāṟku+, talimakaṉ kaṇṇumāṟupārttuṟavu uṇṭu* eṉṟu karutuvāṉ āyiṟ karutaṟkaeṉṟaṟku+ collappaṭṭatu.

<P>itaṉ poruḷ: āṟu iṉṉāmi ~um eṉpatu -- āṟu eṉiṉumvaḻi ~eṉiṉum oru poruṭkiḷavi, varumvaḻi ēṟṟu* uṭittuiḻivu* uṭittu iḻukku* uṭittu kal= uṭittu //
<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P153">{{iṟi: Page 153}}</A>
<HR>
// muḷ= uṭittu eṉṟal; ūṟu eṉpatu -- iṭiyūṟu,puliyāṉum yāṉiyāṉum^ cūraramakaḷirāṉum kaḷḷarāṉumeṇkāṉum iṭiyūṟu* uṭittu eṉṟal; accam eṉpatu --añcappaṭuvaṉa kaṇṭaviṭattu maṉakkuṟippiṉṟi ~ē añcuvatu,accam um ivaṉkaṇ illi ~eṉṟavāṟu; taṉṉiyaḻital umeṉpatu -- taṉkaṇ oru tuṉpam vantaviṭattu eṉakkākātatōroḻukkam eṭuttukkoṇṭēṉ eṉa+ taṉṉi neñciṉāl nōtal umeṉṟavāṟu; kiḻavōṟku illi ~eṉpatu -- iṉiyaṉatalimakaṟku illi eṉṟavāṟu.

<P>aḵtu* ē ~eṉiṉ, ivaṟku aviyuḷavāyvittu niṉiyāmiyiṉilli ~ō? illi ~āy ē illi ~ō eṉiṉ, uḷa ~ē ~eṉiṉniṉiyāṉ āyiṉum vantu nikaḻum. ulakattu uyir vāḻcātikaḷ ellām tam cākkāṭu niṉittu+ celkiṉṟa ~uḷa ~ē?illi ~aṉṟu* ē; illi ~eṉiṉum avi vantu* ēnikaḻntuviṭum. atu pōla ivaṉ niṉiyāṉ āyiṉum uḷa ~āyiṉnikaḻa vēṇṭum; iṉi, illi ~āy ē ~illi ~eṉiṉ, illataṉiilli ~eṉa vēṇṭuvatu* illi; eṉṉi, ākāya+ pū illi eṉavēṇṭā, atu pōla eṉpatu; eṉṟārkku illataṉi ~ē illi~eṉṟār, ivaṉ ulakattu+ talimakaṉallaṉ, pulavarālnāṭṭappaṭṭa talimakaṉ eṉpataṉi yāppuṟuttaṟkuulakattu+ talimakaṉ āyiṉ ivi ~ellām illāmi ~illi~eṉpatu. kiḻavōṟku* illi ~eṉa ~ē kiḻattikku* umtōḻikku* um avi ~uḷa eṉpatu peṟṟām. avar āṟu iṉṉātueṉṟum iṭiyūṟukaḷ uḷa eṉṟum avaṟṟiṟku añcutal um,namperumāṉ taṉakku+ takāta iḷivaravu* oḻukkamoḻukutaṟku+ kāraṇam āyiṉēm ākātu* ē ~eṉṟu tammi~aḻital um uṭiyar eṉṟavāṟu.

<P>aḵtu* ē ~eṉiṉ, vayiram uṭiyāṉ oruvaṉ, vayiram uḷuveṟiyum eṉṟu añcāṉ, atu pōla ivarum añcātu viṭaṟ pālārpiṟa, avaṟku aviyiṉmiyāl eṉiṉ, atu ~aṉṟu; peṇmi~eṉpatu oruporuḷi+ paṭṭāṅku aṟiyāmi ~ākalāṉ, aviavaṟku illiyeṉiṉum uḷavāka+ karutupa eṉpatu. aḵtu* ē~eṉiṉ, mēl ivaṉi+ poruviṟantāṉ eṉṟu pōtarappaṭṭatu*aṉṟu* ē? paṭṭamiyāṉ accam um taṉṉi ~aḻital umilliyeṉa+ koḷḷāmō? maṉattāṉ varum nōy ellām uṇarvu*iṉmiyāṉ varum eṉpatu kaṭā; ataṟku viṭi, ivaṉ ñāṉatti~um oḻukkatti ~um viti iḻukkiṉamiyāṟ ciṟṟaṟiviṉārtaṉmi uṇmiyāṉ uḷa kollō eṉṟu karutiṉ avi ~illi~eṉpatu pōtara+ collappaṭṭatu.

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P154">{{iṟi: Page 154}}</A>
<HR>
<H2>32</H2>
<P>	kaḷaviṉuḷ tavircci variviṉ nīṭṭam
<BR>	tiṅkaḷ iraṇṭiṉ akameṉa moḻipa.

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉpatu eṉ ^nutaliṟṟu* ō eṉiṉ, kaḷaviṉuḷ taṅki oḻukumoḻukkam ittuṇi+ kālam allatu illi ~eṉṟu variyaṟuttuuṇarttutal nutaliṟṟu.

<P>itaṉ poruḷ: kaḷaviṉuḷ tavircci eṉpatu -- kaḷaviṉuḷtaṅkutal eṉṟavāṟu; variviṉ nīṭṭam eṉpatu --varinteytum^ tuṇi nīṭṭikkum^ kālam eṉṟavāṟu; tiṅkaḷiraṇṭiṉ akam eṉa moḻipa eṉpatu -- iraṇṭu tiṅkaḷakameṉa+ koḷka eṉṟavāṟu.

<P>ivvāṟṟāṉ um iḵtu ulakattu iyalpu* aṉṟu eṉpatu peṟṟām,ulakattu* oḻukkattiṟku+ kālavariyaṟi iṉmiyāṉ eṉpatu.iyaṟkippuṇarcci puṇarntaviṭattu+ pirāyam um īṅku* ēurikkappaṭṭatu* ām. patiṉōr āṇṭu* um pattu+ tiṅkaḷ umpukka talimakaḷōṭu* um, patiṉi ~āṇṭu* um pattu+tiṅkaḷ um pukka talimakaṉi+ pōlum puṇartal vēṇṭiṟṟu*eṉpatu peṟṟām. ivaḷ um iru tiṅkaḷ kaḷavu* oḻukku*oḻuka+ paṉṉīrāṭṭi+ pirāyattāḷ ām. atu makkaṭpēṟṟukku+kālam; kaḷavu* oḻukkattiṟku+ poruntātu* eṉavilakkappaṭṭatu* ām āciriyarāṉ eṉpatu. ivaṉ um irutiṅkaḷ kaḷavu* oḻukku oḻuka+ patiṉāṟāṭṭi+ pirāyattāṉām. aḵtu āṇmi nilipeṟum^ kālam ākalāṟ kaḷavu*oḻukkiṟku vilakkappaṭṭatu eṉpatu. aḵtu* ē ~eṉiṉ irutiṅkaḷ eṉṉātu akam eṉṟatu eṟṟiṟku* ō eṉiṉ, iru tiṅkaḷuḷaintāṉ um āṟāṉ um nāḷ uḷavāka+ kaḷavu* oḻukkuoḻintuniṉṟu, varintu pukuvataṉōṭu* um maṟuppataṉōṭu*um attuṇi nāḷum pukku niṟintu niṉṟapiṉṉi atu paṭiṉmikuvāṉ pukum eṉpatu. aḵtu* ē ~eṉiṉ, iruvarkku* ummūppu+ piṇi cākkāṭu* um illi ~eṉṟu mēl+ colliyataṉōṭumāṟukoṇṭu kāṭṭiṟṟu* ām, atu paṭa urittamiyiṉ eṉpatu.eṅṅaṉam ō eṉiṉ, iru tiṅkaḷ+ puka+ paṉṉīrāṭṭi+pirāyattāḷ ē ~āyakkāl piṉṉi+ patiṉ mūvāṭṭi+pirāyattāḷ āy ivvaki nūṟṟirupatu pukku+ talimaṭiyavēṇṭum eṉpatu; ivaṟku* um ammuṟi ~ē koḷka eṉpatu;mūppu+ piṇi uḷvaḻaḻi+ cākkāṭu* uṇmiyāṉ eṉpatu kaṭā.ataṟku viṭi eṅṅaṉam ō eṉiṉ, iru tiṅkaḷ+ puka ivaḷ umpaṉṉīrāṭṭi+ pirāyattāḷ āy ivaṉ um //
<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P155">{{iṟi: Page 155}}</A>
<HR>
// patiṉāṟāṭṭi+ pirāyattāṉ āy+ celvatu* allatu,maṟṟiyaṉa nikaḻā; ulakiṉōṭu ittuṇi māttiri ~ē ~ottu,maṟṟi vikaṟpam ellām ovvā eṉa+ koḷka. ottu ovvātu* āyaṉṟu* ē celkiṉṟatu eṉpatu. aḵtu* ē ~eṉiṉ,

<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`aṇṇāntu* ēntiya vaṉamuli taḷariṉum
<BR>	poṉṉēr mēṉi maṇiyil tāḻnta
<BR>	nal% ^neṭum^ kūntal nariyoṭu muṭippiṉum
<BR>	nīttal ōmpumati pū+ kēḻ ūra'.
<BR>		(([naṟṟiṇi-10]))

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉa ilakkiyam varuvaṉa uḷavālō ~eṉiṉ, aḵtu* illi maṉ,aḵtu eytiṭiṉum eṉṟavāṟu.

<P>iṉi, oru tiṟattār, `tiṅkaḷ iraṇṭiṉakam' eṉpataṉi+collumāṟu:

<P>piṟittiṅkaḷ matittiṅkaḷ eṉa iraṇṭu; avaṟṟuḷ+piṟittiṅkaḷ muṉ= oḷi ~āy+ piṉ= iruḷ ām; matittiṅkaḷpiṉ= oḷiyāy muṉ= iruḷ ām; av= iraṇṭu* um^ cantittuniṉṟairuṭkālattāka eṉṟavāṟu atu poruntātu; eṉṉō kāraṇameṉiṉ, iravukkuṟikku* ē colliṉamiyāṉ. allatūumkālavariyaṟi ~iṉṟi ~ē eññāṉṟum iruḷ+ ^tiṅkaṭkaṇ= ēkaḷavu* oḻukkam vēṇṭappaṭṭatu* ām eṉpatu.

<P>iṉi, oru cārār, `tiṅkaḷ iraṇṭiṉ akam' eṉpataṉi orutiṅkaḷi iraṇṭu kūṟiṭṭa oru kūṟu eṉṟu patiṉintunāḷāka+ collupa. atu ~um poruntāmi aṟintukoḷka.

<H2>33</H2>
<P>	kaḷaviṉuḷ tavircci kiḻavōṟku* illi.

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉpatu eṉ ^nutaliṟṟu* ō eṉiṉ, kaḷavukālattu+talimakaṉatu ilakkaṇam uṇarttutal nutaliṟṟu.

<P>itaṉ poruḷ: kaḷaviṉuḷ tavircci kiḻavōṟku illieṉpatu -- kaḷavukālattu+ talimakaṉ kāraṇamākaiṭiyiṭum iṭiyīṭu illi eṉṟavāṟu.

<P>`talimakaṟku* illi' eṉa ~ē, aruttāpattiyāṉtalimakaḷ kāraṇamāka uṇṭu eṉpatu.

<P>iṉṉum, `kaḷaviṉuḷ tavircci kiḻavōṟku* illi'eṉpataṉāṉ ē kaṟpiṉuḷ talimakaḷ kāraṇamāka iṭiyīṭu*illi ~eṉṟām. eṉṉi, ivaṉ oru ñāṉṟu orukāl a+kuṟiyiṭattu //
<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P156">{{iṟi: Page 156}}</A>
<HR>
// vantu peyarum^ talimakaḷi+ cārnta iṭiyūṟukaḷeytāṉ ām eṉpatu.

<P>iṉi, āṇmimikka talimakaṉ pirivu vēṇṭuvatu* allatutalimakaḷ vēṇṭāḷ kaṟpiṉakattu eṉṟavāṟu. itu collavēṇṭā; eṉṉōkāraṇam eṉiṉ,

<P>	`kaḷaviṉuḷ tavircci kāppumikiṉ urittu* ē
<BR>	variviṭi vitta kāli āṉa'.
<BR>		(([iṟiyaṉār-16]))

<P>eṉa ~um,

<P>	`alla kuṟi+ paṭutal um avvayiṉ urittu* ē
<BR>	avaṉ varavu* aṟiyum^ kuṟippiṉ āṉa'.
<BR>		(([iṟiyaṉār-17]))

<P>eṉa ~um ivvakiyāṉ iṭiyīṭu talimakaḷi+cārntuḻiyavākalāṟ peṟappaṭṭatu eṉpatu. iṉi, ōtal kāvalpaki taṇiviṉi eṉa ivi talimakaṉiyalpātalāṟ kaṟpiṉuḷtalimakaṉ iṭiyīṭākal um peṟappaṭṭatu īṅkuurikkavēṇṭā eṉpatu. avvaki ilēciṉāṟ peṟappaṭum.ataṉi ~ē māṇākkaṉ iṉitu* uṇaral vēṇṭi eṭuttōtiṉāreṉpatu.

<P>allatu, oru tiṟattār, kaḷaviṉakattu+ talimakaḷuḻi+taṅki+ piṟṟiñāṉṟu pōtal talimakaṟku illi eṉṟavāṟueṉpa; atu poruntātu. vantu peyarvatu* allatu nīṭṭikkiliṭiyīṭu* ām, aḵtu uṇarappaṭum ākalāṉ eṉpatu. maṟṟueṉṉō eṉiṉ, kaḷaviṉuḷ tavirtal eṉpatu tamiyaṉā kaṟṟaṉmi~oḻital eṉṟavāṟu. nōytavirntatu veppu+ tavirntatu eṉpa,oḻintatu eṉpār.

<P>iṉi+, `kiḻavōṟku* illi' eṉpatu, talimakaṟku illieṉṟavāṟu eṉa ~ē, av= iru tiṅkaḷ kāṟum^ teruḷātu* ēvantu* oḻukum talimakaṉ; talimakaḷ āyiṉ avviṭattuaṉṟu teruḷāḷ āyiṉ piṟṟi ñāṉṟu uṇarum eṉpatu āyiṉ, ivaṉākātu* ē teruḷaṟpālāṉ, peruñāṉattaṉ ākalāṉ, ivaḷ ākātu*ē teruḷātu viṭaṟpālāḷ avaṉtuṇi+ pēraṟiviṉaḷ aṉmiyāṉeṉiṉ, atu ~aṉṟu. avaṉkaṇiṉṟa tamiyaṉātal+ ^taṉmiyivilakkuvatu illi; iṉmiyāṉ, appeṟṟi cuṭṭappaṭṭatu.ivaḷmāṭṭu ataṉi vilakkuvatu* uṇṭu* aṉṟu* ē, ivaṉatuiḷivaraviṟku* um varuttattiṟku* um kavaṉṟa kavaṟci~eṉpatu. ataṉāṉ ivaṉ teruḷāmikku* um ivaḷ teruṭaṟku*um kāraṇam itu eṉpatu.

<P><B>((kaḷaviyal muṟṟum.))</B>

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P157">{{iṟi: Page 157}}</A>
<HR>

<H1>((2. kaṟpu))</H1>

<H2>34</H2>
<P>	kaṟpiṉuḷ tuṟavu* ē kaṭivarivu* iṉṟu* ē.

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉpatu eṉ ^nutaliṟṟu* ō eṉiṉ, iṅkuniṉṟum^ kaṟpiṉatuilakkaṇam uṇarttutal nutali ~eṭuttukkoḷḷappaṭṭatu.

<P>itaṉ poruḷ: kaṟpiṉuḷ tuṟavu* ē eṉpatu -- kaṟpiṉakattunīṅkum nīkkam eṉṟavāṟu. tuṟavu eṉiṉum, nīkkam eṉiṉum,pirivu eṉiṉum, akaṟci eṉiṉum okkum; kaṭivarivu iṉṟu* ēeṉpatu -- kaṭintu variyappaṭātu āciriyarkaḷāleṉṟavāṟu.

<P>aḵtu* ē ~eṉiṉ, `kaṟpiṉuḷ tuṟavu* ē kaṭital iṉṟu* ē'eṉa ~um, varital iṉṟu* ē' eṉa ~um collātu, `kaṟpiṉuḷtuṟavu* ē kaṭivarivu* iṉṟē' eṉṟatu eṟṟiṟkō eṉiṉ,āciriyarkaḷāl vilakkavumpaṭātu, ittuṇikkālam eṉṟuvariyaṟukkavum paṭātu eṉṟavāṟu. eṉa ~ē, kaḷaviṉakattu+piriyum pirivu orukāl allatu illi ~eṉṟavāṟu.kaḷaviṉakattu+ pakaṟkuṟi nilimikkaṇṇumiravukkuṟinilimikkaṇṇum vantu piriyum ākalāṉ atu ~umpalkālum nikaḻtal uṭittu+ piṟa eṉiṉ, avi ~ellāmāciriyarāṉ+ pirivu* eṉṟu vēṇṭappaṭā, oru karumam*nōkki+ peyarntaṉa aṉmiyiṉ. allatūum, avi pēyāṉumvariyaṟivu uṭittu* ākalāṉ eṉpatu.

<H2>35</H2>
<P>	ōtal kāval pakitaṇi viṉi ~ē
<BR>	vēntarkkuṟṟuḻi poruṭpiṇi paratti ~eṉṟu
<BR>	āṅka āṟu* ē avvayiṉ+ pirivu* ē.

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉpatu eṉ ^nutaliṟṟu* ō eṉiṉ, mēṟ kaṟpukkālattu+ pirivupala eṉṟār, aviyiṟṟi+ peyarum muṟi ~um toki ~umuṇarttutal nutuliṟṟu.

<P>itaṉ poruḷ: ōtal eṉpatu -- kalvi kāraṇattu+ piriyumpirivu eṉṟavāṟu; kāval eṉpatu -- nāṭu kāttaṟku+ piriyumpirivu eṉṟavāṟu; pakitaṇiviṉi eṉpatu -- //
<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P158">{{iṟi: Page 158}}</A>
<HR>
// iruvar aracar tammiṟ porupa eṉṟaviṭattu avari+cantu ceyvittaṟku+ piriyum pirivu eṉṟavāṟu; vēntarkkuuṟṟuḻi eṉpatu -- vēntar eṉpār aracar, aracarkkuṟṟuḻi+piriyum pirivu eṉṟavāṟu; poruṭpiṇi eṉpatu -- poruṭku+piriyum pirivu eṉṟavāṟu, paratti eṉpatu -- puṟappeṇṭirmāṭṭu+ piriyum pirivu eṉṟavāṟu; param eṉpatu puṟam,aḵtu āriyaccol, eṉṟu eṉpatu, eṇṇutaṟku uriyatōrvāypāṭu, āṅku eṉpatu, aciccol; āṟu eṉpatu, avaṟṟatutoki, avvayiṉ eṉpatu -- avviṭattu eṉṟavāṟu, pirivueṉpatu -- nīkkam eṉṟavāṟu,

<P>ē eṉpatu, īṟṟaci ēkāram.

<P>peyar, collappaṭṭa peyar; muṟi, kiṭanta muṟi, toki,āṟu eṉakkoḷka.

<P>iṉi, ōtaṟku+ piriyum pirivu muṉ vikkappaṭṭatu.taliyāṉa pirivākalāṉum uyarntōrkku urittākalāṉumeṉpatu. parattiyiṟpirivu piṉ vikkappaṭṭatu, kāmam piṉvittu eṇṇappaṭum ākalāṉ eṉpatu.

<P>aḵtu* ē ~eṉiṉ, ivar muṉ poruviṟantār eṉpataṉoṭumāṟukoṇṭatu iccūttiram; eṉṉiyō eṉiṉ, talimakaḷieytiyiruntu* ē ivaṉ ōtuvāṉ pirivāṉ eṉiṉ, muṉ ñāṉam ilaṉām; ilaṉ āka ~ē, ñāṉattiṉ vaḻiyatu oḻukkam ākalāṉ um,oḻukkattiṉ vaḻittu+ talikkulam ākalāṉ um ivi ~ellām^kuṟivupaṭṭāṉ ām eṉpatu.

<P>iṉi+, kāval eṉpatu, ivaṉ nāṭṭi+ piṟar pukuntualippatum koḷvatum ceyya, avari nīkkutaṟku nīṅkumēeṉiṉ, āṇmiyiṟ kuṟipaṭṭāṉ ām eṉpatu.

<P>iṉi+, pakitaṇiviṉi ~eṉpatu, cantuceyvittaṟku+piriyum ē ~eṉiṉ, tūtuvaṉ āyiṉāṉ ām; tūtuvar āvārpiṟarkku+ paṇiceytu vāḻvār āvar; avaratu poruviṟappueṉṉi ~ō eṉpatu.

<P>iṉi, vēntaṟkuṟṟuḻi+ piriyum ē ~eṉiṉ, karumam^ ceyvāṉām; karumam^ ceyvatu eṉpatu, iṟappa ~um iṉi vantatōroḻukkam; piṟar kuṟippu* aṉṟi+ taṉkuṟippu illi~eṉappaṭum; ākaliṉ, avaratu poruviṟappu eṉṉi ~ōeṉpatu.

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P159">{{iṟi: Page 159}}</A>
<HR>
iṉi+, poruḷvayiṟ piriyum ē ~eṉiṉ, muṉṉar+ poruḷ ilaṉāyiṉāṉ ām; āka ~ē, eḷḷunar+ paṇittal um irantōrkku*ītal um eṉṉum ivi ~ellām poruṭkuṟipāṭu uṭiyārkkunikaḻāmiyiṉ i+ kuṟipāṭu* ellām uṭiyaṉ ām; avi~uṭiyāṉatu poruviṟappu eṉṉi ~ō eṉpatu.

<P>iṉi+, parattiyarmāṭṭu+ piriyum ē ~eṉiṉ, ivaṉ kaṇṭārkaṇtāḻvāṉ ām; ākalāṉ, talimakaḷmāṭṭu* ē kiṭanta aṉpilaṉāyiṉāṉ ām. allatūum, kaṇṭuḻi ~ellām uḷḷatti+ celīi,uḷḷattiṉvaḻi ōṭum ākalāṉ niṟiyilaṉ āyiṉāṉ ām;niṟiyilāṉatu poruviṟappu eṉṉi ~ō eṉpatu.

<P>ivi ~ellām^ colla+ peritu māṟukoṇṭu kāṭṭiṟṟu eṉiṉ,māṟukoḷḷātu; māṟukoḷḷāmikku+ kāraṇam eṉṉi ~ō eṉiṉ,

<P>ōtaṟku+ piriyum eṉpatu, kaṟpāṉ piriyum eṉpatu* aṉṟu;paṇṭu* ē kuravarkaḷāṟ kaṟpikkappaṭṭu+ kaṟṟāṉ, aṟamporuḷ iṉpam vīṭu pēṟukaḷ nutaliya nūlkaḷ ellām; iṉi+,paratēcaṅkaḷiṉ um avi vallār uḷar eṉiṉ+ kāṇṭaṟku* um,vallārkaḷ uḷvaḻi+ ceṉṟu taṉ ñāṉam mēṟpaṭuttu avarñāṉam^ kīḻppaṭuttaṟku* um piriyum eṉa+ koḷka.

<P>iṉi, nāṭu kāttaṟku+ piriyum eṉpatu, nalivār uḷarākanalivukāttaṟku+ piriyum eṉpatu* aṉṟu; nāṭṭakattuniṉṟumnakarakattu+ tamakku uṟṟatu urikkalāta mūttārkaḷumpeṇṭirkaḷum irukkimuṭavarum kūṉarum kuruṭarumpiṇiyuṭiyār um eṉa ittoṭakkattārtam muṟikkarumam^kēṭṭu+ tiruttutaṟporuṭṭākavum, kāṭṭakattu vāḻumuyirccātikaḷ oṉṟaṉiyoṉṟu nalivaṉa uḷavāyiṉaviṭattutu/tīteṉṟavaṟṟi muṟiceytaṟkum, koṭivalippaṭṭu+kiṭantaṉavaṟṟi+ tuṟi nīkkutaṟporuṭṭākavum, vaḷaṉilvaḻi vaḷam tōṟṟuvittal+ poruṭṭāka ~um, tēvakulam ēcāli ~ē ampalam ē eṉṟu i+ toṭakkattaṉavaṟṟiārāyvataṟku* um, aḻikuṭi ~ōmputaṟku* um piriyum eṉpatu.allatūum, piṟanta uyir tāyikkaṇṭu iṉpuṟuvatu pōla+taṉṉāṟ kākkappaṭum uyirvāḻcātikaḷ taṉṉi+ kaṇṭuiṉpuṟutaliṉ tāṉ avarkaṭku+ taṉ urukkāṭṭutaṟkummāṟṟaracar oṟṟu vantaviṭattu avar muṉṉar+ taṉatu //
<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P160">{{iṟi: Page 160}}</A>
<HR>
// ūkkam^ kāṭṭutaṟporuṭṭākavum piriyum; ataṉāṉ ēmāṟṟaracar um tiṟi koṭuppar eṉpatu.

<P>iṉi+, pakitaṇiviṉi ~eṉpatu, tūtuvar pōla+ cantuceyvittaṟku+ piriyum eṉpatu* aṉṟu; iruvar aracar nāḷi+porutum iṉṟu porutum eṉṟu muraṇkoṇṭu iruntanilimikkaṇ tāṉ avarukku* aracaṉ ākaliṉ, `im makkaḷ umiv vilaṅkukaḷ um ellām paṭa iv= iraṇṭu kulattiṟku* umētam nikaḻum; ataṉāl, i+ pōr oḻikkaṟpālēṉ' eṉṟuiruvari ~um irantu cantuceyvittal um oṉṟu; allatūum,tēvar um acurar um porutakālattu+ tēvari ~um acurari~um, `oruvīr oruvīr mikkāri oṟuppal yāṉ' eṉa+ pāṇṭiyaṉmākīrtti cantuceyvittatu pōla, `iruvariṉ mikiceytīrioṟuppal' eṉṟu cantuceyvittal um oṉṟu, iruvari ~umoṟukkuntuṇi āṟṟaluṭiyaṉ ākalāṉ eṉpatu aḵtu* ē ~eṉiṉ,taṉṉakattu iruntuviṭa amiyātō aṉṉavāṟṟalaṉ ākalāṉ, tāṉcella vēṇṭumō eṉiṉ, cella vēṇṭum eṉpatu. eṉṉi,kātalar+ pirintu oru karumam muṭippataṉiṉ mikka āḷviṉi~illi ~eṉpatu. ātalāṉ+ pirintu* ē cantuceyvikkumeṉpatu.

<P>iṉi, vēntarkkuṟṟuḻi eṉpatu, avarkku+ cēvakaṉ āy+piriyum eṉpatu* aṉṟu; taṉakku naṭṭāṉ ōraracaṉceṉṟaviṭattu avaṟku āpatam aṟuttal iṉitu* eṉṟunīkkutaṟku+ piriyum eṉpatu.

<P>iṉi+, poruṭpiṇi eṉpatu, poruḷilaṉ āy+ piriyumeṉpatu* aṉṟu; taṉ mutukuravarāṟ paṭikkappaṭṭa palvēṟuvakippaṭṭa poruḷ ellām kiṭantatu maṉ, atukoṭu tuyppatuāṇmi+ taṉmi ~aṉṟu* eṉa+ taṉatu tāḷāṟṟalāṉ+ paṭittaporuḷkoṇṭu vaḻaṅki vāḻtaṟku+ piriyum eṉpatu; allatūum,tēvarkāriyam um pitirarkāriyam um taṉatu tāḷāṟṟalāṟpaṭitta poruḷāṟ ceytaṉa ~allatu payaṉpaṭātu; eṉṉi,tāyapporuḷāṟ ceytatu tēvar um pitirar um iṉpuṟār;ātalāṉ, avarkaḷi ~um iṉpuṟuttaṟku+ piriyum eṉpatu.

<P>iṉi+, paratti eṉpatu, potuppeṇṭirmāṭṭu+ pirivu;ivaḷkaṇ aṉpilaṉ āy+ kaṇṭārkaṇ tāḻntu //
<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P161">{{iṟi: Page 161}}</A>
<HR>
// niṟiyilaṉ āy+ pirintāṉ allaṉ; eṉṉi, talimakaḷiṉnīṅki āṭal kāṇpal pāṭal kēṭpal eṉa+ piriyum; piriya,avaṟṟiṉkaṇ+ ceṉṟa uṇarcci talimakaḷmāṭṭu niṉṟauṇarviṉi maṟikkum; eṉṉi, iraṇṭu* uṇarvuuṭaṉillāmiyiṉ; avvaki maṟippa ivarkaṇṇatu* ē uḷḷamām eṉpatu; eṉṉi, tām iyalpāka ~ēyum piṟarāṉnayakkappaṭum vaṉappuṭiyār, āṭaṟṟakiyāṉ umpāṭaṟkuralāṉ um nayappittukkoḷvam eṉṟu eṭuttukkoṇṭāl,āṭavarkaḷ avarkaṇ nayappu+ colla vēṇṭum ō eṉpatu.avaṟṟatu poruḷ aṟiyātu kaṭāyiṉāy, iḵtu avaṟṟu+ poruḷeṉṟu koḷka eṉpatu.

<P>iṉi+ pirivukaḷi vēṟu vēṟu urimi kūṟumiṭattuavaṟṟukku+ ceyyuḷ kāṭṭutum.

<H2>36</H2>
<P>	avaṟṟuḷ,
<BR>	ōtal um kāval um uyarntōrkku* uriya.

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉpatu eṉ ^nutaliṟṟu* ō eṉiṉ, mēṟ collappaṭṭa piriviṉiniṟuttamuṟiyāṉ ē muṉpu iraṇṭum iṉṉārkku uriya eṉpatuuṇarttutal nutaliṟṟu.

<P>itaṉ poruḷ: avaṟṟuḷ eṉpatu -- mēṟ collappaṭṭaaṟuvaki+ piriviṉuḷḷum eṉṟavāṟu; ōtal um kāval umeṉpatu -- ōtaṟku+ piriyum pirivum nāṭukāttaṟku+ piriyumpirivum eṉṟavāṟu; uyarntōrkku uriya eṉpatu -- uyarntōreṉpār pārppār um aracarum, avviruvarkkum uriyaeṉṟavāṟu.

<P>ōtaṟku+ piriyum pārppāṉ, nāṭukāttaṟku+ piriyumaracaṉ eṉa niraṉiṟiyāka+ koḷka. atu poruntātu; eṉṉi,ōtal um kāval um antaṇar aracar eṉṟu iruvarkkum uriya~eṉiṉ ām niraṉiṟi ~āvatu eṉṟārkku, avvāṟu colliṟṟilarāyiṉum poruḷvakiyāṉ nōkka okkum eṉpatu. eṉṉi,uyarntōrkku uriya eṉa ~ē, uyarntōrāvār pārppār umaracar um ē ~ākalāṉ eṉpatu. eṉṟārkku, uyarntōrkku uriyaeṉṟataṉāṟ pārppārkku* ē uriya eṉṟu koḷḷām ō eṉiṉ,koḷḷappaṭātu; kāval pārppār toḻil aṉṟu, ākaliṉiruvarkku* um uriya eṉpatu //
<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P162">{{iṟi: Page 162}}</A>
<HR>
// peṟutum; allatūum, uriyiṟkōṭal eṉpatu tantira utti~ākalāṉ um iruvarkkum uriya eṉpatu peṟutum.

<P>ōtaṟku+ piritaluṟum^ talimakaṉ tōḻiyāltalimakaṭku+ pirivu* uṇarttuvikkum; ataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<H3>((ōtaṟpirivuṇarttal))</H3>

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 239}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
kāvaṟku+ piriyaluṟum^ talimakaṉ tōḻiyāl talimakaṭku+pirivu* uṇarttuvikkum; ataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<H3>((kāvaṟpirivuṇarttal))</H3>

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 240}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉpatu.

<H2>37</H2>
<P>	vēntuviṉi iyaṟki pārppārkku* um urittu* ē.

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉpatu eṉ ^nutaliṟṟu* ō eṉiṉ, pārppārkku+ pirivu* eṉṟuōtappaṭṭatu kalvi mikutaṟku+ piriyum pirivu* aṉṟu* ē,atu ~allāmalum piṟitum oru pirivu uṇṭu* eṉpatuuṇarttutal nutaliṟṟu.

<P>itaṉ poruḷ: vēntu eṉpatu aracu; viṉi eṉpatu ceyki;iyaṟki eṉpatu taṉmi; pārppārkku* um urittu* ē eṉpatupārppārkku* um^ kiḻamiyuṭittu eṉṟavāṟu.

<P>eṉpataṉāṟ pōnta poruḷ, vēntar ceyvittaṟku uriyacantu pārppārkkum urittu eṉṟavāṟu. vēntaṟku+ cantuceyvittal urittu eṉṟu mēṟcolli+ pōntār āyiṉ aṉṟu* ē,`vēntu viṉi iyaṟki pārppārkku* um urittu* ē' eṉpatueṉiṉ, atu mēṟcolliṉāṉ. eṉṉi, //
<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P163">{{iṟi: Page 163}}</A>
<HR>
// kāval paki taṇiviṉi eṉa iraṇṭiṉi ~um oruṅkuvittu avviraṇṭiṉi ~um aracarkkuriya eṉṟamiyiṉapporuṭṭu eṉpatu. eṉṉi aracarkku urittāmāṟu eṉiṉ,iruvaracar vēṟupaṭṭu māṟukoṇṭiruntaviṭattu avarkaḷi+cantu ceyvittaṟku+ piriyātuviṭiṉ, avarkaḷi+ cārntuvāḻvār um avarkaḷ nāṭum peritum tuṉpam eytum aṉṟu* ē;ataṉi nīkkum perumi ~uṭiyāṉ ataṉi nīkkātuuṭaṉpaṭṭiruppatu pāvam um paḻi ~um ākalāṉ, aracarkkuurittu; eṉṉi, avar um perumi ~uṭiyar ākalāṉ. ataṟku+ceyyuḷ:

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 241}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉpatu

<H2>38</H2>
<P>	aracar allā ēṉiyōrkku* um
<BR>	purivatu* eṉpa ōriṭattāṉa

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉpatu eṉ ^nutaliṟṟu* ō eṉiṉ, cantu ceyvittaṟku+piriyum pirivu aracarkkaṉṟi ~um vāṇikarkkum vēḷāḷarkkumurittu eṉpatu uṇarttutal nutaliṟṟu.

<P>itaṉ poruḷ: aracar allā ēṉiyōrkkum eṉpatu --aracarallāta ēṉiyōrāvār oḻinta vāṇikarum vēḷāḷarumeṉṟa iruvarkkum eṉṟavāṟu; purivatu eṉpa ōriṭattāṉeṉpatu -- poruntum eṉpa avar ilvaḻi eṉṟavāṟu.

<P>aracarillātavaḻi vāṇikarum vēḷāḷarum, vēṟupaṭṭumāṟukoṇṭa iruvari ~um cantu ceyvittaṟku+ piriya+peṟuvār eṉpatu. poruḷāṉum āḷviṉiyāṉum aracarōṭoppar,vāṇikarum vēḷāḷarum eṉṉum vēṟṟumi ~allatu eṉpatu.aḵtu* ē ~eṉiṉ, mēṟcūttiram vēṇṭā, `aracar allāēṉiyōrkku* um' eṉa ~ē, pārppār um aṭaṅkuvar ākalāṉeṉpatu; eṉṟārkku, atu ~aṉṟu; aracar allā ēṉiyōr eṉpatuaracariṟ piṉcollappaṭum vāṇikari ~um //
<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P164">{{iṟi: Page 164}}</A>
<HR>
// vēḷāḷari ~um taḻuvutaṟku+ coṉṉār eṉpatu. allākkāl,`vēntuviṉi iyaṟki pārppārkkum urittu' eṉṉārmaṉeṉpatu. iv= iruvarkkum ceyyuḷ mēṟkāṭṭiṟṟu* ē koḷka.

<H2>39</H2>
<P>	vēntarkku* uṟṟuḻi+ poruṭpiṇi+ pirivu* eṉṟu
<BR>	āṅka iraṇṭu* um iḻintōrkku* uriya.

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉpatu eṉ ^nutaliṟṟu* ō eṉiṉ, vāṇikarkkum vēḷāḷarkkumuriyatōr pirivu uṇarttutal nutaliṟṟu.

<P>itaṉ poruḷ: vēntarkku uṟṟuḻi eṉpatu -- aracarkkuuṟṟuḻi eṉṟavāṟu; poruṭpiṇi+ pirivu eṉpatu --poruḷvēṭkiyiṟ piriyum pirivu eṉṟavāṟu; eṉṟu eṉpatu,eṇṇutaṟkuriyatōr vāypāṭu; āṅka eṉpatu, aciccol; iraṇṭueṉpatu, toki; ummi, muṟṟummi; iḻintōr/kku uriyaeṉpatu -- vāṇikarkkum vēḷāḷarkkum kiḻamiyuṭiyaeṉṟavāṟu.

<P>iḻivupaṭa+ colliṉārāl, iḻintār eṉpatuporuviṟappiṉoṭu māṟukoḷḷum eṉiṉ, koḷḷātu; i+ nūlulakiṉōṭu ottum ovvātum naṭakkiṉṟatu* ākalāṉ ulakiyalnōkki+ cātivakiyāṉ iḻintār eṉappaṭṭatu. oḻintaṉavaṟṟāṟporuviṟappu iruvarkkum okkum eṉpatu.

<P>avaṟṟuḷ, vēntaṟkuṟṟuḻi+ piriyum^ talimakaṉ tōḻiyāltalimakaṭku+ pirivuṇarttuvittu+ piriyum; ataṟku+ceyyuḷ:

<H3>((vēntaṟku uṟṟuḻi+ pirivuṇarttal))</H3>

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 242}}

<P><P>{{S 243}}

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P165">{{iṟi: Page 165}}</A>
<HR>
<P>{{C URAI}}
talimakaṉ vēntarkkuṟṟuḻi+ pirintaviṭattu+ talimakaḷvēṟupaṭṭu āṟṟāḷ āyiṉāḷ eṉa+ kavaṉṟa tōḻikku āṟṟuvaleṉpatupaṭa+ talimakaḷ colliyataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<H3>((kārmici vittal))</H3>

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 244}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉpatu;

<P>atu kēṭṭa tōḻi, `ivaḷ pirivu* āṟṟāmiyāṉ aṉṟuvēṟupaṭṭatu; avar kuṟittu+ pirinta kār vara+, pirintapācaṟikkaṇ tōṉṟiyakkāl, tām eṭuttukkoṇṭa viṉimuṭiyātumīḷvar kollō eṉappōlum ivaḷ āṟṟāḷ āyatu; yāṉ piḻikkauṇarntēṉ' eṉa āṟṟuvāḷ āvatu.

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 245}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
vēntarkkuṟṟuḻi+ pirinta talimakaṉ tāṉ kuṟittaparuvavaraviṉkaṇ viṉimuṟṟi mīḷaluṟuvāṉ tērppākaṟku+colliyataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<H3>((nilimi niṉintu kūṟal))</H3>

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 246}}

<P><P>{{S 247}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
itu kēṭṭa tērppākaṉ virintu pōtaṟku oruppaṭuvāṉ ām.

<P>iṉṉum, vēntarkkuṟṟuḻi+ pirintu viṉimuṟṟiyatalimakaṉ ivvāṟum^ collum; ataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P166">{{iṟi: Page 166}}</A>
<HR>
<H3>((viṉimuṟṟi niṉital))</H3>

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 248}}

<P><P>{{S 249}}

<P><P>{{S 250}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
itu kēṭṭa tērppākaṉ virintu kaṭāvuvāṉ āvatu payaṉ.

<P>iṅṅaṉam viṉimuṟṟiya piṉṉiyaṉṟi muṟṟāviṭattum^collum ō eṉiṉ, collāṉ;

<P>eṉṉi,

<P>	`kiḻavi nili ~ē viṉiyiṭattu* uriyār
<BR>	veṉṟi+ kālattu viḷaṅki+ tōṉṟum"
<BR>		(([kaṟpiyal-45]))

<P>eṉpatu* ākalāṉ, viṉi muṟṟiya piṉṉi ~ē collumeṉpatu.
vēntarkkuṟṟuḻi+ ceṉṟu viṉi muṟṟi mīḷvāṉ tērppākaṟku+colliyataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<H3>((pākaṟkurittal))</H3>

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 251}}

<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`ulaku* uṭaṉ niḻaṟṟiya toliyā veṇkuṭi+
<BR>	kaṭal pōl tāṉi+ kalimā vaḻuti
<BR>	veṉṟamar uḻanta viyaṉ perum pācaṟi+
<BR>	ceṉṟu viṉi muṭittaṉam āyiṉ iṉṟu* ē
<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P167">{{iṟi: Page 167}}</A>
<HR>
<BR>	kār+ peyaṟku* etiriya kāṇ ^taku puṟavil
<BR>	kaṇam^ koḷ vaṇṭiṉ am^ ciṟi+ toḻuti
<BR>	maṇam^ kamaḻ mulli māli ārppa
<BR>	utukkāṇ vantaṉṟu poḻutu* ē val virintu
<BR>	celka pāka niṉ ^nal viṉi neṭum^ tēr
<BR>	veṇṇel arinar maṭi vāy+ taṇṇumi
<BR>	pal% malar+ poyki+ paṭu puḷ oppum
<BR>	kāy nel paṭappi vāṇaṉ ciṟukuṭi+
<BR>	taṇṭali kamaḻum kūntal
<BR>	oṇ toṭi maṭanti tōḷ iṇi peṟa ~ē'.
<BR>		(([akam-204]))

<P>{{C URAI}}
iṉṉum piṟavum^ collum; ataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 252}}

<P><P>{{S 253}}

<P><P>{{S 254}}

<P><P>{{S 255}}

<P><P>{{S 256}}

<P><P>{{S 257}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
ivi ~ellām^ collakkēṭṭa tērppākaṉ kaṭitu kaṭāvuvāṉāvatu payaṉ.

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P168">{{iṟi: Page 168}}</A>
<HR>
<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 258}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
itu ~um mēlavaṟṟōṭu okkum.

<P>iṉi, mukil nōkki+ colluvāṉāy+ tērppākaṉ kēṭpa+colliyataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<H3>((mukiloṭu kūṟal))</H3>

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 259}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
itu kēṭṭa tērppākaṉ virintu tēr kaṭāvuvāṉ āvatu payaṉ.

<P>vēntarkkuṟṟuḻi+ pirintu viṉimuṟṟi+ pukuntatalimakaṉatu varavuṇarntu tōḻi talimakaṭku+collumataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<H3>((varaveṭutturittal))</H3>

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 260}}

<P><P>{{S 261}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
iṉi+, talimakaṉ piriviṉkaṇ vēṟupaṭṭa talimakaṭku+tōḻi, viṉimuṟṟi mīḷvār colliya paruvam tūtāki vantatueṉṉum; ataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<H3>((paruvattūtu pāṅkipakartal))</H3>

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 262}}

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P169">{{iṟi: Page 169}}</A>
<HR>
<P>{{C URAI}}
iṉi+, talimakaṉ, viṉimuṟṟi+ pukuntu, talimakaḷōṭuiṉitiruntu, tōḻikku+ colliyataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<H3>((talimakaṉ tōḻikku+ kūṟal))</H3>

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 263}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
iṉi+, poruṭku+ piriyaluṟṟa talimakaṉ tōḻiyāltalimakaṭku+ pirivu uṇarttuvittaṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<H3>((poruṭpirivuṇarttal))</H3>

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 264}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
atu kēṭṭu āṟṟāttaṉmiyaḷ āya talimakaḷ tōḻikku+colliyataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<H3>((talimakaḷ āṟṟāturittal))</H3>

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 265}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
tōḻi talimakaḷ nilimi talimakaṟku+ colliyataṟku+ceyyuḷ:

<H3>((talivinilimi tōḻicāṟṟal))</H3>

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 266}}

<P><P>{{S 267}}

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P170">{{iṟi: Page 170}}</A>
<HR>
<P>{{C URAI}}
itu ~um mēlataṉōṭu okkum.

<P>iṉi+, tōḻi talimakaṉi, `nīr pirintaviṭattu ivvakineṭiyavākiya kaṅkulkaḷi+ tamiyaḷāy evvaki nīntiāṟṟum?' eṉṉum; ataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<H3>((kaṅkulmici vittal))</H3>

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 268}}

<P><P>{{S 269}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
itu ~um atu.

<P>tōḻi talimakaṟku+ pirivu nērntu, `naṉṟu ceytāy,avar cellum^ kāṉam ivvakippaṭṭatu' eṉṉum; ataṟku+ceyyuḷ:

<H3>((kāṉattiyalpu tōḻiyurittal))</H3>

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 270}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
iṉi+, tōḻi talimakaṭku+, `poruḷmuṭittu vantāṉemperumāṉ' eṉṉum; ataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<H3>((talimakaṉ varavu tōḻi kūṟal))</H3>

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 271}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
maṟṟum, iv= iṭattu+ piriviṭi melintu āṟṟāḷ ākiyatalimakaḷi+ paruvam vantatu* eṉṟu vaṟpuṟuppa,vaṉpoṟi ~etiraḻintu colliyataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P171">{{iṟi: Page 171}}</A>
<HR>
<H3>((vaṉpoṟi etiraḻintu kūṟal))</H3>

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 272}}

<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`aḻuntupaṭu viḻuppuṇ vaḻumpuvāy pularā
<BR>	evva neñcattu* eḵku* eṟintāṅku+
<BR>	pirivila pulampi nuvalum^ kuyiliṉum
<BR>	tēṟu nīr keḻīiya yāṟu naṉi koṭitu* ē
<BR>	ataṉiṉum^ koṭiyaḷ tāṉ ē mataṉiṉ
<BR>	tuyttali itaḻa pim^ kurukkattiyoṭu
<BR>	pittiki viravu malar koḷḷīrō ~eṉa
<BR>	vaṇṭu cūḻ vaṭṭiyaḷ tiritarūum
<BR>	taṇṭali uḻavar taṉi maṭa makaḷ ē'.
<BR>		(([naṟṟiṇi -- 97]))

<P>{{C URAI}}
iv= iṭattu+ ceyyuṭkaḷ palavum vantavaḻi+ kaṇṭu koḷka.

<H2>40</H2>
<P>	kātal+ paratti ellārkku* um urittu* ē.

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉpatu eṉ ^nutaliṟṟu* ō eṉiṉ, mēl ellā+ pirivukaḷi ~umciṟappu vakiyāṉ uṇarttiṉār; iṉi+, parattiyiṟ pirivuellārkkum urittu eṉpatu uṇarttutul nutuliṟṟu.

<P>itaṉ poruḷ: kātal+ paratti ellārkku* um urittu* ēeṉpatu -- parattiyiṉ+ pirivu ellā varuṇattārkku* umurittu eṉṟavāṟu.

<P>tammi+ kaṇṭu kātalittār eṉpatu aṟivu* aṉṟu* ē,pēraṟiviṉar ākalāṉ; aṉṉār tām piṉṉi+ taliyaḷiyātuviṭuvatu aruḷ aṉṟu; ataṉāl, ellārkku* um urittu eṉa+koḷka. iv= uri poruntātu; eṉṉi kāraṇam eṉiṉ,mikkāri+ kaṇṭāl iḻintār um uyarntār um maṟṟum ellārumkātalippa, avarmāṭṭu* ellām piriya vēṇṭum. piriya ~ēellā+ kuṟṟam um taṅki+ talimiyoṭu māṟukoḷḷum;allatūum, aṉpiṉāṟ piriyār aruḷiṉāṟ pirivar eṉpatūum^collappaṭṭatu* ām. ataṉāṟ kātalittāḷ māṭṭu+ piriyumpirivu amiyātu eṉakkoḷka.

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P172">{{iṟi: Page 172}}</A>
<HR>
iṉi, oru tiṟattār, kātali+ ceyyum parattikātaṟparatti eṉpa; eṉṉi kāraṇam eṉiṉ, vikalum pāl ētuyttu+ celvāṉ oru makaṉ iṭiyiṭi puḷi ~um^ kāṭi ~umuṇṭakkāl ām piṟa pāliṉatu vicēṭam aṟivāṉ āvatu. aḵtu* ēpōla+ talimakaḷ kuṇaṅkaḷi+ tuyttu+ cellāniṉṟāṉiṭiyiṭi ciṟukuṇattar ākiya parattiyar māṭṭu+pirintuvara+ talimakaḷmāṭṭu+ kātal perukum.allātuviṭṭakkāl ivaḷ kuṇam poruvu* ariyatu eṉpatuaṟiyal ākātu. eṉṉi, iṉṉātatu oṉṟu uṇmiyāṉ iṉiyataṉiṉpam aṟiyappaṭum eṉpatu. iv= uri ~um poruntātu. eṉṉōkāraṇam eṉiṉ, avaroṭu cārttikkoṇṭu* aṉṟu* ē ivaḷkuṇaṅkaḷi+ periya eṉṟu aṟivatu eṉiṉ, avarmāṭṭu+piriyātu viṭṭaviṭattu ivaḷ* ^taṉ kuṇaṅkaḷi mikkaṉakollō mikkila kollō eṉa aiyappaṭṭu niṉṟāṉ
ākal vēṇṭum. aṅṅaṉam āyiṉ, tāṉ avaḷ eṉṉum vēṟṟumi~illār eṉpataṉoṭu māṟukoḷḷum. eṉṉi, tam kuṇaṅkaḷiaiyappaṭuvār iṉmiyāṉ eṉpatu.

<P>maṟṟu eṉṉō uri eṉiṉ, talimakaṉāṟ kātalikkappaṭṭaparatti eṉakkoḷka. aḵtu* ē ~eṉiṉ, ivaṉ kaṇṭāri~ellām^ kāmuṟuvāṉ ākāṉ ō eṉiṉ, ākāṉ; ākātavāṟucollutum: talimakaṉāl taliniṉṟu oḻukappaṭuvaṉa aṟamporuḷ kāmam eṉa mūṉṟu; a+ mūṉṟiṉi ~um, oru pakalimūṉṟu kūṟu* iṭṭu, mutaṟkaṇ+ pattu nāḻiki ~um aṟattoṭupaṭṭu+ cellum; iṭiyaṉa pattu nāḻiki ~um aruttattoṭupaṭṭu+ cellum; kaṭiyaṉa pattu nāḻiki ~um kāmattoṭupaṭṭu+ cellum; ātalāṉ, talimakaṉ nāḻiki aḷantukoṇṭukarumattoṭu paṭuvāṉ, talimakaḷ um vēṇṭa ~ē tāṉ umvēṇṭippōntu attāṇi pukuntu aṟam^ kēṭpatu* um aṟattoṭupaṭṭu+ celvatu* um ceyyum; nāḻiki aḷantukoṇṭu iṭiyaṉapattu nāḻiki ~um iṟi ~um muṟi ~um kēṭṭuaruttattiṉoṭu paṭṭu vāḻvāṉ ām. avaṟṟu nīkkattu+kaṭiyaṉa pattu nāḻikiyuḷ talimakaḷ uḻi+ pōtarum;pōtara, a+ pōtaravu pārttirunta parattiyar kuḻal ūtiyāḻ eḻīi+ taṇṇumi ~iyakki muḻavu* iyampi+ talimakaṉiiṅku+ kūttu* uṇṭu eṉpatu aṟivippa; eṉṉi,

<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`kuḻal vaḻi yāḻ eḻīi+ taṇṇumi+ piṉṉar
<BR>	muḻavu* iyampal āman tiriki'.

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P173">{{iṟi: Page 173}}</A>
<HR>
<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉṟu kūttanūl uṭiyār um^ coṉṉār ākaliṉ eṉpatu. avvakiaṟivikkappaṭṭa talimakaṉ nām itaṉi orukāl nōkki+pōtum eṉṟu cellum; ceṉṟakkāl, avar taṅkaṇ tāḻvippareṉpatu. aḵtu* ē ~eṉiṉ, i+ parattiyari+ talimakaṉtalimakaḷi eytiyiruntu* ē uṭiyaṉ ātal, eytātataṉmuṉuṭiyaṉ ātal iraṇṭu* allatu illi. avaṟṟuḷ eytiyiruntu*ē ~uṭiyaṉ āyiṉāṉ ē ~eṉiṉ, talimakaḷ kuṇam ēyum aṉṟi+piṟa ~um iṉpam^ ceyvaṉa uḷavāka+ karutiṉāṉ ām; āka ~ē,

<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`kaṇṭu kēṭṭu* uṇṭu* uyirttu* uṟṟu* aṟiyum aimpulaṉ um
<BR>	oṇ toṭikaṇ= ē uḷa'.
<BR>		(([kuṟaḷ-1101]))

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉpataṉoṭu māṟukoḷḷum eṉpatu.

<P>iṉi+, talimakaḷi eytātamuṉ uṭiyaṉ āyiṉāṉ ē ~eṉiṉ,muṉ= um ivaṉ kaṟṟa kālam iṉṟi+ kāmattukkaṇ= ē keḻumivarukiṉṟāṉ ām; āka ~ē, neṟiyiṉ vaḷarntāṉ allaṉ āmeṉpatu.

<P>maṟṟu eṉṉō uri eṉiṉ, talimakaḷi eytāta muṉ= ēparattiyari uṭiyaṉ eṉpatu. eṉa ~ē, mēṟcollappaṭṭakuṟi eytātu* ō eṉiṉ, eytātu. kuravarkaḷ ivaṉ aṟiyāmi~ē ivaṉ urimi itu eṉa ~um, ivaṉ yāṉi ~um kutiri ~umiv= eṉa ~um, maṟṟum ellām ivaṟku* eṉṟu vakuttuvittu+tām vaḻaṅki+ tuyppa eṉpatu. avvaki ~ē kuravarkaḷāṉivaṉ urimi eṉṟu* ē vaḷarkkappaṭṭār ākalāṉ talimakaḷieytuvataṉ muṉ uḷar eṉpatu. ivaṉ muṉ= ē taṉ urimi~āvatu aṟintavāṟu eṉṉi eṉiṉ, talimakaṉ talimakaḷinīṅki+ tarumam um aruttam um uḷpaṭṭu+ talimakaḷmāṭṭu+pōtarumiṭattu, avar muṉ coṉṉavāṟu* ē kuḻal um yāḻ umtaṇṇumi ~um muḻavum iyampupa; iyampiṉaviṭattu, `iḵtueṉṉi?' eṉṉum; eṉṟakkāl, `atu niṉ urimi aṉṟō' eṉpa,eṉṟārkku, `aḵtu niṉ urimi aṉṟō' eṉpa, eṉṇārkku, `aḵtueṉ urimi ~āyiṉavāṟu eṉṉi?' eṉṉum; eṉṟaviṭattu, `niṉkuravarkaḷāṉ eṉakku urimiyāka vakukkappaṭṭār' eṉpa.`āyiṉ nām kuravaratu paṇi māṟukoḷḷal ākātu' eṉpataṉāṉ+kāṇṭaṟku+ cellum; ceṉṟāṉi avar taṅkaṇ nayappippaeṉpatu. itu parattiyiṟpirivu nikaḻumāṟu.

<P>aḵtu* ē ~eṉiṉ, maṟṟi+ pirivu* ellām vēṇṭuka,āḷviṉi mikuti uṭimiyāṉ; i+ pirivu eṟṟiṟku* ō eṉiṉ,//
<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P174">{{iṟi: Page 174}}</A>
<HR>
// parattiyiṟ pirintāṉ talimakaṉ eṉṟāl, ūṭal ē pulavi~ē tuṉi ~ē eṉṟivi nikaḻum. nikaḻntāl, avi nīkki+kūṭiṉaviṭattu+ periyatu* ōr iṉpam ām; av= iṉpa+taṉmiyi veḷippaṭuppaṉa avi eṉakkoḷka. ivaṉmeṉcuvimēl naṭantāṉōr āciriyaṉ ākalāṉ i+pirivuvēṇṭiṉāṉ eṉpatu.

<P>aḵtu* ē eṉiṉ, kātaṟparatti ellārkku* um uriyaḷeṉṟu* ākātu* ē cūttiram ceytaṟpālatu, `urittu' eṉṟuaḵṟiṇi vāypāṭṭāṉ+ colliṟṟu eṟṟiṟkō eṉiṉ, pirivatikāramvārāniṉṟamiyāṉ pirivum urittu eṉṟu collappaṭṭatu.

<P>parattiyarmāṭṭu+ piriyum piriviṉkaṇ+ ceyyuḷ:

<H3>((tōḻi vāyilmaṟuttal))</H3>

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 273}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
parattiyiṟ pirinta talimakaṉ peyarntu tōḻiyivāyilvēṇṭa+ tōḻi vāyilmaṟuttāḷ eṉpatu. eṉ collivāyilmaṟuttāḷō eṉiṉ, `emperumāṉatu nilimi iṉṉatu*eṉṟu collal uṟṟēṉ, eṉatu kuṟippu* aṟintu i+ nilimiyaḷāyiṉāḷ, itaṟku+ takkatu* aṟintu ceymiṉ' eṉṟuvāyiṉmaṟuttāḷ eṉpatu.

<P>iṉi+, parattiyiṟ pirinta talimakaṟku vāyilā+ pukkapāṇaṉ talimakaḷāl vāyilmaṟukkappaṭṭu muṉṉiṉṟunīṅkiyataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<H3>((pāṇaṉ pulanturittal))</H3>

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 274}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
maṟṟum vāyilpeṟātu parattiyiṟ pirinta talimakaṉmakaṉi vāyilākakkoṇṭu pukkāṉi+ kaṇṭu poṟāmi nīṅkavēṇṭi+ tōḻi colliyataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P175">{{iṟi: Page 175}}</A>
<HR>
<H3>((poṟāmi nīṅka+ tōḻi pukaṟal))</H3>

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 275}}

<P><P>{{S 276}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
itu mēlataṉōṭu okkum poruṭṭu.

<P>makaṉ vāyilāka+ pukkaviṭattu+ talimakaḷcivappāṟṟiṉāḷ; atu kuṟippaṟintu tōḻi talimakaṟku i+nilimiyaḷāyiṉāḷ eṉṉum; ataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<H3>((talivi āṟiyatu tōḻi kūṟal))</H3>

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 277}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
parattiyiṟ pirinta talimakaṉ vāyil peṟṟu+ pukuntutalimakaḷi+ poṟāmi nīkka+ talimakaḷ poṟāminīṅkuvāḷ colliyataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<H3>((puṉalāṭṭiya īram pulartti varukeṉṟal))</H3>

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 278}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
iḵtu eṉcolliyavāṟō eṉiṉ, `nīr nerunal nuṅkātaliyi+puṉalāṭṭiya īram pularttivantu emakku+ ceyyum āraruḷceyyīr' eṉṟāḷ eṉpatu.

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P176">{{iṟi: Page 176}}</A>
<HR>
<H2>41</H2>
<P>	piriviṉ nīṭṭam nilampeyarntu* uṟivōrkku
<BR>	uriyatu* aṉṟu* ē yāṇṭu variyaṟuttal.

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉpatu eṉ ^nutaliṟṟu* ō eṉiṉ, talimakaṉ pirintuṟiyumiṭattu+ kālavariyaṟi uṇarttutal nutaliṟṟu.

<P>itaṉ poruḷ: piriviṉ nīṭṭam eṉpatu -- piriviṉatuneṭuṅkāli+ celavu eṉṟavāṟu; nilam peyarntu uṟivōrkkueṉpatu -- iṭattiṉ nīṅki nāṭiṭiyiṭṭum kāṭiṭiyiṭṭumuṟivōrkku eṉṟavāṟu; uriyatu aṉṟu* ē yāṇṭuvariyaṟuttal eṉpatu -- urittu* aṉṟu yāṇṭuvariyaṟuttu+ pirital eṉṟavāṟu.

<P>eṉpataṉāṟ pōnta poruḷ yātu* ō eṉiṉ, nāḷ um tiṅkaḷ umirutu ~um variyaṟuttu+ piripa eṉpatu. iṉṉa nāḷuḷvarutum, iṉṉa tiṅkaḷuḷ varutum, iṉṉa irutuḷ varutumeṉṟu colli+ piriyum eṉpatu.

<P>nāḷ+ kuṟittu+ piriyaluṟum^ talimakaṉ pirivu*uṇarttappaṭṭa tōḻi ceṉṟu talimakaṭku+ colliyataṟku+ceyyuḷ:

<H3>((nāṭkuṟittatu tōḻiyurittal))</H3>

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 279}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
tiṅkaḷkuṟittu+ talimakaṉ piriya vēṟupaṭṭāḷ talimakaḷ;vēṟupaṭa, āṟṟāḷ eṉa+ kavaṉṟa tōḻikku, āṟṟuvaleṉpatupaṭa+ talimakaḷ colliyataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 280}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉpatu eṉ collaliṉāḷ ō eṉiṉ, `yāṉ āṟṟēṉ āy aṉṟuvēṟupaṭukiṉṟatu, avar kuṟitta tiṅkaḷatu varavu kaṇṭutām eṭuttukkoṇṭa poruḷ muṭiyātu peyarvar kollō eṉaāṟṟēṉ āvatu' eṉṟāḷ eṉpatu.

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P177">{{iṟi: Page 177}}</A>
<HR>
iṉi+, kār eṉṉum irutu+ kuṟittu+ pirintāṉ talimakaṉ;piriya+, paruva varaviṉkaṇ vēṟupaṭṭāḷ talimakaḷ;vēṟupaṭa, āṟṟāḷ eṉa+ kavaṉṟa tōḻikku, āṟṟuvaleṉpatupaṭa+ colliyataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 281}}

<P><P>{{S 282}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉa ~ē, eṉ colliṉāḷō eṉiṉ, `yāṉ āṟṟēṉ āy aṉṟuvēṟupaṭukiṉṟatu; avar kuṟitta paruvam vantatu kaṇṭu tāmeṭuttukkoṇṭa poruḷ muṭiyātu varuvar kollō eṉa āṟṟēṉāyiṉēṉ' eṉpatu.

<P>paṉi ~eṉṉum irutu+ kuṟittu+ talimakaṉ piriya, a+paruva varaviṉkaṇ talimakaḷ, āṟṟāḷ ām eṉa+ kavaṉṟatōḻikku+, colliyataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 283}}

<P><P>{{S 284}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
iḷavēṉil+ paruvam^ kuṟittu+ talimakaṉ pirintaviṭattu,apparuva varaviṉkaṇ talimakaḷ āṟṟāḷ ām eṉa+ kavaṉṟatōḻi colliyataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<H3>((tōḻi kavaṉṟurittal))</H3>

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 285}}

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P178">{{iṟi: Page 178}}</A>
<HR>
<P>{{C URAI}}
vēṉiṟparuvam^ kuṟittu+ pirinta talimakaṉ piriyavēṟupaṭṭāḷ talimakaḷ; vēṟupaṭa, āṟṟāḷ eṉa+ kavaṉṟatōḻikku āṟṟuval eṉpatupaṭa+ talimakaḷ colliyataṟku+ceyyuḷ:

<H3>((talimakaḷ tōḻikkurittal))</H3>

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 286}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṅṅaṉam āṟṟuval eṉpatupaṭa+ colliṉāḷō eṉiṉ, `iv vēṉilvaraviṉkaṇ nammēl ivvaki veyyavāki viriyāniṉṟapiṇṭiyalar avarkku* um ivvaki vemmiyi+ ceyyum aṉṟu*ē, ceytaviṭattu+ tām eṭuttukkoṇṭa poruḷ muṭiyātu mīḷvarkollō eṉa āṟṟēṉ ākiṉṟēṉ' eṉṟāḷ eṉpatu.

<P>iccūttiram tavaḷi+ pāyccal.

<P>`vēntarkku* uṟṟuḻi' (([iṟiyaṉār -- 39]))

<P>eṉṉum^ cūttirattuṭaṉ nōkkuṭittu eṉpatu.

<H2>42</H2>
<P>	parattiyiṟ pirivu* ē nila+ tiripu* iṉṟu* ē.

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉpatu eṉ ^nutaliṟṟu* ō eṉiṉ, parattiyiṟ pirivunāṭiṭiyiṭṭu nīṅki uṟital illi eṉpatu uṇarttutalnutaliṟṟu.

<P>mēṟ cūttirattuḷ eytiyatu vilakkiyavāṟu.

<P>itaṉ poruḷ: parattiyiṟ pirivu* ē eṉpatu --parattiyarmāṭṭu+ piriyum pirivu eṉṟavāṟu; nila+ tiripuiṉṟu* ē eṉpatu -- iṭattiripu iṉṟu eṉṟavāṟu.

<P>eṉpatu iṭattiṉ nīṅki iyiya+ peṟār eṉṟavāṟu.

<P>parattiyiṟ piriyum^ kālattu nāṭiṭiyiṭṭumkāṭiṭiyiṭṭum piriyappaṭātu eṉṟavāṟu.

<P>eṉa ~ē, or ūratu eṉpatūum, ōr iṭattatu eṉpatūumuṇarttappaṭṭatu* ām.

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P179">{{iṟi: Page 179}}</A>
<HR>
iṉi, oru tiṟattār, taṉṉiṭattatu* ē eṉpa; atu collutalporuntātu;

<P>{{C CITA}}
`māṇ toḻil% mā maṇi kaṟaṅka+ kaṭi kaḻintu'.
<BR>		(([akam -- 66_10]))

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉa ~um,

<P>{{C CITA}}
`varuka til= amma ~em^ cēri cēra'.
<BR>		(([akam -- 276]))

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉa ~um ivi ~ellām^ cāṉṟōr ceyyuḷ uṇmiyāṉ.

<P>iṉi, nilattu nīṅkātu eṉa ~ē, ōrūratu eṉpatupeṟappaṭṭatu; paṭṭamiyāṉ, taṉṉiṭattākavum peṟum,taṉṉiṭattu nīṅki+ cēyatākavum peṟum eṉpatu.

<P>iṉi, ōriṭattatu eṉpataṉāl, talimakaṉ iṭam peritu*ākalāṉ, talimakaḷatu iṭam um parattiyar cēri ~umvēṟāy nīṅki irukkum; atu taṉṉuḷ= ē ceykuṉṟam um vāviyumviḷiyāṭṭiṭam um ellām uṭittu* āyirukkum eṉpatu.

<H2>43</H2>
<P>	parattiyiṉ+ pirinta kiḻavōṉ maṉivi
<BR>	pūppiṉ puṟappāṭu* īr aṟu nāḷ um
<BR>	nīttu* akaṉṟu* uṟital aṟattu* āṟu* aṉṟu* ē.

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉpatu eṉ ^nutaliṟṟu* ō eṉiṉ, talimakaṉ parattiyiṟpirintaviṭattu+ talimakaṭku+ pūppu nikaḻnta kālattu+talimakaṉ ivvāṟu oḻukum eṉpatu uṇarttutal nutaliṟṟu.

<P>itaṉ poruḷ: parattiyiṟ pirinta kiḻavōṉ eṉpatu --puṟappeṇṭirmāṭṭu+ pirinta talimakaṉ eṉṟavāṟu; maṉivipūppiṉ puṟappāṭu īraṟu nāḷum eṉpatu -- kiḻatti pūppu+puṟappaṭṭa nāṇmutaṟ paṉṉirunāḷum eṉṟavāṟu; nīttu akaṉṟuuṟital aṟattāṟu aṉṟu* ē eṉpatu -- nīttum akaṉṟumuṟital aṟaneṟi ~aṉṟu eṉṟavāṟu.

<P>eṉa ~ē, nīyātum akalātum uṟital aṟaneṟi eṉṟavāṟu*ām; eṉpatu coṟkēṭkumvaḻi ~um kūṭi ~um uṟika eṉṟavāṟu.ivvāṟu uṟital ceyaṟpāṉmiyatu eṉṟavāṟu.

<P>aḵtu* āmāṟu: talimakaṉ parattiyiṟ pirinta kālattu+talimakaṭku+ pūppu+ tōṉṟiṟṟu; tōṉṟa+, talimakaṉuṇarum. eṅṅaṉam uṇarumō eṉiṉ, vāyilkaḷ uṇartta uṇarumeṉpatu. eṉṉi vāyilkaḷ uṇarttumāṟu //
<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P180">{{iṟi: Page 180}}</A>
<HR>
// eṉiṉ, talimakaṉ vāyilkaḷum talimakaḷmāṭṭu uḷavām;talimakaḷ vāyilkaḷum talimakaṉmāṭṭu uḷavām; ākalāṉ,avarkaḷ uṇartta uṇarum eṉpatu; allatūum, talimakaṉtamar aṉṟu* ē talimakaṟku nāḷāṉum paṭimakkalattoṭucelvār. aṟṟināḷāṟ ceṅkōlattoṭu* um^ cella uṇarum eṉpārum uḷar.

<P>iṉi, oru tiṟattār, pūppu nikaḻnta nāḷālē cēṭiyi+ceṅkōlañceytu ceppuppālikiyuḷ+ cempū ~um nīr um koṇṭuavaṉ aṭimēl+ peytu pōka, uṇarum eṉpār um uḷar. itumēlāyiṉār iṭaṅkaḷiṉ+ pūppu uṇarttumāṟu* eṉṟu ivvakicolluvar. nallatu aṟintu koḷka.

<P>ivvaki pūppu uṇarttappaṭṭa talimakaṉ taṉ neñciṟku+colliyataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<H3>((talimakaṉ taṉ neñciṟkurittal))</H3>

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 287}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
ivvakiyāṟ pūppu uṇarntu vāyilkaḷōṭu* um^ ceṉṟutalimakaḷ iṭattāṉāy munnāḷum^ coṟkēṭkumvaḻi uṟivāṉāvatu. uṟintapiṉṉi oṉpatunāḷum kūṭi uṟivāṉ āvatu.

<P>munnāḷum^ coṟkēṭkumvaḻi uṟitaṟku+ kāraṇam eṉṉi~eṉiṉ, talimakaṉ parattiyarmāṭṭāṉ āka muṉṉiṉṟapoṟāmi uṇṭu* aṉṟu* ē, atu munnāḷ um^ coṟkēṭkumvaḻiuṟiya ~ē nīṅkum. nīṅkiya piṉṉi+ kūṭṭam āka ~ēkaruniṉṟatu māṭcippaṭum. atu nōkki uṇarttappaṭṭatu.ataṉāṉ aṟam eṉappaṭṭatu.

<P>allātuviṭiṉ, talimakaḷmāṭṭu ōr poṟāmi tōṉṟum,parattiyarmāṭṭuniṉṟum vantāṉ eṉa; appoṟāmi oruvekuḷiyi+ tōṟṟuvikkum; tōṟṟiya vekuḷi periyatōrveppatti+ ceyvikkum; veppattiṉāṟ karu māṭcippaṭātu*ām; paṭātāka ~ē, aṟattiṉ vaḻuvām eṉpatu. ataṉāṉ,munnāḷum^ coṟkēṭkumvaḻi uṟivāṉ ām eṉpatu.

<P>pūppu+ puṟappaṭṭa munnāḷum uḷḷiṭṭa paṉṉiru nāḷ umeṉpatu tuṇipuṟṟāṅku munnāḷum kūṭi uṟiya+ paṭum^ kuṟṟam//
<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P181">{{iṟi: Page 181}}</A>
<HR>
// eṉṉō eṉiṉ, pūppu+ puṟappaṭṭañāṉṟu niṉṟa karuvayiṟṟil ē aḻiyum; iraṇṭām nāḷiṉ niṉṟa karu vayiṟṟil ēcām; mūṉṟām nāḷ niṟkum^ karu+ kuṟuvāḻkkittu* ām,vāḻiṉum tiru ~iṉṟām; ataṉāṟ kūṭappaṭātu eṉpa.

<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`pūppu mutal% munnāḷ+ puṇarār puṇariṉ
<BR>	yāppuṟu marapiṉ muṉivar um amarar um
<BR>	yātta karaṇam aḻiyum eṉpa'.

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉa+ piṟar um ōtiṉār ākalāṉ amiyātu eṉpatu.

<H2>44</H2>
<P>	kaṟpiṉuḷ+ pirintōṉ parattiyiṉ maṟuttantu
<BR>	apporuḷ+ paṭuppiṉum varinili iṉṟu* ē.

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉpatu eṉ ^nutaliṟṟu* ō eṉiṉ, mēli+ cūttirattiṟkuuriyatōr puṟaṉaṭi uṇarttutal nutaliṟṟu.

<P>itaṉ poruḷ: kaṟpiṉuḷ+ pirintōṉ eṉpatu -- parattiyarcēriyaṉāy+ pūppu uṇarttappaṭṭa talimakaṉ eṉṟavāṟu,pūppu nikaḻnta mutaṉmūṉṟu nāḷum vantu coṟkēṭkumvaḻiuṟivāṉilaṉ āyiṉ talimakaṉ kaṟpiṉuḷ+ pirintōṉeṉappaṭṭāṉ; kaṟpu eṉpatu pūppu eṉṟavāṟu; appūppu+kaṟpukkālattaṉṟi+ kaḷavukālattu nikaḻāmi nōkki+pūppiṉi ~um^ kaṟpu eṉṟu colliṉār eṉpatu; parattiyiṉmaṟuttantu eṉpatu -- ammūṉṟu nāḷum^ kaḻittu+parattiyarcēriniṉṟu nīṅki varuvatu eṉṟavāṟu; apporuḷ+paṭuppiṉum eṉpatu -- aṟattāṟupaṭuppiṉum eṉṟavāṟu;aṟattāṟu paṭuttal eṉpatu, talimakaḷi vāyilkaḷālcivappāṟṟuvittu+ pukku+ talimakaḷōṭu puṇartal;varinili iṉṟu* ē eṉpatu -- kuṟṟam eṉappaṭātu attuṇi+ciṟappu* iṉṟu* āyiṉum eṉṟavāṟu.

<P>talimakaḷi vāyilkaḷāṟ civappāṟṟuvittaṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<H3>((talimakaḷi+ civappāṟṟuvittal))</H3>

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 288}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉpatu.

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P182">{{iṟi: Page 182}}</A>
<HR>
<H2>45</H2>
<P>	pukaḻ um koṭumi ~um kiḻavōṉ mēṉa.

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉpatu eṉ ^nutaliṟṟu* ō eṉiṉ, talimakaṟku uriyatōrilakkaṇam uṇarttutal nutaliṟṟu.

<P>itaṉ poruḷ: pukaḻum koṭumi ~um eṉpatu -- pukaḻeṉpatu takkāṉ eṉappaṭutal, koṭumi eṉpatu takāṉeṉappaṭutal eṉṟavāṟu; kiḻavōṉ mēṉa eṉpatu -- aviiraṇṭum talimakaṉkaṇṇa eṉṟavāṟu.

<P>eṉa ~ē, ittaṉmittu+ talimakaṉ oḻukalāṟu eṉṟavāṟu.aḵtu* āmāṟu talimakaḷmāṭṭu uṟintakkāl takkāṉeṉappaṭutal um, parattiyarmāṭṭu uṟintakkāl takāṉeṉappaṭutal um eṉṟavāṟu.

<P>yārāl ō avi collappaṭuvatu eṉiṉ, vāyilkaḷāṉ eṉa+koḷka. avar, `pukaḻuṭiyaṉ' eṉpataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<H3>((takkāṉ eṉṟal))</H3>

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 289}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
iṉi, avar, `takāṉ' eṉṟataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<H3>((takāṉ eṉṟal))</H3>

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 290}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉpatu.

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P183">{{iṟi: Page 183}}</A>
<HR>
<H2>46</H2>
<P>	koṭumi illi+ kiḻavi mēṟṟu* ē.

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉpatu eṉ ^nutaliṟṟu* ō eṉiṉ, talimakaḷatu perumiuṇarttutal nutaliṟṟu.

<P>itaṉ poruḷ: koṭumi illi eṉpatu -- takkāḷeṉappaṭutal allatu takāḷ eṉappaṭutal illi eṉṟavāṟu;kiḻavi mēṟṟu* ē eṉpatu -- talimakaḷmāṭṭu eṉṟavāṟu.

<P>talimakaḷ ekkālattum orutaṉmiyaḷ eṉṟavāṟu;talimakaṉ taṉmāṭṭu vantu uṟinta kālattu* ē takkāḷ āy+parattiyarmāṭṭu+ ceṉṟu uṟinta kālattu+ takāḷ āṅkollōeṉiṉ, ākāḷ eṉṟavāṟu; ataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<H3>((talivi ciṟappurittal))</H3>

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 291}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
itu talimakaṉ parattiyarcēriyaṉāka+ talimakaḷpakkaṟpukka pāṇaṉ talimakaḷatu nilimi kaṇṭu taṉviṟalikku+ colliyatu.

<H2>47</H2>
<P>	kiḻavōṉ muṉṉar+ kiḻatti taṟpukaḻtal
<BR>	pulavi+ kālattum purivatu* aṉṟu* ē.

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉpatu eṉ ^nutaliṟṟu* ō eṉiṉ, talimakaḷtiṟattu iṉṉatōrkuṇam uṇṭu eṉpatu uṇarttutal nutaliṟṟu.

<P>itaṉ poruḷ: kiḻavōṉ muṉṉar+ kiḻatti taṟpukaḻtaleṉpatu -- talimakaṉ muṉṉar+ talimakaḷ taṉṉi+pukaḻtal eṉṟavāṟu; pulavi+ kālattu* um purivatu aṉṟu*ē eṉpatu -- pulavi+ kālattu* aṉṟu* ē aḵtu uriyatu,anta+ kālattu* um^ takātu eṉṟavāṟu.

<P>eṉa ~ē, talimakaḷ evviṭattum taṉṉi+ pukaḻappeṟāḷeṉpatu. eṉa ~ē, talimakaḷatu perumi peṟṟām. iṉi+,kiḻavi taṟpukaḻtal peṟāḷ eṉa, paratti taṟpukaḻtalpeṟum //
<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P184">{{iṟi: Page 184}}</A>
<HR>
// eṉpatu pōntatu. avvāṟu paratti taṟpukaḻtaṟku+ceyyuḷ:

<H3>((paratti taṟpukaḻtal))</H3>

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 292}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
piṟavum aṉṉa kaṇṭukoḷka.

<H2>48</H2>
<P>	nāṭu* um ūr um il= um cuṭṭi+
<BR>	taṉvayiṉ kiḷappiṉ pulavi+ poruṭṭu* ē.

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉpatu eṉ ^nutaliṟṟō eṉiṉ, talimakaḷ taṟpukaḻntāḷākaṟka, ivvāṟu colliyakkāl atu ~um pulavinimittameṉpatu uṇarttutal nutaliṟṟu.

<P>itaṉ poruḷ: nāṭum ūrum illum cuṭṭi eṉpatu -- nāṭu* ē ūrē il= ē ivaṟṟi+ karuti eṉṟavāṟu; taṉvayiṟ kiḷappiṟpulavi+ poruṭṭu* ē eṉpatu -- taṉkaṇ+ colliṟ pulavi+poruṭṭu* ām eṉṟavāṟu.

<P>tāṉ uṟiyum nāṭṭi ~um, taṉ ūri ~um, tāṉ piṟantakuṭiyi ~um colli+ talimakaḷ taṟpukaḻntāḷ ākaṟka;ivvāṟu colliyakkāl, itu pulavi+ poruṭṭu* ām eṉṟavāṟu.aḵtu* āmāṟu, `em nāṭu iṟappa ~um^ ciṟiyārāl ēvāḻappaṭuvatu' eṉa ~um,

<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`kuṟumpu cūḻ irukki maṟantali maṇantu
<BR>	ciṟu kūḻ valciyiṟ cil variyiṟṟu* ē
<BR>	annāṭṭu* uḷḷum em= ūr ām ē
<BR>	pulvāy valakkol lēcitar paṟṟi
<BR>	vaḷa naṉi kuṟinta vārittu* aṉṟu* ē
<BR>	av= ūr uḷḷum piṟanta illam
<BR>	kallā+ ciṟiyōr illam aṉṟu* ē'.

<P>{{C URAI}}
`aṉṉa ciṟiyar oḻukkam numakku+ takkatu* aṉṟu* ē!allatūum, emperumāṟku* eṉiṉ iṟappavum peruntaṉmiyaaṉṟu* ē! annīrārkku ivvāṟu taliyaḷi poṟukkum aṉṟu* ē'eṉa ~um //
<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P185">{{iṟi: Page 185}}</A>
<HR>
// collutal. ivvāṟu colliṉaviṭattu+ talimakaṉ māṭṭu+pulavi ~ē koḷḷa+ karuti+ coṉṉāḷ ām eṉpatu. ataṟku+ceyyuḷ:

<H3>((talivi taṟpukaḻtal))</H3>

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 293}}

<H2>49</H2>
<P>	avaṉvayiṉ kiḷappiṉ variviṉ poruṭṭu* ē.

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉpatu eṉ ^nutaliṟṟu* ō eṉiṉ, ivvāṟu colliṉ variviṉporuṭṭākum eṉpatu uṇarttutal nutaliṟṟu.

<P>itaṉ poruḷ: avaṉvayiṉ kiḷappiṉ eṉpatu -- nāṭu* um ūrum il= um cuṭṭi+ talimakaṉi+ cārtti+ colliṉ eṉṟavāṟu;variviṉ poruṭṭu* ē eṉpatu -- varital eṉpatu,nīkkiniṟuttaṟ poruḷa ~ām eṉṟavāṟu.

<P>yātiṉi nīkki niṟuttal ō eṉiṉ, pulaviyi nīkkiniṟuttal. aḵtu eṉṉi peṟumāṟu eṉiṉ, mēṟcūttirattiṟ,`pulavi' eṉṟu atikāram vārāniṉṟatu* ākalāṉ eṉpatu.

<P>parattiyi maṟuttantu vāyilāṟ pukka talimakaṉiēṟṟu etirkoṇṭu vaḻipaṭṭāḷ; piṉṉi+ kāraṇattiṉ nīṅkiyapoṟāmikku+ kāraṇam peṟṟu+ tōṟṟiṟṟu. atu tōṉṟa+,talimakaṉi oṉṟaṉ talikkīṭāka+ collutal; `emperumāṉ,nīr peritākiya nāṭṭiṟ peritummikka ūriṟ peritum mikkakulattiṟ piṟanta pēroḻukkattiṉīrkku+ takkatu* ē ciṟiyēmākiya entiṟattu+ taliyaḷi!' eṉa+ collutal; ivvāṟucolluvāḷ pulavi nīkkuvāṉ colliṟṟāka eṉpatu; avvāṟucolliyataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<H3>((mikkīrkkitu takkataṉṟeṉṟal))</H3>

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 294}}

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P186">{{iṟi: Page 186}}</A>
<HR>
<P>{{C URAI}}
i+ cūttiratti+ paruntuvīḻkkāṭāka+ kiṭantatu* eṉṟu,kaḷaviṉuḷ variviṉ poruṭṭāka eṉpār um uḷar. atuporuttam aṉṟu. eṉṉi,

<P>	`varital vēṭki+ poruḷa'
<BR>		(([iṟiyaṉār-30]))

<P>eṉṟa cūttirattuḷ, `aṉṉa marapiṟ piṟavum^ tokii'eṉṟa vaḻi aṭaṅkum. allatūum, kaṟpiṉuḷ+ kaḷavu koṇarntuurittal poruntātu.

<H2>50</H2>
<P>	uṇarppu vayiṉ vārā ūṭal tōṉṟiṟ
<BR>	pulattal tāṉ ē kiḻavaṟku* um variyār.

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉpatu eṉ ^nutaliṟṟu* ō eṉiṉ, talimakaṭku* ē uriyatu*ōr ilakkaṇam ōr iṭattu+ talimakaṟku* um urittu eṉpatuuṇarttutal nutaliṟṟu.

<P>itaṉ poruḷ: uṇarppu vayiṉ vārā ūṭal tōṉṟiṉ eṉpatu --uṇarttutaṟku iṭamvārā ūṭal talimakaṭku veḷippaṭṭuniṟpiṉ eṉṟavāṟu; pulattal tāṉ ē kiḻavaṟku* um variyāreṉpatu -- pulantu collutal+ ^taṉmi talimakaṟku* umvariyār eṉṟavāṟu.

<P>atu talimakaṭku* ē urittu* aṉṟu. avi i+nērattukkaṇ talimakaṟku* um uriya eṉṟavāṟu.

<P>talimakaḷ māṭṭu ūṭal tōṉṟumiṭattu mūṉṟu vakiyāṉūṭal tōṉṟum, ceytāṉ kollō eṉa ~um ceyyāniṉṟāṉ kollō eṉa~um ceyvāṉ kollō eṉa ~um, avaṟṟuḷ ceytāṉ kollō eṉa+piṟattal eṉpatu, parattiyi+ tēr ēṟṟiṉāṉ, pū+cūṭṭiṉāṉ, avaḷōṭu āṭiṉāṉ kollō pirintāṉ kollō eṉa+piṟappatu. i+ ceytāṉ eṉpatu iṟantakālattu+ tuṇipu paṟṟinikaḻvatu. iṉi ceyvāṉ kollō eṉpatu etirkālattu+ ceyyum^kollō eṉa nikaḻvatu. avaṟṟuḷ iṟantakālattu* ē tāṉnikaḻntatu uṇarttutaṟku iṭaṉ uṭittu* aṉṟu; teṟṟeṉaaṟintēṉ allātēṉ emperumāṉi varuttuvēṉ ō eṉa ~um tāṉ ē~um mīṇṭu nili ~uṭittu. piṟar ciṟitu colla ~um mīṇṭumnili ~uṭittu, iṉi, etirkālattu* ē nikaḻvatu* ummīṇṭum nili ~uṭittu, teṟṟeṉa aṟinteṉ allātēṉ orukālattu nikaḻvatu* eṉa+ karututal poruntātu. eṉṉi, //
<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P187">{{iṟi: Page 187}}</A>
<HR>
// ~āṟu varukiṉṟatu* eṉṟu āṭi tali+ cūṭār aṉṟu* ēeṉpatu. iṉi, iṟantakālattu+ tuṇivu paṟṟi nikaḻntatu*uṇṭu* aṉṟu* ē, aḵtu* ellārum uṇara+ ceytāṉ ākalāṉ um,aḵtu uṇarttutaṟku iṭam aṉṟu, atu ceytilēṉ eṉṟucolliviṭiṉ atu maṟivatu* aṉṟu* ākalāṉ eṉpatu. iṉimaṟuppāṉ āyiṉ, ceytaṉa mēlum^ cempū+ citaṟiṉāṟpōla+koṭumi ~uṭittu* ām. atu tāṉ uṇarttutaṟku iṭaṉ aṉṟu*āyiṟṟu eṉpatu, av= ūṭal tōṉṟum eṉiṉ eṉṟavāṟu.

<P>eṉa ~ē, e+ nērattukkaṇ= ē tōṉṟuvatu eṉiṉ+ collutum:parattiyar cēriyiṉiṉṟum vanta tōḻiyi vāyilāka+koṇṭāṉ; koḷḷa+, tōḻi pukku+ pala kāraṇam um^ kāṭṭiṉāḷ;kāṭṭuvāḷ, `nām illiruntu iṟivaḻipaṭṭu, makkaḷivaḷarttu, viruntu puṟantarutal allatu pōkattuḷḷām aṉṟu*ē, allātēm ūṭal um pulavi ~um tuṉi ~um koḷḷaṟpālamallam;

<P>allatūum, vaṇṭōr aṉiyar āṭavar, pūvōr aṉiyar makaḷireṉpatu; eṉṉi, vaṇṭukaḷ tātu* ūtumiṭattu naṉmalar ēūtuvēm allātatu ūtēm eṉṉā, ellā malar um ūtum; iṉi+, pū~āyiṉakkāl, `emmi ~ē ūtā ellā+ pūvi ~um ūtiṉa' eṉṟupulavātu* aṉṟu* ē; atu pōla+ talimakaṉ um ellā+peṇpālkaḷi ~um talippeytal+ ^taṉmiyāṉ; a+ taṉmiaṟivāṉ pōmpoḻutu puṟantoḻutu varumpoḻutu etirtoḻutuēṟṟukkoṇṭu vaḻipaṭutal allatu malittaṟkaṇṇēm allam;malittu i+ peṟṟiyam ātal talimi ~aṉṟu;

<P>allatūum, ivvāṟu* ē vaḻipaṭātu* oḻivām allātu* āmnamperumāṉi varutti eṉ ceytum eṉṟu ēṟṟukkoṇṭuvaḻipaṭuvatu `poruḷ ē pōla+ kāṭṭum' eṉṟu iṅṅaṉam^colla, `aḵtu* okkum piṟa' eṉṟu appōtikku+ civappunīṅkiṟṟu; nīṅka+ `pukutuka' eṉṟāḷ. eṉa, avaṉ pukkāṉ.pukku+ paḷḷiyiṭattāṉ āka, uḷḷuṭittu* ākiya civappu+tōṉṟum eṉpatu; tōṉṟa+ kaṇ civantu nutal vēṟupaṭṭu+kāṭṭiṉāḷ; kāṭṭa+ peritum āṟṟāṉ āyiṉāṉ; āṟṟā+ taṉmiyaṉē ~āy iṟantakālattu nikaḻntaṉavaṟṟi+ paṟṟi+ pulantucollum. `eṉṉi, mēli+ kālattu nām āṟṟām āka+ tāṉ āṟṟāḷāy nām āṟṟa āṟṟi varukiṉṟa ivaḷ ē, iṟṟiyiṉ ūṅku nāmāṟṟām āyatu aṟiyāmiyāl, iv= āṟṟāmi //
<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P188">{{iṟi: Page 188}}</A>
<HR>
// eṉṉi ~āṟṟilāmiyāl ivaḷ nam^ kātali ~allaḷ. avaḷpōlvatu* ōr teyvam; nī avaḷ eṉa+ karutiṉāy neñcē,niṉatu maṭamiyāl; neñciṟku+ collum; avaḷ yār ākiyāḷeṉa neñciṟku+ colliyataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<H3>((talimakaṉ neñciṟku* urittal))</H3>

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 295}}

<P><P>{{S 296}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉpatu, talimakaṉ neñciṟku+ colliyatu. atu kēṭṭatalimakaḷ, `mēṉāḷ yāṉ ceyta kuṟṟa vēl uṭkoḷvāṉ āyiṟṟu,eṉkaṇ+ pēraruḷiṉāṉ aṉṟu* ē, ivvaki+ pēraruḷiṉāṉtiṟattu ivvaki civattal takātu' eṉṟu civappu nīṅkuvāḷāvatu.

<H2>51</H2>
<P>	nilampeyarntu* uṟiyum niliyiyal maruṅkiṉ
<BR>	kaḷavuṟi kiḷavi tōṉṟuvatu* āyiṉ
<BR>	tiṇinilippeyarkkōḷ kiḻavaṟku* um variyār.

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉpatu eṉ ^nutaliṟṟu* ō eṉiṉ, iṉṉum^ kaṟpukkālattu+talimakaṟku uriyatōr ilakkaṇam uṇarttutal nutaliṟṟu.

<P>itaṉ poruḷ: nilam peyarntu uṟiyum niliyiyalmaruṅkiṉ eṉpatu -- nilampeyarntu uṟiyum eṉpatu,uḷḷattukkaṇ nilipeṟṟaviṭattu eṉṟavāṟu; kaḷavuṟikiḷavi tōṉṟuvatu āyiṉ eṉpatu -- kaḷavu kālattiṟkuriyacol talimakaḷmāṭṭu+ tōṉṟum ē eṉiṉ eṉṟavāṟu;tiṇinili+ peyarkkōḷ kiḻavaṟkum variyār eṉpatu --tiṇinili+ peyarntukoḷḷum^ kōḷ talimakaṟkum variyāreṉṟavāṟu.

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P189">{{iṟi: Page 189}}</A>
<HR>
aḵtu* āmāṟu, talimakaḷi eyti+ kaṟpukkālattuoḻukāniṉṟa nilimikkaṇ neñcu poruṭku+ piritum eṉṟatueṉpatu.

<P>`naṭṭāri ~ākkutal um ceṟṟāri+ citittal umporuṭkuṟipāṭu uṭiyārkku nikaḻāvākalāṟ kuṟipāṭunīṅka+ poruṭku+ piritum' eṉṟa neñciṟku+ talimakaṉ, nāmporuṭku+ piriya ivaḷ āṟṟumēṟ piritum, āṟṟāḷ āyiṉoḻitum' eṉṟu neñciṉōṭum oruppaṭṭu+ talimakaḷuḻi+pukkāṉ; pukku+ paḷḷiyiṭattāṉ āki+ periyatu* ōraruḷicceyki ceytāṉ; ceyya+ talimakaḷ, `emperumāṉpaṇṭu* um aruḷicceyki ceytāṉ maṉ, ivi paṇṭu* ēpōlātu, peritum iḻumattakkaṉa pōla+ kāṭṭiṉa, piriya+karutiṉāṉ kavaṭu pōlum' "maṟṟu niṉṉiṟ piriyēṉ piriyiṉāṟṟēṉ" eṉṟu collum col poyppaṭṭatu* ām' eṉa poy eṉṟumoḻukkam^ kuṟipāṭāmatu piṟa ~eṉa eṉṟu āṟṟāḷ āyiṉāḷ. av=āṟṟāttaṉmi talimakaṟku+ pulaṉ āyiṟṟu* ākalāṉ, `ivaḷkuṟippiṉāṉ ē pirivu* uṇarntu āṟṟāḷ āyiṉāḷ, piriyiṉiṟantupaṭum' eṉṟu talimakaṉ neñciṟku+ colliyataṟku+ceyyuḷ:

<H3>((neñciṟkurittal))</H3>

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 297}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
ivvaṇṇam neñciṟku+ colli+ celavaḻuṅkiyataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<H3>((talimakaṉ celavaḻuṅkal))</H3>

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 298}}

<P><P>{{S 299}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
ivvāṟum neñciṟku+ colli+ celavaḻuṅkum.

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P190">{{iṟi: Page 190}}</A>
<HR>
<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`maruntu* eṉiṉ maruntu* ē vippu* eṉiṉ vippu* ē
<BR>	arumpiya cuṇaṅkiṉ am pakaṭṭu* iḷa muli+
<BR>	perum^ tōḷ nuṇukiya nucuppiṉ
<BR>	kal keḻu kāṉavar nalkuṟu makaḷ ē'.
<BR>		(([kuṟun. -- 71]))

<P>{{C URAI}}
ivvāṟu niṉintu pālinilattāṉ āyiṉāṉ celavu* aḻuṅkimarutanilattāṉ āyiṉāṉ eṉa+ koḷka. atu, `tiṇinili+peyarkkōḷ' kiḻavaṟku* um uṇṭāyiṉavāṟu. piriviṉivēṇṭātāḷ talimakaḷ āyiṉum talimakaṉ um vēṇṭātāṉākaliṉ, i+ nērattukkaṇ eṉṟavāṟu.

<P>iṉṉum, `nilampeyarntu uṟiyum niliyiyaṉ maruṅkiṉ'eṉpatu, uṭaṉkoṇṭu pōvēṉ eṉa+ talimakaṉ uḷḷattiṉkaṇnilipeṟṟaviṭattu eṉṟavāṟu.

<P>`kaḷavu* uṟi kiḷavi' eṉpatu, kaḷavu* uṟintakālattiṟku uriya col, aṟattoṭunili eṉṟavāṟu.

<P>`tōṉṟuvatu* āyiṉ' eṉpatu, talimakaṉ mēl tōḻi māṭṭu+tōṉṟum ē eṉiṉ eṉṟavāṟu.

<P>`tiṇinili+ peyarkkōḷ kiḻavaṟku* um variyār'eṉpatu, pālinilattāṉ āyiṉāṉ talimakaṉ marutanilattāṉāyiṉāṉ eṉpatu.

<P>kiḻavaṟku* um variyār eṉṟa ummiyāl kiḻattikku* umvariyār eṉakkoḷka. ivaḷ um uṭaṉpōkku oṭṭi+pālinilattāḷ āyiṉāḷ, ivaṉ oḻintami collamarutanilattāḷ āyiṉaḷ eṉa+ koḷka. mēl uṭaṉpōkku+cūttirattukkaṇ urikkum poruḷ ītu* eṉṟu koḷka.

<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`poruḷ vayiṟ piriyiṉum puṇarntu* uṭaṉpōkiṉum
<BR>	atu pirivu* urippiṉum pāli ~ākum'.

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉṟār ākaliṉ.

<H2>52</H2>
<P>	nilampeyarntu* uṟiyum ellā+ pirivu* um
<BR>	oḻintōr aṟiya ~um aṟiyāmi ~um
<BR>	kaḻintu cēṭpaṭūum iyaṟkiya eṉpa.

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉpatu eṉ ^nutaliṟṟu* ō eṉiṉ, itu ~um kaṟpu+ kālattu+talimakaṉ piriviṉkaṇ uriyatu* ōr ilakkaṇam uṇarttutalnutaliṟṟu.

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P191">{{iṟi: Page 191}}</A>
<HR>
itaṉ poruḷ: nilam peyarntu uṟiyum ellā+ pirivum eṉpatu-- parattiyiṟ pirivoḻittu ellā+ pirivum eṉṟavāṟu;oḻintōr aṟiyavum aṟiyāmi ~um eṉpatu -- talimakaḷ umtōḻi ~um aṟiya ~um aṟiyāmi ~um eṉṟavāṟu; kaḻintucēṭpaṭum iyaṟkiya eṉpa eṉpatu -- kāṭu* iṭiyiṭṭu* umnāṭu* iṭiyiṭṭu* um akaṉṟu uṟital+ ^taṉmiyar eṉṟucolluvar pulavar eṉṟavāṟu.

<P>eṉa ~ē,

<P>	`ōtal kāval pakitaṇi viṉi ~ē
<BR>	vēntaṟku* uṟṟuḻi+ poruṭpiṇi+ pirivu' (([iṟiyaṉār-- 35]))

<P>eṉa, ivaṟṟiṟku+ pirikiṉṟavaṉ talimakaḷi ~um tōḻiyi~um aṟiyaccolli+ pirital um uṭiyaṉ, aṟiyāmi+piriyavum uṭiyaṉ, iraṇṭum ilakkaṇam eṉpatu.

<P>avaṟṟuḷ aṟiyāmi+ pirital poruttamiṉṟu.

<P>aṟiya+ pirivatu, `yāṉ iṉṉatōriṭattu iṉṉatōr karumammuṭittu varuvēṉ' eṉa avaḷi uṭaṉpaṭuttu+ pirivatu* ētakkatu.

<P>allatu, avaṉ collātu pirintaviṭattu, `ivvaki collātupiritaṟku+ kāraṇam eṉṉikollō' eṉa ~ē kavalpa ~ākaliṉ,aḵtu aṟiyāmi+ pirital eṉpatu.

<P>cilanāḷ iṭiyuṭittāka ōratikārampaṭuttu, `iṅṅaṉampirintu oru karumam muṭittukkoṇṭu vantār talimakkaḷ,talimakaḷirum avar atu muṭittu varuntuṇi ~umāṟṟiyiruntuvantār, iḵtu ulakiṉatupaṇpu' eṉṉum. eṉa,`okkumpiṟa, talimakaṉ pirintu poruḷmuṭittu niṉṟakkāltalimakaḷir āṟṟārāpa ~ē' eṉiṉ, `avaratu āḷviṉiyiiṭiyūṟuceytārāvarpiṟa, ataṉāl, avar pirintu poruṇmuṭittu varuntuṇi ~um āṟṟuvatu* ē ~ākātu* ēceyyappaṭuvatu' eṉṉum. eṉa, `āṟṟuvēṉ' eṉṟāḷ,iṭiyuṭittālō eṉpataṉāṉ. eṉṉi, cātal um keṭutal umellā ~uyir um aṟiyum ē ~eṉiṉum cettāl ō eṉpataṉāṟkalaṅkār maṉaṉ; aṉṉatu ivaṭku* um ām eṉpatu, iṅṅaṉamuṇarttivittār piriyum nāḷatu katumeṉa+ kalaṅki āṟṟāḷāka ~um pōvatu cāntaṉmiyāṉ eṉpataṉāl peṟṟatu* ēilēcāka+ pirivatu karumam eṉṟu muṟpaṭātu pirital umuṭiyaṉ eṉpatu. "annāḷ āṟṟuvēṉ eṉṟāy aṉṟu* ē, āṟṟāḷāvataṟku+ //
<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P192">{{iṟi: Page 192}}</A>
<HR>
// kāraṇam illi mēṟpoyyā+ taṉmiyaḷ ākaliṉ" eṉṟumuṟpaṭṭu āṟṟuvittu+ tōḻiyi ōmpaṭi ēvi+ piriyavumpeṟum eṉpatu, aṟiya+ pirivatu valiyuṭittu.

<P>aṟiyāmi+ pirinta talimakaṉiyuṭiya kiḻatticolliyataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 300}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
aḵtu* ē ~eṉiṉ, nilampeyarntu uṟiyum pirivu* um oḻintōraṟiya ~um aṟiyāmi ~um eṉa amiyātu* ē, `ellām' eṉṟatueṟṟiṟkō eṉiṉ, kaḷavukālattum oru pirivu collappaṭṭatu*aṉṟu* ē, nilampeyarntu uṟivatu paṭṭapiṉṟivariyākkiḻavaṉ neṭṭiṭi kaḻintu poruḷvayiṟ pirivatueṉa; aṅku* um aṟiya+ piriyavum, aṟiyāmaṟ piriyavumamiyum eṉpataṟkum collappaṭṭatu eṉpatu.

<P>`cēṭpaṭum iyaṟkiyatu' eṉa amiyātu* ē, `kaḻintu'eṉṟatu eṟṟiṟkō eṉiṉ, kaḻintapiṉṟi+ kaḻital ē ~allatuiṭiccurattu* ē niṉṟāṉum annilattu* ē niṉṟāṉum peyartalilli eṉpatu; eṉṉi, ciṟṟaṟiviṉār aṉṟu* ē, oru karumameṭuttukkoṇṭu muṭippāṉ pukku, muṭiyātu tavirvār eṉpatu.

<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`āṭiya veṟi ~um aḻuṅkiya celavu* um
<BR>	nāṭum^ kāli il= eṉa moḻipa'.

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉṟār piṟar.

<P>iṉṉum, aṟiyāmaṟ piritaṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`celvār allar eṉṟu^ yāṉ ikaḻntaṉaṉ ē
<BR>	olvāḷ allaḷ eṉṟu* avar ikaḻntaṉar ē
<BR>	āyiṭi iru pēr āṇmi ceyta pūcal
<BR>	nallarā+ katuvi āṅku* eṉ
<BR>	allal neñcam alamalakkuṟum ē'.
<BR>		(([kuṟun-43]))

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉpatūum^ koḷka.

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P193">{{iṟi: Page 193}}</A>
<HR>
<H2>53</H2>
<P>	ellā vāyilum kiḻavōṉ pirivayiṉ
<BR>	pal= āṟṟāṉ um vaṉpuṟi kuṟittaṉṟu.

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉpatu eṉ ^nutaliṟṟu* ō eṉiṉ, piriviṭi āṟṟāḷ āyatalimakaḷi vāyilkaḷ āṟṟuvikkumāṟu uṇarttutalnutaliṟṟu.

<P>itaṉ poruḷ: ellā vāyilum eṉpatu -- talimakaṉumviruntum oḻintu ellā vāyilkaḷum; tōḻi ~um pārppāṉumpāṇaṉum pāṭiṉi ~um eṉa ivarkaḷ kiḻavōṉ pirivayiṉtalimakaṉ nāṭiṭiyiṭṭum kāṭiṭiyiṭṭum piriyumpiriviṉkaṇ; pal āṟṟāṉ um vaṉpuṟi kuṟittaṉṟu -- palaneṟiyāṉ um āṟṟuvittali+ karutiṉa eṉṟavāṟu.

<P>eṉpatu, paruvam kuṟikkappaṭṭa talimakaḷ paruvavaraviṉkaṇ, āṟṟāḷ āy+, `kārpparuvam varumvaḻi avarpāṇippārallar, vantār, vārāniṉṟār, varuvar' eṉa ~um,`itaṉipparuvamaṉṟeṉṟum paḻittu, ataṉi+ paruvam ē eṉa+karutiṉāy ē ~eṉil avarāṟ kuṟikkappaṭṭa paruvam aṉṟu;eṉṉi, avar poyyuri uriyār ākalāṉ; yām teḷiyēm' eṉa~um, kālam^ kāṭṭi ~um, cokiṉam^ colli ~um, yāḻ paṇṇi~um ellāttiṟattāṉum talimakaḷi āṟṟuvikkum eṉpatu.iṉitalimakaṉṟaṉṉi, `aṉpilaṉ koṭiyaṉ' eṉa ~um i+toṭakkattaṉa ellām^ colli ~um āṟṟuvikkum.

<P>avaṟṟuḷ+ paruva varaviṉkaṇ āṟṟāḷ āya talimakaḷiāṟṟuvittaṟku+ paṭittu moḻintu paruvam aṉṟu eṉṟataṟku+ceyyuḷ:

<H3>((paruvamaṉṟeṉṟal))</H3>

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 301}}

<P><P>{{S 302}}

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P194">{{iṟi: Page 194}}</A>
<HR>
<P>{{S 303}}

<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`nīr aṟa vaṟanta nirampā nīḷ iṭi+
<BR>	tukil virittaṉṉa veyil avir uruppiṉ
<BR>	añcuvara+ paṉikkum vem^ curam iṟantōr
<BR>	tām vara+ teḷitta paruvam^ kāṇvara
<BR>	itu ~ō eṉṟiciṉ maṭanti mati ~iṉṟu
<BR>	maṟantu kaṭal mukanta kamam^ cūl mā maḻi
<BR>	poṟuttal cellātu* iṟutta vaṇ peyal
<BR>	kār eṉṟu* ayarnta uḷḷamoṭu tērvu ila
<BR>	piṭa ~um koṉṟi ~um kōṭal um
<BR>	maṭava ākaliṉ malarntaṉa pala ~ē'.
<BR>		(([naṟṟiṇi -- 99]))

<P>{{C URAI}}
ivi piriviṭi+ paruvaṅkaṇṭu āṟṟāḷ āya talimakaḷi ituparuvam aṉṟu; eṉṉi, avar poyyuriyār ākalāṉ; itu ~umvampu; vampiṉi+ paruvam eṉṟu tam maṭamiyāṟ piṭavu* umkōṭal um koṉṟi ~um mayaṅki+ pūttaṉa' eṉṟu vaṟpuṟuttāḷ.

<H3>((varuvareṉa vaṟpuṟuttiyatu))</H3>

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 304}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
itu piriviṭi ~āṟṟāḷ ākiya talimakaḷi+ tōḻi, `avarkuṟitta paruvam vantatu* ākaliṉ avarum poyyār, varuvar'eṉṟu vaṟpuṟuttiyatu.

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 305}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
itu ~um atu.

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 306}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
itu ~um atu.

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P195">{{iṟi: Page 195}}</A>
<HR>
<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 307}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
itu ~um atu.

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 308}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
itu ~um atu.

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 309}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
itu ~um atu.

<P>aḵtu* ē ~eṉiṉ, `ellā vāyil um^ kiḻavōṉ pirivayiṉvaṉpuṟi kuṟitta' eṉṉātu, `pallāṟṟāṉum' eṉa mikipaṭa+kūṟiyavataṉāṉ kaṟpukkālattu+ kaṭimaṉi ceṉṟa cevili,talimakaṉatu nilimi ~um talimakaḷatu nilimi ~umpārttu vantu naṟṟāykku+ colliyaṉavum koḷka; ataṟku+ceyyuḷ:

<H3>((cevili naṟṟāykkurittal))</H3>

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 310}}

<P><P>{{S 311}}

<P><P>{{S 312}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
piṟavum^ koḷka.

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P196">{{iṟi: Page 196}}</A>
<HR>
<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`kāṉam^ kōḻi kavarkuraṟ cēval
<BR>	oṇpoṟi eruttiṉ taṇcitar uṟippa+
<BR>	putalnīr vārum pūnāṟu puṟaviṟ
<BR>	cīṟūrōḷ ē maṭanti vēṟūr
<BR>	vēntuviṭu toḻiloṭu celiṉum
<BR>	cērntuvaral aṟiyātu cemmal tēr ē'.
<BR>		(([kuṟun. -- 242]))

<P>{{C URAI}}
maṟṟum^ kaṟpukkālattu+ kiḷavikaḷ itu nilamāka+koḷḷappaṭuvaṉa ~ellām aṟintukoḷka.

<H2>54</H2>
<P>	vaṉpuṟi kuṟitta vāyil ellām
<BR>	aṉputali+ pirinta kiḷavi tōṉṟiṟ
<BR>	ciṟippuṟam^ kuṟittaṉṟu* eṉmaṉār pulavar.

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉpatu eṉ ^nutaliṟṟu* ō eṉiṉ, mēṟ cūttirattuāṟṟuvittukkoṇṭirukkumāṟu uṇartti+ pōntār, iṉi+,talimakaṉ piriveṭuttukkoṇṭu piriyumiṭattu vāyilkaḷukkuuṇartta, vāyilkaḷ talimakaṭku+ pirivuṇartta+talimakaḷatu vāyilkaḷ ām iṭattu+ ciṟippuṟattāṉ ākaavaṉ kēṭkum aṇimikkaṇ uṇarttuka eṉpatu uṇarttutalnutaliṟṟu; eṉpār um,

<P>iṉi+, talimakaṉatu piriviṉkaṇ talimakaḷ āṟṟāḷāyiṉaviṭattu+ ciṟippuṟam^ kūṟiyum āṟṟuvikka eṉpatuuṇarttutal nutaliṟṟu eṉpār um uḷar.

<P>itaṉ poruḷ: vaṉpuṟi kuṟitta vāyil ellām eṉpatu --talimakaḷi āṟṟuvikkum vakiyāl āṟṟuvittaṟkuriya vāyilellām, eṉṟavāṟu; aṉpu talippirinta kiḷavi tōṉṟiṉeṉpatu -- talimakaṉ piriviṉkaṇ talimakaḷ āṟṟāḷāyiṉaviṭattu, eṉṟavāṟu; eṉpatu avviṭattu vāyilkaḷāṟṟuvikkaṟpāla, āṟṟuvikka killātaviṭattu; ciṟippuṟamkuṟittaṉṟu eṉmaṉār pulavar eṉpatu --ciṟippuṟattukkaṇṇuṟuttu āṟṟuvikka eṉa+ colluvar kaṟṟuvallōr eṉṟavāṟu.

<P>`ciṟippuṟam^ kuṟittaṉṟu' eṉpatu, kaṟpeṉappaṭṭaciṟimēlvittu āṟṟuvittal eṉpatu. aḵtu* āmāṟu,mēṟcolliṉa muṟiyāṉ ellām āṟṟuvippa ~um āṟṟāḷ āyniṉṟatalimakaḷi ivvāṟṟāṉ ē āṟṟuvittu+ kāṇpaṉ eṉa+ karuti,//
<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P197">{{iṟi: Page 197}}</A>
<HR>
// namperumāṭṭi piṟanta kulam mēṉāḷtoṭṭum oḻukka+citiviṉṟi viḻuppamuṭittāy ōṅki vārāniṉṟatu* oruperuṅkulam aṉṟu* ē, a+ kulatti nī aḻittal takkatō!kāṇum kaṟpu* um aṉṟu* ē peṇṭirkku aṇikalam āvaṉaeṉpataṉāl, i+ kulattiṉavar kaṟpu* eṉappaṭṭa ciṟiaḻiyāmi kāttukkoṇṭoḻukiṉār, ataṉi nī aḻikkiṉṟāyākaliṉ niṉkaṇ+ periyatōr paḻi ~ākkukiṉṟāy' eṉṟum,`namperumāṉ um tamatu āṇmittaṉmi kāṭṭippirintār, nī~um avar karutiyatu muṭittu varum^ tuṇi ~umkaṟpukkāttirukka vēṇṭum' eṉṟum, `cāṉṟōrmakaḷir eṉpārciṟiyaraṉṟi+ periyarākalvēṇṭum; attaṉmi ~eṉpatutaṅkulanōkki+ tam kaṟpukkāttu oḻukiṉ, ataṉiṉ mikkatu*illi' eṉṟum ivvaki āṟṟuvittal, ciṟippuṟam^ kuṟittal'eṉpatu; ataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<H3>((ciṟippuṟam^ kuṟittal))</H3>

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 313}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
ivvaki colli āṟṟuvittal ē, `ciṟippuṟaṅkuṟittal'eṉṟavāṟu.

<H2>55</H2>
<P>	ciṟippuṟam kuṟiyā tōṉṟal um uḷa ~ē
<BR>	avaṉ+ puṇarvu* aṟiyum kuṟippiṉ āṉa.

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉpatu eṉ ^nutaliṟṟu* ō eṉiṉ, talimakaṉ pirintavaḻi+talimakaḷ āṟṟāḷ āyiṉaviṭattu+ talimakaṉatu varavucolli āṟṟuvikka eṉpatu uṇarttutal nutaliṟṟu.

<P>itaṉ poruḷ: ciṟippuṟam kuṟiyā tōṉṟal um uḷa ~ēeṉpatu -- mēl tōḻi kaṟpu* eṉappaṭṭa ciṟiyi aḻikkiṉṟāyeṉṟu* aṉṟu* ē āṟṟuvittatu, avvāṟaṉṟi varuvaṉa ~um uḷaeṉṟavāṟu; avaṉ puṇarvu aṟiyum kuṟippiṉ āṉa eṉpatu --talimakaṉ viṉimuṟṟi ~āṉum poruṇmuṟṟi ~āṉum varum^kuṟippiṉkaṇ eṉṟavāṟu.

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P198">{{iṟi: Page 198}}</A>
<HR>
aḵtu* āmāṟu, mēl avvakiyāṟ pirivu* eṭuttukkoṇṭuāṟṟuvittār, āṟṟal kaṇṭu pirintavaḻi+ tōḻi talimakaḷiāṟṟuvittukkoṇṭu iruntāḷ aṉṟu* ē; iruntaviṭattu+talimakaṉ um tāṉ eṭuttukkoṇṭa viṉi muṭittāṉ aṉṟu* ē;muṭittavaḻiyāṉ+ kuṟittakālam vantatu eṉṟu, maṟuttum^cārntāṉ aṉṟu* ē; cārnta iṭattu+ caṅkam paṭakam vantuicittaṉa. icippa+, tōḻi talimakaṉatu varavu*uṇarntu, `emperumāṭṭi, nī iṟantupaṭuvāṉ pukkāyāl,kaṇṭāy aṉṟu* ē, uḷḷārāl eytappaṭāta poruḷ illi, nīāṟṟiyuḷḷāy ākiṉṟu* ē iṉṟu* um emperumāṉi vaḻipaṭuvāyāyiṉāy āyiṟṟu' eṉa ivvāṟu collutal, `ciṟippuṟam^kuṟiyā tōṉṟal um uḷa ~ē' eṉpatu.

<P>caṅka paṭakam icippa+ caṅkiṉi vāḻtti+colliyataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<H3>((caṅkiṉi vāḻttal))</H3>

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 314}}

<P>{{C CITA}}
<BR>	`puri vaḷi vāl% kōṭu puttēḷōṭu* otti
<BR>	tiru ~amar mārpaṉ um ēntiṉaṉ tammuṉ
<BR>	uruvam puriyum niṉ kēḻ'.

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉpatūum^ koḷka.

<H2>56</H2>
<P>	tiṇi ~ē kikōḷ kūṟṟu* ē kēṭpōr
<BR>	iṭaṉ ē kālam eccam meyppāṭu
<BR>	payaṉ ē kōḷ eṉṟāṅku* a+ pattu* ē
<BR>	akaṉ aintiṇi ~um urittal āṟu* ē.

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉpatu eṉ ^nutaliṟṟu* ō eṉiṉ, mēṟ kaḷavum kaṟpumuṇarttiṉār, iṉi avviraṇṭumpaṟṟi varukiṉṟa pāṭṭiṉi i+kūṟappaṭṭa pattu* ilakkaṇattāṉ um urikka eṉpatuuṇarttutal nutaliṟṟu.

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P199">{{iṟi: Page 199}}</A>
<HR>
itaṉ poruḷ: tiṇi ~eṉpatu palporuḷ oru collāy+kiṭantatu: nilattiṉi ~um tiṇi ~eṉpa, kulattiṉi ~umtiṇi ~eṉpa, oḻukkattiṉi ~um tiṇi ~eṉpa; āka ~ē,ākupeyarāl, avarāl oḻukalāṟu nikaḻnta iṭatti ~um tiṇieṉṟār; avi, kuṟiñci pāli mulli marutam neytal eṉaaintuvakippaṭum.

<P>avi aṟiyumiṭattu, mutal karu uripporuḷpaṟṟiaṟiyappaṭum eṉṟavāṟu. av= ilakkaṇam ellām mēl,

<P>`aṉpiṉ aim^ tiṇi'
<BR>		(([iṟiyaṉār -- 1]))

<P>eṉṟataṉvaḻi ~ē uṇartti+ pōntām. avi tiṇi~eṉappaṭuvaṉa.

<P>akappāṭṭiṉ oru pāṭṭu+ kēṭṭaviṭattu iv= aintiṇiyuḷḷumiṉṉatoṉṟupaṟṟi vantatu* eṉṟu colluvatu.

<P>iṉi+ kikōḷ eṉpatu, kaḷavu kaṟpu eṉṟavāṟu; itu kaḷavupaṟṟi vantatu, itu kaṟpu+ paṟṟi vantatu eṉa aṟivatu.

<P>iṉi+, kūṟṟu eṉpatu, kūṟutaṟku uriyāri aṟintu, avaruḷiṉṉār kūṟiṉār ippāṭṭu eṉpatu aṟivatu; a+ kūṟutaṟkuuriyāri+ cempūṭcēyār kūṟṟiyaluḷḷum, tolkāppiyaṉārporuṭpāluḷḷum kaṇṭukoḷka.

<P>	`pārppāṉ pāṅkaṉ tōḻi cevili
<BR>	cīrttaku ciṟappiṟ kiḻavaṉ kiḻattiyōṭu
<BR>	aḷaviyal marapiṉ aṟu vakiyōrum
<BR>	kaḷaviṉiṟ kiḷavikku* uriyar eṉpa'.
<BR>		(([ceyyuḷiyal-181]))

<P>	`pāṇaṉ kūttaṉ viṟali paratti
<BR>	yāṇam^ cāṉṟa aṟivar kaṇṭōr
<BR>	pēṇutaku ciṟappiṟ pārppāṉ mutalā
<BR>	muṉṉuṟa+ kiḷanta kiḷaviyoṭu tokii+
<BR>	toṉṉeṟi marapiṟ kaṟpiṟ kuriyar'. (([ceyyuḷiyal --182]))

<P>eṉṟu ōtiṉār tolkāppiyaṉār eṉa+ koḷka.

<P>iccollappaṭṭāruḷ iṉṉār kūṟṟu eṉṟaṟivatu.

<P>iṉi+, kēṭpōr eṉpatu, iṉṉār kūṟa iṉṉār kēṭṭāreṉṟaṟivatu; tōḻi kūṟa+ talimakaḷ kēṭṭāḷ, talimakaḷkūṟa+ tōḻi kēṭṭāḷ, tōḻi kūṟa+ talimakaṉ //
<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P200">{{iṟi: Page 200}}</A>
<HR>
// kēṭṭāṉ, talimakaṉ kūṟa+ tōḻi kēṭṭāḷ eṉṟu ivvakiaṟintu urippatu.

<P>iṭam eṉpatu, avvāṟu oruvar kūṟa oruvar kēṭkumiṭameṉṟaṟivatu; avi, taṉmi muṉṉili paṭarkki eṉpaṉa.avaṟṟuḷ, yāṉ eṉpatu taṉmi, nī ~eṉpatu muṉṉili, avaṉeṉpatu paṭarkki. avaṟṟuḷ iṉṉatupaṟṟi vantatu* eṉṟuaṟivatu.

<P>kālam eṉpatu, iṟantakālam nikaḻkālam etirkālam eṉamūṉṟuvakippaṭum; avaṟṟuḷ, uṇṭāṉ eṉpatu iṟantakālam,uṇṇāniṉṟāṉ eṉpatu nikaḻkālam, uṇpāṉ eṉpatu etirkālam.ivaṟṟuḷ iṉṉatupaṟṟi vantatu* eṉṟu aṟivatu.

<P>eccam eṉpatu oḻivu, aḵtu iraṇṭu vakippaṭum. colleccamum kuṟippeccam um eṉa. aviyāmāṟu muṉṉar+ collutum.

<P>meyppāṭu eṉpatu eṭṭuvakippaṭum: avi-naki, aḻuki,iḷivaral, maruṭki, uvaki, accam, perumitam, vekuḷieṉa ivi; avaṟṟuḷ iṉṉatōr meyppāṭu vantatu* eṉṟuaṟivatu.

<P>payaṉ eṉpatu, itu colla iṉṉatu payakkum eṉṟuaṟivatu.
kōḷ eṉpatu, oru pāṭṭiṉakattu+ poruḷkoṇṭu niṟkum nili;aḵtu aintuvakippaṭum -- viṟpūṭṭu, vitali yāppu,pācinīkku, koṇṭukūṭṭu, oruciṟinili eṉṟavaṟṟuḷ iṉṉatōrporuḷkoṇṭu niṉṟatu ippāṭṭu eṉṟu aṟivatu. avaṟṟuḷ,

<P>viṟpūṭṭu+ poruḷkōḷ varumāṟu:

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 315}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
iṉi, vitaliyāppu varumāṟu:

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 316}}

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P201">{{iṟi: Page 201}}</A>
<HR>
<P>{{C URAI}}
pācinīkkam varumāṟu:

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 317}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
koṇṭukūṭṭu+ poruḷkōḷ varumāṟu:

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 318}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
oruciṟinili varumāṟu:

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 319}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
viṟpūṭṭu eṉpatu, tali ~um kaṭi ~um poruḷkoḷvatu;

<P>vitaliyāppu eṉpatu, tali ~um iṭi ~um kaṭi ~umporuḷkoḷvatu;

<P>pācinīkkam eṉpatu, coṟṟōṟum aṭitōṟum poruḷēṟṟuniṟpatu;

<P>koṇṭukūṭṭu eṉpatu, coṟkaḷi+ koṇṭukūṭṭi+poruḷkoḷḷumāṟu aṟintukoḷvatu;

<P>oruciṟinili ~eṉpatu, oru pāṭṭiṉakattu+ collappaṭṭaporuḷ oruvaḻi niṟpatu.

<P>āṅkappattu* ē eṉpatu -- āṅku eṉpatu aciccol; pattueṉpatu toki; ē eṉpatu īṟṟaci ēkāram;

<P>akaṉ aim^ tiṇi ~um urittal āṟu* ē eṉpatu -- akaṉaim^ tiṇi ~um aṟintu urikka akappāṭṭiṉi vallōrcollumiṭattu eṉṟavāṟu.

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 320}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
ippāṭṭiṟku+
<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P202">{{iṟi: Page 202}}</A>
<HR>
tiṇi -- kuṟiñci; kikōḷ -- kaḷavu; kūṟṟu -- tōḻikūṟṟu;kēṭṭāṉ -- talimakaṉ; iṭam -- muṉṉili; kālam --etirkālam, vantu oḻukāniṉṟāṉukku urittamiyāṉnikaḻkālam āka ~um koḷka;

<P>eccam -- nī ~eṉpatu eñciṟṟu;

<P>meyppāṭu -- accam, iv= oḻukkam piṟar aṟiyiṉ iṟantupaṭumeṉṉum niliyiṉaḷ āyiṉamiyiṉ;

<P>payaṉ -- varivu kaṭātal;
poruḷkōḷ -- taḷitaru taṇ cilampā takkatu* aṉṟu ivaḷniya ivvāṟu oḻukuvatu eṉa+ koṇṭamiyiṉ, vitaliyāppu.

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 321}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
ippāṭṭukku+
tiṇi -- marutam; kikōḷ -- kaṟpu; kūṟṟu -- talimakaṉkūṟṟu, talimakaṉ parattiyi+ kōla+ ciṟappu+ ceytāṉeṉṟu vēṟupaṭal uṟṟa talimakaḷ kuṟippu* aṟintutalimakaṉ colliyatu;

<P>kēṭṭāḷ -- talimakaḷ;

<P>iṭam -- muṉṉili;

<P>kālam -- iṟanta kālam paṟṟivanta nikaḻkālam;

<P>eccam -- eṉṉōṭu eṉpatu eñciṟṟu;

<P>meyppāṭu -- naṭukkam;

<P>payaṉ -- kēṭṭu+ talimakaḷ ūṭal tīrvāḷ āvatu;

<P>poruḷkōḷ -- vitali yāppu, `yāṉ koytu aṇintakuraviṉam pōtu* ē iṉṉum kamaḻum eṉ kittalam' eṉṟumūṉṟu* iṭattu+ poruḷkoṇṭamiyāṉ eṉpatu.

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P203">{{iṟi: Page 203}}</A>
<HR>
<H2>57</H2>
<P>	avaṟṟuḷ
<BR>	eccam um kōḷ um iṉmi ~um uriya.

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉpatu eṉ ^nutaliṟṟu* ō eṉiṉ, mēṟkūṟappaṭṭa pattiṉuḷ=um eccam um kōḷ um iṉṟi ~um uriya eṉpatu uṇarttutalnutaliṟṟu.

<P>itaṉ poruḷ: avaṟṟuḷ eṉpatu -- mēṟ kūṟappaṭṭapattiṉuḷ= um eṉṟavāṟu; eccam um kōḷ um iṉmi ~um uriyaeṉpatu -- eccam āṉum kōḷ āṉum av= iraṇṭiṉuḷ= umoṉṟu* oḻintu* um iraṇṭu* um oḻintu* um niṟka ~um peṟumeṉṟavāṟu.

<P>avaṟṟuḷ, eccam iṉṟi vantataṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 322}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
iṉi+, kōḷ iṉṟi vantatu varumāṟu:

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 323}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉa+ koḷka.

<H2>58</H2>
<P>	col= ē kuṟippu* ē āy iraṇṭu* eccam.

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉpatu eṉ ^nutaliṟṟu* ō eṉiṉ, mēṟkūṟappaṭṭa eccamiraṇṭu vakippaṭum eṉpatu uṇarttutal nutaliṟṟu.

<P>itaṉ poruḷ: col= ē kuṟippu* ē āy iraṇṭu eccam eṉpatu-- colleccam um kuṟippeccam um eṉa iraṇṭu eccam āmeṉṟavāṟu.

<P>colleccam eṉṟu collappaṭṭa vāypāṭu* iṉṟi+piṟavāypāṭṭāl tōṉṟiṉum eṉṟavāṟu.

<P>eccam eṉpatu oḻital eṉṟavāṟu.

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P204">{{iṟi: Page 204}}</A>
<HR>
colleccattiṟku+ ceyyuḷ:

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 324}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
iṉi+, kuṟippeccam vanta ceyyuḷ:

<P>{{C PK}}
<P>{{S 325}}

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉa ~um^ koḷka.

<H2>59</H2>
<P>	muṟpaṭa+ kiḷanta poruṭpaṭikku* ellām
<BR>	eccam āki varumvaḻi aṟintu
<BR>	kiḷanta alla vēṟupiṟa tōṉṟiṉum
<BR>	kiḷantavaṟṟu* iyalāṉ uṇarntaṉar koḷal ē.

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉpatu eṉ ^nutaliṟṟu* ō eṉiṉ, i+ nūluḷ eṭuttōttu* ē,ilēcu* ē eṉṟu ivaṟṟāṉ muṭiyātu niṉṟaṉa ~ellām itupuṟaṉaṭi ~āka+ tanturikka eṉpatu uṇarttutalnutaliṟṟu.

<P>itaṉ poruḷ: muṟpaṭakkiḷanta poruḷ+ paṭikku ellāmeṉpatu -- muṉṉāl urikkappaṭṭa cūttirattu+ poruṭku*ellām eṉṟavāṟu; eccam āki varum vaḻi aṟintu eṉpatu --oḻivuṭapavarūum iṭam ārāyntu eṉṟavāṟu; kiḷanta allavēṟu piṟa tōṉṟiṉum eṉpatu -- collappaṭṭa vāypāṭiṉṟi+piṟavāypāṭu tōṉṟiṉum eṉṟavāṟu; kiḷantavaṟṟu iyalāṉuṇarntaṉar koḷal ē eṉpatu -- a+ collappaṭṭa pattuilakkaṇattāṉ ē uṇarntu urikkappaṭum eṉṟavāṟu.

<P>itu kaḷaviṭattu* oḻintatu, kaṟpiṭattu* oḻintatu eṉṟuaṟintu eṉṟavāṟu.

<P>tali+ cūttirattuḷ, `aṉpiṉintiṇi' eṉṟatu* allatuaṉpu uṇarttumāṟu āṇṭu uṇarttiyatu* illi, itu ~ēōttāka+ tantu uṇarntu ataṉ vikaṟpam ellām^ koḷka.

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P205">{{iṟi: Page 205}}</A>
<HR>
aṉpiṉāṉāya aintiṇikkuriya iṟiccipporuḷ uṇarttiyatu*illi; avi,

<P>	`teyvam uṇāvu* ē mā maram puḷ+ paṟi
<BR>	ceyti yāḻiṉ pakutiyoṭu tokii'
<BR>		(([akattiṇiyiyal-20]))

<P>aivaki nilattiṉ ōtappaṭṭa iṭam um kālam um teyvam umuṇavu* um mā ~um maram um puḷ= um paṟi ~um ceyki ~umyāḻ um āṭūu+ peyar um makaṭūu+ peyar um avvavanilattukku makkaḷ um pū ~um nīr um irutu ~um eṉṟu* i+toṭakkattaṉa ~um, aintiṇikku* uriyaṉa uripporuḷ um,avaṟṟiṉ nimittam um, aintiṇikku* uriya vikaṟpam umavi ellām itu ~ē ōttu* āka+ tanturikka.

<P>iṉi, eṇvaki maṇattiṉ vikaṟpam um itu ~ē ōttu* āka+tanturikka.

<P>iṉi+, kantaruva vaḻakkiṉ vikaṟpam um itu ~ē ōttāka+tanturikka.

<P>iyaṟki+ puṇarcci+ kaṇ= um viḷiyāṭṭu* okkal vēṟiṭampaṭara iruvar um tammuḷ talippeyyumāṟu, puṇarumiṭattu+ taṉmi ~um, atu kaṉmēṟ potumpupaṭṭu+ kōṭṭuppū~um koṭippū ~um nirantu, nīrttuṟimēl+ cittirappaṭāmvirittāl ē pōṉṟu, vaṇṭu* um tumpi ~um varikkaṭi+piracam um yāḻ um kuḻal um muraṉṟu, kaṭaṟṟiri ~umkāṉiyāṟu* um muḻavu* um tuṭi ~um pāṭu* iyampa, iravōraṉṉa koḻu niḻaṟṟu* āy, nilavōr aṉṉa veṇmaṇal oḻuki,akattār puṟattāri+ kāṇṭal eḷitu* āy+, puṟattārakattāri+ kāṇṭal aritu* āy, vāṉōr um viḻivi+tavirttōr um virumpum poḻiluḷ, iyaṟki+ puṇarcciyatuiṟutikkaṇ, talimakaḷi āṟṟuvittu+ piriyum pirivum itu~ē ōttu* āka+ tanturikka.

<P>iṉi+, pāṅkaṟkūṭṭattukkaṇ talimakaṉatu vēṟupāṭukaṇṭu pāṅkaṉ viṉāva+ talimakaṉ colliṉavum, avi kēṭṭapāṅkaṉ kaḻaṟiṉavum, pāṅkaṟku etirmaṟiyāka+ colliṉavum,etirppaṭṭa talimakaṉatu āṟṟāmi kaṇṭu pāṅkaṉtalimakaṟku+ kavaṉṟaṉavum, kavaṉṟapāṅkaṉ niṉṉāṟkāṇappaṭṭa uru evviṭattu ettaṉmittu eṉṉumāṟum,talimakaṉ iṉṉaviṭattu ittaṉmittu eṉṉāṟ kāṇappaṭṭa urueṉṉumāṟum, atu kēṭṭa pāṅkaṉ avviṭattu etirṉōkki+cellumāṟum, avviṭam pukku+ pāṅkaṉ talimakaḷi+ //
<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P206">{{iṟi: Page 206}}</A>
<HR>
// kaṇṭu niṉṟu colliṉavum, pāṅkaṉ mīṇṭuvantu iṭamkāṭṭiṉavum itu ~ē ōttāka+ tanturikka.

<P>`av= iyalpu* allatu' (([iṟiyaṉār -- 4]))

<P>eṉṉum^ cūttirattu vikaṟpam itu ~ē ōttāka+ tanturikka.

<P>talimakaṉ tōḻiyi irantu kuṟiyuṟumāṟum,

<P>kuṟiyuṟāniṉṟavaḻi+ tōḻi kiyuṟi maṟukkumāṟum,

<P>matiyuṭampaṭukkumāṟum,

<P>paṭuttavaḻi iruvarkuṟippumpaṟṟi+ kūṭṭamuṇmiuṇarumāṟum,

<P>uṇarntāḷ atu neñciṟku+ collumāṟum,

<P>piṉṉi+ tōḻi talimakaṉatu āṟṟāmikku+ kuṟi nērumāṟum,

<P>nērntāḷ talimakaḷi+ kuṟinayappu+ kūṟumāṟum,

<P>tamar iṟceṟittavaḻi+ talimakaḷatu kaṟpaḻivu nōkkiaṟattoṭu niṟkumāṟum,

<P>kuṟiyuṟāniṉṟa talimakaṉi+ talimakaḷatu arumiperumi kūṟi+ tōḻi cēṭpaṭukkumāṟum,

<P>tōḻi aṟattoṭu niṟkum vikaṟpam um,

<P>iravukkuṟi vikaṟpam um,

<P>pakaṟkuṟikkaṇ tōḻi ~um talimakaṉum collum vikaṟpam um,

<P>iravukkuṟiyiṭattu vā eṉṟu collum vikaṟpam um,

<P>iravukkuṟi nikaḻum iṭam iṉṉa iṭam eṉṟu collumvikaṟpam um;

<P>iravukkuṟikkaṇ ampal um alarum āmuṟi iraṇṭumkaḷavāmāṟum,

<P>veḷippaṭṭapiṉṟi nikaḻum^ collum,

<P>puṇarntuṭaṉ pōkkum,

<P>uṭaṉpōkkiṉkaṇ tōḻi ~um talimakaṉum collum vikaṟpamum,

<P>iṭiccūram^ celavu* aḻuṅkumāṟum,

<P>aṟattoṭunili māṭcimi+ paṭātaviṭattu+ tōḻitalimakaḷi+ kiyaṭi tantāḷ oḻiyumāṟum,

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P207">{{iṟi: Page 207}}</A>
<HR>
talimakaṉ ēṉṟukoṇṭu pōmāṟum,

<P>avarkaḷi iṭiccurattu+ kaṇṭār collum vāypāṭum,

<P>cevili piṉcellumāṟum,

<P>piṉcella iṭiccurattu+ kaṇṭār collum muṟimi ~um,

<P>kaṇṭār iṭiccurattu+ talimakaḷatu nilimiyurittumīṭkumāṟum,

<P>talimakaṉ makiḻcciyāmāṟum,

<P>talimakaṉ poruḷ mutalāyiṉavaṟṟiṟku variviṭi vittu+pirintavaḻi, talimakaḷi+ tōḻi āṟṟuvikkumiṭattu+talimakaḷ tōḻikku+ colluvaṉavum,

<P>varivoṭu pukkavaḻi+ tanti ~um taṉṉiyaṉmār ummaṟukkumāṟum,

<P>avvaḻi naṟṟāy aṟattoṭu niṟkumāṟum,

<P>kaṟpukkālattu+ talimakaṉ talimakaḷi+ piriyum pirivu*eṉṟu collappaṭṭa pirivu* um,

<P>pirintaviṭattu+ talimakaḷ āṟṟāḷ āka+ tōḻi vaṟpuṟuttaṉa~um,

<P>paruvaṅkāṭṭiṉavum,

<P>talimakaṉ viṉimuṟṟuvittu vantavāṟum,

<P>aḵtu* uṇarnta tōḻi colliṉavum,

<P>talimakaṉ viṉimuṟṟiṉāṉ tērppākaṟku+ colliṉavum,mukilukku+ colliṉavum,

<P>talimakaṉ talimakaḷuṭaṉiruntu tōḻi kēṭpa+colliṉavum,

<P>maṟṟum, parattiyiṟ piriviṉkaṇ tuṉi ~um pulaviyūṭalum avaṟṟatu vikaṟpam um,

<P>parattiyiṟ pirinta talimakaṟku+ talimakaḷvāyiṉmaṟuttaṉavum,

<P>vāyilvēṇṭi+ pāṇaṉ muntuṟuttaṉavum,

<P>viruntu muntuṟuttaṉavum,

<P>vāyil peṟṟu+ pukkaṉa ~um, maṟṟum piṟa ~um ellām itu~ē ōttu* āka+ tanturikka.

<HR>
<P><A NAME="_IRAI_P208">{{iṟi: Page 208}}</A>
<HR>
<H2>60</H2>
<P>	kaḷavu kaṟpu* eṉa+ kaṇṇiya īṇṭiyōr
<BR>	uḷanikaḻ aṉpiṉ uyarcci mēṉa.

<P>{{C URAI}}
eṉpatu eṉ ^nutaliṟṟō eṉiṉ, mēlvakutta kaḷavukaṟpukaṭku+ piṟitum āvatu* ōr puṟaṉaṭi uṇarttutalnutaliṟṟu.

<P>itaṉ poruḷ: kaḷavu kaṟpu eṉa+ kaṇṇiya eṉpatu -- kaḷavu*eṉṟu* um kaṟpu* eṉṟu* um pulavōrāl vakutturikkappaṭṭaoḻukkaṅkaḷ eṉṟavāṟu; īṇṭiyōr eṉpatu -- iv= ulakattiṟpiṟantāṉum cañcarittāṉum poruntuvōratu eṉṟavāṟu; uḷamnikaḻ aṉpiṉ uyarcci mēṉa eṉpatu -- uyarkula+ talivaṉtalivi ~eṉṟu iṉṉōratu uḷattiṉkaṇ nikaḻkiṉṟa aṉpiṉatuuyarviṉkaṇṇa ~ām eṉṟavāṟu.

<P>tēvarkku* um nākarkku* um iv= oḻukkam avar ulakattililli eṉpār, `īṇṭiyōr' eṉṟār. eṉa ~ē, aṉṉōrkku aḵtuōrōr kālattu iv= ulakattu nikaḻum eṉṟār āyiṟṟu: aḵtuiv= ulakil um iyaṟkiyāṉ nilipeṟātu pulavarāṉ, `illatuiṉiyatu nallatu' eṉa nāṭṭappaṭṭatōr oḻukkam eṉpār,`kaṇṇiya' eṉṟār.

<P>iṉi, iraṭṭuṟamoḻitalāṉ, `īṇṭiyōr' eṉpati orupeyarāka+koḷḷātu; `īṇṭi ōr' eṉa+ koṇṭu,

<P>	`tāṉ ē ~avaḷ ē tamiyar'
<BR>		(([iṟiyaṉār -- 2]))

<P>eṉṟataṉāl, tāṉ ē avaḷ, avaḷ ē tāṉ eṉa iyaṉṟaīruṭaliṉ ōruyirpōlvār uḷattu eṉṟu koḷḷiṉum amiyum.`aṉpiṉ uyarcci' eṉa ~ē, aḵtu* illāviṭattu iv=oḻukkaṅkaḷ naṭipeṟā eṉpatūum, ataṉāṉ ē aḵtu uyarntōrmāṭṭatu eṉpatūum, avaruḷḷum aracarkku* ē ciṟantatueṉpatūum peṟṟām. aṟṟu* āyiṉ, `uyarntōr mēṉa' eṉa+ pāṭamōtal ākātu* ō eṉiṉ,

<P>	`aṭiyōr pāṅkiṉum viṉivala pāṅkiṉum
<BR>	kaṭivari ~ilapuṟattu* eṉmaṉār pulavar'.
<BR>		(([akat. -- 23]))

<P>eṉa maṟṟi varuṇattōrkku* um^ ciṟupāṉmi aḵtuuriyatu eṉṟu taḻīikkōṭal karutappaṭṭatu eṉka.

<P><B>((kaṟpiyal muṟṟum))</B>
<P><B>((kaḷaviyal eṉṟa iṟiyaṉār akapporuḷ mūlam umuri ~um muṟṟiṟṟu.))</B>

</FONT>
</BODY>
